(98289, 3977, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good , though my first reaction is "poor", not old.<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good , though my first reaction is "poor", not old.', '2002-08-10 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98290, 3977, 3198, '<td valign="top">like the totem pole, composition is a bit awkward</td>', 'like the totem pole, composition is a bit awkward', '2002-08-11 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98291, 3979, 1569, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed and composed!!</td>', 'Nicely exposed and composed!!', '2002-08-05 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98292, 3979, 2170, '<td valign="top">The modern street lighting and soda machines throw off the "old" of this photo.  I''m sure there are other shots that you could have taken around Coney Island that would have looked more....timeless.</td>', 'The modern street lighting and soda machines throw off the "old" of this photo.  I''m sure there are other shots that you could have taken around Coney Island that would have looked more....timeless.', '2002-08-05 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98293, 3979, 1019, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and the night feeling--</td>', 'Love the colours and the night feeling--', '2002-08-05 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98294, 3979, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-05 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98295, 3979, 811, '<td valign="top">Good night time shot.  For some reason,  i am wanting to see more on the right side of the road.  It just seems a little off-balance to me.  Not sure how to correct it though. karmat</td>', 'Good night time shot.  For some reason,  i am wanting to see more on the right side of the road.  It just seems a little off-balance to me.  Not sure how to correct it though. karmat', '2002-08-06 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98296, 3979, 2752, '<td valign="top">nice depth and lighting</td>', 'nice depth and lighting', '2002-08-06 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98297, 3979, 2482, '<td valign="top">Real nice photograph. It is quite eye catching</td>', 'Real nice photograph. It is quite eye catching', '2002-08-07 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98298, 3979, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting... Coney Island is an ''old'' place in itself... I can''t make up my mind if i like the concept of the old building in the photo or not... - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting... Coney Island is an ''old'' place in itself... I can''t make up my mind if i like the concept of the old building in the photo or not... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98299, 3979, 2798, '<td valign="top">I like this - it''s a nice contrast shot showing the bright lights next to this old building. I like that you kept the streetlamp in to frame it but it meant that your old building has been sidelined just a little too much in my opinion. There''s not a lot of light on it so it needed to fill more of the frame I think.</td>', 'I like this - it''s a nice contrast shot showing the bright lights next to this old building. I like that you kept the streetlamp in to frame it but it meant that your old building has been sidelined just a little too much in my opinion. There''s not a lot of light on it so it needed to fill more of the frame I think.', '2002-08-08 07:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98300, 3979, 3149, '<td valign="top">Great use of depth.  Nice job...</td>', 'Great use of depth.  Nice job...', '2002-08-09 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98301, 3979, 1005, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the entire left half of this photo, why did you include it?  Lower street lights on the right are a bit bright.  6 Swash</td>', 'I don''t get the entire left half of this photo, why did you include it?  Lower street lights on the right are a bit bright.  6 Swash', '2002-08-09 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98302, 3979, 2427, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  Never been to Coney but definitely evocative of the era from my limited experisnce at Atlantic City.<br/>Steet light and ferris wheel against ''flatness'' of foreground building works well</td>', 'Great subject.  Never been to Coney but definitely evocative of the era from my limited experisnce at Atlantic City.Steet light and ferris wheel against ''flatness'' of foreground building works well', '2002-08-09 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98303, 3979, 2661, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and you did a good job with a tricky exposure situation. good colors too.</td>', 'I like the composition, and you did a good job with a tricky exposure situation. good colors too.', '2002-08-11 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98304, 3979, 637, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, the composition, the lights, the colors. 6 sjgleah</td>', 'I like the idea, the composition, the lights, the colors. 6 sjgleah', '2002-08-11 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98305, 3981, 509, '<td valign="top">Does the title have anything to do with the lyrics in a Creed song? ; )<br/>Nice shot, definitely looks old.</td>', 'Does the title have anything to do with the lyrics in a Creed song? ; )Nice shot, definitely looks old.', '2002-08-05 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98306, 3981, 1569, '<td valign="top">Nice old truck.Getting closer to eliminate the signs,poles and wires would have helped.It also looks a little muddy for black and white.</td>', 'Nice old truck.Getting closer to eliminate the signs,poles and wires would have helped.It also looks a little muddy for black and white.', '2002-08-05 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98307, 3981, 2815, '<td valign="top">does anyone still drive that???</td>', 'does anyone still drive that???', '2002-08-05 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98308, 3981, 2223, '<td valign="top">nice old peice of crap! i think you could have shot it in a different angle to get rid of the mailboxes...unless there attached.</td>', 'nice old peice of crap! i think you could have shot it in a different angle to get rid of the mailboxes...unless there attached.', '2002-08-05 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98309, 3981, 2200, '<td valign="top">I''ve done several of these old relics. I find they''re more interesting if you have less background. Use close ups of different sections of the truck.</td>', 'I''ve done several of these old relics. I find they''re more interesting if you have less background. Use close ups of different sections of the truck.', '2002-08-05 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98310, 3981, 2170, '<td valign="top">Tighter cropping or a different angle would have been better.  Get rid of the modern street and the newspaper boxes.  Nice idea.</td>', 'Tighter cropping or a different angle would have been better.  Get rid of the modern street and the newspaper boxes.  Nice idea.', '2002-08-05 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98311, 3981, 1175, '<td valign="top">this just looks like a snapshot.  If you really think about it and give it some more effort you can do better than this. The first problem is the time of day.  The sun is high so whatever is lit is really bright and what ever is in shadow is dark.  Go retake this picture early in the day within the first hour of sunrise or in the evening right before sunset and you''ll have a better picture. The shadows are also very hard and defined.  I''m not sure whats to the right but a picture of the front of this truck, close to the grill and to the headlights would have been a great shot.</td>', 'this just looks like a snapshot.  If you really think about it and give it some more effort you can do better than this. The first problem is the time of day.  The sun is high so whatever is lit is really bright and what ever is in shadow is dark.  Go retake this picture early in the day within the first hour of sunrise or in the evening right before sunset and you''ll have a better picture. The shadows are also very hard and defined.  I''m not sure whats to the right but a picture of the front of this truck, close to the grill and to the headlights would have been a great shot.', '2002-08-05 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98312, 3981, 2587, '<td valign="top">Nice subject ... but I would''ve zoomed in a bit closer to eliminate the environment. The focus is on the truck and should not be on the stop sign or the mail boxes, right? I think it would''ve been a bit more visually interesting to only see a certain part of the truck.</td>', 'Nice subject ... but I would''ve zoomed in a bit closer to eliminate the environment. The focus is on the truck and should not be on the stop sign or the mail boxes, right? I think it would''ve been a bit more visually interesting to only see a certain part of the truck.', '2002-08-06 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98313, 3981, 2928, '<td valign="top">It looks like it''s still in useINSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(98487, 4004, 3105, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful portrait, well done.</td>', 'This is a wonderful portrait, well done.', '2002-08-07 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98488, 4004, 917, '<td valign="top">Really doesnt fit the challenge, there is no sense of ''getting older'' here, its just a kid in a car. Reasonably taken shot, though.</td>', 'Really doesnt fit the challenge, there is no sense of ''getting older'' here, its just a kid in a car. Reasonably taken shot, though.', '2002-08-08 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98489, 4004, 2158, '<td valign="top">I really find this stretching the challenge too much.</td>', 'I really find this stretching the challenge too much.', '2002-08-08 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98490, 4004, 2719, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is actually a great photo.  She looks much older/wiser than her age... and I can''t put my finger on what aspect exudes that. This is beyond photographic technique.</td>', 'Wow, this is actually a great photo.  She looks much older/wiser than her age... and I can''t put my finger on what aspect exudes that. This is beyond photographic technique.', '2002-08-09 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98491, 4004, 2857, '<td valign="top">nice picture, but i wish it was a 90-year old.</td>', 'nice picture, but i wish it was a 90-year old.', '2002-08-09 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98492, 4004, 811, '<td valign="top">Her expression looks so grown up and concerned.  They really do grow up too fast, I think.  I had initially scored this low, thinking it was a stretch of meeting the challenge, but after studying it, i think it does.  karmat</td>', 'Her expression looks so grown up and concerned.  They really do grow up too fast, I think.  I had initially scored this low, thinking it was a stretch of meeting the challenge, but after studying it, i think it does.  karmat', '2002-08-09 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98493, 4004, 3087, '<td valign="top">I am sure she is ageing, as is everything on earth, but when I look at this I see the beauty of youth and not old.</td>', 'I am sure she is ageing, as is everything on earth, but when I look at this I see the beauty of youth and not old.', '2002-08-10 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98494, 4004, 671, '<td valign="top">cute little girl, doesn''t do much for me in regard to the topic.</td>', 'cute little girl, doesn''t do much for me in regard to the topic.', '2002-08-10 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98495, 4004, 2353, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it..how does this meet the challenge?</td>', 'I don''t get it..how does this meet the challenge?', '2002-08-10 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98496, 4004, 2900, '<td valign="top">nice picture, but without the title I wouldn''t think of it as "something old".</td>', 'nice picture, but without the title I wouldn''t think of it as "something old".', '2002-08-11 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98497, 4004, 2204, '<td valign="top">Too young for the something old challenge.  It will be a long time before she meets the criteria.  She is a cutie though.....</td>', 'Too young for the something old challenge.  It will be a long time before she meets the criteria.  She is a cutie though.....', '2002-08-11 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98498, 4004, 2661, '<td valign="top">ok, so old is a relative term. the problem is that all of the people voting will be older than this little girl, so to them, she is young. you might have tried putting her next to a baby to emphasize the relativity of the concept of age. other than that, it''s a great shot, and I get your point, so I''m going to score it well.</td>', 'ok, so old is a relative term. the problem is that all of the people voting will be older than this little girl, so to them, she is young. you might have tried putting her next to a baby to emphasize the relativity of the concept of age. other than that, it''s a great shot, and I get your point, so I''m going to score it well.', '2002-08-11 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98499, 4004, 3215, '<td valign="top">good light but where do we get old?</td>', 'good light but where do we get old?', '2002-08-11 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98500, 4005, 2815, '<td valign="top">interesting objects, but I can''t quite tell what they are.  I think it is a bottle and a bottle opener.  I like how you can see the obvious age in the objects.</td>', 'interesting objects, but I can''t quite tell what they are.  I think it is a bottle and a bottle opener.  I like how you can see the obvious age in the objects.', '2002-08-05 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98501, 4005, 2798, '<td valign="top">Wow what a wonderfully pin sharp image. Your lighting is good - not too even since that would have made everything look flat - just right for the highlights. I think my only comment is that it would have been nice to see a little more of this gadget so that we can see how it works. :)</td>', 'Wow what a wonderfully pin sharp image. Your lighting is good - not too even since that would have made everything look flat - just right for the highlights. I think my only comment is that it would have been nice to see a little more of this gadget so that we can see how it works. :)', '2002-08-05 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98502, 4005, 2170, '<td valign="top">Great details.</td>', 'Great details.', '2002-08-05 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98503, 4005, 811, '<td valign="top">i like the angles of this, and the clarity of the details.  i think a background color other than white would be nice. karmat</td>', 'i like the angles of this, and the clarity of the details.  i think a background color other than white would be nice. karmat', '2002-08-05 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98504, 4005, 1143, '<td valign="top">my grandmother had these. very useful little things. nice composition/crop</td>', 'my grandmother had these. very useful little things. nice composition/crop', '2002-08-05 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98505, 4005, 2983, '<td valign="top">I know what this is, and haven''t used one for years.  Great angles working here.</td>', 'I know what this is, and haven''t used one for years.  Great angles working here.', '2002-08-06 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98506, 4005, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good clarity, nice composition, but this photo just doesn''t grab my interest. lhall</td>', 'Good clarity, nice composition, but this photo just doesn''t grab my interest. lhall', '2002-08-06 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98507, 4005, 2928, '<td valign="top">The photography is not an issue  can''t find fault there (6).  But  for me  the content is a bit moribund and lacks punchINSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(98700, 4018, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - great<br/>Technical Aspects - very good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes+<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - high<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - greatTechnical Aspects - very goodMeets Challenge - yes+Visual Impact / Originality - high', '2002-08-05 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98701, 4018, 2912, '<td valign="top">Nice work !</td>', 'Nice work !', '2002-08-06 05:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98702, 4018, 2815, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for gun pics.  This looks like a neat old Marlin Rifle.  I also have an old Marlin Rifle.  I am the 4th Generation to own and hunt with my rifle.   I think that it is great that a family hands down a gun from a father to a son.  Great photo.</td>', 'I am a sucker for gun pics.  This looks like a neat old Marlin Rifle.  I also have an old Marlin Rifle.  I am the 4th Generation to own and hunt with my rifle.   I think that it is great that a family hands down a gun from a father to a son.  Great photo.', '2002-08-06 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98703, 4018, 2535, '<td valign="top">way too contrived<br/><br/>not even a good photo</td>', 'way too contrivednot even a good photo', '2002-08-06 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98704, 4018, 1327, '<td valign="top">doh! the modern glass through that one off...</td>', 'doh! the modern glass through that one off...', '2002-08-06 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98705, 4018, 2752, '<td valign="top">nice arrangement and use of materials</td>', 'nice arrangement and use of materials', '2002-08-06 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98706, 4018, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you have ocmposed this.  Nicely done. karmat</td>', 'I really like the way you have ocmposed this.  Nicely done. karmat', '2002-08-07 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98707, 4018, 2323, '<td valign="top">Nice effort!   I love the layout and the composition.<br/><br/>The sepia effect seems a bit too strong, and everything (even the antique gun) looks way too smooth to give the impression of being old.<br/><br/>--6-- sohr</td>', 'Nice effort!   I love the layout and the composition.The sepia effect seems a bit too strong, and everything (even the antique gun) looks way too smooth to give the impression of being old.--6-- sohr', '2002-08-07 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98708, 4018, 3112, '<td valign="top">A good idea.  I can''t figure how I would really make it work subject-wise, either, though.  Good technical photo.</td>', 'A good idea.  I can''t figure how I would really make it work subject-wise, either, though.  Good technical photo.', '2002-08-07 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98709, 4018, 554, '<td valign="top">Very nice and well presented too.</td>', 'Very nice and well presented too.', '2002-08-07 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98710, 4018, 2798, '<td valign="top">Heck you Americans have some scary family heirlooms! Nice arrangement though and excellent lighting.</td>', 'Heck you Americans have some scary family heirlooms! Nice arrangement though and excellent lighting.', '2002-08-08 08:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98711, 4018, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a neat shot, but the exposure seems to be a little strong... - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is a neat shot, but the exposure seems to be a little strong... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98712, 4018, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this but find the frame of the photo distracting. I''d have liked it better with the photo out of the frame and the gun on that, with nothing else in the shot. The frame just seems to jar a little wth the photo and gun.</td>', 'I like this but find the frame of the photo distracting. I''d have liked it better with the photo out of the frame and the gun on that, with nothing else in the shot. The frame just seems to jar a little wth the photo and gun.', '2002-08-08 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98713, 4018, 1005, '<td valign="top">Is the photo "real" or one of those county fair deals?  (doesn''t matter, just curious, like are you in the photo?)  Excellent capture of the gun, it must be in really great shape, it doesn''t look very old (except for maybe the styling).  Was the placement over the "ladies" due to necessity (space) or is there hidden meaning in it?  It''s just that the dresses seem to fit better than the uniforms.  8 Swash</td>', 'Is the photo "real" or one of those county fair deals?  (doesn''t matter, just curious, like are you in the photo?)  Excellent capture of the gun, it must be in really great shape, it doesn''t look very old (except for maybe the styling).  Was the placement over the "ladies" due to necessity (space) or is there hidden meaning in it?  It''s just that the dresses seem to fit better than the uniforms.  8 Swash', '2002-08-08 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98714, 4018, 509, '<td valign="top">Is that really a Civil War gun?  I''ve shot my uncle''s a few times, it doesn''t look that advanced ; )<br/>Nice photo though, the sepia tone fits well.</td>', 'Is that really a Civil War gun?  I''ve shot my uncle''s a few times, it doesn''t look that advanced ; )Nice photo though, the sepia tone fits well.', '2002-08-10 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98715, 4018, 2204, '<td valign="top">Nice ....but, lacking something I can''t quite pin point.  Hopefully someone with more experience will be able to comment more constructively.  =6 syamjonimi</td>', 'Nice ....but, lacking something I can''t quite pin point.  Hopefully someone with more experience will be able to comment more constructively.  =6 syamjonimi', '2002-08-10 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98716, 4018, 1031, '<td valign="top">Did you consciously edit out the ladies?</td>', 'Did you consciously edit out the ladies?', '2002-08-11 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98717, 4020, 2928, '<td valign="top">Top picture - Great drama - love the black sky (9)</td>', 'Top picture - Great drama - love the black sky (9)', '2002-08-05 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98718, 4020, 2295, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows..  Focus is OK, Lighting is interesting...  7</td>', 'I like the shadows..  Focus is OK, Lighting is interesting...  7', '2002-08-05 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98719, 4020, 1856, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  it looks like it''s watching the night sky.  I wish it were a little further set back so there was more of the sky (it''s watching) in the image.  8 Lisa</td>', 'I really like this.  it looks like it''s watching the night sky.  I wish it were a little further set back so there was more of the sky (it''s watching) in the image.  8 Lisa', '2002-08-05 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98720, 4020, 1143, '<td valign="top">looks a lot like the math building Ayres at Univ of TN - I was in class once when the tower was hit by lightning<br/>nice job with exposure</td>', 'looks a lot like the math building Ayres at Univ of TN - I was in class once when the tower was hit by lightningnice job with exposure', '2002-08-05 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98721, 4020, 2752, '<td valign="top">very good use of light.</td>', 'very good use of light.', '2002-08-06 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98722, 4020, 1, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, but the with the lit up clock, it doesn''t seem as old as it probably is.</td>', 'nice lighting, but the with the lit up clock, it doesn''t seem as old as it probably is.', '2002-08-06 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98723, 4020, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice shot... i like the placement of the subject and the negative space here.. night time shots like this work well.. it provides a naturally dark background to make the subject stand out... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice shot... i like the placement of the subject and the negative space here.. night time shots like this work well.. it provides a naturally dark background to make the subject stand out... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-06 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98724, 4020, 3112, '<td valign="top">Exposure might be a tad too long, as the contrast between building and sky is almost unreal.</td>', 'Exposure might be a tad too long, as the contrast between building and sky is almost unreal.', '2002-08-07 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98725, 4020, 3016, '<td valign="top">a little cropping on both sides to just frame the central tower would have made this picture more dramatic</td>', 'a little cropping on both sides to just frame the central tower would have made this picture more dramatic', '2002-08-07 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98726, 4020, 1454, '<td valign="top">I liked the idea, but to me, the tower would look better if it were more to the right.</td>', 'I liked the idea, but to me, the tower would look better if it were more to the right.', '2002-08-08 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98727, 4020, 2023, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Well lit subject or nice camera!</td>', 'Nice shot. Well lit subject or nice camera!', '2002-08-08 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98728, 4020, 3149, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo...</td>', 'Very nice photo...', '2002-08-09 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98729, 4020, 1005, '<td valign="top">A very interesting shot.  I like the fact that you got a couple of bonus stars in the frame, too.  I can''t see how this happened, most of the shot is terribly clear, but a couple places on the tower seem distorted, like under the circle that is divided into three sections and below and to the right of the clock.  Could these be caused by moving shadows (trees)?   Odd crop job in my opinion, but you must have had  your reasons.  Finally, the window in the bottom probably should have been cropped off.  With all these comments, you''d think I was panning this shot, wouldn''t you?  (have I kept you in enough suspense?)  8 Swash</td>', 'A very interesting shot.  I like the fact that you got a couple of bonus stars in the frame, too.  I can''t see how this happened, most of the shot is terribly clear, but a couple places on the tower seem distorted, like under the circle that is divided into three sections and below and to the right of the clock.  Could these be caused by moving shadows (trees)?   Odd crop job in my opinion, but you must have had  your reasons.  Finally, the window in the bottom probably should have been cropped off.  With all these comments, you''d think I was panning this shot, wouldn''t you?  (have I kept you in enough suspense?)  8 Swash', '2002-08-09 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98730, 4020, 2618, '<td valign="top">Lovely building, lovely photo.</td>', 'Lovely building, lovely photo.', '2002-08-10 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98731, 4021, 2907, '<td valign="top">Why are the medals cut off at the bottom??</td>', 'Why are the medals cut off at the bottom??', '2002-08-05 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98732, 4021, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is a picture of a picture. Several in this genre have been submitted for this challenge. I find the attempt to make it more than just a rendition of a picture, i.e. the medals, not successfully done.</td>', 'This is a picture of a picture. Several in this genre have been submitted for this challenge. I find the attempt to make it more than just a rendition of a picture, i.e. the medals, not successfully done.', '2002-08-05 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98733, 4021, 2716, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, however I find the cloth at the bottom and the right edge of the picture distracting.  I like the contrast between the bright colors of the medals and the mellow colors of the photo.  (6)</td>', 'Love the idea, however I find the cloth at the bottom and the right edge of the picture distracting.  I like the contrast between the bright colors of the medals and the mellow colors of the photo.  (6)', '2002-08-05 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98734, 4021, 2158, '<td valign="top">What happened to the bottom of the medals?</td>', 'What happened to the bottom of the medals?', '2002-08-05 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98735, 4021, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - high/good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - high/good', '2002-08-05 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98736, 4021, 2912, '<td valign="top">Without the medals, it''d be much better. Or did you think about trying it in B&amp;W ?</td>', 'Without the medals, it''d be much better. Or did you think about trying it in B&W ?', '2002-08-06 04:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98737, 4021, 2754, '<td valign="top">I find the black space to the right and bottom of the picture distracting.  The black on bottom is also covering the bottom of the medals.</td>', 'I find the black space to the right and bottom of the picture distracting.  The black on bottom is also covering the bottom of the medals.', '2002-08-06 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98738, 4021, 811, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  The only suggestion would be to eliminate the black strip down the right, and  not to cover the bottom of the medals up.  karmat</td>', 'Great idea.  The only suggestion would be to eliminate the black strip down the right, and  not to cover the bottom of the medals up.  karmat', '2002-08-06 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98739, 4021, 1, '<td valign="top">Decently setup though the edge on the right and the slightly cut off medallions distract from the overall effect.</td>', 'Decently setup though the edge on the right and the slightly cut off medallions distract from the overall effect.', '2002-08-06 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98740, 4021, 772, '<td valign="top">the concept here is really nice... I think the edge of the photo being visible in the frame also adds a nice sense of ''old'' because it is a bit tattered and torn... - jmsetzler</td>', 'the concept here is really nice... I think the edge of the photo being visible in the frame also adds a nice sense of ''old'' because it is a bit tattered and torn... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-06 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98741, 4021, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Focus is good, lighting is good, subject is good.  The cropping at the bottom of the medals is a bit strange.  7</td>', 'Nicely done.  Focus is good, lighting is good, subject is good.  The cropping at the bottom of the medals is a bit strange.  7', '2002-08-07 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98742, 4021, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Could use better framing.</td>', 'Good idea.  Could use better framing.', '2002-08-07 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98743, 4021, 3087, '<td valign="top">I do like the idea, but the bottom of the medals are hidden and the photo isn''t straight within the shot... otherwise I sort of like it... I would have liked even better an old man looking at his medals or some such...</td>', 'I do like the idea, but the bottom of the medals are hidden and the photo isn''t straight within the shot... otherwise I sort of like it... I would have liked even better an old man looking at his medals or some such...', '2002-08-07 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98744, 4021, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement and vibrant colour. I''ve a feeling those medals are impressive. But check out those ears! (no offense meant!)</td>', 'Nice arrangement and vibrant colour. I''ve a feeling those medals are impressive. But check out those ears! (no offense meant!)', '2002-08-08 08:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98745, 4021, 2221, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the light from below at the medals was a good choice. For itself it looks good, nice contrast and very dramatic, but I think it does not fit to the photo in the background. It almost looks like the medals were put into the photo in postprocessing (what I don''t think was actually done). But there is such a high contrast between the two subjects that it looks strange. Also in regard to the colors. The medals are highly saturated but the photo has very soft colors which really look old.<br/>Now it could be that this contrast was intended. If so then, well, I don''t like it ;-)<br/>It also would be nice to see the medals completely. Instead I see the dark cloth or something like that. I also don''t like that the right edge of the photo is visible.<br/>Anyway, it fits the challenge and it''s a good idea.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'I''m not sure if the light from below at the medals was a good choice. For itself it looks good, nice contrast and very dramatic, but I think it does not fit to the photo in the background. It almost looks like the medals were put into the photo in postprocessing (what I don''t think was actually done). But there is such a high contrast between the two subjects that it looks strange. Also in regard to the colors. The medals are highly saturated but the photo has very soft colors which really look old.Now it could be that this contrast was intended. If so then, well, I don''t like it ;-)It also would be nice to see the medals completely. Instead I see the dark cloth or something like that. I also don''t like that the right edge of the photo is visible.Anyway, it fits the challenge and it''s a good idea.-stephan', '2002-08-09 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98746, 4021, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I''m glad you chose to leave this in color as well, the medals really add to the contrasts here.  One of my highest rated this round</td>', 'Nice composition.  I''m glad you chose to leave this in color as well, the medals really add to the contrasts here.  One of my highest rated this round', '2002-08-10 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98747, 4021, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image!  I don''t understand the cropping at the bottom, the metals are partly missing, plus the right edge of the shot has me asking why.  Are the metals themselves a bit worn, I just can''t see that as being a focus issue.  Overall, nice job!  8 Swash</td>', 'This is a wonderful image!  I don''t understand the cropping at the bottom, the metals are partly missing, plus the right edge of the shot has me asking why.  Are the metals themselves a bit worn, I just can''t see that as being a focus issue.  Overall, nice job!  8 Swash', '2002-08-10 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98748, 4022, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but I wish that the bridge were in focus. I think one or two steps down in aperture would have given just a bit more DOF but would have kept the same mood.</td>', 'Nice photo but I wish that the bridge were in focus. I think one or two steps down in aperture would have given just a bit more DOF but would have kept the same mood.', '2002-08-05 03:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98749, 4022, 2928, '<td valign="top">Very artistic and fits the challenge well - but I would have liked a much shaper focus - I''m being picky there. I love the lighting... (6)</td>', 'Very artistic and fits the challenge well - but I would have liked a much shaper focus - I''m being picky there. I love the lighting... (6)', '2002-08-05 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98750, 4022, 1569, '<td valign="top">I think there should be more than just two inches of string in focus.Almost no depth of field here.</td>', 'I think there should be more than just two inches of string in focus.Almost no depth of field here.', '2002-08-05 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98751, 4022, 2717, '<td valign="top">Not very clear.</td>', 'Not very clear.', '2002-08-05 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98752, 4022, 2466, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a crisper focus</td>', 'Perhaps a crisper focus', '2002-08-05 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98753, 4022, 1856, '<td valign="top">Very unique perspective.  I would have liked greater focus in the foreground and blurring in the distance.  This tells me I wouldn''t like to be farsighted.  Good idea.  Lisa</td>', 'Very unique perspective.  I would have liked greater focus in the foreground and blurring in the distance.  This tells me I wouldn''t like to be farsighted.  Good idea.  Lisa', '2002-08-05 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98754, 4022, 2667, '<td valign="top">musical instruments are so hard to do. this one looks quite old and i''m sure its really quite interesting...however, this doesn''t come through well in the photo. in fact, i''m not at all sure what it is? a sitar? in any case, the lighting is quite harsh, and it would have been nice to see more of the subject matter.  ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...4<br/>Meets Challenge...4<br/>Overall...4</td>', 'musical instruments are so hard to do. this one looks quite old and i''m sure its really quite interesting...however, this doesn''t come through well in the photo. in fact, i''m not at all sure what it is? a sitar? in any case, the lighting is quite harsh, and it would have been nice to see more of the subject matter.  ~mcmurmaAesthetics...4Meets Challenge...4Overall...4', '2002-08-05 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98755, 4022, 1360, '<td valign="top">I like what you attempted here, tho I think this image needs more light, or more accents of light to really be effective, maybe some incandescent lights to add some warmth?</td>', 'I like what you attempted here, tho I think this image needs more light, or more accents of light to really be effective, maybe some incandescent lights to add some warmth?', '2002-08-05 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98756, 4022, 1175, '<td valign="top">The focus area is too far out of the picture. It almost seems like an accident.  Why did you choose that spot.  Whatever you want your viewer to look at is the area that should be in focus, and your area appears to be right behind the bridge.</td>', 'The focus area is too far out of the picture. It almost seems like an accident.  Why did you choose that spot.  Whatever you want your viewer to look at is the area that should be in focus, and your area appears to be right behind the bridge.', '2002-08-05 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98757, 4022, 2798, '<td valign="top">Very very very shallow DOF shot. Not sure it works out too well here since the focus point seems to be just beyond the bridge. Would have been nice to see the bridge in focus too. Interesting lighting and angle. Bit of a glare in the middle foreground.</td>', 'Very very very shallow DOF shot. Not sure it works out too well here since the focus point seems to be just beyond the bridge. Would have been nice to see the bridge in focus too. Interesting lighting and angle. Bit of a glare in the middle foreground.', '2002-08-06 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98758, 4022, 2752, '<td valign="top">nice depth and dramatic light...the focus should be sharper</td>', 'nice depth and dramatic light...the focus should be sharper', '2002-08-06 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98759, 4022, 2553, '<td valign="top">Much too out of focus for my taste.  "Something Old" is not the first thing that I think about when I see this shot - perhaps a different angle would show more of the age/patina of the instrument. lhall</td>', 'Much too out of focus for my taste.  "Something Old" is not the first thing that I think about when I see this shot - perhaps a different angle would show more of the age/patina of the instrument. lhall', '2002-08-06 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98760, 4022, 1793, '<td valign="top">i''d use a larger depth of field.. hard to focus.</td>', 'i''d use a larger depth of field.. hard to focus.', '2002-08-06 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98761, 4022, 1759, '<td valign="top">The composition in this photo is simply excellent and is the foundation supporting everything else. The only issues that I can see are the DOF and the distracting glare. For this shot I don''t mind the out of focus foreground, in fact, this is one of the few where I think it actually supports the shot, good job. However, I would like a bit more DOF for the strings as we look down them so as to keep the form of the parallel lines farther down the neck.  Good job on this one, I really enjoy the creative vision that has gone into it.</td>', 'The composition in this photo is simply excellent and is the foundation supporting everything else. The only issues that I can see are the DOF and the distracting glare. For this shot I don''t mind the out of focus foreground, in fact, this is one of the few where I think it actually supports the shot, good job. However, I would like a bit more DOF for the strings as we look down them so as to keep the form of the parallel lines farther down the neck.  Good job on this one, I really enjoy the creative vision that has gone into it.', '2002-08-06 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98762, 4022, 772, '<td valign="top">the composition here is excellent... I like the way the light plays on the strings of this instrument... my personal taste would like to see a little more focus in the foreground and then fading to soft focus in the background... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'the composition here is excellent... I like the way the light plays on the strings of this instrument... my personal taste would like to see a little more focus in the foreground and then fading to soft focus in the background... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98763, 4022, 917, '<td valign="top">That big spot of light is a problem. You need to experiment more with the lighting.</td>', 'That big spot of light is a problem. You need to experiment more with the lighting.', '2002-08-07 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98764, 4022, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice angle, but to be honest, this photo doesn''t specifically speak ''old'' to me.  maybe if the woodgrain was more visible.  technically, your focus (if you decide to use a shallow depth of field) should be further in the foreground, probably where the wood piece is that pushes the strings up (not sure what the real name for that is).  you should also try and use different lighting so that you don''t have that big white hotspot in the foreground.  maybe indirect lighting? -- gr8photos (2)</td>', 'nice angle, but to be honest, this photo doesn''t specifically speak ''old'' to me.  maybe if the woodgrain was more visible.  technically, your focus (if you decide to use a shallow depth of field) should be further in the foreground, probably where the wood piece is that pushes the strings up (not sure what the real name for that is).  you should also try and use different lighting so that you don''t have that big white hotspot in the foreground.  maybe indirect lighting? -- gr8photos (2)', '2002-08-07 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98765, 4022, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good exercise in DOF, but subject is too vague to convey the age portion of the requirement.</td>', 'Good exercise in DOF, but subject is too vague to convey the age portion of the requirement.', '2002-08-07 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98766, 4022, 2323, '<td valign="top">This is way too dark to make out much of anything.  Unfortunately the most prominent feature in the image is the bit of glare below the fret...<br/><br/>--3-- sohr</td>', 'This is way too dark to make out much of anything.  Unfortunately the most prominent feature in the image is the bit of glare below the fret...--3-- sohr', '2002-08-07 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98767, 4022, 3077, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but I don''t really feel like it truly fits the topic...</td>', 'I like this photo, but I don''t really feel like it truly fits the topic...', '2002-08-07 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98768, 4022, 436, '<td valign="top">great idea.  the limited depth of field in the foreground was disconcerting and the lighting could better bring out the color and texture of the violin.  keep trying!</td>', 'great idea.  the limited depth of field in the foreground was disconcerting and the lighting could better bring out the color and texture of the violin.  keep trying!', '2002-08-08 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98769, 4022, 811, '<td valign="top">Wow, I feel like i''m being carried infinitely far away.  Good use of lines.  I alos like the narrow depth of field. karmat</td>', 'Wow, I feel like i''m being carried infinitely far away.  Good use of lines.  I alos like the narrow depth of field. karmat', '2002-08-08 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98770, 4022, 1005, '<td valign="top">Dark image, very steep angle of attack, sharp light reflection (very distracting), disappearing strings (not good) and something unidentifiable in the right lower corner.  6 Swash</td>', 'Dark image, very steep angle of attack, sharp light reflection (very distracting), disappearing strings (not good) and something unidentifiable in the right lower corner.  6 Swash', '2002-08-08 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98771, 4022, 2221, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle! Unfortunately the white spot distracts too much. Use indirect light to avoid this. The DOF is too small for my taste. The strings behind this "thing" in the middle are in focus. But what is there? Nothing interesting. If you subject of interest was the instrument then you should have brought more if not all into focus.<br/>- stephan</td>', 'Interesting angle! Unfortunately the white spot distracts too much. Use indirect light to avoid this. The DOF is too small for my taste. The strings behind this "thing" in the middle are in focus. But what is there? Nothing interesting. If you subject of interest was the instrument then you should have brought more if not all into focus.- stephan', '2002-08-08 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98772, 4022, 2473, '<td valign="top">a bit dark and out of focus</td>', 'a bit dark and out of focus', '2002-08-09 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98773, 4022, 509, '<td valign="top">If the bridge had been in focus, I would have rated this much higher.  You may have had something different in mind however.  The depth of field is very nice.</td>', 'If the bridge had been in focus, I would have rated this much higher.  You may have had something different in mind however.  The depth of field is very nice.', '2002-08-10 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98774, 4022, 2661, '<td valign="top">the angle on this photo is great, but you need a few things. first, try focusing on the bridge, and using a greater depth of field. second, get rid of that glare by lighting it from teh side instead of overhead. third, the shot would probably work better in black and white.</td>', 'the angle on this photo is great, but you need a few things. first, try focusing on the bridge, and using a greater depth of field. second, get rid of that glare by lighting it from teh side instead of overhead. third, the shot would probably work better in black and white.', '2002-08-11 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98775, 4022, 637, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for the flatness of this composition.  4 sjgleah</td>', 'I don''t really care for the flatness of this composition.  4 sjgleah', '2002-08-11 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98776, 4024, 2700, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for the title... however THIS site is not based on titles, but photos, as for capturing fire with the tree... interesting, 8</td>', 'I don''t really care for the title... however THIS site is not based on titles, but photos, as for capturing fire with the tree... interesting, 8', '2002-08-05 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98777, 4024, 2780, '<td valign="top">this is an amazing photo, its a great effect, but I''m afraid I dont see how it related to something old, so I am voting it a 5. If you please email me at konador@mpz.co.uk telling me how it shows "Something Old" I will definatly up my  vote to 8 or 9.</td>', 'this is an amazing photo, its a great effect, but I''m afraid I dont see how it related to something old, so I am voting it a 5. If you please email me at konador@mpz.co.uk telling me how it shows "Something Old" I will definatly up my  vote to 8 or 9.', '2002-08-05 04:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98778, 4024, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... a very subtle way to show the age of the log by its rings.</td>', 'Beautiful... a very subtle way to show the age of the log by its rings.', '2002-08-05 04:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98779, 4024, 205, '<td valign="top">This is mind opening</td>', 'This is mind opening', '2002-08-05 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98780, 4024, 1569, '<td valign="top">Working with fire is tricky--nice shot!!</td>', 'Working with fire is tricky--nice shot!!', '2002-08-05 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98781, 4024, 2815, '<td valign="top">I am glad that you camera didn''t melt</td>', 'I am glad that you camera didn''t melt', '2002-08-05 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98782, 4024, 3108, '<td valign="top">I thought this picture was pretty amazing. This photo definately stood out from the rest.</td>', 'I thought this picture was pretty amazing. This photo definately stood out from the rest.', '2002-08-05 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98783, 4024, 2928, '<td valign="top">A technically superb picture.  But I think the theme is a little off track from the challenge... I am going to score it 7, because I think the actual picture itself merits a decent score.</td>', 'A technically superb picture.  But I think the theme is a little off track from the challenge... I am going to score it 7, because I think the actual picture itself merits a decent score.', '2002-08-05 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98784, 4024, 2172, '<td valign="top">This is just so great.  I gave 4 10s and this is one.  Not too sure about the title though, but doesn''t matter.  Some may call me a pyromaniac (love watching flames, they''re so intriguing), so I may be a bit biased towards this one.  Excellent.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'This is just so great.  I gave 4 10s and this is one.  Not too sure about the title though, but doesn''t matter.  Some may call me a pyromaniac (love watching flames, they''re so intriguing), so I may be a bit biased towards this one.  Excellent.Ruthann', '2002-08-05 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98785, 4024, 2352, '<td valign="top">Interesting and very creative!</td>', 'Interesting and very creative!', '2002-08-05 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98786, 4024, 2912, '<td valign="top">It does not fit the content but it is really a nice photo. You have to force yourself to think that it fits the challenge. Very beautiful shot, anyway.</td>', 'It does not fit the content but it is really a nice photo. You have to force yourself to think that it fits the challenge. Very beautiful shot, anyway.', '2002-08-06 04:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
