(98809, 4030, 2466, '<td valign="top">i really like this photo.  Too bad about the clutter in the background, but your composition made it very subtle, until I just stared and relished the tractor.  You can be proud.  it does''t just sit there. It evokes a sense of history.  It makes me wonder where the farmer has gone, and if he''ll ever be back. 9</td>', 'i really like this photo.  Too bad about the clutter in the background, but your composition made it very subtle, until I just stared and relished the tractor.  You can be proud.  it does''t just sit there. It evokes a sense of history.  It makes me wonder where the farmer has gone, and if he''ll ever be back. 9', '2002-08-05 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98810, 4030, 2170, '<td valign="top">I have a shot of a restored Farm-All tractor that is almost exactly from the same angle!  I bet they''d be nice before and after photos.  8)  Great shot!</td>', 'I have a shot of a restored Farm-All tractor that is almost exactly from the same angle!  I bet they''d be nice before and after photos.  8)  Great shot!', '2002-08-05 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
