(98817, 4030, 3124, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this weeks collection. Black and White makes it look old, which I like. The angle is great: it makes it look majestic, rather than junk. Picture is very sharp, back ground is still clear, showing it is dry and hot. <br/>Jeroen (no photographer, just admiring good shots)</td>', 'One of my favorites in this weeks collection. Black and White makes it look old, which I like. The angle is great: it makes it look majestic, rather than junk. Picture is very sharp, back ground is still clear, showing it is dry and hot. Jeroen (no photographer, just admiring good shots)', '2002-08-06 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98818, 4030, 2667, '<td valign="top">very nice shot. i love the angle and the sepia tone. the background seems a bit littered with other things, but not much you could do about that. well done.  ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...8<br/>Meets Challenge...9<br/>Overall...9</td>', 'very nice shot. i love the angle and the sepia tone. the background seems a bit littered with other things, but not much you could do about that. well done.  ~mcmurmaAesthetics...8Meets Challenge...9Overall...9', '2002-08-06 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98819, 4030, 1019, '<td valign="top">A great photo ofa proud old survivor--very strong-good detail-andrewm</td>', 'A great photo ofa proud old survivor--very strong-good detail-andrewm', '2002-08-06 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98820, 4030, 2798, '<td valign="top">Absolutely superb subject. And I love that you got so low to the ground to shoot it. Sepia neither helps nor hinders. Excellent work. Love it.</td>', 'Absolutely superb subject. And I love that you got so low to the ground to shoot it. Sepia neither helps nor hinders. Excellent work. Love it.', '2002-08-06 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98821, 4030, 3105, '<td valign="top">Really nice job framing the subject and use of perspective.  Keeping the horizon at the top of the tires just below the chassis so that the mostly clear sky occupies all of the area behind the bulk of the tractor is nice and adds to the grand feeling of the old tractor.  This probably would look good in color too if the sky was a nice blue.</td>', 'Really nice job framing the subject and use of perspective.  Keeping the horizon at the top of the tires just below the chassis so that the mostly clear sky occupies all of the area behind the bulk of the tractor is nice and adds to the grand feeling of the old tractor.  This probably would look good in color too if the sky was a nice blue.', '2002-08-06 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98822, 4030, 3035, '<td valign="top">nice!</td>', 'nice!', '2002-08-06 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98823, 4030, 1793, '<td valign="top">finished it is.. the composition seems to be too much off balance for my personal taste.. i''d try a different angle.</td>', 'finished it is.. the composition seems to be too much off balance for my personal taste.. i''d try a different angle.', '2002-08-06 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98824, 4030, 2079, '<td valign="top">Woe, this is right out of the Twilight Zone. It makes me want to wish everyone into the corn field. Excellent capture the tones are superb. 10</td>', 'Woe, this is right out of the Twilight Zone. It makes me want to wish everyone into the corn field. Excellent capture the tones are superb. 10', '2002-08-07 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98825, 4030, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very lovely framing and nice use of sepia.</td>', 'Very lovely framing and nice use of sepia.', '2002-08-07 04:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98826, 4030, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a really good picture.  I think that it''s a worthy high scorer.  I particularly like the sense of emptiness as well as age (10)</td>', 'This is a really good picture.  I think that it''s a worthy high scorer.  I particularly like the sense of emptiness as well as age (10)', '2002-08-07 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98827, 4030, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo... one of the things i like about your composition here is the angle of the shot... this low angle does two things for me... 1 - it makes the tractor look larger... 2 - you have successfully hidden items in teh background that may have been distracting from the image...  I also think your choice of toning works very well... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'Beautiful photo... one of the things i like about your composition here is the angle of the shot... this low angle does two things for me... 1 - it makes the tractor look larger... 2 - you have successfully hidden items in teh background that may have been distracting from the image...  I also think your choice of toning works very well... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
