(98832, 4030, 1041, '<td valign="top">the color scheme works well, so does the angle, but the background, specifically behind the wheels to the right in the photo seems a little cluttered, especially because the tones of the wheel and the items in the background are pretty similar.  i know you can''t always control these factors (unless you could''ve shot this from the other side w/out clutter, but obviously i have no idea what that looks like) -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'the color scheme works well, so does the angle, but the background, specifically behind the wheels to the right in the photo seems a little cluttered, especially because the tones of the wheel and the items in the background are pretty similar.  i know you can''t always control these factors (unless you could''ve shot this from the other side w/out clutter, but obviously i have no idea what that looks like) -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-08-08 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
