(98849, 4031, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. This would look nice printed on a card with a vellum overlay with the writing. An invitation of some sort. seems a little too...sharpened  maybe? not sure</td>', 'Very pretty. This would look nice printed on a card with a vellum overlay with the writing. An invitation of some sort. seems a little too...sharpened  maybe? not sure', '2002-08-05 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
