(98865, 4032, 1569, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice pix, but it is really out of focus.Almost like you moved when you pushed the shutter button down.</td>', 'This is a really nice pix, but it is really out of focus.Almost like you moved when you pushed the shutter button down.', '2002-08-05 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98866, 4032, 2466, '<td valign="top">but not gone!  The roof seems out of focus and the image less than crisp, toherwise I like it. 6</td>', 'but not gone!  The roof seems out of focus and the image less than crisp, toherwise I like it. 6', '2002-08-05 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98867, 4032, 2667, '<td valign="top">several problems with this photo. the first is the lighting, it is just a bit too dark to get any detail in the walls. (they are in the shadows, and admittedly, to have exposed "this" shot to get detail in the walls would have washed out the remainder of the photo...catch22)  the second is the composition.  the straight-on... "here''s a picture of an old house" look just doesn''t interest me visually. third, the focus is a bit soft. the subject matter meets the challenge, it just wasn''t presented in a very engaging manner, imo. I do like the black and white, however.  ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...4<br/>Meets Challenge...5<br/>Overall...5</td>', 'several problems with this photo. the first is the lighting, it is just a bit too dark to get any detail in the walls. (they are in the shadows, and admittedly, to have exposed "this" shot to get detail in the walls would have washed out the remainder of the photo...catch22)  the second is the composition.  the straight-on... "here''s a picture of an old house" look just doesn''t interest me visually. third, the focus is a bit soft. the subject matter meets the challenge, it just wasn''t presented in a very engaging manner, imo. I do like the black and white, however.  ~mcmurmaAesthetics...4Meets Challenge...5Overall...5', '2002-08-05 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98868, 4032, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-05 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
