(98875, 4032, 1005, '<td valign="top">Now this is a building in disrepair!   I will try to add more thoughts to this comment, but right now, I just can''t think of anything "useful" to write.  Color???<br/>6 Swash</td>', 'Now this is a building in disrepair!   I will try to add more thoughts to this comment, but right now, I just can''t think of anything "useful" to write.  Color???6 Swash', '2002-08-07 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
