(98877, 4032, 3149, '<td valign="top">This is a great B&amp;W!</td>', 'This is a great B&W!', '2002-08-09 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98878, 4034, 2780, '<td valign="top">awsome photo, love the colours and the sun beams. 9</td>', 'awsome photo, love the colours and the sun beams. 9', '2002-08-05 04:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98879, 4034, 205, '<td valign="top">I don''t know thats kind of stretching it...</td>', 'I don''t know thats kind of stretching it...', '2002-08-05 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98880, 4034, 772, '<td valign="top">I guess you have probably photogrphed the oldest subject for this challenge :) Congratulations :)  - jmsetzler</td>', 'I guess you have probably photogrphed the oldest subject for this challenge :) Congratulations :)  - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98881, 4034, 2223, '<td valign="top">very pretty</td>', 'very pretty', '2002-08-05 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98882, 4034, 2928, '<td valign="top">It''s bold, it''s dead cheeky, and it flies in the face of the challenge... But, the sun is, without doubt, old... I''m scoring 10 for this; it''s a shot I''d wished I''d thought of, and you''ve executed it with skill.  Even the title has put a smile on my face - will others see it this way?  If they do it''ll win hands down... Good luck...</td>', 'It''s bold, it''s dead cheeky, and it flies in the face of the challenge... But, the sun is, without doubt, old... I''m scoring 10 for this; it''s a shot I''d wished I''d thought of, and you''ve executed it with skill.  Even the title has put a smile on my face - will others see it this way?  If they do it''ll win hands down... Good luck...', '2002-08-05 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98883, 4034, 2466, '<td valign="top">i''d love to have seen this shot with infrared.  you can do that with digital cameras, you know?</td>', 'i''d love to have seen this shot with infrared.  you can do that with digital cameras, you know?', '2002-08-05 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98884, 4034, 2170, '<td valign="top">NIce photo, but I don''t get the connection to the challenge.</td>', 'NIce photo, but I don''t get the connection to the challenge.', '2002-08-05 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98885, 4034, 2641, '<td valign="top">I took this same picture didnt use it though. Did you use any filters?</td>', 'I took this same picture didnt use it though. Did you use any filters?', '2002-08-05 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98886, 4034, 2473, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot</td>', 'Amazing shot', '2002-08-06 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98887, 4034, 3099, '<td valign="top">too much explanation to be part of the theme.</td>', 'too much explanation to be part of the theme.', '2002-08-06 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98888, 4034, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the color tones on this, and the single ray of light at the top.  I think more sky and less tree might have been better, unless there was something really boring up there. karmat</td>', 'I really like the color tones on this, and the single ray of light at the top.  I think more sky and less tree might have been better, unless there was something really boring up there. karmat', '2002-08-06 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98889, 4034, 2764, '<td valign="top">ummm, nope, not much appeals to me, arrangement is uninteresting - too dark - I don''t like the color, the sun has too many bright spots and the "jesus light" is chopped off, the cloud in the right corner is distracting, sorry.. I like some of the tree in the top right, maybe you could experiment with recropping and get a better photo.</td>', 'ummm, nope, not much appeals to me, arrangement is uninteresting - too dark - I don''t like the color, the sun has too many bright spots and the "jesus light" is chopped off, the cloud in the right corner is distracting, sorry.. I like some of the tree in the top right, maybe you could experiment with recropping and get a better photo.', '2002-08-06 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98890, 4034, 1, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but I''m just not feeling it relate to the challenge.</td>', 'Cool shot, but I''m just not feeling it relate to the challenge.', '2002-08-06 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98891, 4034, 3035, '<td valign="top">nice photo but i wouldnt egt the connection without the title</td>', 'nice photo but i wouldnt egt the connection without the title', '2002-08-06 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98892, 4034, 3087, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the way the title links this to the theme really works for me - The link to the theme I would go for would be that since a tree in itself is something old and something which can often outlive a man it has it''s own age. But that''s just me...</td>', 'I don''t think the way the title links this to the theme really works for me - The link to the theme I would go for would be that since a tree in itself is something old and something which can often outlive a man it has it''s own age. But that''s just me...', '2002-08-07 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98893, 4034, 2173, '<td valign="top">bety lights, nice  picture</td>', 'bety lights, nice  picture', '2002-08-07 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98894, 4034, 2370, '<td valign="top">innovative idea!</td>', 'innovative idea!', '2002-08-07 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98895, 4034, 2361, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but a bit of stretch for the challenge!</td>', 'Nice picture, but a bit of stretch for the challenge!', '2002-08-08 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98896, 4034, 2857, '<td valign="top">i like the shot but it doesnt say "old"</td>', 'i like the shot but it doesnt say "old"', '2002-08-08 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98897, 4034, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Sepia tone is the only indication of age, though.</td>', 'Good photo.  Sepia tone is the only indication of age, though.', '2002-08-09 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98898, 4034, 2618, '<td valign="top">Love the colour.</td>', 'Love the colour.', '2002-08-10 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98899, 4034, 2661, '<td valign="top">yes, I suppose the sun does qualify as old. you had to mention it in the title, though, or you knew people wouldn''t get it. it''s a good twist on the theme of "old". also a nice shot. the colors are the best part. I also like the little ray of light coming out of the top.</td>', 'yes, I suppose the sun does qualify as old. you had to mention it in the title, though, or you knew people wouldn''t get it. it''s a good twist on the theme of "old". also a nice shot. the colors are the best part. I also like the little ray of light coming out of the top.', '2002-08-11 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(98900, 4035, 2815, '<td valign="top">What a great vehicle.   I also took a pic of a vehicle.  Yours has such nice color I am glad that you didn''t do it in B&amp;W</td>', 'What a great vehicle.   I also took a pic of a vehicle.  Yours has such nice color I am glad that you didn''t do it in B&W', '2002-08-05 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98901, 4035, 1569, '<td valign="top">The power lines and the utility pole a re really distracting.A shot of just the front of the bus may have been a better choice.</td>', 'The power lines and the utility pole a re really distracting.A shot of just the front of the bus may have been a better choice.', '2002-08-05 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98902, 4035, 1658, '<td valign="top">Really one of the more interesting shots this week.  I like the angle and perspective, photo seems like it lost a little in compression, but I still like the shot a lot.</td>', 'Really one of the more interesting shots this week.  I like the angle and perspective, photo seems like it lost a little in compression, but I still like the shot a lot.', '2002-08-05 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98903, 4035, 1360, '<td valign="top">I really like what you attempted here, but it seems this image has a ton of "jaggies" in it that really distract from it.</td>', 'I really like what you attempted here, but it seems this image has a ton of "jaggies" in it that really distract from it.', '2002-08-05 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98904, 4035, 1175, '<td valign="top">looks like you had some file problems.  If only those power lines weren''t there.  I wonder if you used your flash for this because teh front of the buss looks pretty bright and the area next to the bus does not.  Seems a bit unnatural.</td>', 'looks like you had some file problems.  If only those power lines weren''t there.  I wonder if you used your flash for this because teh front of the buss looks pretty bright and the area next to the bus does not.  Seems a bit unnatural.', '2002-08-05 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98905, 4035, 2643, '<td valign="top">not the best quality, B &amp; W would have meritted more points.</td>', 'not the best quality, B & W would have meritted more points.', '2002-08-05 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98906, 4035, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great subject, good picture, scores well (8) but it''s just a tad on the dark side.</td>', 'Great subject, good picture, scores well (8) but it''s just a tad on the dark side.', '2002-08-05 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98907, 4035, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and it fits the challenge well.   I am concerned about the power lines, is there some way that you could have moved around to get rid of them?   Your picture looks kind of sureal,  was the lighting poor or did you get that effect on purpose?   Maybe your focus was off, I am just thinking with a little more time you could have made a lot better picture.   Autool</td>', 'Nice subject and it fits the challenge well.   I am concerned about the power lines, is there some way that you could have moved around to get rid of them?   Your picture looks kind of sureal,  was the lighting poor or did you get that effect on purpose?   Maybe your focus was off, I am just thinking with a little more time you could have made a lot better picture.   Autool', '2002-08-05 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98908, 4035, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. (6)</td>', 'Nice perspective. (6)', '2002-08-05 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98909, 4035, 772, '<td valign="top">yup.. she needs a little paint :)  I think the jpg compression monster may have snagged you some on this one.. there are a few jagged edges on the wires and the diagonals in this photo... - jmsetzler</td>', 'yup.. she needs a little paint :)  I think the jpg compression monster may have snagged you some on this one.. there are a few jagged edges on the wires and the diagonals in this photo... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-06 05:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98910, 4035, 1189, '<td valign="top">would be good, but to tampered with.</td>', 'would be good, but to tampered with.', '2002-08-06 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98911, 4035, 811, '<td valign="top">This looks pixelated to me, maybe oversharpened.  I really like the capture of this old bus though.  Good job! karmat</td>', 'This looks pixelated to me, maybe oversharpened.  I really like the capture of this old bus though.  Good job! karmat', '2002-08-06 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98912, 4035, 2079, '<td valign="top">Cool Picture. the lighting in the front is great. The lighting down the left is a little dark. great detail.</td>', 'Cool Picture. the lighting in the front is great. The lighting down the left is a little dark. great detail.', '2002-08-07 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98913, 4035, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice choice.  Focus looks good, Lighting is good.  Seem to have a lot of pixilization on the wires.  My camera does that to.  6</td>', 'Nice choice.  Focus looks good, Lighting is good.  Seem to have a lot of pixilization on the wires.  My camera does that to.  6', '2002-08-07 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98914, 4035, 3112, '<td valign="top">Like many of my own, the flash is a little too obvious, but I love the subject. Good spot!</td>', 'Like many of my own, the flash is a little too obvious, but I love the subject. Good spot!', '2002-08-07 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98915, 4035, 2932, '<td valign="top">yeah, paint and probably a little gas.  Power lines in background distract, and you probably could have cropped it closer for dramatic effect, rather than try to include entire bus.</td>', 'yeah, paint and probably a little gas.  Power lines in background distract, and you probably could have cropped it closer for dramatic effect, rather than try to include entire bus.', '2002-08-08 04:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98916, 4035, 2798, '<td valign="top">Another victim of a bad resizing algorithm. Those cables above the bus have turned into dashed lines. Avoid resizing methods like bicubic, bilinear or nearest neighbor. Stick to "resample" and if necessary add a tiny bit of sharpening afterwards.</td>', 'Another victim of a bad resizing algorithm. Those cables above the bus have turned into dashed lines. Avoid resizing methods like bicubic, bilinear or nearest neighbor. Stick to "resample" and if necessary add a tiny bit of sharpening afterwards.', '2002-08-08 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98917, 4035, 3105, '<td valign="top">Strangely while I normally find compression artifacts and jagies annoying in digital photos, it kind of works with this subject.  The color is nice too with most of the yellow still on the front but gone from the sides.</td>', 'Strangely while I normally find compression artifacts and jagies annoying in digital photos, it kind of works with this subject.  The color is nice too with most of the yellow still on the front but gone from the sides.', '2002-08-08 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98918, 4035, 637, '<td valign="top">Yes it needs paint, but is it really that old?  4 sjgleah</td>', 'Yes it needs paint, but is it really that old?  4 sjgleah', '2002-08-09 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98919, 4035, 917, '<td valign="top">Too many compression effects. Nicely framed, good lighting.</td>', 'Too many compression effects. Nicely framed, good lighting.', '2002-08-09 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98920, 4035, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the peeling paint and rust.</td>', 'Love the peeling paint and rust.', '2002-08-10 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98921, 4035, 2618, '<td valign="top">It looks like you over did the sharpen/despeckle tools a bit - the overhead wires are all blocky and chopped up. Or was just a really low resolution image?</td>', 'It looks like you over did the sharpen/despeckle tools a bit - the overhead wires are all blocky and chopped up. Or was just a really low resolution image?', '2002-08-10 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98922, 4035, 2, '<td valign="top">This shot seems really grainy -- perhaps oversharpening or too low of a quality mode on your camera.  The subject is really cool.  It''d be neat to see some macros of features on this bus.</td>', 'This shot seems really grainy -- perhaps oversharpening or too low of a quality mode on your camera.  The subject is really cool.  It''d be neat to see some macros of features on this bus.', '2002-08-11 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98923, 4035, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - maybe<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/>Don''t confuse old with broken down.<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - maybeVisual Impact / Originality - goodDon''t confuse old with broken down.', '2002-08-11 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98924, 4037, 2607, '<td valign="top">i do not see the old...sorry</td>', 'i do not see the old...sorry', '2002-08-05 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98925, 4037, 2667, '<td valign="top">the image is distracting due to lack of focus across the entire subject, and does not meet challenge well, imo.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...4<br/>Meets Challenge...3<br/>Overall...4</td>', 'the image is distracting due to lack of focus across the entire subject, and does not meet challenge well, imo.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...4Meets Challenge...3Overall...4', '2002-08-05 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98926, 4037, 1569, '<td valign="top">Where is the --something old --part? The foreground focus is great but the background is really cluttered.</td>', 'Where is the --something old --part? The foreground focus is great but the background is really cluttered.', '2002-08-05 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98927, 4037, 1143, '<td valign="top">old isn''t my first thought. or my second, but i like the colors. the DOF is almost too shallow</td>', 'old isn''t my first thought. or my second, but i like the colors. the DOF is almost too shallow', '2002-08-05 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98928, 4037, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - good. I would have preferred that the whole stalk was in focus<br/>Meets Challenge - sort of<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good/high<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - good. I would have preferred that the whole stalk was in focusMeets Challenge - sort ofVisual Impact / Originality - good/high', '2002-08-05 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98929, 4037, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is very striking... I like the composition. The way the end of the branch is blurred works in drawing my eyes back up to the sharper part, but I''m not sure if it''s effective overall.</td>', 'This is very striking... I like the composition. The way the end of the branch is blurred works in drawing my eyes back up to the sharper part, but I''m not sure if it''s effective overall.', '2002-08-06 08:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98930, 4037, 1202, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked three times and I am still in the dark.   I suppose in plant life it is old, but not compared to a big redwood tree.   On the technical side you did a good job on the DOF but a large portion of the main subject is out of focus.    In my opinion, Autool</td>', 'I''ve looked three times and I am still in the dark.   I suppose in plant life it is old, but not compared to a big redwood tree.   On the technical side you did a good job on the DOF but a large portion of the main subject is out of focus.    In my opinion, Autool', '2002-08-06 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98931, 4037, 2754, '<td valign="top">I looked again, as the title requested...and then again...and then yet again.  Am I missing something?</td>', 'I looked again, as the title requested...and then again...and then yet again.  Am I missing something?', '2002-08-06 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98932, 4037, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the depth field on this, and the clarity of the subject in front. karmat</td>', 'I like the depth field on this, and the clarity of the subject in front. karmat', '2002-08-06 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98933, 4037, 2535, '<td valign="top">why would i want to?<br/></td>', 'why would i want to?', '2002-08-06 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98934, 4037, 3099, '<td valign="top">what is it?</td>', 'what is it?', '2002-08-06 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98935, 4037, 1891, '<td valign="top">Something seems to be missing from the subject.  Is it part of a larger field?  What''s in the background?</td>', 'Something seems to be missing from the subject.  Is it part of a larger field?  What''s in the background?', '2002-08-06 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98936, 4037, 2553, '<td valign="top">This does not say "Something Old" to me, however, I really like the shot! lhall</td>', 'This does not say "Something Old" to me, however, I really like the shot! lhall', '2002-08-07 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98937, 4037, 1005, '<td valign="top">Were you attempting to draw my attention to the seed pod in the lower left?  There is "extra" light there and the focus seems to be on that area most strongly.  I would have preferred a wider focal range to include all of the grass.  The title confuses me, sounds a little desparate.....6 Swash</td>', 'Were you attempting to draw my attention to the seed pod in the lower left?  There is "extra" light there and the focus seems to be on that area most strongly.  I would have preferred a wider focal range to include all of the grass.  The title confuses me, sounds a little desparate.....6 Swash', '2002-08-07 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98938, 4037, 3112, '<td valign="top">Two changes I would make - deeper field, and more color saturation/contrast.  Good subject choice.</td>', 'Two changes I would make - deeper field, and more color saturation/contrast.  Good subject choice.', '2002-08-07 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98939, 4037, 1041, '<td valign="top">ok, so i''ve looked again.  i think i still don''t get it.  it''s a hanging down branch or some kind of oat/wheat, etc.  it''s brown, so potentially old.  hm.  the background is a little busy for my liking but i understand that you can''t always control that.  i like that it''s nicely out of focus. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'ok, so i''ve looked again.  i think i still don''t get it.  it''s a hanging down branch or some kind of oat/wheat, etc.  it''s brown, so potentially old.  hm.  the background is a little busy for my liking but i understand that you can''t always control that.  i like that it''s nicely out of focus. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-08-07 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98940, 4037, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a great photo... if the entire ''grain bud'' was in focus, it would really punch.. just a bit more depth of field and you would nail this one :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is a great photo... if the entire ''grain bud'' was in focus, it would really punch.. just a bit more depth of field and you would nail this one :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98941, 4037, 2798, '<td valign="top">DoF is too narrow for my taste. And what am I supposed to be seeing? I''m afraid I dont see it.</td>', 'DoF is too narrow for my taste. And what am I supposed to be seeing? I''m afraid I dont see it.', '2002-08-08 08:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98942, 4037, 917, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, shame about the lack of fucus.</td>', 'Nice framing, shame about the lack of fucus.', '2002-08-09 09:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98943, 4037, 2700, '<td valign="top">INteresting Photo... 8 - time is relative...</td>', 'INteresting Photo... 8 - time is relative...', '2002-08-10 01:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98944, 4037, 3087, '<td valign="top">Though I understand that grass like this grows, lives and then dies, looking at the shot doesn''t say OLD to me. Although I can link it to the challenge with explanations, if I were to show the shot to someone who didn''t know what the challenge was, I don''t think they''d come up with OLD at all. Sorry.</td>', 'Though I understand that grass like this grows, lives and then dies, looking at the shot doesn''t say OLD to me. Although I can link it to the challenge with explanations, if I were to show the shot to someone who didn''t know what the challenge was, I don''t think they''d come up with OLD at all. Sorry.', '2002-08-10 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98945, 4037, 2661, '<td valign="top">there must be something here that you want me to see, but that I''m missing. is it the fuzz on the plant? I really have no idea. But it''s a nice shot anyways, so no worries, and I think it fits the challenge just fine. I like the pull focusing to make the background blurred. I also like the colors in the background. the composition is nice too. I would suggest using a slightly larger dof, though, so you can get the whole plant in focus.</td>', 'there must be something here that you want me to see, but that I''m missing. is it the fuzz on the plant? I really have no idea. But it''s a nice shot anyways, so no worries, and I think it fits the challenge just fine. I like the pull focusing to make the background blurred. I also like the colors in the background. the composition is nice too. I would suggest using a slightly larger dof, though, so you can get the whole plant in focus.', '2002-08-11 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98946, 4037, 2781, '<td valign="top">I like the strong diagonal of the way you framed this.</td>', 'I like the strong diagonal of the way you framed this.', '2002-08-11 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98947, 4038, 205, '<td valign="top">we don''t need presidents</td>', 'we don''t need presidents', '2002-08-05 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98948, 4038, 2170, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'The background is a bit distracting.', '2002-08-05 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98949, 4038, 1143, '<td valign="top">i like the stamp, but what is THAT..a rock?</td>', 'i like the stamp, but what is THAT..a rock?', '2002-08-05 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98950, 4038, 2172, '<td valign="top">VERY NICELY DONE!!!     The darkness of the photo is very effective.  Is that somekind of rock the stamp is on - it''s very interesting.  Great photo  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'VERY NICELY DONE!!!     The darkness of the photo is very effective.  Is that somekind of rock the stamp is on - it''s very interesting.  Great photo  9Ruthann', '2002-08-05 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98951, 4038, 2983, '<td valign="top">A little dark in color, but great tone and composition.</td>', 'A little dark in color, but great tone and composition.', '2002-08-06 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98952, 4038, 1327, '<td valign="top">nice arrangement, what is the background?</td>', 'nice arrangement, what is the background?', '2002-08-06 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98953, 4038, 1202, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture with good composition.   I personaly don''t care for the red cast but I am sure it was to cause the subject to look older.   Autool</td>', 'Interesting picture with good composition.   I personaly don''t care for the red cast but I am sure it was to cause the subject to look older.   Autool', '2002-08-06 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
