(98967, 4039, 772, '<td valign="top">are these people old?   The man in the solid white shirt looks older than the rest... maybe he should have been the focus of the effort rather than making a sepia toned image out of a normal snapshot.  Maybe the ''culture'' being displayed in this photograph is something ''old'' that I don''t understand... - jmsetzler</td>', 'are these people old?   The man in the solid white shirt looks older than the rest... maybe he should have been the focus of the effort rather than making a sepia toned image out of a normal snapshot.  Maybe the ''culture'' being displayed in this photograph is something ''old'' that I don''t understand... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
