(98976, 4040, 772, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I struggle with photos like this one... I can''t tell if you were making an honest effort to participate competitively in the challenge or not... your title conflicts with the image... are the dead leaves the subect of ''old'' here or is it the invisible ''old'' fence suggested by the title?  - jmsetzler</td>', 'Hmmm... I struggle with photos like this one... I can''t tell if you were making an honest effort to participate competitively in the challenge or not... your title conflicts with the image... are the dead leaves the subect of ''old'' here or is it the invisible ''old'' fence suggested by the title?  - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 02:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
