(98993, 4041, 1644, '<td valign="top">this was a good idea. There is something off about the light. mayb if it was a little brighter to more sharply delineate the steps.</td>', 'this was a good idea. There is something off about the light. mayb if it was a little brighter to more sharply delineate the steps.', '2002-08-06 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98994, 4041, 2798, '<td valign="top">Interesting viewing angle - really draws the eye down to the bottom of the stairwell and holds it there. It''s a little gloomy but that''s obviously down to the location - not much you could do with that. Some strange blockyness on the red rail in the top right corner. Seems to be because it''s against the gridwork metal floor. Nothing to do with your camera or processing - just an odd optical effect I think.</td>', 'Interesting viewing angle - really draws the eye down to the bottom of the stairwell and holds it there. It''s a little gloomy but that''s obviously down to the location - not much you could do with that. Some strange blockyness on the red rail in the top right corner. Seems to be because it''s against the gridwork metal floor. Nothing to do with your camera or processing - just an odd optical effect I think.', '2002-08-07 05:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98995, 4041, 885, '<td valign="top">Weird, it looks sort of like an umbrella.  But I''ll take your word it''s a spiral stairwell :-)  The red railing is really nice in there.  Interesting subject, seems a little bit soft though.  I hate leaving that comment, but it really does.</td>', 'Weird, it looks sort of like an umbrella.  But I''ll take your word it''s a spiral stairwell :-)  The red railing is really nice in there.  Interesting subject, seems a little bit soft though.  I hate leaving that comment, but it really does.', '2002-08-07 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98996, 4041, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Not as strong as it could be though.</td>', 'Good idea.  Not as strong as it could be though.', '2002-08-07 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98997, 4041, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the patterns in this image... I think a little extra sharpness would be a nice enhancement :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like the patterns in this image... I think a little extra sharpness would be a nice enhancement :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98998, 4041, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the way the red rail leads your eyes through the stairs.  This picture has a neat effect.  karmat</td>', 'I like the way the red rail leads your eyes through the stairs.  This picture has a neat effect.  karmat', '2002-08-08 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
