(99016, 4043, 1037, '<td valign="top">Stunning! I love this photo. The composition is cluttered, in a way, but not overly so... just enough to reveal all the varied discolouration of the mechanism. The composition draws my eye around, but isn''t too distracting. The lighting, focus, exposure, etc. work perfectly to highlight all the textures in the image. 10 from me! - lisae</td>', 'Stunning! I love this photo. The composition is cluttered, in a way, but not overly so... just enough to reveal all the varied discolouration of the mechanism. The composition draws my eye around, but isn''t too distracting. The lighting, focus, exposure, etc. work perfectly to highlight all the textures in the image. 10 from me! - lisae', '2002-08-06 08:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
