(99034, 4044, 2667, '<td valign="top">very moody and soft. lovely color and textures. couldn''t change a thing.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...8<br/>Meets Challenge...8<br/>Overall...</td>', 'very moody and soft. lovely color and textures. couldn''t change a thing.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...8Meets Challenge...8Overall...', '2002-08-06 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99035, 4044, 2551, '<td valign="top">Good composition</td>', 'Good composition', '2002-08-06 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99036, 4044, 2798, '<td valign="top">What is derelict? The building? The wall? The corrugated iron sheet? Nice focus, colour and contrast but the picture lacks direction. Where are we supposed to be looking?</td>', 'What is derelict? The building? The wall? The corrugated iron sheet? Nice focus, colour and contrast but the picture lacks direction. Where are we supposed to be looking?', '2002-08-06 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99037, 4044, 2937, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition of the picture. The corrugated metal in the front is a real eye-catcher and the vanishing of the colours towards the back are great! Congratulations</td>', 'Very nice composition of the picture. The corrugated metal in the front is a real eye-catcher and the vanishing of the colours towards the back are great! Congratulations', '2002-08-06 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99038, 4044, 3105, '<td valign="top">Good job of conveying the subject.  I like the contrasting colors of bright greens and brown/red rust.  The amount of new growth over and around the structure and the metal help define your subject.  Great framing too.</td>', 'Good job of conveying the subject.  I like the contrasting colors of bright greens and brown/red rust.  The amount of new growth over and around the structure and the metal help define your subject.  Great framing too.', '2002-08-06 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99039, 4044, 1, '<td valign="top">great composure and exposure.  basicaly perfect.</td>', 'great composure and exposure.  basicaly perfect.', '2002-08-06 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99040, 4044, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice example of ''rustic'' :)  I think the top portion of this image is slightly over exposed.. .maybe a neutral density or polarizing filter would remedy this one.  Good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice example of ''rustic'' :)  I think the top portion of this image is slightly over exposed.. .maybe a neutral density or polarizing filter would remedy this one.  Good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-06 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99041, 4044, 917, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the old roofing to get something into the foreground.</td>', 'Nice use of the old roofing to get something into the foreground.', '2002-08-09 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99042, 4044, 3112, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject.  Slightly overexposed. I would crank the EV down 2/3 to 1 stop</td>', 'Wonderful subject.  Slightly overexposed. I would crank the EV down 2/3 to 1 stop', '2002-08-09 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99043, 4044, 2700, '<td valign="top">nice title :) I like the "DOF" - as it is commonly refered to on this site...</td>', 'nice title :) I like the "DOF" - as it is commonly refered to on this site...', '2002-08-10 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99044, 4044, 2204, '<td valign="top">Foreground (corrigated tin) image detracts from building.  =5 in my humble opinion - syamjonimi</td>', 'Foreground (corrigated tin) image detracts from building.  =5 in my humble opinion - syamjonimi', '2002-08-10 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99045, 4044, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - good. I''d like to see it without the metal roof in foreground<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - probably. Might look unkempt, not old.<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - good. I''d like to see it without the metal roof in foregroundTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - probably. Might look unkempt, not old.Visual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-10 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99046, 4044, 2661, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful subject. I like the color contrast between the warm rust and bricks and the cool grass. you might want to try to tone down the sky. if you made the whole image a little darker, it might enhance the abandoned feeling of the building and keep the sky from bleeding like that. nice shot.</td>', 'this is a wonderful subject. I like the color contrast between the warm rust and bricks and the cool grass. you might want to try to tone down the sky. if you made the whole image a little darker, it might enhance the abandoned feeling of the building and keep the sky from bleeding like that. nice shot.', '2002-08-11 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99047, 4045, 2003, '<td valign="top">the 1st penny backed with the Lincoln Memorial was minted in 1959</td>', 'the 1st penny backed with the Lincoln Memorial was minted in 1959', '2002-08-05 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99048, 4045, 1569, '<td valign="top">I''ll have to take your word on the date.The penny looks out of place here,maybe its too new.The other coins are really interesting because of the way they have aged.</td>', 'I''ll have to take your word on the date.The penny looks out of place here,maybe its too new.The other coins are really interesting because of the way they have aged.', '2002-08-05 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99049, 4045, 2223, '<td valign="top">we should get our coin collection together!!</td>', 'we should get our coin collection together!!', '2002-08-05 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99050, 4045, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and arrangement, although it would have been nice to see some of the dates on the coins.  It also appears to need a little color adjustment.</td>', 'I like the idea and arrangement, although it would have been nice to see some of the dates on the coins.  It also appears to need a little color adjustment.', '2002-08-05 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99051, 4045, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - not without the title<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - not without the titleVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-05 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99052, 4045, 2172, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  I like the lighting/coloring.  I like that you can see the dimensions of the coins (no just flat).  Very nice detail and great texture.  Culture''ific!!!   9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Very well done.  I like the lighting/coloring.  I like that you can see the dimensions of the coins (no just flat).  Very nice detail and great texture.  Culture''ific!!!   9Ruthann', '2002-08-05 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99053, 4045, 3077, '<td valign="top">Lovely collection of textures and tones you have here...</td>', 'Lovely collection of textures and tones you have here...', '2002-08-06 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99054, 4045, 3044, '<td valign="top">nice compositon. needs some color correction. little too yellow.</td>', 'nice compositon. needs some color correction. little too yellow.', '2002-08-06 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99055, 4045, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro!  Good focus and composition.  I like how you have filled the frame up with the different coins. karmat</td>', 'Excellent macro!  Good focus and composition.  I like how you have filled the frame up with the different coins. karmat', '2002-08-06 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99056, 4045, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting composition of old coins... the only thing that bothers me is the penny :)  I wonder why this is here?  Is it a size reference or something?  Good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a very interesting composition of old coins... the only thing that bothers me is the penny :)  I wonder why this is here?  Is it a size reference or something?  Good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99057, 4045, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good arrangement and lighting. Great subjects. Great shot.</td>', 'Good arrangement and lighting. Great subjects. Great shot.', '2002-08-08 07:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99058, 4045, 1454, '<td valign="top">I think the cent ruins it. It takes all the attention and if that was supposed to be, it''s in a very bad place.</td>', 'I think the cent ruins it. It takes all the attention and if that was supposed to be, it''s in a very bad place.', '2002-08-08 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99059, 4045, 2370, '<td valign="top">I think some of the chinese coins date back to even a few centuries old :)</td>', 'I think some of the chinese coins date back to even a few centuries old :)', '2002-08-08 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99060, 4045, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good macro shot.  Color balance is off.</td>', 'Good macro shot.  Color balance is off.', '2002-08-09 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99061, 4045, 1005, '<td valign="top">Can we re-think your title?  If you use money, it goes away, if you don''t use money, doesn''t it stay in your pocket (or whatever?)  Next, most of the coins appear worn (more argument against your wording of the title).  Sorry to pick on the title so much..... It''s a good shot of the coins, but the penny is out of time/place.  Buffalo head nickle would have been O.K.  7 Swash</td>', 'Can we re-think your title?  If you use money, it goes away, if you don''t use money, doesn''t it stay in your pocket (or whatever?)  Next, most of the coins appear worn (more argument against your wording of the title).  Sorry to pick on the title so much..... It''s a good shot of the coins, but the penny is out of time/place.  Buffalo head nickle would have been O.K.  7 Swash', '2002-08-09 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99062, 4045, 3188, '<td valign="top">nice photo..  love the detail..</td>', 'nice photo..  love the detail..', '2002-08-10 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99063, 4045, 3212, '<td valign="top">you must have quite the collection of coins</td>', 'you must have quite the collection of coins', '2002-08-11 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99064, 4045, 2661, '<td valign="top">it looks like the white balance on this shot is a little off. did you shooot it under flourescent light? well anyways, it''s a good picture. if you lit it from the side of the frame, it would make nice shadows and bring out the texture of the coins.</td>', 'it looks like the white balance on this shot is a little off. did you shooot it under flourescent light? well anyways, it''s a good picture. if you lit it from the side of the frame, it would make nice shadows and bring out the texture of the coins.', '2002-08-11 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99065, 4046, 1792, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  The part against the wood and the rocks looks real good, but the part with the bushes in back seems to fade into the bushes.</td>', 'Nice subject.  The part against the wood and the rocks looks real good, but the part with the bushes in back seems to fade into the bushes.', '2002-08-05 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99066, 4046, 1135, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see the entire tricycle. Nice subject.</td>', 'I wish I could see the entire tricycle. Nice subject.', '2002-08-05 03:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99067, 4046, 1569, '<td valign="top">The background is really distracting.Especially with the spokes and other vertical lines in the frame of the tricycle.</td>', 'The background is really distracting.Especially with the spokes and other vertical lines in the frame of the tricycle.', '2002-08-05 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99068, 4046, 2011, '<td valign="top">Wish this wasnt cropped so tightly, so we coould see the whole thing</td>', 'Wish this wasnt cropped so tightly, so we coould see the whole thing', '2002-08-05 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99069, 4046, 2170, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this photo a lot.  It blends into the background quite a bit, though.  Less depth of field may have helped it stand out.</td>', 'I enjoy this photo a lot.  It blends into the background quite a bit, though.  Less depth of field may have helped it stand out.', '2002-08-05 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99070, 4046, 1202, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful OLD trike.   Why the heck didn''t you work at getting it fully composed in your picture?   It is such a great subject you could have stood back and let it sell itself.   It looks like you had quite a lot to work with, technically you got it but composition is lacking.  IMO    Autool</td>', 'What a wonderful OLD trike.   Why the heck didn''t you work at getting it fully composed in your picture?   It is such a great subject you could have stood back and let it sell itself.   It looks like you had quite a lot to work with, technically you got it but composition is lacking.  IMO    Autool', '2002-08-05 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99071, 4046, 1003, '<td valign="top">that tricycle is so cool..</td>', 'that tricycle is so cool..', '2002-08-05 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99072, 4046, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice, maybe less cropping so the whole bike could have been into view.  My eyes are heavily attracted to the pedal, when I''d like the focul point to be the wheels (6)</td>', 'Very nice, maybe less cropping so the whole bike could have been into view.  My eyes are heavily attracted to the pedal, when I''d like the focul point to be the wheels (6)', '2002-08-05 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99073, 4046, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a cool tricycle!</td>', 'Wow!  What a cool tricycle!', '2002-08-05 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99074, 4046, 3077, '<td valign="top">Nice tone to this shot.</td>', 'Nice tone to this shot.', '2002-08-06 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99075, 4046, 2667, '<td valign="top">great subject, i only wish i could see more of it.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...5<br/>Meets Challenge...7<br/>Overall...6</td>', 'great subject, i only wish i could see more of it.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...5Meets Challenge...7Overall...6', '2002-08-06 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99076, 4046, 2323, '<td valign="top">Definitely looks old!<br/><br/>The sepia is a bit overdone here, and there isn''t much contrast here. Also, cutting the bike out of the frame in both tires and the handle bars is a bit distracting.<br/><br/>--5-- sohr</td>', 'Definitely looks old!The sepia is a bit overdone here, and there isn''t much contrast here. Also, cutting the bike out of the frame in both tires and the handle bars is a bit distracting.--5-- sohr', '2002-08-07 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99077, 4046, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject.</td>', 'Good subject.', '2002-08-07 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99078, 4046, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like subject and background but shame about cropping. Would have liked to see whole bike against same boardwalk and stones and leaves.</td>', 'Like subject and background but shame about cropping. Would have liked to see whole bike against same boardwalk and stones and leaves.', '2002-08-07 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99079, 4046, 1005, '<td valign="top">Most of a nice picture...what happened to the rest of the tryk?  (front and one rear tire and handlebars cut off)  In my opinion, the subject/background are too close in color value for a good black and white photo.  Suggestion:  turn the bike 90 degrees and use the boardwalk as your background, it shows up really good against the planks and take a step back and get the whole subject.  6 Swash</td>', 'Most of a nice picture...what happened to the rest of the tryk?  (front and one rear tire and handlebars cut off)  In my opinion, the subject/background are too close in color value for a good black and white photo.  Suggestion:  turn the bike 90 degrees and use the boardwalk as your background, it shows up really good against the planks and take a step back and get the whole subject.  6 Swash', '2002-08-07 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99080, 4046, 2932, '<td valign="top">the boardwalk makes this picture more than just exceptional.  The entire scene looks as if it could have been spapped turn of the century.  The trike going off the left edge gives it the illusion of motion, rather than being framed as a museum piece.  Exceptionally well done!</td>', 'the boardwalk makes this picture more than just exceptional.  The entire scene looks as if it could have been spapped turn of the century.  The trike going off the left edge gives it the illusion of motion, rather than being framed as a museum piece.  Exceptionally well done!', '2002-08-08 04:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99081, 4046, 1454, '<td valign="top">I liked the idea, but to me, the composition does not help.</td>', 'I liked the idea, but to me, the composition does not help.', '2002-08-08 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99082, 4046, 772, '<td valign="top">wow.. i don''t believe I have ever seen a contraption quite like this before :)  I would love to have seen the whole thing... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'wow.. i don''t believe I have ever seen a contraption quite like this before :)  I would love to have seen the whole thing... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99083, 4046, 2023, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, except where is the rest of the bike??</td>', 'This is a great shot, except where is the rest of the bike??', '2002-08-09 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99084, 4046, 2480, '<td valign="top">I find all the stuff in the background distracting</td>', 'I find all the stuff in the background distracting', '2002-08-09 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99085, 4046, 2223, '<td valign="top">i d like this better if the whole bike was in the frame.</td>', 'i d like this better if the whole bike was in the frame.', '2002-08-10 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99086, 4047, 2586, '<td valign="top">A close-up of the stone might have been a much better shot.</td>', 'A close-up of the stone might have been a much better shot.', '2002-08-05 04:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99087, 4047, 1569, '<td valign="top">Removing the bird dropings would have been a good idea.Eliminating the out of focus clutter in the background would have helped too.</td>', 'Removing the bird dropings would have been a good idea.Eliminating the out of focus clutter in the background would have helped too.', '2002-08-05 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99088, 4047, 157, '<td valign="top">wow..that''s one of the most depressing tombstones I''ve ever seen.</td>', 'wow..that''s one of the most depressing tombstones I''ve ever seen.', '2002-08-05 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99089, 4047, 2223, '<td valign="top">that sends a chill up my spine</td>', 'that sends a chill up my spine', '2002-08-05 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99090, 4047, 92, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s the death angel on the top. What a cool old tombstone. A ground up photo of it with the tiny flowers in front would be too awesome. I would love to see a photo of this done like that. Shiiizzzam</td>', 'Wow that''s the death angel on the top. What a cool old tombstone. A ground up photo of it with the tiny flowers in front would be too awesome. I would love to see a photo of this done like that. Shiiizzzam', '2002-08-06 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99091, 4047, 1202, '<td valign="top">It''s old alright, but I wish the sun had been on this side.   It is starving for light, maybe you could have used a piece of white cardboard or the like to reflect some light onto this side.    Autool</td>', 'It''s old alright, but I wish the sun had been on this side.   It is starving for light, maybe you could have used a piece of white cardboard or the like to reflect some light onto this side.    Autool', '2002-08-06 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99092, 4047, 133, '<td valign="top">A very interesting tombstone with the creepy skull at the top.</td>', 'A very interesting tombstone with the creepy skull at the top.', '2002-08-07 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99093, 4047, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  good lighting, good focus, good subject matter.  8<br/></td>', 'Very nice.  good lighting, good focus, good subject matter.  8', '2002-08-07 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99094, 4047, 2933, '<td valign="top">This is old - good idea!</td>', 'This is old - good idea!', '2002-08-07 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99095, 4047, 772, '<td valign="top">wow@1698 :)  I thought about doing a cemetery shot this week but didn''t make it happen.. we have an old cemetery near here that has some really old stones in it like this...  good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'wow@1698 :)  I thought about doing a cemetery shot this week but didn''t make it happen.. we have an old cemetery near here that has some really old stones in it like this...  good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99096, 4047, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is sooooo good!  I like the stone at an angle, off in the distance, otherwise, I would have asked you to crop to THE stone (the gravestones to the left are just a little distracting).  The only other suggestion I might offer would be about the time of day, the words on the gravestone might have appeared slightly easier to read if the sun were on them, instead of behind them.  This is great work!  9 Swash</td>', 'This is sooooo good!  I like the stone at an angle, off in the distance, otherwise, I would have asked you to crop to THE stone (the gravestones to the left are just a little distracting).  The only other suggestion I might offer would be about the time of day, the words on the gravestone might have appeared slightly easier to read if the sun were on them, instead of behind them.  This is great work!  9 Swash', '2002-08-08 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99097, 4047, 3112, '<td valign="top">Best use of gravestones as a subject so far.</td>', 'Best use of gravestones as a subject so far.', '2002-08-09 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99098, 4047, 2700, '<td valign="top">might have been more effective with a "darker light"</td>', 'might have been more effective with a "darker light"', '2002-08-10 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99099, 4047, 3002, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot that, in my honest opinion, is cropped too tightly.</td>', 'Very pretty shot that, in my honest opinion, is cropped too tightly.', '2002-08-10 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99100, 4047, 2204, '<td valign="top">I too spent some time in the cemetary this past week.....I discovered that tombstones are a much more difficult subject than I had anticipated.  I think this would have more impact if taken without the bright sun in the background.....=5 syamjonimi</td>', 'I too spent some time in the cemetary this past week.....I discovered that tombstones are a much more difficult subject than I had anticipated.  I think this would have more impact if taken without the bright sun in the background.....=5 syamjonimi', '2002-08-11 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99101, 4048, 2011, '<td valign="top">Wish I could see this in color</td>', 'Wish I could see this in color', '2002-08-05 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99102, 4048, 205, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it better had the bridge not been so small in the composition</td>', 'I would have liked it better had the bridge not been so small in the composition', '2002-08-05 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99103, 4048, 2170, '<td valign="top">Would have been better w/o the guardrails.</td>', 'Would have been better w/o the guardrails.', '2002-08-05 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(99104, 4048, 1280, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like to see less road, which takes up nearly half the picture.  If possible I think a different angle, off to the side maybe to give a view of more of the outter bridge.</td>', 'I think I''d like to see less road, which takes up nearly half the picture.  If possible I think a different angle, off to the side maybe to give a view of more of the outter bridge.', '2002-08-05 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99105, 4048, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  Is this in Eel River, New Brunswick?  <br/></td>', 'Nice subject.  Is this in Eel River, New Brunswick?  ', '2002-08-05 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99106, 4048, 92, '<td valign="top">I love old covered bridges. I think if you had moved in just a bit closer you would have a better result. Still...a great photo. Shiiizzzam</td>', 'I love old covered bridges. I think if you had moved in just a bit closer you would have a better result. Still...a great photo. Shiiizzzam', '2002-08-06 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99107, 4048, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject but we have total blackness inside the tunnel and it''s a little off centre. Otherwise a fine photo.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject but we have total blackness inside the tunnel and it''s a little off centre. Otherwise a fine photo.', '2002-08-06 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99108, 4048, 811, '<td valign="top">I know you were probably wanting to include the sign, but I think getting closer to the bridge would have been good.  Also, if you could have been in the middle of the road so that it was symmetrical, it would have more power.  nice shot, I like covered bridges.  karmat</td>', 'I know you were probably wanting to include the sign, but I think getting closer to the bridge would have been good.  Also, if you could have been in the middle of the road so that it was symmetrical, it would have more power.  nice shot, I like covered bridges.  karmat', '2002-08-06 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99109, 4048, 2752, '<td valign="top">I like how the picture draws me in..good depth</td>', 'I like how the picture draws me in..good depth', '2002-08-07 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99110, 4048, 772, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting view :)  I would have attempted to center the bridge and the road in this shot either completely, or much more off center... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is an interesting view :)  I would have attempted to center the bridge and the road in this shot either completely, or much more off center... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99111, 4048, 917, '<td valign="top">Take a step to the right.</td>', 'Take a step to the right.', '2002-08-09 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99112, 4048, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject.</td>', 'Good choice of subject.', '2002-08-09 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99113, 4048, 2247, '<td valign="top">Nice perpective!</td>', 'Nice perpective!', '2002-08-10 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
