(99505, 4079, 2997, '<td valign="top">You are another person that knows how to compose a shot and tell a story. I need to take some lessons from you. :-)</td>', 'You are another person that knows how to compose a shot and tell a story. I need to take some lessons from you. :-)', '2002-08-05 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
