(99507, 4079, 2586, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Meets challenge. Picture has a nice mood.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Meets challenge. Picture has a nice mood.', '2002-08-05 04:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99508, 4079, 2170, '<td valign="top">I guess enamel instead of paint is the way to go.</td>', 'I guess enamel instead of paint is the way to go.', '2002-08-05 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99509, 4079, 1202, '<td valign="top">They are old alright.   It looks to me as though you are underexposed.   I would have liked to see more of the lock in the foreground.   The board on the right robs from the nice verticle look of the old doors.   If you can try it without the board I think you will like it.   In my opinion any way.   Autool</td>', 'They are old alright.   It looks to me as though you are underexposed.   I would have liked to see more of the lock in the foreground.   The board on the right robs from the nice verticle look of the old doors.   If you can try it without the board I think you will like it.   In my opinion any way.   Autool', '2002-08-05 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99510, 4079, 2752, '<td valign="top">good composition..I like the angles.</td>', 'good composition..I like the angles.', '2002-08-06 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99511, 4079, 3044, '<td valign="top">great composition. nice textures. seems a hair soft. i feel like i say this a lot but this would be a great b&amp;w. good work.</td>', 'great composition. nice textures. seems a hair soft. i feel like i say this a lot but this would be a great b&w. good work.', '2002-08-06 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99512, 4079, 255, '<td valign="top">oooh, i see something new... just kidding! ;) i really like the lines and composition of this picture--very rustic looking. good job, 8--amitchell</td>', 'oooh, i see something new... just kidding! ;) i really like the lines and composition of this picture--very rustic looking. good job, 8--amitchell', '2002-08-06 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99513, 4079, 2932, '<td valign="top">the angle adds interest to this photo, piqued by the flaking paint at various stages.  The contrast of ages in the photo is neat.</td>', 'the angle adds interest to this photo, piqued by the flaking paint at various stages.  The contrast of ages in the photo is neat.', '2002-08-08 04:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99514, 4079, 2798, '<td valign="top">Great and unusual choice of subject. There''s not much light in your picture and that has meant that we''ve got almost no detail on the mechanism behind the white doorknob. But the paint on these doors looks great.</td>', 'Great and unusual choice of subject. There''s not much light in your picture and that has meant that we''ve got almost no detail on the mechanism behind the white doorknob. But the paint on these doors looks great.', '2002-08-08 07:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99515, 4079, 1041, '<td valign="top">the angle makes me dizzy for some reason.  nice catch the two doorknobs like that with the peeling paint.  good focus, too.  i wish the rusty doorknob was somehow more the focus of the photo than the new one ... but still a good photo. -- gr8photos (6)</td>', 'the angle makes me dizzy for some reason.  nice catch the two doorknobs like that with the peeling paint.  good focus, too.  i wish the rusty doorknob was somehow more the focus of the photo than the new one ... but still a good photo. -- gr8photos (6)', '2002-08-08 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99516, 4079, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting :)  I like the composition here... I think a little more light on the white door knob would bring out some of the detail in that lock... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting :)  I like the composition here... I think a little more light on the white door knob would bring out some of the detail in that lock... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99517, 4079, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  Composition seems to lack a little in organization.</td>', 'Good subject.  Composition seems to lack a little in organization.', '2002-08-09 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99518, 4079, 596, '<td valign="top">I took this picture out on our farm... when i took the photo i wasn''t thinking of using it for this challenge i was just thinking hmm that''d make a good background for my computer... once i got home i realized that it was my favorite out of the pics i took for this challenge... hehe funny how that works huh?</td>', 'I took this picture out on our farm... when i took the photo i wasn''t thinking of using it for this challenge i was just thinking hmm that''d make a good background for my computer... once i got home i realized that it was my favorite out of the pics i took for this challenge... hehe funny how that works huh?', '2002-08-12 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(99519, 4080, 2352, '<td valign="top">Help me focus on something....</td>', 'Help me focus on something....', '2002-08-05 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99520, 4080, 1829, '<td valign="top">Stunning B&amp;W,  it seems to "add to the feel" of the challenge.  Great.</td>', 'Stunning B&W,  it seems to "add to the feel" of the challenge.  Great.', '2002-08-05 08:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99521, 4080, 1024, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white and a very appropriate subject.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white and a very appropriate subject.  Well done.', '2002-08-05 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99522, 4080, 2752, '<td valign="top">You have captured the oldness and the greyscale is right.</td>', 'You have captured the oldness and the greyscale is right.', '2002-08-06 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99523, 4080, 205, '<td valign="top">this is cool its almost as if I see a ghost in the picture.</td>', 'this is cool its almost as if I see a ghost in the picture.', '2002-08-06 04:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99524, 4080, 2373, '<td valign="top">I like this alot but i wish the picture were more clear, not so grainy. I wonder if this is due to the reduction in image size to fit on the web site.</td>', 'I like this alot but i wish the picture were more clear, not so grainy. I wonder if this is due to the reduction in image size to fit on the web site.', '2002-08-06 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99525, 4080, 2111, '<td valign="top">black &amp; white ruins this picture</td>', 'black & white ruins this picture', '2002-08-06 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99526, 4080, 2667, '<td valign="top">nice photo, i do find the composition a bit distracting, though. too many things to focus on, imo.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...6<br/>Meets Challenge...6<br/>Overall...6</td>', 'nice photo, i do find the composition a bit distracting, though. too many things to focus on, imo.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...6Meets Challenge...6Overall...6', '2002-08-06 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99527, 4080, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  DOF is either too shallow for the all-sharp-everything''s-the-subject, or too deep to emphasize a focal point. Overall good.</td>', 'Good subject.  DOF is either too shallow for the all-sharp-everything''s-the-subject, or too deep to emphasize a focal point. Overall good.', '2002-08-07 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99528, 4080, 772, '<td valign="top">nice sense of dark and ''old'' in this photo...  the markers are so old here that the inscriptions are worn smooth :)  this looks vaguely like an old cemetery near my home... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice sense of dark and ''old'' in this photo...  the markers are so old here that the inscriptions are worn smooth :)  this looks vaguely like an old cemetery near my home... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99529, 4080, 2235, '<td valign="top">The only thing wrong with this photo is the flag in the front detracts from the one in the background which would have set off the picture perfectly. Still I''ll give it a 9. Great shot. Moody and works well in B&amp;W</td>', 'The only thing wrong with this photo is the flag in the front detracts from the one in the background which would have set off the picture perfectly. Still I''ll give it a 9. Great shot. Moody and works well in B&W', '2002-08-09 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99530, 4080, 2204, '<td valign="top">I also submitted a graveyard photo.  I spent 3 afternoons in 2 different cemetaries and discovered this is quite a difficult subject.  ps: my photo isn''t doing as well as I expected.  Your shot sure fits the challenge but I can''t quite figure out where to focus my eye.   =4 - in my humble opinion -  syamjonimi</td>', 'I also submitted a graveyard photo.  I spent 3 afternoons in 2 different cemetaries and discovered this is quite a difficult subject.  ps: my photo isn''t doing as well as I expected.  Your shot sure fits the challenge but I can''t quite figure out where to focus my eye.   =4 - in my humble opinion -  syamjonimi', '2002-08-10 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99531, 4080, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - pretty good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - pretty good', '2002-08-10 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99532, 4083, 2804, '<td valign="top">your picture is my favorit, it reminds me of my childhood...you got a 10</td>', 'your picture is my favorit, it reminds me of my childhood...you got a 10', '2002-08-05 07:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99533, 4083, 2815, '<td valign="top">this picsture has amazing color</td>', 'this picsture has amazing color', '2002-08-05 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99534, 4083, 2997, '<td valign="top">Great shot &amp; wonderful subject.</td>', 'Great shot & wonderful subject.', '2002-08-05 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99535, 4083, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is so close to being a classic that it hurts  for me, the bit missing is the rest of the bag and the string and a bit more of ground.  The central theme is tops, evokes great childhood memories, it''s got great feel, it tells a story  only thing wrong here (in my opinion) is there''s to much of the central theme. Loses points, but I like the idea so muchINSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(99704, 4092, 1280, '<td valign="top">On my monitor I can''t see the brick because the image is too dark. I''d also like to see it off-center.  Sure does meet the "something old" challenge though.</td>', 'On my monitor I can''t see the brick because the image is too dark. I''d also like to see it off-center.  Sure does meet the "something old" challenge though.', '2002-08-11 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99705, 4092, 656, '<td valign="top">a bit flat/ dull... maybe if you''d gotten closer and isolated a small section of the building ?</td>', 'a bit flat/ dull... maybe if you''d gotten closer and isolated a small section of the building ?', '2002-08-11 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99706, 4095, 2997, '<td valign="top">Another of my shots was that of a Bible whose page-edges had yellowed with time.  I''m glad I didn''t submit it now.</td>', 'Another of my shots was that of a Bible whose page-edges had yellowed with time.  I''m glad I didn''t submit it now.', '2002-08-05 02:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99707, 4095, 157, '<td valign="top">a bit too dark...but nice ocmposition</td>', 'a bit too dark...but nice ocmposition', '2002-08-05 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99708, 4095, 1569, '<td valign="top">I think if you had let the candle burn down to about half way or more the pix would have been more interesting---and the light would have been closed to the book and glasses adding more soft illumination to them.</td>', 'I think if you had let the candle burn down to about half way or more the pix would have been more interesting---and the light would have been closed to the book and glasses adding more soft illumination to them.', '2002-08-05 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99709, 4095, 1003, '<td valign="top">nicely done.</td>', 'nicely done.', '2002-08-05 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99710, 4095, 2223, '<td valign="top">its too bad u couldnt find old fashioned glasses to go with this...i like the idea though...</td>', 'its too bad u couldnt find old fashioned glasses to go with this...i like the idea though...', '2002-08-05 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99711, 4095, 2200, '<td valign="top">would have been better if you could place some light on the pages. book and glasses lost in darkness</td>', 'would have been better if you could place some light on the pages. book and glasses lost in darkness', '2002-08-05 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99712, 4095, 2928, '<td valign="top">Love it - another 10 - it''s magical, it captures the moment, it tells a story, it''s technically unfaultable - bet somebody has a dig though :-) - well done - this has to be one of the best pictures I''ve seen (and there are quite a few quality pictures in the challenge).  Totally professional in my book...</td>', 'Love it - another 10 - it''s magical, it captures the moment, it tells a story, it''s technically unfaultable - bet somebody has a dig though :-) - well done - this has to be one of the best pictures I''ve seen (and there are quite a few quality pictures in the challenge).  Totally professional in my book...', '2002-08-05 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99713, 4095, 3103, '<td valign="top">too dark, this had alot of potential</td>', 'too dark, this had alot of potential', '2002-08-05 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99714, 4095, 1135, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top photos of the week. I love the mood that it evokes. The subtle blue in the tablecloth really accentuates the old yellow color of the book. I''m sure you are hearing that it is too dark but I think if it was any lighter it would spoil the mood. Great Job!</td>', 'This is one of my top photos of the week. I love the mood that it evokes. The subtle blue in the tablecloth really accentuates the old yellow color of the book. I''m sure you are hearing that it is too dark but I think if it was any lighter it would spoil the mood. Great Job!', '2002-08-05 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99715, 4095, 1143, '<td valign="top">the glasses don''t look very old  ;oP  Really though, nice job</td>', 'the glasses don''t look very old  ;oP  Really though, nice job', '2002-08-05 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99716, 4095, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, however a little dark (tough to shoot a candle light isn''t it?).  More light could have highlighted the age of the book.  (5).</td>', 'Nice composition, however a little dark (tough to shoot a candle light isn''t it?).  More light could have highlighted the age of the book.  (5).', '2002-08-05 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99717, 4095, 1330, '<td valign="top">I knew I left my glasses somewhere.  9</td>', 'I knew I left my glasses somewhere.  9', '2002-08-05 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99718, 4095, 3102, '<td valign="top">Just a teeny bit too dark -- would have been great otherwise.</td>', 'Just a teeny bit too dark -- would have been great otherwise.', '2002-08-05 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99719, 4095, 811, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Maybe a touch too close on the left, but that is minor.  karmat</td>', 'Very nicely done. Maybe a touch too close on the left, but that is minor.  karmat', '2002-08-06 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99720, 4095, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of the candle in this photo.. the book is obviously old... I wonder if a little extra lighting on the book would work well here? good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I really like the concept of the candle in this photo.. the book is obviously old... I wonder if a little extra lighting on the book would work well here? good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-06 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99721, 4095, 2861, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark for me</td>', 'A bit too dark for me', '2002-08-07 07:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99722, 4095, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, and the composition, but it is just a little too dark for me (or on my monitor). lhall</td>', 'I like the photo, and the composition, but it is just a little too dark for me (or on my monitor). lhall', '2002-08-07 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99723, 4095, 2932, '<td valign="top">what''s old?  the time when people actually read by candlelight?  for a composed scene, pretty good.  the reflection in the glasses redeems the darkness somewhat, and actually it is quite realistic</td>', 'what''s old?  the time when people actually read by candlelight?  for a composed scene, pretty good.  the reflection in the glasses redeems the darkness somewhat, and actually it is quite realistic', '2002-08-08 04:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99724, 4095, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea but waaay too dark. A gentle light from a bulb is really needed to be able to see the glasses and book properly without over exposing the flame. Very very difficult shot to get right - well done for attempting it.</td>', 'Lovely idea but waaay too dark. A gentle light from a bulb is really needed to be able to see the glasses and book properly without over exposing the flame. Very very difficult shot to get right - well done for attempting it.', '2002-08-08 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99725, 4095, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good compositional idea.  A bit underexposed. Out-of-period glasses.</td>', 'Good compositional idea.  A bit underexposed. Out-of-period glasses.', '2002-08-09 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99726, 4095, 1005, '<td valign="top">I know this is supposed to be dark, but how about burning the candle down half way.  The glasses are "out of place/time".  Your setting seems to be turn of the century (1900, not 2000), but the glasses are very current.  Plus the reflection on the lens probably isn''t a good thing.  6 Swash</td>', 'I know this is supposed to be dark, but how about burning the candle down half way.  The glasses are "out of place/time".  Your setting seems to be turn of the century (1900, not 2000), but the glasses are very current.  Plus the reflection on the lens probably isn''t a good thing.  6 Swash', '2002-08-09 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99727, 4095, 2903, '<td valign="top">A little too dark</td>', 'A little too dark', '2002-08-10 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99728, 4095, 2204, '<td valign="top">I sure hope everyone who votes on this photo takes the time to let the page load fully.  From the thumbnail I was thinking "1", then afer looking at the expanded view I discovered why it is so dark.  This is a very good "available light" photo.  It is quite clear and it is easy to distinguish what the separate opbjects are.  The darkness of the photo almost lends it an almost sinister feel rather than and older feel.  Still I think this is very good.  I know how difficult it is to get a good clear shot with no lights.  =7 syamjonimi</td>', 'I sure hope everyone who votes on this photo takes the time to let the page load fully.  From the thumbnail I was thinking "1", then afer looking at the expanded view I discovered why it is so dark.  This is a very good "available light" photo.  It is quite clear and it is easy to distinguish what the separate opbjects are.  The darkness of the photo almost lends it an almost sinister feel rather than and older feel.  Still I think this is very good.  I know how difficult it is to get a good clear shot with no lights.  =7 syamjonimi', '2002-08-11 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99729, 4097, 205, '<td valign="top">Not  seeing age here, plus the glow at the mid top is distracting</td>', 'Not  seeing age here, plus the glow at the mid top is distracting', '2002-08-05 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99730, 4097, 1041, '<td valign="top">i like the chimneys (or whatever they are) all lined up on the top.  the sunshine is a little too strong, even though it creates nice patterns on the overlapping leaves, but that leaves the main object (the building) dark and not as much the focus of the shot as it should be. -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'i like the chimneys (or whatever they are) all lined up on the top.  the sunshine is a little too strong, even though it creates nice patterns on the overlapping leaves, but that leaves the main object (the building) dark and not as much the focus of the shot as it should be. -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-08-05 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99731, 4097, 2466, '<td valign="top">I wish the colors of the building weren''t so dull 5</td>', 'I wish the colors of the building weren''t so dull 5', '2002-08-05 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99732, 4097, 509, '<td valign="top">I like how the leaves frame this, nice angle</td>', 'I like how the leaves frame this, nice angle', '2002-08-05 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99733, 4097, 1856, '<td valign="top">I love how the leaves frame this!  7 Lisa</td>', 'I love how the leaves frame this!  7 Lisa', '2002-08-05 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99734, 4097, 715, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like how you used the leafs to create a natural frame.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like how you used the leafs to create a natural frame.', '2002-08-05 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99735, 4097, 2798, '<td valign="top">This picture is almost more interesting for the way the light shines through the leaves than the building itself. The framing is nice and catching the sun in front of you is always tricky to get right. You do manage to capture a lot of the building detail but it doesnt stand out as the subject strongly enough for me.</td>', 'This picture is almost more interesting for the way the light shines through the leaves than the building itself. The framing is nice and catching the sun in front of you is always tricky to get right. You do manage to capture a lot of the building detail but it doesnt stand out as the subject strongly enough for me.', '2002-08-05 19:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99736, 4097, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - I''m having trouble here. Mistreated, not old?<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - ok<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - I''m having trouble here. Mistreated, not old?Visual Impact / Originality - ok', '2002-08-05 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99737, 4097, 2752, '<td valign="top">excellent composition.  I especially like the framing of the oak leaves.</td>', 'excellent composition.  I especially like the framing of the oak leaves.', '2002-08-06 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99738, 4097, 2111, '<td valign="top">beautiful subject but the focus looks more on the leaves which are also pretty</td>', 'beautiful subject but the focus looks more on the leaves which are also pretty', '2002-08-06 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99739, 4097, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and framing of this.  It is a touch overexposed at the top , I think, but that causes a nice effect on the leaves.   I like hoe the plastic (?) is torn off of one window. karmat</td>', 'I like the composition and framing of this.  It is a touch overexposed at the top , I think, but that causes a nice effect on the leaves.   I like hoe the plastic (?) is torn off of one window. karmat', '2002-08-06 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99740, 4097, 2764, '<td valign="top">I like this one - What the heck are the chimneys?  I think I need a history lesson.  I like to composition and all the light, sky, sky reflected in windows, light through the leaves.  Only thing I don''t like is how dark the bushes ae in the front.  I know it couldn''t be helped - maybe a friend could have pulled them down out of the way.</td>', 'I like this one - What the heck are the chimneys?  I think I need a history lesson.  I like to composition and all the light, sky, sky reflected in windows, light through the leaves.  Only thing I don''t like is how dark the bushes ae in the front.  I know it couldn''t be helped - maybe a friend could have pulled them down out of the way.', '2002-08-07 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99741, 4097, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great Photo!   2 things I like the best - 1 the way the chimneys make a great diagonal line - great angle  2-The way the light shines through the leaves - very translucent.  Excellent photo quality!  None of those absolutely frustrating purple fringes/abberations - that alone scores well with me.  Great work  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great Photo!   2 things I like the best - 1 the way the chimneys make a great diagonal line - great angle  2-The way the light shines through the leaves - very translucent.  Excellent photo quality!  None of those absolutely frustrating purple fringes/abberations - that alone scores well with me.  Great work  9Ruthann', '2002-08-07 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99742, 4097, 436, '<td valign="top">i like the repetition of elements on the top, but wish the building had more detail.<br/></td>', 'i like the repetition of elements on the top, but wish the building had more detail.', '2002-08-08 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99743, 4097, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting use of the leaves for framing on this building... i think that is an excellent touch :)  good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting use of the leaves for framing on this building... i think that is an excellent touch :)  good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99744, 4097, 3105, '<td valign="top">This is pretty nice.  It looks like a wide depth of field (DOF) was used since most everything looks to be pretty much in focus.  If your camera allows you to set your aperture it may be interesting to see what results you get with a narrow DOF (higher aperture number) while focusing on the building to put the foreground leaves out of focus and blur them creating an intersting border.  (Sorry if you already knew the terms, it''s just a habit from teaching)</td>', 'This is pretty nice.  It looks like a wide depth of field (DOF) was used since most everything looks to be pretty much in focus.  If your camera allows you to set your aperture it may be interesting to see what results you get with a narrow DOF (higher aperture number) while focusing on the building to put the foreground leaves out of focus and blur them creating an intersting border.  (Sorry if you already knew the terms, it''s just a habit from teaching)', '2002-08-08 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99745, 4097, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject.</td>', 'Good subject.', '2002-08-09 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99746, 4097, 3149, '<td valign="top">I like how the leaves help create a 3D environment.</td>', 'I like how the leaves help create a 3D environment.', '2002-08-09 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99747, 4097, 2900, '<td valign="top">I like the leaves.</td>', 'I like the leaves.', '2002-08-11 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99748, 4099, 2997, '<td valign="top">Another caption for this could have been "Past Old." :-)</td>', 'Another caption for this could have been "Past Old." :-)', '2002-08-05 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99749, 4099, 2763, '<td valign="top">The image is great, the contrast with the background is excellent and it speaks to me.  It is worthy of a 10, so thats what I gave it!</td>', 'The image is great, the contrast with the background is excellent and it speaks to me.  It is worthy of a 10, so thats what I gave it!', '2002-08-05 07:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99750, 4099, 436, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see just the door without the grass and other distractions.  As is, nicely done.</td>', 'I''d like to see just the door without the grass and other distractions.  As is, nicely done.', '2002-08-05 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99751, 4099, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat photo... it could be my eyes, but it looks a little oversharpened possibly... Did you experiment with this image any in black and white?  good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a neat photo... it could be my eyes, but it looks a little oversharpened possibly... Did you experiment with this image any in black and white?  good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
