(100195, 4126, 3105, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W is nice for this subject.  It''s similar to another submission from this week and for my tastes, though, there needs to be more of the environment.  It''s obviously a train, but what makes it worth noting?  I can''t help but wonder if there is something off to either side that would help draw attention to the specialness of this particular train.</td>', 'B&W is nice for this subject.  It''s similar to another submission from this week and for my tastes, though, there needs to be more of the environment.  It''s obviously a train, but what makes it worth noting?  I can''t help but wonder if there is something off to either side that would help draw attention to the specialness of this particular train.', '2002-08-06 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100196, 4126, 3035, '<td valign="top">where did the color go?</td>', 'where did the color go?', '2002-08-06 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100197, 4126, 2667, '<td valign="top">nice photo, but the lighting seems harsh, and i really wanted to see the detail in the shadows. also, it would have been great to see the front of this locomotive.<br/>Aesthetics...6<br/>Meets Challenge...7<br/>Overall...6</td>', 'nice photo, but the lighting seems harsh, and i really wanted to see the detail in the shadows. also, it would have been great to see the front of this locomotive.Aesthetics...6Meets Challenge...7Overall...6', '2002-08-06 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100198, 4126, 1644, '<td valign="top">very sharp image, but I think I would have liked it better in color. Maybe the setting sun reflecting off the train and warming it up a little.I like the whole old train idea, though.</td>', 'very sharp image, but I think I would have liked it better in color. Maybe the setting sun reflecting off the train and warming it up a little.I like the whole old train idea, though.', '2002-08-06 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100199, 4126, 2928, '<td valign="top">I love the content and the picture itself  I''d have preferred a colour image in this case, because I think it would show the age of this splendid old engine. (8)</td>', 'I love the content and the picture itself  I''d have preferred a colour image in this case, because I think it would show the age of this splendid old engine. (8)', '2002-08-07 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
