(100275, 4129, 835, '<td valign="top">i was waiting for someone to take another shot of the moon.  well donebut I don''t like the bottom of the moon being cropped off</td>', 'i was waiting for someone to take another shot of the moon.  well donebut I don''t like the bottom of the moon being cropped off', '2002-08-05 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100276, 4129, 1143, '<td valign="top">good job! nice detail. love the lighting/shadow</td>', 'good job! nice detail. love the lighting/shadow', '2002-08-05 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100277, 4129, 2172, '<td valign="top">NICE!  The cropping in this is great.  Yeah, you''re a show-off with that great telephoto lens of yours....haha  says the envious onlooker.    Guess you get NO. 1 for OLDEST!    Wonderful work.  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'NICE!  The cropping in this is great.  Yeah, you''re a show-off with that great telephoto lens of yours....haha  says the envious onlooker.    Guess you get NO. 1 for OLDEST!    Wonderful work.  9Ruthann', '2002-08-05 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100278, 4129, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice choice of subject.  Maybe a little less cropping on the bottom and sharper/more focused details.  I''ll give you an 8 because I''m jealous of whatever zoom lens you have.  Can''t wait to see the technical details.</td>', 'Very nice choice of subject.  Maybe a little less cropping on the bottom and sharper/more focused details.  I''ll give you an 8 because I''m jealous of whatever zoom lens you have.  Can''t wait to see the technical details.', '2002-08-05 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100279, 4129, 2641, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! Very nice</td>', 'Cool shot! Very nice', '2002-08-05 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100280, 4129, 1263, '<td valign="top">I would not have cropped the bottom so close but I still like the image...7</td>', 'I would not have cropped the bottom so close but I still like the image...7', '2002-08-06 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100281, 4129, 1141, '<td valign="top">I don''t like your cropping but other than that, very original</td>', 'I don''t like your cropping but other than that, very original', '2002-08-06 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100282, 4129, 1519, '<td valign="top">Wow! Now that''s a camera! :) Do you use a telescope for this kind of photography?  It''s a beatufiul photograph.  Perfect composition. 10! lecalan</td>', 'Wow! Now that''s a camera! :) Do you use a telescope for this kind of photography?  It''s a beatufiul photograph.  Perfect composition. 10! lecalan', '2002-08-07 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100283, 4129, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture, and I think the moon is about as old as you can get (9)</td>', 'This is a great picture, and I think the moon is about as old as you can get (9)', '2002-08-07 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100284, 4129, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good quality picture but Im not sure at all about the framing.</td>', 'Good quality picture but Im not sure at all about the framing.', '2002-08-08 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100285, 4129, 811, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot.  I love this.  Would definitely hang it on my wall! karmat<br/><br/>PS -- How did you get it so large?</td>', 'Gorgeous shot.  I love this.  Would definitely hang it on my wall! karmatPS -- How did you get it so large?', '2002-08-08 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100286, 4129, 2829, '<td valign="top">This was my original idea...Unfortunately, I could not get a good shot of the moon and I don''t have a telescope so, I abandoned that idea on Thursday....Great photo :)</td>', 'This was my original idea...Unfortunately, I could not get a good shot of the moon and I don''t have a telescope so, I abandoned that idea on Thursday....Great photo :)', '2002-08-08 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100287, 4129, 2353, '<td valign="top">Okay, you have to know that this picture totally rocks!  Only thing...I wish that it hadn''t have been cropped quite so close on the bottom.  But this is definately a 10.  Great job :) !!!!!!</td>', 'Okay, you have to know that this picture totally rocks!  Only thing...I wish that it hadn''t have been cropped quite so close on the bottom.  But this is definately a 10.  Great job :) !!!!!!', '2002-08-10 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100288, 4129, 554, '<td valign="top">You can wax it in a couple of weeks. Why did you trim part of it away? Nice job on the BLACK sky!!!  By the way, isn''t this moon only about 23 days old?---10</td>', 'You can wax it in a couple of weeks. Why did you trim part of it away? Nice job on the BLACK sky!!!  By the way, isn''t this moon only about 23 days old?---10', '2002-08-11 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100289, 4129, 1031, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot, but isn''t that a waxing crescent? (Doesn''t affect my scoring, just like to check these things out.)</td>', 'A lovely shot, but isn''t that a waxing crescent? (Doesn''t affect my scoring, just like to check these things out.)', '2002-08-11 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100290, 4129, 2, '<td valign="top">I drool over zoom like this.</td>', 'I drool over zoom like this.', '2002-08-12 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100291, 4132, 772, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I have any helpful comments on this subject... The focus is a little soft possibly... - jmsetzler</td>', 'I don''t think I have any helpful comments on this subject... The focus is a little soft possibly... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100292, 4132, 2643, '<td valign="top">A visible dog sleeping in the house would''ve made this a 9.</td>', 'A visible dog sleeping in the house would''ve made this a 9.', '2002-08-05 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100293, 4132, 2798, '<td valign="top">Strange - it''s in B&amp;W but my brain is telling me it''s green. Is that the leaves or is there really a hint of green in there? Either way it''s a striking shot. But the dog house doesnt look all that old.</td>', 'Strange - it''s in B&W but my brain is telling me it''s green. Is that the leaves or is there really a hint of green in there? Either way it''s a striking shot. But the dog house doesnt look all that old.', '2002-08-05 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100294, 4132, 811, '<td valign="top">the colors tones in this really give it soem interest, and the brightness helps to downplay the fence.  nice job. karmat</td>', 'the colors tones in this really give it soem interest, and the brightness helps to downplay the fence.  nice job. karmat', '2002-08-06 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100295, 4132, 1644, '<td valign="top">lots of emotion in this picture I thought. I am a big dog lover, so maybe that''s why I see emotion here. Poor Lucy...</td>', 'lots of emotion in this picture I thought. I am a big dog lover, so maybe that''s why I see emotion here. Poor Lucy...', '2002-08-06 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100296, 4132, 2928, '<td valign="top">Is the dog still living there?  If you stick your head in, I wonder if it will come out again?  Nice picture, great atmosphere.  I can''t decide on the technical aspect, it could be better technically I suppose, but despite that I like the picture enough from the composition and challenge side of things to score it well.  Great picture (8)</td>', 'Is the dog still living there?  If you stick your head in, I wonder if it will come out again?  Nice picture, great atmosphere.  I can''t decide on the technical aspect, it could be better technically I suppose, but despite that I like the picture enough from the composition and challenge side of things to score it well.  Great picture (8)', '2002-08-07 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100297, 4132, 573, '<td valign="top">In doggy years I imagine this house is verry old.  Composition, focus and exposure are all good.  Choice of monotone with the greenish-grey cast is good for the something old challenge.  Will a famos art collector buy a print and hang it on his galllery wall?  Probablu not in your or my lifetimes but still a high score in my book.</td>', 'In doggy years I imagine this house is verry old.  Composition, focus and exposure are all good.  Choice of monotone with the greenish-grey cast is good for the something old challenge.  Will a famos art collector buy a print and hang it on his galllery wall?  Probablu not in your or my lifetimes but still a high score in my book.', '2002-08-07 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100298, 4132, 1005, '<td valign="top">It looks like a dog house.  The glare between the trees and from behind the fence take away quite a bit from this shot.  I wish I could come up with more comments that I could turn into positive ones, sorry.  5 Swash</td>', 'It looks like a dog house.  The glare between the trees and from behind the fence take away quite a bit from this shot.  I wish I could come up with more comments that I could turn into positive ones, sorry.  5 Swash', '2002-08-07 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100299, 4132, 2932, '<td valign="top">doesn''t look like even the dog has lived here for a while.  Thank you for giving the dog a little foreground to step out onto if he ever does come out of there.  Nice framing</td>', 'doesn''t look like even the dog has lived here for a while.  Thank you for giving the dog a little foreground to step out onto if he ever does come out of there.  Nice framing', '2002-08-08 04:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100300, 4132, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - good. Did you try a tighter crop?<br/>Technical Aspects - good. Sepia is good <br/>Meets Challenge - maybe, but I can''t really tell<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - good. Did you try a tighter crop?Technical Aspects - good. Sepia is good Meets Challenge - maybe, but I can''t really tellVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-10 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100301, 4132, 656, '<td valign="top">I''d rather see the green in the leaves for this one I think - not sure if the B&amp;W works to best advantage</td>', 'I''d rather see the green in the leaves for this one I think - not sure if the B&W works to best advantage', '2002-08-11 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100302, 4133, 1569, '<td valign="top">Nice--the lamp on the right isn''t really needed---it seems to throw the picture off.</td>', 'Nice--the lamp on the right isn''t really needed---it seems to throw the picture off.', '2002-08-05 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100303, 4133, 1856, '<td valign="top">i really like this composition and the punch of red.  that''s awesome!  I wish the bricks looked older...maybe if you had played with the color levels/saturation a bit this would have looked really old.  7 LIsa<br/></td>', 'i really like this composition and the punch of red.  that''s awesome!  I wish the bricks looked older...maybe if you had played with the color levels/saturation a bit this would have looked really old.  7 LIsa', '2002-08-05 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(100304, 4133, 2717, '<td valign="top">I guess I would like to know what the door leads to. Church? Warehouse?</td>', 'I guess I would like to know what the door leads to. Church? Warehouse?', '2002-08-05 13:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100305, 4133, 2466, '<td valign="top">I really like the red and the wood texture.  If you got even closer would it be even better?</td>', 'I really like the red and the wood texture.  If you got even closer would it be even better?', '2002-08-05 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100306, 4133, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting example of old :)  In this image, I think i would prefer to see the door centered and the light removed from the image... the light isn''t really contributing anything to the image and it is keeping your door from being centered in the frame... - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting example of old :)  In this image, I think i would prefer to see the door centered and the light removed from the image... the light isn''t really contributing anything to the image and it is keeping your door from being centered in the frame... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100307, 4133, 1019, '<td valign="top">Powerful image of a beautiful old portal.</td>', 'Powerful image of a beautiful old portal.', '2002-08-05 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100308, 4133, 2643, '<td valign="top">"Doors to the Past" would have been a better title.</td>', '"Doors to the Past" would have been a better title.', '2002-08-05 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100309, 4133, 2716, '<td valign="top">Somebody didn''t finish their job, ha ha! (paint). I like it.  Reminds me of the old barn door at my grand dad''s farm.  I''m not sure, just an idea, but maybe this shot could have put the door in  dead centre ... some people believe that the rule of thirds should always be followed.  I don''t.  Oh yeah, I give it a 7.</td>', 'Somebody didn''t finish their job, ha ha! (paint). I like it.  Reminds me of the old barn door at my grand dad''s farm.  I''m not sure, just an idea, but maybe this shot could have put the door in  dead centre ... some people believe that the rule of thirds should always be followed.  I don''t.  Oh yeah, I give it a 7.', '2002-08-05 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100310, 4133, 3105, '<td valign="top">I stared at this photo for about 5 minutes trying to decide if the door being off center because of including the lamp mattered to me or not and I still don''t know.  I really like the colors in this photo but I think it may have looked a little better if it was more centered since the symmetrical door fills the whole frame and is the main subject.</td>', 'I stared at this photo for about 5 minutes trying to decide if the door being off center because of including the lamp mattered to me or not and I still don''t know.  I really like the colors in this photo but I think it may have looked a little better if it was more centered since the symmetrical door fills the whole frame and is the main subject.', '2002-08-06 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100311, 4133, 3122, '<td valign="top">sipmple composition,yet it tells a lot!!!!</td>', 'sipmple composition,yet it tells a lot!!!!', '2002-08-06 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100312, 4133, 3112, '<td valign="top">I like.  Good pickup on the attempt by the painter to prevent the subject from being further old.</td>', 'I like.  Good pickup on the attempt by the painter to prevent the subject from being further old.', '2002-08-07 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100313, 4133, 3016, '<td valign="top">i like it! but the ground is a little plain and detracts from the focus of the picture</td>', 'i like it! but the ground is a little plain and detracts from the focus of the picture', '2002-08-07 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100314, 4133, 3099, '<td valign="top">Good color and composition.</td>', 'Good color and composition.', '2002-08-08 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100315, 4133, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice, love that the door is partially painted and shows the remnants of previous coats. Although the low viewpoint makes one appreciate the size of the door, I''d be interested to see it face on, if it''s big, maybe taken standing on a chair? The lamp by the door looks new and jars a little with the fabulous door.</td>', 'Nice, love that the door is partially painted and shows the remnants of previous coats. Although the low viewpoint makes one appreciate the size of the door, I''d be interested to see it face on, if it''s big, maybe taken standing on a chair? The lamp by the door looks new and jars a little with the fabulous door.', '2002-08-10 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100316, 4133, 616, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The nice detail really brings out the texture of the door. Cropping out the light might have been a good idea because it seems to take your eyes away from the door.</td>', 'Great shot. The nice detail really brings out the texture of the door. Cropping out the light might have been a good idea because it seems to take your eyes away from the door.', '2002-08-10 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100317, 4133, 2353, '<td valign="top">Good subject matter but the door is a little off-centered.  Perhaps crop the pic off to center the door and eliminate some of the walkway in the foreground?  This would also probably look amazing in black and white.  Good job! - 8</td>', 'Good subject matter but the door is a little off-centered.  Perhaps crop the pic off to center the door and eliminate some of the walkway in the foreground?  This would also probably look amazing in black and white.  Good job! - 8', '2002-08-10 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100318, 4133, 637, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the composition here.  Too much to look at; the ground in front of the grass is superfluous.  4 sjgleah</td>', 'I don''t like the composition here.  Too much to look at; the ground in front of the grass is superfluous.  4 sjgleah', '2002-08-11 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100404, 4135, 2815, '<td valign="top">WOW that is disgusting, but an interesting photo</td>', 'WOW that is disgusting, but an interesting photo', '2002-08-05 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100405, 4135, 2011, '<td valign="top">At first glimps I thought this was some kind of cereal box front.  Intresting.  Yoou need to do one of those How did they do that tutorials.</td>', 'At first glimps I thought this was some kind of cereal box front.  Intresting.  Yoou need to do one of those How did they do that tutorials.', '2002-08-05 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100406, 4135, 772, '<td valign="top">M R some old peaches :) I actually think this is a nice interpretation of the challenge... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'M R some old peaches :) I actually think this is a nice interpretation of the challenge... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100407, 4135, 2173, '<td valign="top">sinica, sarcastica, ironica ... me gusta</td>', 'sinica, sarcastica, ironica ... me gusta', '2002-08-05 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100408, 4135, 2643, '<td valign="top">Actually gets to be kinda gross instead of old.</td>', 'Actually gets to be kinda gross instead of old.', '2002-08-05 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100409, 4135, 2716, '<td valign="top">Yummy!</td>', 'Yummy!', '2002-08-05 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100410, 4135, 1141, '<td valign="top">I think that you misread the subject... something old not something nasty! Bad idea!!! Grrrr!</td>', 'I think that you misread the subject... something old not something nasty! Bad idea!!! Grrrr!', '2002-08-05 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100411, 4135, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure I get it...</td>', 'Not quite sure I get it...', '2002-08-05 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100412, 4135, 2473, '<td valign="top">Yummy</td>', 'Yummy', '2002-08-06 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100413, 4135, 205, '<td valign="top">yuck</td>', 'yuck', '2002-08-06 04:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100414, 4135, 1759, '<td valign="top">Although the subject didn''t particularly excite me, it did give me a chuckle.  I can''t help but give this a great score based on it''s originality and because it is a very well done photo (lighting, composition, DOF, focus, etc).</td>', 'Although the subject didn''t particularly excite me, it did give me a chuckle.  I can''t help but give this a great score based on it''s originality and because it is a very well done photo (lighting, composition, DOF, focus, etc).', '2002-08-06 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100415, 4135, 133, '<td valign="top">Eek!</td>', 'Eek!', '2002-08-07 08:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100416, 4135, 1202, '<td valign="top">You are outside of the box on this one, but it is a great idea that shows something doesn''t have to come from King Tut''s tomb to be considered old.   NIce work.  Very artistic with good basics and composition.   Autool</td>', 'You are outside of the box on this one, but it is a great idea that shows something doesn''t have to come from King Tut''s tomb to be considered old.   NIce work.  Very artistic with good basics and composition.   Autool', '2002-08-07 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100417, 4135, 3090, '<td valign="top">Unique composition. Great!</td>', 'Unique composition. Great!', '2002-08-07 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100418, 4135, 1019, '<td valign="top">I am not really sure why I like this so much--the contrast between the rich colours of the peach and the sterile plate--the ornate spoon and the title all add a surreal aura-- the focus and detail are spot on---well done  andrewm</td>', 'I am not really sure why I like this so much--the contrast between the rich colours of the peach and the sterile plate--the ornate spoon and the title all add a surreal aura-- the focus and detail are spot on---well done  andrewm', '2002-08-08 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100419, 4135, 637, '<td valign="top">Yes, the peach is old, but what''s the purpose of the cereal box behind it?    Believe the peach can st and alone 5 sjgleah</td>', 'Yes, the peach is old, but what''s the purpose of the cereal box behind it?    Believe the peach can st and alone 5 sjgleah', '2002-08-09 03:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100420, 4135, 806, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well done.</td>', 'Very creative and well done.', '2002-08-09 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100421, 4135, 616, '<td valign="top">Great idea, very original. Nice detail and the Breakfast of Champions was a nice touch.</td>', 'Great idea, very original. Nice detail and the Breakfast of Champions was a nice touch.', '2002-08-09 19:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100422, 4135, 671, '<td valign="top">nice colors, arrangement.  Thanks for the humor!</td>', 'nice colors, arrangement.  Thanks for the humor!', '2002-08-10 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100423, 4135, 2661, '<td valign="top">that''s just gross. clever shot, though.</td>', 'that''s just gross. clever shot, though.', '2002-08-11 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100424, 4137, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Find the composition distracting though. Some items are barely recognizable and it might have been better using fewer of them or re-arranging them.</td>', 'Nice image. Find the composition distracting though. Some items are barely recognizable and it might have been better using fewer of them or re-arranging them.', '2002-08-05 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100425, 4137, 2011, '<td valign="top">I would like this better without the flashlight.  Also think it needs a title.</td>', 'I would like this better without the flashlight.  Also think it needs a title.', '2002-08-05 03:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100426, 4137, 2200, '<td valign="top">too dark. objects producing light would be better if dark areas were lighter</td>', 'too dark. objects producing light would be better if dark areas were lighter', '2002-08-05 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100427, 4137, 2466, '<td valign="top">more distance between the elements would help me see each independently and all as a group, I think</td>', 'more distance between the elements would help me see each independently and all as a group, I think', '2002-08-05 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100428, 4137, 1983, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better without the flashlight. I think the flashlight took away from the picture.</td>', 'I would have liked this better without the flashlight. I think the flashlight took away from the picture.', '2002-08-05 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100429, 4137, 1856, '<td valign="top">I really like this but wish you had kept the plastic out.  Great colors and lighting!  8 Lisa</td>', 'I really like this but wish you had kept the plastic out.  Great colors and lighting!  8 Lisa', '2002-08-05 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100430, 4137, 2928, '<td valign="top">You should not (in my opinion)  have used the modern torch. It also makes the picture too busy.  Lighting is great, in fact, that torch is really my only beef.  An old light in the dark would have worked really well... Sorry to sound so negative. (5)</td>', 'You should not (in my opinion)  have used the modern torch. It also makes the picture too busy.  Lighting is great, in fact, that torch is really my only beef.  An old light in the dark would have worked really well... Sorry to sound so negative. (5)', '2002-08-05 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100431, 4137, 1143, '<td valign="top">might have worked better without adding the newer flashlight. would be cool to use the black background and put a light behind the lantern so that it looks lit</td>', 'might have worked better without adding the newer flashlight. would be cool to use the black background and put a light behind the lantern so that it looks lit', '2002-08-05 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100432, 4137, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good. I would like to see it witout the flash light for comparison<br/>Technical Aspects - very good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - high<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite good. I would like to see it witout the flash light for comparisonTechnical Aspects - very goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - high', '2002-08-05 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100433, 4137, 1175, '<td valign="top">It just looks like a jumble of crap.  it looks like you just tried to put them as close together as possible and then took a snapshot of it.  Try setting thsi up again and moving things around.  If the big thing is a lantern why not try standing it up.  How about showing the front of the flashlight.  At this angle it could be something else.  Also, the black flashlight blends into the background.  Try doing this on a white background. Also, try coming up with a title. Untitled just doesn''t fit. It illustrates a lack of creativity and effort to try and make the best photo you can. -Chariot</td>', 'It just looks like a jumble of crap.  it looks like you just tried to put them as close together as possible and then took a snapshot of it.  Try setting thsi up again and moving things around.  If the big thing is a lantern why not try standing it up.  How about showing the front of the flashlight.  At this angle it could be something else.  Also, the black flashlight blends into the background.  Try doing this on a white background. Also, try coming up with a title. Untitled just doesn''t fit. It illustrates a lack of creativity and effort to try and make the best photo you can. -Chariot', '2002-08-06 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100434, 4137, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement of lanterns through the ages. Well done for taking the time to find this collection. Your picture is nicely focussed but lacks detail in the shadow areas. It looks like you''ve pushed the contrast too far. Overall an excellent shot.</td>', 'Nice arrangement of lanterns through the ages. Well done for taking the time to find this collection. Your picture is nicely focussed but lacks detail in the shadow areas. It looks like you''ve pushed the contrast too far. Overall an excellent shot.', '2002-08-06 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100435, 4137, 133, '<td valign="top">A good visual contrast with the new and the old together.</td>', 'A good visual contrast with the new and the old together.', '2002-08-07 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100436, 4137, 2204, '<td valign="top">This would have gotten a better score from me without the flashlight.  The flash in the glass and at the bottom of the lantern are distracting and makes my eye want to focus there.  =7<br/>syamjonimi</td>', 'This would have gotten a better score from me without the flashlight.  The flash in the glass and at the bottom of the lantern are distracting and makes my eye want to focus there.  =7syamjonimi', '2002-08-07 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100437, 4137, 811, '<td valign="top">cool set-up.  I like the contrast/progress you have shown here.  A color other than black may have helped the flashlight show up better, mayber.  karmat</td>', 'cool set-up.  I like the contrast/progress you have shown here.  A color other than black may have helped the flashlight show up better, mayber.  karmat', '2002-08-07 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100438, 4137, 3087, '<td valign="top">Striking and such a wonderful deep black background. Did you clean it up or did you shoot it so wonderfully black to begin with? I like the limited colour scope, everything in golds, yellows and bronzes plus the black.</td>', 'Striking and such a wonderful deep black background. Did you clean it up or did you shoot it so wonderfully black to begin with? I like the limited colour scope, everything in golds, yellows and bronzes plus the black.', '2002-08-07 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100439, 4137, 2370, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between old and new :)</td>', 'I like the contrast between old and new :)', '2002-08-07 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100440, 4137, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting set of lights :)  The old oil lantern may have made a great shot by itself... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting set of lights :)  The old oil lantern may have made a great shot by itself... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100441, 4137, 3112, '<td valign="top">better than average technical photo.  Something discontinuous about the composition, though.</td>', 'better than average technical photo.  Something discontinuous about the composition, though.', '2002-08-09 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
