(100445, 4138, 2928, '<td valign="top">Fantastic - love it all.  Jumps out at you.  The purist may moan at a few things but I can''t find fault - only one mark for this one - 10...</td>', 'Fantastic - love it all.  Jumps out at you.  The purist may moan at a few things but I can''t find fault - only one mark for this one - 10...', '2002-08-05 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
