(100447, 4138, 2466, '<td valign="top">nice portrait</td>', 'nice portrait', '2002-08-05 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100448, 4138, 2170, '<td valign="top">Fun picture.  He looks like he''s about to kick your butt.</td>', 'Fun picture.  He looks like he''s about to kick your butt.', '2002-08-05 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100449, 4138, 3105, '<td valign="top">This is pretty good as a portrait.  The subject is positioned nicely in relation to the background objects.  The only thing I would note is the reflections off of his glasses and the window.  Possibly using an external filter or repositioning at least to get rid of the reflections on the eyeglasses.  Other than that, this is really good.</td>', 'This is pretty good as a portrait.  The subject is positioned nicely in relation to the background objects.  The only thing I would note is the reflections off of his glasses and the window.  Possibly using an external filter or repositioning at least to get rid of the reflections on the eyeglasses.  Other than that, this is really good.', '2002-08-06 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100450, 4138, 2111, '<td valign="top">black &amp; white ruins this picture</td>', 'black & white ruins this picture', '2002-08-06 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100451, 4138, 811, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  The only recommendation I would make would be shift to the left just slightly and take the picture so that he is further right, and you can see some more of the stuff past him.  This is a great picture I think. karmat</td>', 'Great picture.  The only recommendation I would make would be shift to the left just slightly and take the picture so that he is further right, and you can see some more of the stuff past him.  This is a great picture I think. karmat', '2002-08-06 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100452, 4138, 2764, '<td valign="top">It''s his Mona Lisa smile that makes the picture.</td>', 'It''s his Mona Lisa smile that makes the picture.', '2002-08-07 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100453, 4138, 772, '<td valign="top">How much did he charge you to take this photo :)))  good shot... :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'How much did he charge you to take this photo :)))  good shot... :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100454, 4138, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  b&amp;w works well here.  you did a good job with the glasses (a tough one) and he has an interesting expression on his face.  i think i would''ve preferred it if the gentleman was positioned more to the right in the shot and then in the space to the left there would actually be some specific old things visible that he trades in.  this way, it looks a little haphazardous to my eyes. -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'nice idea.  b&w works well here.  you did a good job with the glasses (a tough one) and he has an interesting expression on his face.  i think i would''ve preferred it if the gentleman was positioned more to the right in the shot and then in the space to the left there would actually be some specific old things visible that he trades in.  this way, it looks a little haphazardous to my eyes. -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-08-07 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100455, 4138, 2798, '<td valign="top">What a great model this guy was. Im not sure why this is sepia/b&amp;w though. It''s obviously a modern picture - the shirt, hat and glasses give that away. I think I would have stayed in colour and let this fella''s face do all the work for you. :)</td>', 'What a great model this guy was. Im not sure why this is sepia/b&w though. It''s obviously a modern picture - the shirt, hat and glasses give that away. I think I would have stayed in colour and let this fella''s face do all the work for you. :)', '2002-08-08 07:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100456, 4138, 1880, '<td valign="top">I like this picture ,,,  Not enough portraits in these challenges ...Would have liked it more if more tightly cropped and in color ...  RLS</td>', 'I like this picture ,,,  Not enough portraits in these challenges ...Would have liked it more if more tightly cropped and in color ...  RLS', '2002-08-10 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100457, 4138, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love all the old junk behind the vendor (is that the vendor?) though the large expanse of wall at the left isnt as interesting. Wonder if could have changed where you took the photo from to maximise the old junk in the background?</td>', 'I love all the old junk behind the vendor (is that the vendor?) though the large expanse of wall at the left isnt as interesting. Wonder if could have changed where you took the photo from to maximise the old junk in the background?', '2002-08-10 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100458, 4138, 3002, '<td valign="top">Definitely old.  A little better DOF to keep from distracting from the man''s face would have made the photo a little bit better, as the background is VERY busy.  Nice B&amp;W though.</td>', 'Definitely old.  A little better DOF to keep from distracting from the man''s face would have made the photo a little bit better, as the background is VERY busy.  Nice B&W though.', '2002-08-10 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100459, 4138, 671, '<td valign="top">What a great looking guy1  He looks like a friend of mine, or if he''s not I''d like him to be.  Very good portrait/personality study.</td>', 'What a great looking guy1  He looks like a friend of mine, or if he''s not I''d like him to be.  Very good portrait/personality study.', '2002-08-10 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
