(100466, 4139, 3105, '<td valign="top">Being shot in b&amp;w really helps to bring out the textures and also hepls bring the lighter exterior of the tomb into the forefront wihle the darkness of the surrounding trees and the archway draw my eyes into the photograph and into the tomb.  Nice job.</td>', 'Being shot in b&w really helps to bring out the textures and also hepls bring the lighter exterior of the tomb into the forefront wihle the darkness of the surrounding trees and the archway draw my eyes into the photograph and into the tomb.  Nice job.', '2002-08-06 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100467, 4139, 1005, '<td valign="top">Let''s start with my bias, I dislike black and white shots.  That said, this is still great and certainly enhanced by the B&amp;W effect.  Very good focus/framing/contrast!!!!  You are my only 10 at this point!  I hope you win!  Swash</td>', 'Let''s start with my bias, I dislike black and white shots.  That said, this is still great and certainly enhanced by the B&W effect.  Very good focus/framing/contrast!!!!  You are my only 10 at this point!  I hope you win!  Swash', '2002-08-06 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
