(100473, 4139, 917, '<td valign="top">Need to take just a little more care about standing absolutly on the centre line for formal subjects like this, you are about 30cm to the left. Nicely framed, good clarity.</td>', 'Need to take just a little more care about standing absolutly on the centre line for formal subjects like this, you are about 30cm to the left. Nicely framed, good clarity.', '2002-08-09 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
