(100507, 4141, 1993, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows, but wonder if it might have been a stronger pcture from another angle, rather than straight on.  Just a thought.</td>', 'I like the shadows, but wonder if it might have been a stronger pcture from another angle, rather than straight on.  Just a thought.', '2002-08-05 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100508, 4141, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Well presented, focus is good, lighting is good, subject is good...  8</td>', 'Very well done.  Well presented, focus is good, lighting is good, subject is good...  8', '2002-08-05 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100509, 4141, 1041, '<td valign="top">it is old, isn''t it.  nice find.  i''m not sure about the positioning of the house in the middle of the photo.  i think i would have tried to position it all the way to the left (maybe even cropped off the edge) to get rid of that blank bit of sky on the left and to include more of the trees and such on the right). -- gr8photos (6)</td>', 'it is old, isn''t it.  nice find.  i''m not sure about the positioning of the house in the middle of the photo.  i think i would have tried to position it all the way to the left (maybe even cropped off the edge) to get rid of that blank bit of sky on the left and to include more of the trees and such on the right). -- gr8photos (6)', '2002-08-05 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100510, 4141, 1003, '<td valign="top">good photo of old</td>', 'good photo of old', '2002-08-05 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100511, 4141, 2667, '<td valign="top">most of the time, the straight-on... "here''s a picture of an old house" look just doesn''t interest me visually, but you have made that work in this shot. it appears to be a fine photo technically, well exposed, and maybe just a touch soft. the power lines on the right are not even much of an issue.  the subject matter meets the challenge, it just leaves me wanting something more from this photo. I think its that the overall composition feels a bit unbalanced, heavy on the right side.  ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...6<br/>Meets Challenge...6<br/>Overall...6</td>', 'most of the time, the straight-on... "here''s a picture of an old house" look just doesn''t interest me visually, but you have made that work in this shot. it appears to be a fine photo technically, well exposed, and maybe just a touch soft. the power lines on the right are not even much of an issue.  the subject matter meets the challenge, it just leaves me wanting something more from this photo. I think its that the overall composition feels a bit unbalanced, heavy on the right side.  ~mcmurmaAesthetics...6Meets Challenge...6Overall...6', '2002-08-05 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100512, 4141, 2928, '<td valign="top">Technically very good, great subject, great picture...</td>', 'Technically very good, great subject, great picture...', '2002-08-05 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100513, 4141, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice detail.  Maybe this shot could have been taken farther away  and not shot dead on.  Looks like the fence on the left could have played a role in the picture too, shooting the house (store?) on an angle. (6).</td>', 'Nice detail.  Maybe this shot could have been taken farther away  and not shot dead on.  Looks like the fence on the left could have played a role in the picture too, shooting the house (store?) on an angle. (6).', '2002-08-05 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100514, 4141, 2752, '<td valign="top">I like the building..If you had taken it from a different and off center the composition would have been better</td>', 'I like the building..If you had taken it from a different and off center the composition would have been better', '2002-08-06 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100515, 4141, 811, '<td valign="top">what character.  my only suggestion would be to move to the left just a hair, so the viewer could get an idea of depth by looking at the side of the biling as well.  Looks like some of the terrain in my area. karmat</td>', 'what character.  my only suggestion would be to move to the left just a hair, so the viewer could get an idea of depth by looking at the side of the biling as well.  Looks like some of the terrain in my area. karmat', '2002-08-06 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100516, 4141, 133, '<td valign="top">I love buildings that look like they could tell a story.  This one really does that.  Very nice.</td>', 'I love buildings that look like they could tell a story.  This one really does that.  Very nice.', '2002-08-07 08:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100517, 4141, 3090, '<td valign="top">Great combination of textures in this building.</td>', 'Great combination of textures in this building.', '2002-08-07 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100518, 4141, 772, '<td valign="top">this place is definitely old :)  I believe that it would offer some more visual impact if it was shot from an angle to show some depth... the straight on view seems flat and less interesting than a view that has more three dimensional qualities :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'this place is definitely old :)  I believe that it would offer some more visual impact if it was shot from an angle to show some depth... the straight on view seems flat and less interesting than a view that has more three dimensional qualities :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100519, 4141, 917, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit lopsided.</td>', 'Looks a bit lopsided.', '2002-08-09 07:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100520, 4141, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Photo is better than average, technically.  Good effort.</td>', 'Good subject. Photo is better than average, technically.  Good effort.', '2002-08-09 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100521, 4141, 3149, '<td valign="top">This was a really good subject to shot.</td>', 'This was a really good subject to shot.', '2002-08-09 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100522, 4141, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good. Did you try B&amp;W?<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - high<br/>I would guess that a B&amp;W or sepia shot with the door, Posted sign, and window would be very good.<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - quite good. Did you try B&W?Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - highI would guess that a B&W or sepia shot with the door, Posted sign, and window would be very good.', '2002-08-10 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100523, 4141, 3198, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more of the surroundings, looks boxed-in</td>', 'I would have liked to see more of the surroundings, looks boxed-in', '2002-08-11 07:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100524, 4141, 656, '<td valign="top">could be great in black and white</td>', 'could be great in black and white', '2002-08-11 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100525, 4142, 1569, '<td valign="top">Nice setup,I like the starburst highlights.</td>', 'Nice setup,I like the starburst highlights.', '2002-08-05 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100526, 4142, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the light and shadow, and even the subject, but the composition doesn''t engage me.  I think I would have liked to have seen the bottle at a more oblique angle.  lhall</td>', 'I like the light and shadow, and even the subject, but the composition doesn''t engage me.  I think I would have liked to have seen the bottle at a more oblique angle.  lhall', '2002-08-05 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100527, 4142, 2535, '<td valign="top">what the.......?<br/></td>', 'what the.......?', '2002-08-06 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100528, 4142, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very well done! I like the unusual lighting. The detail in this shot is superb.</td>', 'Very well done! I like the unusual lighting. The detail in this shot is superb.', '2002-08-06 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100529, 4142, 2011, '<td valign="top">I think I know what your going for here.  Trying to light the image?  But I find the background distracts from the overall photo.</td>', 'I think I know what your going for here.  Trying to light the image?  But I find the background distracts from the overall photo.', '2002-08-07 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100530, 4142, 2798, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject and I love your use of the metal background with the light behind it. Creative thinking! Works REALLY well.</td>', 'Excellent subject and I love your use of the metal background with the light behind it. Creative thinking! Works REALLY well.', '2002-08-07 06:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100531, 4142, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is superbly lit; I love the effects you have created without going over the top.  It gives sense of power emanating from the object rather than just plain light.  The bubbled background just adds to the effect  but does it look old, yes, 10  definitelyINSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(100589, 4146, 1792, '<td valign="top">Good still life.  Nice effect.</td>', 'Good still life.  Nice effect.', '2002-08-05 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100590, 4146, 2815, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for anything that has to do with Pepsi.   What a neat old bottle</td>', 'I am a sucker for anything that has to do with Pepsi.   What a neat old bottle', '2002-08-05 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100591, 4146, 1569, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the double exposure works here.It''s kind of distracting.</td>', 'I don''t think the double exposure works here.It''s kind of distracting.', '2002-08-05 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100592, 4146, 1856, '<td valign="top">Neat effect!  I would like this better if the bottle zoomed in from outside of the frame.  A solid background would have been nice too.  Pepsi''s gross.  Does that mean I''m young? 7 Lisa</td>', 'Neat effect!  I would like this better if the bottle zoomed in from outside of the frame.  A solid background would have been nice too.  Pepsi''s gross.  Does that mean I''m young? 7 Lisa', '2002-08-05 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100593, 4146, 671, '<td valign="top">I resemble that!</td>', 'I resemble that!', '2002-08-05 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100594, 4146, 2928, '<td valign="top">Inventive and well done... (8)</td>', 'Inventive and well done... (8)', '2002-08-05 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100595, 4146, 2798, '<td valign="top">This is neat but Im not sure I understand *why* the bottle has moved. Lighting is great, as is focus. Technically a great shot.</td>', 'This is neat but Im not sure I understand *why* the bottle has moved. Lighting is great, as is focus. Technically a great shot.', '2002-08-06 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100596, 4146, 811, '<td valign="top">Great job at adding interest to the picture.  Don''t know if it was possible, but would have been neat to see a new pepsi bottle coming out of the old one, or vice versa.  Great job! karmat</td>', 'Great job at adding interest to the picture.  Don''t know if it was possible, but would have been neat to see a new pepsi bottle coming out of the old one, or vice versa.  Great job! karmat', '2002-08-06 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100597, 4146, 2373, '<td valign="top">Really good effect. what was your shutter speed?</td>', 'Really good effect. what was your shutter speed?', '2002-08-06 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100598, 4146, 2535, '<td valign="top">i don''t get the significance of the image drag<br/></td>', 'i don''t get the significance of the image drag', '2002-08-06 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100599, 4146, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice work but I would have liked to see you light it up a bit.   Just because it is old it doesn''t need to be dark.   Autool</td>', 'Nice work but I would have liked to see you light it up a bit.   Just because it is old it doesn''t need to be dark.   Autool', '2002-08-06 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100600, 4146, 772, '<td valign="top">good image of an old pepsi bottle :)  The motion blur is a nice effect and well executed, but I''m not really sure what the purpose of it is in this image other tha for a simple special effect.  It does not ''degrade'' the image in any way.. i was just wondering if it has another purpose... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'good image of an old pepsi bottle :)  The motion blur is a nice effect and well executed, but I''m not really sure what the purpose of it is in this image other tha for a simple special effect.  It does not ''degrade'' the image in any way.. i was just wondering if it has another purpose... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100601, 4146, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat effect.  Not so sure about your choice of background though.  And I think the bottle seems to need a bit more light, especially at the bottom.</td>', 'Neat effect.  Not so sure about your choice of background though.  And I think the bottle seems to need a bit more light, especially at the bottom.', '2002-08-07 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100602, 4146, 2323, '<td valign="top">Somewhat dark, and the image doesn''t emphasize the age of the subject that much.  Still, an interesting inerpration of the challenge.<br/><br/>--5-- sohr</td>', 'Somewhat dark, and the image doesn''t emphasize the age of the subject that much.  Still, an interesting inerpration of the challenge.--5-- sohr', '2002-08-07 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100603, 4146, 3147, '<td valign="top">interesting effect.  i''d be interested in learning how to create that effect</td>', 'interesting effect.  i''d be interested in learning how to create that effect', '2002-08-07 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100604, 4146, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not sure why it''s moving? One idea might be to have a new and an old and have the old one morph to the new, as it were... don''t know how to acheive that, just thinking in terms of contents. As it stands the movement doesn''t add anything (for me).</td>', 'Not sure why it''s moving? One idea might be to have a new and an old and have the old one morph to the new, as it were... don''t know how to acheive that, just thinking in terms of contents. As it stands the movement doesn''t add anything (for me).', '2002-08-07 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100605, 4146, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice movement effect, well executed!  The quilting of your background is a little distracting, but not horribly.  I''m kinda confused by the title vs the action of the shot, but I''m easily confused.  Where did you find this old bottle in such good condition?  (was this old enough to have real cocaine?)  9 Swash</td>', 'Nice movement effect, well executed!  The quilting of your background is a little distracting, but not horribly.  I''m kinda confused by the title vs the action of the shot, but I''m easily confused.  Where did you find this old bottle in such good condition?  (was this old enough to have real cocaine?)  9 Swash', '2002-08-08 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100606, 4146, 2567, '<td valign="top">Terrific pic.  Would like to know how you did this.  Spiller</td>', 'Terrific pic.  Would like to know how you did this.  Spiller', '2002-08-09 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100607, 4146, 3112, '<td valign="top">Nifty photo. Age is implicit.  Is the backdrop a jacket liner? Focus is a tad soft, but that''s very difficult to do in a moving shot.</td>', 'Nifty photo. Age is implicit.  Is the backdrop a jacket liner? Focus is a tad soft, but that''s very difficult to do in a moving shot.', '2002-08-09 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100608, 4146, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  So, either you or someone in the family is a pack-rat huh?  <br/>Creative.  Nice technique.  The top half of the background is visible and looks blue - could be the monitor.  A little piece of history.  Great photo -9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great photo!  So, either you or someone in the family is a pack-rat huh?  Creative.  Nice technique.  The top half of the background is visible and looks blue - could be the monitor.  A little piece of history.  Great photo -9Ruthann', '2002-08-09 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100609, 4146, 2618, '<td valign="top">Why the motiuon blur? It doesn''t seem to fit with the subject or the title.</td>', 'Why the motiuon blur? It doesn''t seem to fit with the subject or the title.', '2002-08-10 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100610, 4146, 2829, '<td valign="top">I am a pepsi fiend...I love the motion blur but have a suggestion :) Would have been nice if you did a tranition between new pepsi plastic bottles and the old one...But it''s a great picture nevertheless...</td>', 'I am a pepsi fiend...I love the motion blur but have a suggestion :) Would have been nice if you did a tranition between new pepsi plastic bottles and the old one...But it''s a great picture nevertheless...', '2002-08-11 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100611, 4146, 2661, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get why you made it move, but it''s a nice effect. a nice, original subject. I like that.</td>', 'I don''t really get why you made it move, but it''s a nice effect. a nice, original subject. I like that.', '2002-08-11 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100612, 4146, 637, '<td valign="top">I like it alot, and I''m not sure what the special effect adds to it.  6 sjgleah</td>', 'I like it alot, and I''m not sure what the special effect adds to it.  6 sjgleah', '2002-08-11 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100613, 4146, 2781, '<td valign="top">Gotta love Pepsi!</td>', 'Gotta love Pepsi!', '2002-08-11 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100614, 4146, 2109, '<td valign="top">heh ;)  Thanks all for the comments (if you ever read this).  The "motion blur" is there just to break up the boredom of a tradition still life.  It has no special meaning, although this photo is the first in a personal series that will eventually become a shot of an old pepsi bottle fading into a new pepsi bottle (or can).  <br/><br/>This shot was attained by moving the tripod along its lateral axis at the beginning of a 2 second exposure, under 100% natural light shining through the window.  Exposure compensation was maxed out.</td>', 'heh ;)  Thanks all for the comments (if you ever read this).  The "motion blur" is there just to break up the boredom of a tradition still life.  It has no special meaning, although this photo is the first in a personal series that will eventually become a shot of an old pepsi bottle fading into a new pepsi bottle (or can).  This shot was attained by moving the tripod along its lateral axis at the beginning of a 2 second exposure, under 100% natural light shining through the window.  Exposure compensation was maxed out.', '2002-08-12 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(100615, 4147, 2815, '<td valign="top">this must be right in the garden.  It looks like I can see Cabbage and some tomatoes</td>', 'this must be right in the garden.  It looks like I can see Cabbage and some tomatoes', '2002-08-05 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100616, 4147, 3084, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colour.  Almost surreal.</td>', 'Wonderful colour.  Almost surreal.', '2002-08-05 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100617, 4147, 1569, '<td valign="top">A little bit light and (I think) needs more contrast.Otherwise nice pix.</td>', 'A little bit light and (I think) needs more contrast.Otherwise nice pix.', '2002-08-05 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100618, 4147, 2125, '<td valign="top">very good color and focus and title...</td>', 'very good color and focus and title...', '2002-08-05 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100619, 4147, 2170, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The color seems a bit washed out -- would like to see more definition of the colors.</td>', 'Very nice.  The color seems a bit washed out -- would like to see more definition of the colors.', '2002-08-05 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100620, 4147, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and beautiful "color palette" - very pleasing to look at. lhall</td>', 'Nice composition and beautiful "color palette" - very pleasing to look at. lhall', '2002-08-05 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100621, 4147, 772, '<td valign="top">I definitely think this is good work :)  I wish there was a way to add some contrast thought... I also wonder if a different angle would have allowed you to remove the wooden post from the image... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I definitely think this is good work :)  I wish there was a way to add some contrast thought... I also wonder if a different angle would have allowed you to remove the wooden post from the image... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100622, 4147, 2667, '<td valign="top">for me, finding this photo was like discovering a diamond in the rough. lovely in its own right, but it was clear that with a little polishing through photoshop by tweaking the levels, contrast, saturation, sharpening, etc... that this photo would be a real gem. if you dont use photoshop or one of its equivalents, i urge you to look into doing so. myself and many others on this site would be happy to answer any questions you may have about their use.    ~mcmurma (revised 8/11 because i felt the wording in the original was a bit harsh and subject to misinterpretation. my apologies if it offended in any way) <br/>Aesthetics...7 (as is, it would be a 9 or 10 if tweaked)<br/>Meets Challenge...9<br/>Overall...8</td>', 'for me, finding this photo was like discovering a diamond in the rough. lovely in its own right, but it was clear that with a little polishing through photoshop by tweaking the levels, contrast, saturation, sharpening, etc... that this photo would be a real gem. if you dont use photoshop or one of its equivalents, i urge you to look into doing so. myself and many others on this site would be happy to answer any questions you may have about their use.    ~mcmurma (revised 8/11 because i felt the wording in the original was a bit harsh and subject to misinterpretation. my apologies if it offended in any way) Aesthetics...7 (as is, it would be a 9 or 10 if tweaked)Meets Challenge...9Overall...8', '2002-08-05 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100623, 4147, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - Very good<br/>Technical Aspects - Very good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes+<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - high<br/>Looks like a painting. Great job. In my top 3.</td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - Very goodTechnical Aspects - Very goodMeets Challenge - yes+Visual Impact / Originality - highLooks like a painting. Great job. In my top 3.', '2002-08-05 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100624, 4147, 2928, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen the entire barrow.  Apart from that  good shootingINSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(100789, 4160, 2717, '<td valign="top">Could Bob Vella do anything with this? 6</td>', 'Could Bob Vella do anything with this? 6', '2002-08-05 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100790, 4160, 2170, '<td valign="top">I would crop this so the porch support is not almost dead center.</td>', 'I would crop this so the porch support is not almost dead center.', '2002-08-05 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100791, 4160, 2123, '<td valign="top">I like that you cropped it down and didn''t succumb to the temptation to show the whole building. :-) 7</td>', 'I like that you cropped it down and didn''t succumb to the temptation to show the whole building. :-) 7', '2002-08-05 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100792, 4160, 772, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a decent example of ''old'' :)  The weeds in the foreground of the image seem to work out ok as an enhancement to the ''rural'' mood of the photo.  The overall image seems a little ''flat'' and lacking depth... I wonder if there would have been a different angle for this shot that would give a better three dimensional feel to the image?  - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is definitely a decent example of ''old'' :)  The weeds in the foreground of the image seem to work out ok as an enhancement to the ''rural'' mood of the photo.  The overall image seems a little ''flat'' and lacking depth... I wonder if there would have been a different angle for this shot that would give a better three dimensional feel to the image?  - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100793, 4160, 2172, '<td valign="top">One of the few house shots that I liked.  I very much like the coloring and lighting.  The cropping is great.  The green weeds really bring out the weatheredness of the structure.  Great work - 9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'One of the few house shots that I liked.  I very much like the coloring and lighting.  The cropping is great.  The green weeds really bring out the weatheredness of the structure.  Great work - 9Ruthann', '2002-08-05 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100794, 4160, 1143, '<td valign="top">nice lighting</td>', 'nice lighting', '2002-08-05 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100795, 4160, 3105, '<td valign="top">I like the aged look of the house but for me there is no clear focal point.  My eyes shift between the broken window and the boarded up door.  To further complicate things the horizontal elements of the electricity meter (?) and the wooden supports lie right in the middle of the frame adding more separation to the two possible subjects.  Focusing on one element (door or window) and maybe composing the supports off to one side would have worked better for me.  This would probably look good in B&amp;W too.</td>', 'I like the aged look of the house but for me there is no clear focal point.  My eyes shift between the broken window and the boarded up door.  To further complicate things the horizontal elements of the electricity meter (?) and the wooden supports lie right in the middle of the frame adding more separation to the two possible subjects.  Focusing on one element (door or window) and maybe composing the supports off to one side would have worked better for me.  This would probably look good in B&W too.', '2002-08-06 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100796, 4160, 2667, '<td valign="top">great image, good moody lighting.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...8<br/>Meets Challenge...8<br/>overall...8</td>', 'great image, good moody lighting.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...8Meets Challenge...8overall...8', '2002-08-06 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100797, 4160, 2932, '<td valign="top">not an interesting angle (head on), but contains many old elements - flaking paint, broken windows, midding doorknob, askew boards.</td>', 'not an interesting angle (head on), but contains many old elements - flaking paint, broken windows, midding doorknob, askew boards.', '2002-08-08 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100798, 4160, 806, '<td valign="top">good job. nice detail.</td>', 'good job. nice detail.', '2002-08-09 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100799, 4160, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent technical photo. Great colors.  I think old very easily with this one.</td>', 'Excellent technical photo. Great colors.  I think old very easily with this one.', '2002-08-09 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
