(100830, 4161, 917, '<td valign="top">Turf roofs? Must be Iceland, must be Arni. This may become this weeks winner, but I think you''ve sold out this week. Please get back to giving your adoring public a masterclass in use of DOF and negative space.</td>', 'Turf roofs? Must be Iceland, must be Arni. This may become this weeks winner, but I think you''ve sold out this week. Please get back to giving your adoring public a masterclass in use of DOF and negative space.', '2002-08-07 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
