(100846, 4161, 1143, '<td valign="top">AHA! I thought this looked like something I''ve seen in Sweden. Iceland is close though! Very pretty. I like the lines and color. I think you deserved an even higher score. My only suggestion would have been trying it under different, less harsh lighting so that you could expose the shadow areas a little better.</td>', 'AHA! I thought this looked like something I''ve seen in Sweden. Iceland is close though! Very pretty. I like the lines and color. I think you deserved an even higher score. My only suggestion would have been trying it under different, less harsh lighting so that you could expose the shadow areas a little better.', '2002-08-13 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(100847, 4162, 157, '<td valign="top">great composition...but there''s a lot of pixelation in this picture..either the quality of the camera or your jpeg conversion</td>', 'great composition...but there''s a lot of pixelation in this picture..either the quality of the camera or your jpeg conversion', '2002-08-05 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
