(100860, 4162, 2834, '<td valign="top">It was Sunday night when I was trying to get the size correct and made the mistake of re-editing the photo several times.  Basically, I ran out of patience and time to start the process over and over.  I knew the quality was lost but have not the software and knowledge how to properly re-size.  Thanks for your comments and concerns about the quality of the photo.  I''ll keep trying and looking for the right technique.  Jerry Mattys.<br/></td>', 'It was Sunday night when I was trying to get the size correct and made the mistake of re-editing the photo several times.  Basically, I ran out of patience and time to start the process over and over.  I knew the quality was lost but have not the software and knowledge how to properly re-size.  Thanks for your comments and concerns about the quality of the photo.  I''ll keep trying and looking for the right technique.  Jerry Mattys.', '2002-08-12 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(100861, 4164, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very complex. Black and white probably helps simplify it, but the impact is a bit confusing.  I think I would have tried to find an asymmetric way to frame it that would draw the eye to one point.</td>', 'Very complex. Black and white probably helps simplify it, but the impact is a bit confusing.  I think I would have tried to find an asymmetric way to frame it that would draw the eye to one point.', '2002-08-05 06:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
