(100880, 4164, 2933, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo.  Shows height, depth, creativity and a thought provoking scene.  A old path and doorway to once was somewhere!<br/><br/></td>', 'This is an interesting photo.  Shows height, depth, creativity and a thought provoking scene.  A old path and doorway to once was somewhere!', '2002-08-07 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100881, 4164, 2932, '<td valign="top">this looks just like a railroad bridge I used to shortcut across in Salem, OR (until they put the fence up).  Don''t suppose it''s the same one, but it sure brings back old memories for me.</td>', 'this looks just like a railroad bridge I used to shortcut across in Salem, OR (until they put the fence up).  Don''t suppose it''s the same one, but it sure brings back old memories for me.', '2002-08-08 04:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
