(100894, 4165, 811, '<td valign="top">Good framing and composition.  The blue "sea" is a nice touch.  I think if the light was a little more even on the sails, it would be more effective, for me.  karmat</td>', 'Good framing and composition.  The blue "sea" is a nice touch.  I think if the light was a little more even on the sails, it would be more effective, for me.  karmat', '2002-08-05 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100895, 4165, 2123, '<td valign="top">The towel really detracts from an otherwise good shot.  5</td>', 'The towel really detracts from an otherwise good shot.  5', '2002-08-05 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100896, 4165, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - good<br/>Meets Challenge - looks like a new model of an old ship<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - goodMeets Challenge - looks like a new model of an old shipVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-05 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100897, 4165, 2553, '<td valign="top">The blue fabric/towel under the boat is very distracting to me.  I would have preferred to see it completely surrounded by black so that it appeared to be floating in air.  The shot also feels "crowded" to me.  Maybe landscape with a little more negative space to give the boat room to breathe. Hope this makes sense to you.  lhall</td>', 'The blue fabric/towel under the boat is very distracting to me.  I would have preferred to see it completely surrounded by black so that it appeared to be floating in air.  The shot also feels "crowded" to me.  Maybe landscape with a little more negative space to give the boat room to breathe. Hope this makes sense to you.  lhall', '2002-08-06 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100898, 4165, 2928, '<td valign="top">I Love the shot and I love the idea. But the bath towel looking base spoils it completely.  Technically, I can''t fault the picture, but (for me) I felt I was looking at the towel more than the wonderful ship (5)</td>', 'I Love the shot and I love the idea. But the bath towel looking base spoils it completely.  Technically, I can''t fault the picture, but (for me) I felt I was looking at the towel more than the wonderful ship (5)', '2002-08-07 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100899, 4165, 772, '<td valign="top">nice composition :)  I love these old model ships... i had a few that I managed to destroy as a child :(  good shot - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice composition :)  I love these old model ships... i had a few that I managed to destroy as a child :(  good shot - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100900, 4165, 2798, '<td valign="top">You know I''m not sure Victory really had stripey sails like that. Lovely model though. Good idea to use a blue towel to represent the sea. Good lighting too.</td>', 'You know I''m not sure Victory really had stripey sails like that. Lovely model though. Good idea to use a blue towel to represent the sea. Good lighting too.', '2002-08-08 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100901, 4165, 917, '<td valign="top">Looks more like an collision between a clipper, a coal barge and some pyjamas to me, Victory looks alot different to this. This ship looks quite cute, maybe some humorous touches would help. The towel sea was worth a try, but I think it cheapens it, a proper stand would look better. There are compression effects, particularly on the strings. The light is good, but overexposes the flags a bit, maybe softening it a bit would help.</td>', 'Looks more like an collision between a clipper, a coal barge and some pyjamas to me, Victory looks alot different to this. This ship looks quite cute, maybe some humorous touches would help. The towel sea was worth a try, but I think it cheapens it, a proper stand would look better. There are compression effects, particularly on the strings. The light is good, but overexposes the flags a bit, maybe softening it a bit would help.', '2002-08-09 07:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100902, 4165, 806, '<td valign="top">Too bad you didn''t have a black cloth rather than that blue towel.</td>', 'Too bad you didn''t have a black cloth rather than that blue towel.', '2002-08-09 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100903, 4165, 2172, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  (I''m being frank - NOT to offend)  The black background is well executed.  I don''t think that the blue towel (material) does much - maybe to connect with the blue in the sails?  Lighting is ok and the the focus is good.   7<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Interesting.  (I''m being frank - NOT to offend)  The black background is well executed.  I don''t think that the blue towel (material) does much - maybe to connect with the blue in the sails?  Lighting is ok and the the focus is good.   7Ruthann', '2002-08-10 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100904, 4167, 117, '<td valign="top">i like the shot maybe it the kid in me</td>', 'i like the shot maybe it the kid in me', '2002-08-05 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100905, 4167, 1569, '<td valign="top">The reflection in the window is very distracting.</td>', 'The reflection in the window is very distracting.', '2002-08-05 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100906, 4167, 2466, '<td valign="top">I want you to change the background and keep the lighting.  And please take that pin out of his eye.  It hurts to look at it.  A little thread and needle work and One-eyed teddy will feel much better</td>', 'I want you to change the background and keep the lighting.  And please take that pin out of his eye.  It hurts to look at it.  A little thread and needle work and One-eyed teddy will feel much better', '2002-08-05 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
