(100909, 4167, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I would have tried using fill flash to put more light on the subject and a polarizing filter to get rid of the glare from the window</td>', 'Nice, but I would have tried using fill flash to put more light on the subject and a polarizing filter to get rid of the glare from the window', '2002-08-05 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100910, 4167, 2928, '<td valign="top">You can''t knock the cute vote.  My only quibble is that you seem to have chopped too much off the bottom. (7)</td>', 'You can''t knock the cute vote.  My only quibble is that you seem to have chopped too much off the bottom. (7)', '2002-08-05 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
