(100914, 4167, 1644, '<td valign="top">I really like the position of the toy in front of the window and the way it''s backlit, but not so much that you''ve lost detail in the face. The driveway out the window is kind of distracting with that crack, and also whatever is on the bottom right of the toy is a little distracting too. Something propping Theodore up? I really like the texture on him though.</td>', 'I really like the position of the toy in front of the window and the way it''s backlit, but not so much that you''ve lost detail in the face. The driveway out the window is kind of distracting with that crack, and also whatever is on the bottom right of the toy is a little distracting too. Something propping Theodore up? I really like the texture on him though.', '2002-08-06 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100915, 4167, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo... I think a possibly better composition on this would have been to put the bear in the corner of the window and have him off center just a little bit :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an interesting photo... I think a possibly better composition on this would have been to put the bear in the corner of the window and have him off center just a little bit :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-06 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
