(100936, 4170, 2983, '<td valign="top">I was thinking of doing the exact same photo, but the only one of these I could find was behind glass.  Excellent photo overall.</td>', 'I was thinking of doing the exact same photo, but the only one of these I could find was behind glass.  Excellent photo overall.', '2002-08-06 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
