(101055, 4178, 772, '<td valign="top">I definitely believe this photo would have more impact if shot from a lower angle... this reminds me of some shots of children I see regularly where the adult is standing above the child pointing the camera in a downward angle... In a situation like this one, it could be better to get down on the level of your subject and shoot at a relatively parallel angle to the ground :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I definitely believe this photo would have more impact if shot from a lower angle... this reminds me of some shots of children I see regularly where the adult is standing above the child pointing the camera in a downward angle... In a situation like this one, it could be better to get down on the level of your subject and shoot at a relatively parallel angle to the ground :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
