(101062, 4178, 2661, '<td valign="top">you have a good subject, and a good start. what would really make this photo great would be better lighting. if you waited till the sun was low in the sky, it would cast a nice long shadow which would make the image a little more dramatic. also, try not to place the center of the cross in the center of the picture. black and white might also be nice.</td>', 'you have a good subject, and a good start. what would really make this photo great would be better lighting. if you waited till the sun was low in the sky, it would cast a nice long shadow which would make the image a little more dramatic. also, try not to place the center of the cross in the center of the picture. black and white might also be nice.', '2002-08-11 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101063, 4179, 1041, '<td valign="top">good idea!  i''m not sure how to, but your photo needs a little more contrast in my opinion.  gr8photos (5)</td>', 'good idea!  i''m not sure how to, but your photo needs a little more contrast in my opinion.  gr8photos (5)', '2002-08-05 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101064, 4179, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lol - nice idea but there''s no substitute for the real thing. If Im not mistaken this is one of those toy archeology dig things you can buy. Or is it just a toy dinosaur in a sandpit? Regardless, though, some care has been taken with the lighting and the arrangement and to good effect. The resolution of the picture is a little low, though.</td>', 'Lol - nice idea but there''s no substitute for the real thing. If Im not mistaken this is one of those toy archeology dig things you can buy. Or is it just a toy dinosaur in a sandpit? Regardless, though, some care has been taken with the lighting and the arrangement and to good effect. The resolution of the picture is a little low, though.', '2002-08-05 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
