(101090, 4180, 2932, '<td valign="top">I don''t think decreasing the saturation helped much here.  The composition follows the rule of thirds well, but isn''t stunning.  I guess the cannon has nowhere to shoot except straigh off the edge of the picture -- you should have given it a little room on the right</td>', 'I don''t think decreasing the saturation helped much here.  The composition follows the rule of thirds well, but isn''t stunning.  I guess the cannon has nowhere to shoot except straigh off the edge of the picture -- you should have given it a little room on the right', '2002-08-08 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
