(101093, 4180, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, what, no smoke from the barrel?  I try to not fight the black and white stuff too much anymore, but even though this turned out better than most, I still think I would like this in living color.  The far wheel top nearly disappears, plus the greens, browns, blacks and greys would have looked really nice.  O.K. off my high horse....8 Swash</td>', 'Nice shot, what, no smoke from the barrel?  I try to not fight the black and white stuff too much anymore, but even though this turned out better than most, I still think I would like this in living color.  The far wheel top nearly disappears, plus the greens, browns, blacks and greys would have looked really nice.  O.K. off my high horse....8 Swash', '2002-08-09 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101094, 4180, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Feels too low in frame. Need just a little more grass at the front.</td>', 'Lovely. Feels too low in frame. Need just a little more grass at the front.', '2002-08-10 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
