(101102, 4182, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice one.  good angle, sunlight is a little bit too bright.  i like how all the vehicles are lined up to the left and then there''s the one facing me to the right.  the ones to the left all look like they are on a slope though and about to roll into the vehicle on the right.  looking at the pole in the background, i think this is your photo.  some level adjustment would help with that. -- gr8photos (6)</td>', 'nice one.  good angle, sunlight is a little bit too bright.  i like how all the vehicles are lined up to the left and then there''s the one facing me to the right.  the ones to the left all look like they are on a slope though and about to roll into the vehicle on the right.  looking at the pole in the background, i think this is your photo.  some level adjustment would help with that. -- gr8photos (6)', '2002-08-05 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
