(101115, 4182, 436, '<td valign="top">I''ve thought about his photo seeral times since I left your score on monday.  It''s really very nice.  But I think I''d have preferred one or the other focus of the picture.  Either the amazing hoods all in a line OR an even closer crop of the incredible curves of the car on the right.  It''s almost too much for me.  (But then, that''s me)</td>', 'I''ve thought about his photo seeral times since I left your score on monday.  It''s really very nice.  But I think I''d have preferred one or the other focus of the picture.  Either the amazing hoods all in a line OR an even closer crop of the incredible curves of the car on the right.  It''s almost too much for me.  (But then, that''s me)', '2002-08-08 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
