(101117, 4182, 3105, '<td valign="top">When I look at this, the vehicle on the right just doesn''t seem to belong in the picture.  It fits because they are all cars but it interrupts the strong line created by the other cars entering from the left of the frame an that''s why it seems out of place.  If the car on the right occupied most of the frame and the others were just breifly shown it may work better for me.  Possibly shooting vertically instead of horizontally and cutting out the single car but keeping the line of cars and the tree on the left.</td>', 'When I look at this, the vehicle on the right just doesn''t seem to belong in the picture.  It fits because they are all cars but it interrupts the strong line created by the other cars entering from the left of the frame an that''s why it seems out of place.  If the car on the right occupied most of the frame and the others were just breifly shown it may work better for me.  Possibly shooting vertically instead of horizontally and cutting out the single car but keeping the line of cars and the tree on the left.', '2002-08-08 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
