(101124, 4182, 3002, '<td valign="top">I love this B&amp;W shot.  I think the photographer captured as much detail and information as possible with this angle.  Good eye; nice work!</td>', 'I love this B&W shot.  I think the photographer captured as much detail and information as possible with this angle.  Good eye; nice work!', '2002-08-10 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101125, 4182, 2247, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is BEAUUUUTIFUL!   I really love the contrast of dark and light.  Great overall composition. A 10!</td>', 'Wow!  This is BEAUUUUTIFUL!   I really love the contrast of dark and light.  Great overall composition. A 10!', '2002-08-10 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
