(101139, 4183, 255, '<td valign="top">nice- i could totally picture this on the wall of a cool diner of something. i really like the lighting and grainy look. gives it a real artsy feel. 9--amitchell</td>', 'nice- i could totally picture this on the wall of a cool diner of something. i really like the lighting and grainy look. gives it a real artsy feel. 9--amitchell', '2002-08-06 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101140, 4183, 2535, '<td valign="top">WONDERFUL..........i hope this one wins!  it captures the essence of the past<br/>and it''s a lovely photograph</td>', 'WONDERFUL..........i hope this one wins!  it captures the essence of the pastand it''s a lovely photograph', '2002-08-06 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101141, 4183, 3105, '<td valign="top">I remember those things!  I like the grainyness of the photo and definitely helps to be in B&amp;W (did you increase the ISO rating in camera for this shot?).  Having the warped section of the LP in focus gets points in my book, definitely old.  Good job.</td>', 'I remember those things!  I like the grainyness of the photo and definitely helps to be in B&W (did you increase the ISO rating in camera for this shot?).  Having the warped section of the LP in focus gets points in my book, definitely old.  Good job.', '2002-08-06 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101142, 4183, 1644, '<td valign="top">I wish it wasn''t quite so grainy in the center.  The sharpness of the grooves is good, though.</td>', 'I wish it wasn''t quite so grainy in the center.  The sharpness of the grooves is good, though.', '2002-08-06 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101143, 4183, 2667, '<td valign="top">you have captured that olde tyme feel with this shot, well done.  ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...7<br/>Meets Challenge...7<br/>Overall...7</td>', 'you have captured that olde tyme feel with this shot, well done.  ~mcmurmaAesthetics...7Meets Challenge...7Overall...7', '2002-08-06 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101144, 4183, 2172, '<td valign="top">Well done!  I like the use of DOF here.  The angle and composition are very effective for this.  I even like the graininess at the top.  Good Work. 8<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Well done!  I like the use of DOF here.  The angle and composition are very effective for this.  I even like the graininess at the top.  Good Work. 8Ruthann', '2002-08-06 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101145, 4183, 772, '<td valign="top">this photo rocks... the light catch on the record and the film grain really makes this image stand out for me... i scored this photo with a 6 on my initial vote but it''s going to the top now.. excellent work... keep it up :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'this photo rocks... the light catch on the record and the film grain really makes this image stand out for me... i scored this photo with a 6 on my initial vote but it''s going to the top now.. excellent work... keep it up :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101146, 4183, 2079, '<td valign="top">Very clever. I wouldn''t know how to improve on this. - 10</td>', 'Very clever. I wouldn''t know how to improve on this. - 10', '2002-08-07 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101147, 4183, 2798, '<td valign="top">Damn - I cant believe someone else thought of photographing a record! And on a suitably old looking player too. You''ve captured those grooves beautifully. Good use of DoF try and hide the fact that it''s ''Ghostbusters'' by Ray Parker Jr. &amp;lt;wink&amp;gt;</td>', 'Damn - I cant believe someone else thought of photographing a record! And on a suitably old looking player too. You''ve captured those grooves beautifully. Good use of DoF try and hide the fact that it''s ''Ghostbusters'' by Ray Parker Jr. &lt;wink&gt;', '2002-08-07 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101148, 4183, 2861, '<td valign="top">But so hard to keep clean. May be a bit to the right would have brought the cartridge into a more balanced position.</td>', 'But so hard to keep clean. May be a bit to the right would have brought the cartridge into a more balanced position.', '2002-08-07 07:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101149, 4183, 885, '<td valign="top">Personally, I love the graininess and the way that the shallow depth of field draws my eye right to that highlight on the grooves of the record.  Great photo.</td>', 'Personally, I love the graininess and the way that the shallow depth of field draws my eye right to that highlight on the grooves of the record.  Great photo.', '2002-08-07 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
