(101205, 4187, 734, '<td valign="top">The idea is great, i would have just worked with the lighting more to eliminate the hot spots., and try to create a more solid shadow.</td>', 'The idea is great, i would have just worked with the lighting more to eliminate the hot spots., and try to create a more solid shadow.', '2002-08-07 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101206, 4187, 3099, '<td valign="top">What does this have to do with the challenge?</td>', 'What does this have to do with the challenge?', '2002-08-08 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101207, 4187, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent composition and I love the shadow play in this photo.  My only trouble is that I don''t think I understand what I''m looking at and i''m not receiving the ''old'' message.  I assume the object that is holding the brandy snifter is old possibly... I may need some help with this one after the challenge :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an excellent composition and I love the shadow play in this photo.  My only trouble is that I don''t think I understand what I''m looking at and i''m not receiving the ''old'' message.  I assume the object that is holding the brandy snifter is old possibly... I may need some help with this one after the challenge :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101208, 4187, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. I''d crop a little at the left but that''s it. The play of light through the glass is so perfectly visible in the shadow - it''s great.</td>', 'I like this very much. I''d crop a little at the left but that''s it. The play of light through the glass is so perfectly visible in the shadow - it''s great.', '2002-08-08 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101209, 4187, 3112, '<td valign="top">Great technical photo.  Does not evoke thoughts of oldness as much as it should, though.</td>', 'Great technical photo.  Does not evoke thoughts of oldness as much as it should, though.', '2002-08-09 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101210, 4187, 3190, '<td valign="top">this is way to contrived.</td>', 'this is way to contrived.', '2002-08-10 03:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101211, 4187, 2480, '<td valign="top">That shadow is beautiful!</td>', 'That shadow is beautiful!', '2002-08-11 00:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101212, 4187, 2900, '<td valign="top">interesting picture, but it is old?</td>', 'interesting picture, but it is old?', '2002-08-11 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101213, 4187, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love the play of light in this photo.  Sorry I have no constructive critisism.</td>', 'I love the play of light in this photo.  Sorry I have no constructive critisism.', '2002-08-11 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101214, 4187, 2661, '<td valign="top">I wish I knew what it was (though not knowing doesn''t detract from the appeal of the photo at all). I really like the picture. great lighting and colors. the one thing I would reccomend is to move slightly to the left to increase the distance between the original and the shadow, putting one near each corner. great shot, though.</td>', 'I wish I knew what it was (though not knowing doesn''t detract from the appeal of the photo at all). I really like the picture. great lighting and colors. the one thing I would reccomend is to move slightly to the left to increase the distance between the original and the shadow, putting one near each corner. great shot, though.', '2002-08-11 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101215, 4187, 656, '<td valign="top">Like the shadow</td>', 'Like the shadow', '2002-08-11 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101216, 4189, 1569, '<td valign="top">Nice old lens-- the only problem is all the glaring highlights from the light source.</td>', 'Nice old lens-- the only problem is all the glaring highlights from the light source.', '2002-08-05 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101217, 4189, 772, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a nice photograph of an old camera... I think you could have achieved the depth of field you wanted by backing up a little bit and working with the resolution of your camera to crop a section from a larger photo.  Some cameras don''t work as well at close range as others do... -jmsetzler</td>', 'This is definitely a nice photograph of an old camera... I think you could have achieved the depth of field you wanted by backing up a little bit and working with the resolution of your camera to crop a section from a larger photo.  Some cameras don''t work as well at close range as others do... -jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101218, 4189, 2861, '<td valign="top">would like to see greater depth of field. Hard I know</td>', 'would like to see greater depth of field. Hard I know', '2002-08-07 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101219, 4189, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo  but I haven''t a clue what the object is.  It does feel old, and I really like the composition. (7)</td>', 'This is a great photo  but I haven''t a clue what the object is.  It does feel old, and I really like the composition. (7)', '2002-08-07 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
