(101282, 4193, 92, '<td valign="top">Old toys...so interesting ! You took this with a great b/g and crop. I would like to see the back end more in focus. More so since it''s such a tight crop and single subject. Still..nice photo. Shiiizzzam</td>', 'Old toys...so interesting ! You took this with a great b/g and crop. I would like to see the back end more in focus. More so since it''s such a tight crop and single subject. Still..nice photo. Shiiizzzam', '2002-08-06 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
