(101294, 4193, 2172, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  (I''m being frank - NOT to offend)  I like the subject very much; the angle is good.  Perhaps a bit tighter crop.  I do like how the horizon line is blended.  Yet, there is something that is not working for me.  I have been putting off the comment - but keep coming back to the thumbnail.  The image is attractive - catches my eye - but I think maybe the lighting is off a bit - but not sure if it''s good or not.  So I''m torn on what to say...All in all a good photo - 7<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Good photo.  (I''m being frank - NOT to offend)  I like the subject very much; the angle is good.  Perhaps a bit tighter crop.  I do like how the horizon line is blended.  Yet, there is something that is not working for me.  I have been putting off the comment - but keep coming back to the thumbnail.  The image is attractive - catches my eye - but I think maybe the lighting is off a bit - but not sure if it''s good or not.  So I''m torn on what to say...All in all a good photo - 7Ruthann', '2002-08-10 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
