(101300, 4194, 2172, '<td valign="top">This is just great.  When I first starting getting interested in photography, I wanted to do shots just like this (I still need some practice).  I like the b/w - you''ll have to post an outtake of the color version, if possible.   Great work!!   9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'This is just great.  When I first starting getting interested in photography, I wanted to do shots just like this (I still need some practice).  I like the b/w - you''ll have to post an outtake of the color version, if possible.   Great work!!   9Ruthann', '2002-08-05 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
