(101329, 4197, 2123, '<td valign="top">This is a little disorienting to me; the armor is leaning one way and the window the other!</td>', 'This is a little disorienting to me; the armor is leaning one way and the window the other!', '2002-08-05 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101330, 4197, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good subject but I think you should have moved around the subject to avoid the bright white light of the window which has shown up chromatic aberrations in your lens (the blue fringes). Good use of flash. Good focus, colour and contrast.</td>', 'Good subject but I think you should have moved around the subject to avoid the bright white light of the window which has shown up chromatic aberrations in your lens (the blue fringes). Good use of flash. Good focus, colour and contrast.', '2002-08-07 06:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101331, 4197, 2928, '<td valign="top">The armour looks like it''s trying to hear something  the title ''Pardon me, only I''m a little deaf'' would have been amusing :)  Technically and challenge wise it''s a great picture.</td>', 'The armour looks like it''s trying to hear something  the title ''Pardon me, only I''m a little deaf'' would have been amusing :)  Technically and challenge wise it''s a great picture.', '2002-08-07 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101332, 4197, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice subject matter but I am not keen on what''s included in the frame and what''s missing (rest of him).</td>', 'Nice subject matter but I am not keen on what''s included in the frame and what''s missing (rest of him).', '2002-08-07 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101333, 4197, 2932, '<td valign="top">white window distracts -- as does red background.  ignoring that, I think the title was very appropriate, and if the figure were talking to something other than the edge of the picture, it would be quite cute.</td>', 'white window distracts -- as does red background.  ignoring that, I think the title was very appropriate, and if the figure were talking to something other than the edge of the picture, it would be quite cute.', '2002-08-08 04:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101334, 4197, 772, '<td valign="top">this is definitely a nice subject for the ''old'' challenge... the background, however, does not contribute much to that concept.  Maybe it woud have been possible to move to a better area, maybe not :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is definitely a nice subject for the ''old'' challenge... the background, however, does not contribute much to that concept.  Maybe it woud have been possible to move to a better area, maybe not :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101335, 4197, 811, '<td valign="top">That is a bright red, there.  I think if you had moved jsut a touch to the left, then the yellowish color could play in the picture a little more.  It kinda looks like he just walked in the door.  karmat</td>', 'That is a bright red, there.  I think if you had moved jsut a touch to the left, then the yellowish color could play in the picture a little more.  It kinda looks like he just walked in the door.  karmat', '2002-08-08 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101336, 4197, 3112, '<td valign="top">Flash is too obvious in this one.  Might be better as a tripod mounted medium exposure.</td>', 'Flash is too obvious in this one.  Might be better as a tripod mounted medium exposure.', '2002-08-09 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101337, 4197, 1005, '<td valign="top">Too bad the window is right there!  That''s a rust armor!  I kinda question the cropping, esp. the left elbow and hands, I can live without the legs/feet.  7 Swash</td>', 'Too bad the window is right there!  That''s a rust armor!  I kinda question the cropping, esp. the left elbow and hands, I can live without the legs/feet.  7 Swash', '2002-08-09 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101338, 4197, 3198, '<td valign="top">nasty flash, taken old very literally</td>', 'nasty flash, taken old very literally', '2002-08-10 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101339, 4197, 2353, '<td valign="top">Great subject matter but the red wall is a little distracting.  Perhaps if you had made this black and white the armor would be more of a focal point? Also, it is a bit off-centered.  Perhaps if it were zoomed-in a bit more also and focused in on a specific part of the armor like the helmet?</td>', 'Great subject matter but the red wall is a little distracting.  Perhaps if you had made this black and white the armor would be more of a focal point? Also, it is a bit off-centered.  Perhaps if it were zoomed-in a bit more also and focused in on a specific part of the armor like the helmet?', '2002-08-10 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101340, 4197, 2661, '<td valign="top">good subject, good composition, and good colors. the only problem you need to correct is the overexposure of the sky. it looks like you already tried to fix that with your flash. I guess there''s not much else you could do if it''s in a museum. maybe you could have a buddy cover up the window fromthe outside? what might be best is to wait until it''s not so bright outside (though by then the museum or whatever could be closed. I don''t know)</td>', 'good subject, good composition, and good colors. the only problem you need to correct is the overexposure of the sky. it looks like you already tried to fix that with your flash. I guess there''s not much else you could do if it''s in a museum. maybe you could have a buddy cover up the window fromthe outside? what might be best is to wait until it''s not so bright outside (though by then the museum or whatever could be closed. I don''t know)', '2002-08-11 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101341, 4197, 637, '<td valign="top">I like the idea... don''t like the backgorund... would prefer if the armor were standing in a more appropriate place. 4 sjgleah</td>', 'I like the idea... don''t like the backgorund... would prefer if the armor were standing in a more appropriate place. 4 sjgleah', '2002-08-11 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101362, 4199, 2997, '<td valign="top">I like that you didn''t choose to show "age" by relativity (comparing it to or setting it along side of something newer).</td>', 'I like that you didn''t choose to show "age" by relativity (comparing it to or setting it along side of something newer).', '2002-08-05 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101363, 4199, 2780, '<td valign="top">cool! mickey mouse cutlery! Nice photo, I like the black background, it brings out the fork and spoon nicley.</td>', 'cool! mickey mouse cutlery! Nice photo, I like the black background, it brings out the fork and spoon nicley.', '2002-08-05 04:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101364, 4199, 1569, '<td valign="top">WoW-just a little dark but a great picture.</td>', 'WoW-just a little dark but a great picture.', '2002-08-05 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101365, 4199, 2170, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2002-08-05 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101366, 4199, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very Nice.  Could have been just a bit lighter.  (I know it''s a matter of taste)  Focus is good, subject is good.  8</td>', 'Very Nice.  Could have been just a bit lighter.  (I know it''s a matter of taste)  Focus is good, subject is good.  8', '2002-08-05 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101367, 4199, 2123, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one.  The composition, lighting, background...perfect!  No complaints here. 9</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one.  The composition, lighting, background...perfect!  No complaints here. 9', '2002-08-05 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101368, 4199, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-05 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101369, 4199, 2172, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Exposure is very effective - the composition is as effective.  Nice use of space.  Great Job  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Exposure is very effective - the composition is as effective.  Nice use of space.  Great Job  9Ruthann', '2002-08-05 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101370, 4199, 1202, '<td valign="top">Even though you wanted them to look older with your lighting I think it would have been more powerful if you had used more light.   Use indirect light to keep from getting unwanted glare.   You probably tried moving them around, but the placement still doesn''t look right to me.   My problem is I don''t know what would help.    In my opinion, Autool</td>', 'Even though you wanted them to look older with your lighting I think it would have been more powerful if you had used more light.   Use indirect light to keep from getting unwanted glare.   You probably tried moving them around, but the placement still doesn''t look right to me.   My problem is I don''t know what would help.    In my opinion, Autool', '2002-08-06 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101371, 4199, 2754, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, but I would have liked to have seen something more imaginative done with it.</td>', 'I like the subject, but I would have liked to have seen something more imaginative done with it.', '2002-08-06 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101372, 4199, 1793, '<td valign="top">great texture. i''d level a bit more, to make the bg totaly black.</td>', 'great texture. i''d level a bit more, to make the bg totaly black.', '2002-08-06 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101373, 4199, 885, '<td valign="top">Good job on the black background and the lighting...I think the utensils could have been placed more dynamically though.  Cropped more tightly or at a less straightforward angle would appeal more to my taste.</td>', 'Good job on the black background and the lighting...I think the utensils could have been placed more dynamically though.  Cropped more tightly or at a less straightforward angle would appeal more to my taste.', '2002-08-07 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101374, 4199, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice composition... my only critique would be the darkness on the detail... I can definitely tell that these are old but I think a little highlighting on the details would be nice as well... good work :) = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice composition... my only critique would be the darkness on the detail... I can definitely tell that these are old but I think a little highlighting on the details would be nice as well... good work :) = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101375, 4199, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  Photo is very documentary, however, rather than evocative.</td>', 'Good subject.  Photo is very documentary, however, rather than evocative.', '2002-08-07 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101376, 4199, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I can see it as an advert with the text in the bottom right. Without text it''s too much white (or in this case black) space for me.</td>', 'Interesting, I can see it as an advert with the text in the bottom right. Without text it''s too much white (or in this case black) space for me.', '2002-08-10 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101377, 4199, 3002, '<td valign="top">Nice, old Mickey Mouse silverware.  Well done.  I probably would have played around with the angle some, but that is a personal preference.  Nice work.</td>', 'Nice, old Mickey Mouse silverware.  Well done.  I probably would have played around with the angle some, but that is a personal preference.  Nice work.', '2002-08-10 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101378, 4199, 2204, '<td valign="top">Nice ....but seems awfully dark and shadowy.  Hopefully someone with more experience will be able to comment more constructively.  =5 syamjonimi</td>', 'Nice ....but seems awfully dark and shadowy.  Hopefully someone with more experience will be able to comment more constructively.  =5 syamjonimi', '2002-08-10 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101379, 4200, 2717, '<td valign="top">I think I would need to know what it is to understand the message.</td>', 'I think I would need to know what it is to understand the message.', '2002-08-05 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101380, 4200, 2170, '<td valign="top">the colors could be a little bit more vibrant -- maybe that would have emphasized the cracks and peeling parts better.</td>', 'the colors could be a little bit more vibrant -- maybe that would have emphasized the cracks and peeling parts better.', '2002-08-05 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101381, 4200, 811, '<td valign="top">I think backing up and getting more context would help give this picture more depth and meaning, especially at the top.  I like the colors. karmat</td>', 'I think backing up and getting more context would help give this picture more depth and meaning, especially at the top.  I like the colors. karmat', '2002-08-08 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101382, 4200, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture technically, but I can''t see the work of the photographer, only another artist.  Sorry for sounding negativeINSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(101409, 4204, 2111, '<td valign="top">wouldve been good for fear challenge but the sepia hurts it here I think</td>', 'wouldve been good for fear challenge but the sepia hurts it here I think', '2002-08-06 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101410, 4204, 2815, '<td valign="top">this looks lonely<br/></td>', 'this looks lonely', '2002-08-06 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101411, 4204, 1, '<td valign="top">Sepia effect worked nicely for you, the framing could use a bit of work -- take off the dead space on the left, and give a pinch more to the top and right.</td>', 'Sepia effect worked nicely for you, the framing could use a bit of work -- take off the dead space on the left, and give a pinch more to the top and right.', '2002-08-06 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101412, 4204, 1793, '<td valign="top">don''t agree with the toning - but the building is sure a find for this challenge.</td>', 'don''t agree with the toning - but the building is sure a find for this challenge.', '2002-08-06 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101413, 4204, 2752, '<td valign="top">good angle shot and use of sepia</td>', 'good angle shot and use of sepia', '2002-08-07 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101414, 4204, 772, '<td valign="top">nice view :)  The clutter in the foreground adds a lot to this one... the darker sepia toning also adds a nice effect ... - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice view :)  The clutter in the foreground adds a lot to this one... the darker sepia toning also adds a nice effect ... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101415, 4204, 2932, '<td valign="top">this is good when everything in thr frame is old -- both the backdrop and the foreground.  heck even the bushes look untended for years.  the broken windows look great, and the non-broken ones reflect enough to give the illusion that this is just one standing wall left.  great shot</td>', 'this is good when everything in thr frame is old -- both the backdrop and the foreground.  heck even the bushes look untended for years.  the broken windows look great, and the non-broken ones reflect enough to give the illusion that this is just one standing wall left.  great shot', '2002-08-08 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101416, 4204, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  Sepia tone is unneccessary, as the subject is quite evocative of feelings of oldness by itself. I would have shot this one in a similar fashion.</td>', 'Good subject.  Sepia tone is unneccessary, as the subject is quite evocative of feelings of oldness by itself. I would have shot this one in a similar fashion.', '2002-08-09 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101417, 4204, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice though lose some at the left and gain a little at the top right where the roof tower is chopped off.</td>', 'Nice though lose some at the left and gain a little at the top right where the roof tower is chopped off.', '2002-08-10 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101418, 4204, 2661, '<td valign="top">this is a great subject for the challenge, and a well done photograph as well. the sepia toning was a great idea. The only way I could think of to make this photo better would be to wait for the lighting to improve.</td>', 'this is a great subject for the challenge, and a well done photograph as well. the sepia toning was a great idea. The only way I could think of to make this photo better would be to wait for the lighting to improve.', '2002-08-11 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101419, 4205, 210, '<td valign="top">The people on the right really tend to distract from this photo.  Otherwisee, I''d like to see a bit of leveling to get rid of the "brightness."</td>', 'The people on the right really tend to distract from this photo.  Otherwisee, I''d like to see a bit of leveling to get rid of the "brightness."', '2002-08-05 05:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101420, 4205, 1569, '<td valign="top">Nice pix, the people on the right should have been cropped out or the camera moved to eliminate them.</td>', 'Nice pix, the people on the right should have been cropped out or the camera moved to eliminate them.', '2002-08-05 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101421, 4205, 2815, '<td valign="top">Now that is OLD</td>', 'Now that is OLD', '2002-08-05 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101422, 4205, 2200, '<td valign="top">I liked your use of people to show the relative size of these old trees</td>', 'I liked your use of people to show the relative size of these old trees', '2002-08-05 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101423, 4205, 2170, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  I can''t decide if cropping the people out would help or hurt.</td>', 'Excellent photo.  I can''t decide if cropping the people out would help or hurt.', '2002-08-05 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101424, 4205, 715, '<td valign="top">Very good that you also show the people to the rigtht of the tree, because it gives a perfect  impression how huge  this old redwood really is. Well done!<br/></td>', 'Very good that you also show the people to the rigtht of the tree, because it gives a perfect  impression how huge  this old redwood really is. Well done!', '2002-08-05 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101425, 4205, 1019, '<td valign="top">Impressive age</td>', 'Impressive age', '2002-08-05 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101426, 4205, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice colors!  I''m not sure if I''d like this better with or without the people though.  Did you try a vertical composition?  It might be interesting to see it from that perspective.</td>', 'Nice colors!  I''m not sure if I''d like this better with or without the people though.  Did you try a vertical composition?  It might be interesting to see it from that perspective.', '2002-08-05 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101427, 4205, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Must be in British Columbia ... went there 20 years ago.   Very nice texture.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Must be in British Columbia ... went there 20 years ago.   Very nice texture.', '2002-08-05 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101428, 4205, 1141, '<td valign="top">people to the right are blurry</td>', 'people to the right are blurry', '2002-08-05 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101429, 4205, 2641, '<td valign="top">Thats a hell of a tree, nice picture good thing you got some people in there, otherwise ?.?.?.whoknows</td>', 'Thats a hell of a tree, nice picture good thing you got some people in there, otherwise ?.?.?.whoknows', '2002-08-05 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101430, 4205, 2752, '<td valign="top">If you had cropped the people off it would be better.  Great shot and I like the leaves in the foreground</td>', 'If you had cropped the people off it would be better.  Great shot and I like the leaves in the foreground', '2002-08-06 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101431, 4205, 92, '<td valign="top">I saw a tree like this in north Alabama. I am wondering where this was taken. Kust unreal ! Nice subject for this week:) Shiiizzzam</td>', 'I saw a tree like this in north Alabama. I am wondering where this was taken. Kust unreal ! Nice subject for this week:) Shiiizzzam', '2002-08-06 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101432, 4205, 2900, '<td valign="top">the people in the background add interest and make you realize how big it is.</td>', 'the people in the background add interest and make you realize how big it is.', '2002-08-06 02:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101433, 4205, 2111, '<td valign="top">great 7</td>', 'great 7', '2002-08-06 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101434, 4205, 2261, '<td valign="top">Thats a big tree. Nice photo, the people give it a great sense of scale.</td>', 'Thats a big tree. Nice photo, the people give it a great sense of scale.', '2002-08-06 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101435, 4205, 1202, '<td valign="top">Pictures have been taken of these for as long as they have had cameras, so it is difficult to take a "new" picture of one.   In that case the photographer must strive to take the best picture he/she can.   I have no suggestions other than just think of how you could have done the picture to cause interest in the viewer.   A difficult task at best. Good luck!   Autool</td>', 'Pictures have been taken of these for as long as they have had cameras, so it is difficult to take a "new" picture of one.   In that case the photographer must strive to take the best picture he/she can.   I have no suggestions other than just think of how you could have done the picture to cause interest in the viewer.   A difficult task at best. Good luck!   Autool', '2002-08-06 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101436, 4205, 2861, '<td valign="top">The people give a good indication of scale.</td>', 'The people give a good indication of scale.', '2002-08-07 07:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101437, 4205, 1037, '<td valign="top">WOW! I know it''s very hard to photograph things like that, because you can''t get much into frame, and you need to establish the scale of it. You accomplished the second part really well, but the photo itself is just a bit flat to me.</td>', 'WOW! I know it''s very hard to photograph things like that, because you can''t get much into frame, and you need to establish the scale of it. You accomplished the second part really well, but the photo itself is just a bit flat to me.', '2002-08-07 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101438, 4205, 2798, '<td valign="top">I''m SO glad you got some people in this shot. It gives it 110% more impact. Lovely colours and a good amount of detail even in the shadows. Choice of angle really tells us everything about the sheer size of this thing! Love the picture. This is a sequoia right?</td>', 'I''m SO glad you got some people in this shot. It gives it 110% more impact. Lovely colours and a good amount of detail even in the shadows. Choice of angle really tells us everything about the sheer size of this thing! Love the picture. This is a sequoia right?', '2002-08-08 08:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101439, 4205, 772, '<td valign="top">wow.. this thing is massive... I would be curious to know how old this tree is.. do you know?  These things are amazing.  I would love to see them sometime... I think you made a great choice of including the people in the frame on the right... they give great perspective to the size of this tree.... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'wow.. this thing is massive... I would be curious to know how old this tree is.. do you know?  These things are amazing.  I would love to see them sometime... I think you made a great choice of including the people in the frame on the right... they give great perspective to the size of this tree.... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101440, 4205, 2458, '<td valign="top">May I suggest b/w.  mj 6</td>', 'May I suggest b/w.  mj 6', '2002-08-09 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101441, 4205, 2302, '<td valign="top">truely amazing - this says Old to me better than any other shot this week - my only 10</td>', 'truely amazing - this says Old to me better than any other shot this week - my only 10', '2002-08-09 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101442, 4205, 1863, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites this week. Yes, it is old, and yes, you can see how old it is; I like the people on the side, it gives you a perspective of how old this tree really is. 10, well done.<br/>-Annida</td>', 'This is one of my favorites this week. Yes, it is old, and yes, you can see how old it is; I like the people on the side, it gives you a perspective of how old this tree really is. 10, well done.-Annida', '2002-08-10 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101443, 4205, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - good. Wish you waited for no people in back<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good. Did you try B&amp;W ?<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - high<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - good. Wish you waited for no people in backTechnical Aspects - quite good. Did you try B&W ?Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - high', '2002-08-10 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101444, 4205, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful texture, clearly old (and massive.)  What I don''t like is it is too centered and the tree or pole directly next to it on my left  detracts. I think I''d have shfted the camerea to the right a bit and included more of the path and people looking at the tree.   The curve of the path would draw you to the people and they would draw you back to the massive Seqouia. (sp)</td>', 'Beautiful texture, clearly old (and massive.)  What I don''t like is it is too centered and the tree or pole directly next to it on my left  detracts. I think I''d have shfted the camerea to the right a bit and included more of the path and people looking at the tree.   The curve of the path would draw you to the people and they would draw you back to the massive Seqouia. (sp)', '2002-08-11 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101445, 4205, 637, '<td valign="top">Seems to me to be too obvious of a redwood shot.. Would like to see a more creative perspective.... 4 sjgleah</td>', 'Seems to me to be too obvious of a redwood shot.. Would like to see a more creative perspective.... 4 sjgleah', '2002-08-11 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101446, 4205, 117, '<td valign="top">I want to thank everyone for their comments and the time they took to vote. This tree is a giant sequoia and I would guess that he was a baby before a white man set foot on this continent. The old ones are older than 300 years old.</td>', 'I want to thank everyone for their comments and the time they took to vote. This tree is a giant sequoia and I would guess that he was a baby before a white man set foot on this continent. The old ones are older than 300 years old.', '2002-08-12 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
