(101448, 4206, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - OK<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - not really<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - low<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - OKTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - not reallyVisual Impact / Originality - low', '2002-08-05 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
