(101493, 4208, 1005, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this is a side-step of the challenge.  The toys are new, the man isn''t THAT old (no gray hair!) and I play with toys (cat-toys, yes, but they are toys).  The photo is well taken and hammy acted, but I cannot agree with this interpretation of the challenge.  Best I can go is 6.  Swash</td>', 'In my opinion, this is a side-step of the challenge.  The toys are new, the man isn''t THAT old (no gray hair!) and I play with toys (cat-toys, yes, but they are toys).  The photo is well taken and hammy acted, but I cannot agree with this interpretation of the challenge.  Best I can go is 6.  Swash', '2002-08-07 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101494, 4208, 1041, '<td valign="top">i don''t know ... even parents should be allowed to have some fun sometimes!  :)  nice focus and idea for this challenge, i think what would''ve helped your photo do even better would be a different angle, maybe get lower so you are more on the same level as dad. -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'i don''t know ... even parents should be allowed to have some fun sometimes!  :)  nice focus and idea for this challenge, i think what would''ve helped your photo do even better would be a different angle, maybe get lower so you are more on the same level as dad. -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-08-07 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101495, 4208, 436, '<td valign="top">Ah! humor!!  I wish you''d have shot it more on his level and less the top of his head/body...but then, maybe you did and chose this one.  Nice humor.</td>', 'Ah! humor!!  I wish you''d have shot it more on his level and less the top of his head/body...but then, maybe you did and chose this one.  Nice humor.', '2002-08-08 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
