(101527, 4210, 2815, '<td valign="top">I love the lines in the roof.  This does look really old.</td>', 'I love the lines in the roof.  This does look really old.', '2002-08-06 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101528, 4210, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic angles and the contrasting colors.  good work. karmat</td>', 'I like the dramatic angles and the contrasting colors.  good work. karmat', '2002-08-06 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101529, 4210, 1891, '<td valign="top">NOt really a subject here.  The leaves are ditacting at top.</td>', 'NOt really a subject here.  The leaves are ditacting at top.', '2002-08-06 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101530, 4210, 1005, '<td valign="top">Title and picture don''t quite match.  The building looks in disuse, but from what I can see, it''s not that bad.  The copper roof appears normal, the patena wear is normal for a 10 year old (or less) building.  I like the boardering trees, nice touch.  6 Swash</td>', 'Title and picture don''t quite match.  The building looks in disuse, but from what I can see, it''s not that bad.  The copper roof appears normal, the patena wear is normal for a 10 year old (or less) building.  I like the boardering trees, nice touch.  6 Swash', '2002-08-07 20:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101531, 4210, 2798, '<td valign="top">Oh I dont know - a lick of paint and... Nice framing and colour.</td>', 'Oh I dont know - a lick of paint and... Nice framing and colour.', '2002-08-08 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101532, 4210, 3112, '<td valign="top">excellent subject choice, and competent technical photo.  The large expanse of sharply-inclined roofing makes for confusing orientation.  I would probably have cropped the top just a bit to shift attention from that.</td>', 'excellent subject choice, and competent technical photo.  The large expanse of sharply-inclined roofing makes for confusing orientation.  I would probably have cropped the top just a bit to shift attention from that.', '2002-08-09 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101533, 4210, 2221, '<td valign="top">I can''t really say why, but I like this photo very much.<br/>Nice composition. The photo has an appealing simplicity. To me the house looks old and abandoned. So you met the challenge very good.<br/>The way how to roof in the background goes straight up and has these lines pointing to the subject is nice. I also like the broken window halfly hidden behind the tree.<br/>Maybe a touch overexposured because the area to the left of of the window is a little blown out, but I see that it was a difficult scene. High contrast between the white wall and the shadows created by the trees on the right side.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'I can''t really say why, but I like this photo very much.Nice composition. The photo has an appealing simplicity. To me the house looks old and abandoned. So you met the challenge very good.The way how to roof in the background goes straight up and has these lines pointing to the subject is nice. I also like the broken window halfly hidden behind the tree.Maybe a touch overexposured because the area to the left of of the window is a little blown out, but I see that it was a difficult scene. High contrast between the white wall and the shadows created by the trees on the right side.-stephan', '2002-08-09 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101534, 4210, 2437, '<td valign="top">great details on this picture</td>', 'great details on this picture', '2002-08-10 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101535, 4210, 637, '<td valign="top">don''t really "get" this perspective... although i can tell its old... 4 sjgleah</td>', 'don''t really "get" this perspective... although i can tell its old... 4 sjgleah', '2002-08-11 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101536, 4211, 1569, '<td valign="top">Just a bit dark,otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'Just a bit dark,otherwise nice shot.', '2002-08-05 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101537, 4211, 2553, '<td valign="top">While I like the photo, I find it a little dark. lhall</td>', 'While I like the photo, I find it a little dark. lhall', '2002-08-05 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101538, 4211, 1944, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo. I like the composition and the coloration of your picture, but for me it''s a bit contrasty.</td>', 'An interesting photo. I like the composition and the coloration of your picture, but for me it''s a bit contrasty.', '2002-08-05 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101539, 4211, 748, '<td valign="top">Better lighting and exposure may have brought this one to life.</td>', 'Better lighting and exposure may have brought this one to life.', '2002-08-06 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101540, 4211, 2983, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and color</td>', 'I like the composition and color', '2002-08-06 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101541, 4211, 2535, '<td valign="top">nice sepia tones</td>', 'nice sepia tones', '2002-08-06 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101542, 4211, 2752, '<td valign="top">I like your compositon and use of light</td>', 'I like your compositon and use of light', '2002-08-06 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101543, 4211, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo. The strong shadows add a lot to the mood and the regal bearing of the statue. One of my favourites! 10 - lisae</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo. The strong shadows add a lot to the mood and the regal bearing of the statue. One of my favourites! 10 - lisae', '2002-08-07 03:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101544, 4211, 133, '<td valign="top">A good picture, but is perhaps a little dark.</td>', 'A good picture, but is perhaps a little dark.', '2002-08-07 08:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101545, 4211, 772, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a phenomenal photo... I love the composition AND the lighting here... the darkenss adds a great sense of ''old'' and ''foreboding'' to my interpretation of this image.... These old statues are beautiful.  I wish I had the opportunity to make photos like this in America.  Our doesn''t even date back this far :)  Great shot... = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Congratulations on a phenomenal photo... I love the composition AND the lighting here... the darkenss adds a great sense of ''old'' and ''foreboding'' to my interpretation of this image.... These old statues are beautiful.  I wish I had the opportunity to make photos like this in America.  Our doesn''t even date back this far :)  Great shot... = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101546, 4211, 3016, '<td valign="top">just a tad too dark</td>', 'just a tad too dark', '2002-08-07 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101547, 4211, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting showing the depth of this picture. It''s a bit of a shame that the majority of the light isn''t on the face though. Still a great shot.</td>', 'Lovely lighting showing the depth of this picture. It''s a bit of a shame that the majority of the light isn''t on the face though. Still a great shot.', '2002-08-08 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101548, 4211, 811, '<td valign="top">I think this picture needs more light to truly emphasize the features.  I like the general composition. karmat</td>', 'I think this picture needs more light to truly emphasize the features.  I like the general composition. karmat', '2002-08-08 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101549, 4211, 1041, '<td valign="top">possibly the oldest item photographed for this challenge.  nice composition, too.  the shadows are too black for my liking though.  i would love to see at least a little detail there.  i played around with the photo a little, and found that by increasing contrast, brightness and gamma this photo got a little more ''umph'' which i think improved it.  let me know if you would like a copy of what i did for comparison and to see whether you would like it. -- gr8photos (6)</td>', 'possibly the oldest item photographed for this challenge.  nice composition, too.  the shadows are too black for my liking though.  i would love to see at least a little detail there.  i played around with the photo a little, and found that by increasing contrast, brightness and gamma this photo got a little more ''umph'' which i think improved it.  let me know if you would like a copy of what i did for comparison and to see whether you would like it. -- gr8photos (6)', '2002-08-09 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101550, 4211, 3087, '<td valign="top">Shadows too dark and top half of photo overall too dark. Ignoring that I like the content.</td>', 'Shadows too dark and top half of photo overall too dark. Ignoring that I like the content.', '2002-08-10 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101551, 4211, 671, '<td valign="top">really nice lighting for this one.</td>', 'really nice lighting for this one.', '2002-08-10 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101552, 4211, 2353, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I love the lighting and the cropping.  Having the face off-centered and showing a portion of the upper body leads the eye upward to the top right of the picture.  - 10</td>', 'Great job!  I love the lighting and the cropping.  Having the face off-centered and showing a portion of the upper body leads the eye upward to the top right of the picture.  - 10', '2002-08-10 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101553, 4211, 3198, '<td valign="top">the assignment was taken very literally...</td>', 'the assignment was taken very literally...', '2002-08-11 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101554, 4211, 616, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the positioning of the statue, a position in the middle would have been as perfect. The lighting is also great, the shadows are really nice.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the positioning of the statue, a position in the middle would have been as perfect. The lighting is also great, the shadows are really nice.', '2002-08-11 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101555, 4211, 2661, '<td valign="top">great composition and great lighting.</td>', 'great composition and great lighting.', '2002-08-11 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101556, 4211, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the way the colors "fit" the subject</td>', 'I like the way the colors "fit" the subject', '2002-08-11 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101557, 4211, 2221, '<td valign="top">I find the diversity of opinions very interesting... If I count how many people like the lighting (counting me in) and how many think it''s too dark it''s 9 to 9. I''m not sure what to do now ;-)<br/><br/>After reading floyds comment I also see that the photo would have looked better when the light was more evenly distributed. The direction of the light was not under my control as the statue is in a museum and I think they wouldn''t be very happy if I would have started to adjust the lamps ;-)<br/><br/>Personally I liked the photo for the strong shadows and to me it looked almost like the statue "beholds" me. That was also the reason why I cropped it that way. To me the statue looks down at me and somehow I liked this effect.<br/><br/>Anyway, many thanks for your comments. As always, most welcome :-)<br/></td>', 'I find the diversity of opinions very interesting... If I count how many people like the lighting (counting me in) and how many think it''s too dark it''s 9 to 9. I''m not sure what to do now ;-)After reading floyds comment I also see that the photo would have looked better when the light was more evenly distributed. The direction of the light was not under my control as the statue is in a museum and I think they wouldn''t be very happy if I would have started to adjust the lamps ;-)Personally I liked the photo for the strong shadows and to me it looked almost like the statue "beholds" me. That was also the reason why I cropped it that way. To me the statue looks down at me and somehow I liked this effect.Anyway, many thanks for your comments. As always, most welcome :-)', '2002-08-12 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(101558, 4212, 1569, '<td valign="top">The background material needed to be adjusted on the top right corner,its really distracting.</td>', 'The background material needed to be adjusted on the top right corner,its really distracting.', '2002-08-05 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101559, 4212, 2170, '<td valign="top">A plain colored background would have been perfect for this.</td>', 'A plain colored background would have been perfect for this.', '2002-08-05 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101560, 4212, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - good. background upper right is poor<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - good. background upper right is poorTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-05 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101561, 4212, 2983, '<td valign="top">The shadow is distracting and the pillow you used for the background isn''t filling the entire background.  I would suggest using a larger background, like a bed sheet, and place it in the distance.  That way, shadows are less likely to line up the way they do here, and you can use depth of field to blur out any "imperfections" like wrinkles.</td>', 'The shadow is distracting and the pillow you used for the background isn''t filling the entire background.  I would suggest using a larger background, like a bed sheet, and place it in the distance.  That way, shadows are less likely to line up the way they do here, and you can use depth of field to blur out any "imperfections" like wrinkles.', '2002-08-06 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101562, 4212, 3112, '<td valign="top">Flash or ambient light produces distracting shadows.</td>', 'Flash or ambient light produces distracting shadows.', '2002-08-07 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101563, 4212, 772, '<td valign="top">nice still life :)  In this particular image, I believe that a darker background would work better.  This would offer a greater contrast between your subject and the background.  - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice still life :)  In this particular image, I believe that a darker background would work better.  This would offer a greater contrast between your subject and the background.  - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101564, 4212, 671, '<td valign="top">good choice of background.  The framing could have been a little tighter to eliminate the problem in the upper right hand corner.</td>', 'good choice of background.  The framing could have been a little tighter to eliminate the problem in the upper right hand corner.', '2002-08-10 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101565, 4212, 2361, '<td valign="top">This really doesn''t suggest "old" to me.  The composition and lighting are flat and uninspired.  3  Jak</td>', 'This really doesn''t suggest "old" to me.  The composition and lighting are flat and uninspired.  3  Jak', '2002-08-10 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101566, 4212, 2204, '<td valign="top">This may be an antique but, it just "looks" too new for the challenge.</td>', 'This may be an antique but, it just "looks" too new for the challenge.', '2002-08-11 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101567, 4212, 1280, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the background does this any justice.  Some side lighting would show more detail and shadow.  It appears that you used flash or direct light instead.</td>', 'I don''t think the background does this any justice.  Some side lighting would show more detail and shadow.  It appears that you used flash or direct light instead.', '2002-08-11 21:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101568, 4213, 772, '<td valign="top">If this place is old, I would have tried to capture its age with a different camera angle... When I look at a building from this angle, I think cutting the entrance way out of the photo is not a good idea.  This photo also needs some more contrast and sharpness to come off well... - jmsetzler</td>', 'If this place is old, I would have tried to capture its age with a different camera angle... When I look at a building from this angle, I think cutting the entrance way out of the photo is not a good idea.  This photo also needs some more contrast and sharpness to come off well... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101569, 4213, 2891, '<td valign="top">is the grill, or the architechture, that is the subject</td>', 'is the grill, or the architechture, that is the subject', '2002-08-05 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101570, 4213, 1569, '<td valign="top">Getting closer to the sign would have helped.</td>', 'Getting closer to the sign would have helped.', '2002-08-05 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101571, 4213, 2716, '<td valign="top">This photo could have been enhanced by rotating it a little to the left and with more focus.</td>', 'This photo could have been enhanced by rotating it a little to the left and with more focus.', '2002-08-05 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101572, 4213, 2172, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I''m not sure what I''m looking at.  Is it the building or the sign.  I''m being very frank in my comments - not to offend.  The don''t think the tilt is working with this photo.  It''s hard to comment on something I don''t understand.  What is the main subject of the photo - the sign. the building structure, the restaurant..  There should be on object in which the photo will guide the eye to.  Too much guess work for me.  The color is good and the focus.  Just my opinion - not to offend.   4<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Unfortunately, I''m not sure what I''m looking at.  Is it the building or the sign.  I''m being very frank in my comments - not to offend.  The don''t think the tilt is working with this photo.  It''s hard to comment on something I don''t understand.  What is the main subject of the photo - the sign. the building structure, the restaurant..  There should be on object in which the photo will guide the eye to.  Too much guess work for me.  The color is good and the focus.  Just my opinion - not to offend.   4Ruthann', '2002-08-05 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101573, 4213, 2983, '<td valign="top">The empty space is very distracting to me.  The right side is good, though, and cropped would stand well as it is.</td>', 'The empty space is very distracting to me.  The right side is good, though, and cropped would stand well as it is.', '2002-08-06 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101574, 4213, 2535, '<td valign="top">too much negative space<br/></td>', 'too much negative space', '2002-08-06 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101575, 4213, 2928, '<td valign="top">Front on would be better (I think)  and there seems to be far too much empty space and very little subject... This is just my opinion, good luck...</td>', 'Front on would be better (I think)  and there seems to be far too much empty space and very little subject... This is just my opinion, good luck...', '2002-08-07 05:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101576, 4213, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the sign, since that seems to be what you are focusing on, should be more important in the picture.  Also, I think cropping the right side windows would help.   I like the way the bushes/tress lead the eyes to the building. karmat</td>', 'I think the sign, since that seems to be what you are focusing on, should be more important in the picture.  Also, I think cropping the right side windows would help.   I like the way the bushes/tress lead the eyes to the building. karmat', '2002-08-08 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101577, 4213, 2798, '<td valign="top">Really needed to be framed to show the grille better - or the sign better. There''s a lot of blank wall here. Good choice of subject though.</td>', 'Really needed to be framed to show the grille better - or the sign better. There''s a lot of blank wall here. Good choice of subject though.', '2002-08-08 08:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101578, 4213, 1005, '<td valign="top">I''ll keep this short, left half is somewhat negative space (intensional?)  The sky is blown out (intensional, too?)  The sign is almost readable.  Best suggestion:  walk up closer to the building and take the shot in portrait.  6 Swash</td>', 'I''ll keep this short, left half is somewhat negative space (intensional?)  The sky is blown out (intensional, too?)  The sign is almost readable.  Best suggestion:  walk up closer to the building and take the shot in portrait.  6 Swash', '2002-08-09 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101579, 4213, 2903, '<td valign="top">what are we looking at?</td>', 'what are we looking at?', '2002-08-10 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101580, 4213, 1880, '<td valign="top">Colors look off.. Depth of field lacking (Due to the focus on the flora on the left.)...  Makes photo look OOF ...  RLS</td>', 'Colors look off.. Depth of field lacking (Due to the focus on the flora on the left.)...  Makes photo look OOF ...  RLS', '2002-08-10 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101581, 4213, 917, '<td valign="top">This only just passes my quality threshold, beyond which I start to make impolite comments. But you just made it, so: <br/>The whole thing appears lopsided. Youve used the right corner as your guide, but you should have used the nearest one, as that is in the center of the picture.<br/>There is a very large area of boring wall and hedge. Use a verticle frame and focus more on the front of the building, as that has more interest. <br/>You have chopped the entrance to the building off, it may have been ugly or had cars in front, but do try to show entrances when doing buildings, they give scale, and lead you into the picture.<br/>Youve used too much compression, Dont go below 70% comprression for these challenges.</td>', 'This only just passes my quality threshold, beyond which I start to make impolite comments. But you just made it, so: The whole thing appears lopsided. Youve used the right corner as your guide, but you should have used the nearest one, as that is in the center of the picture.There is a very large area of boring wall and hedge. Use a verticle frame and focus more on the front of the building, as that has more interest. You have chopped the entrance to the building off, it may have been ugly or had cars in front, but do try to show entrances when doing buildings, they give scale, and lead you into the picture.Youve used too much compression, Dont go below 70% comprression for these challenges.', '2002-08-10 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101582, 4213, 2618, '<td valign="top">This looks to be very low resolution. Or maybe it is a very small crop from a much larger picture. Either way, it''s just too grainy and blocky for me. Sorry.</td>', 'This looks to be very low resolution. Or maybe it is a very small crop from a much larger picture. Either way, it''s just too grainy and blocky for me. Sorry.', '2002-08-10 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101583, 4213, 2361, '<td valign="top">A poorly composed picture with no obvious relevance to the challenge.  2  Jak</td>', 'A poorly composed picture with no obvious relevance to the challenge.  2  Jak', '2002-08-10 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101584, 4213, 637, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I think the composition is severely lacking in this image.  Too much empty wall.  3 sjgleah</td>', 'Sorry, I think the composition is severely lacking in this image.  Too much empty wall.  3 sjgleah', '2002-08-11 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101585, 4214, 117, '<td valign="top">i like old black and white photos</td>', 'i like old black and white photos', '2002-08-05 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101586, 4214, 1569, '<td valign="top">There is a rule against taking pictures of pictures,this may get disqualified,but its a nice ''still life'' anyway.</td>', 'There is a rule against taking pictures of pictures,this may get disqualified,but its a nice ''still life'' anyway.', '2002-08-05 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101587, 4214, 2928, '<td valign="top">It''s technically a very well done shot.  But I think it lacks a central theme. This has the effect of making the picture a bit too busy.  My motto, less is best, would work well here - but, this is only my opinion... Good luck... (5)</td>', 'It''s technically a very well done shot.  But I think it lacks a central theme. This has the effect of making the picture a bit too busy.  My motto, less is best, would work well here - but, this is only my opinion... Good luck... (5)', '2002-08-05 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101588, 4214, 1003, '<td valign="top">nicely done</td>', 'nicely done', '2002-08-05 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101589, 4214, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - very good<br/>Technical Aspects - very good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes+<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - high<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - very goodTechnical Aspects - very goodMeets Challenge - yes+Visual Impact / Originality - high', '2002-08-05 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101590, 4214, 2798, '<td valign="top">Is this one of Betty''s? I dont know but my first impression is that it has Betty''s style. Well whoever you are - this is great. I love the arrangement. Everything in this shot is suitable and interesting to look at. I''m dying to see more detail on that box at the front. Focus, contrast and colour are all excellent. Well done.</td>', 'Is this one of Betty''s? I dont know but my first impression is that it has Betty''s style. Well whoever you are - this is great. I love the arrangement. Everything in this shot is suitable and interesting to look at. I''m dying to see more detail on that box at the front. Focus, contrast and colour are all excellent. Well done.', '2002-08-06 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101591, 4214, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition, and the lighting works well here. karmat</td>', 'Good composition, and the lighting works well here. karmat', '2002-08-06 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101592, 4214, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice still life... i like your composition on this one... the contrast offered by the different color of the book adds a ''unique'' bit of color to this image... :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice still life... i like your composition on this one... the contrast offered by the different color of the book adds a ''unique'' bit of color to this image... :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-06 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101593, 4214, 2172, '<td valign="top">A Nice collage of old objects.  I''m being frank in my comments - not to offend.  For me: I would change the angle and the cropping, sometimes not all of the subject/objects have to be completely visible...that could lend the viewer to look again.  I do like that the objects are not just flat.  Good work   6<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'A Nice collage of old objects.  I''m being frank in my comments - not to offend.  For me: I would change the angle and the cropping, sometimes not all of the subject/objects have to be completely visible...that could lend the viewer to look again.  I do like that the objects are not just flat.  Good work   6Ruthann', '2002-08-07 00:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101594, 4214, 3112, '<td valign="top">Technically, very good.  Theme is forced.</td>', 'Technically, very good.  Theme is forced.', '2002-08-09 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101595, 4214, 3087, '<td valign="top">There have been a number of photos on this theme (still life of a collection of old things) in this challenge, I think this is my favourite.</td>', 'There have been a number of photos on this theme (still life of a collection of old things) in this challenge, I think this is my favourite.', '2002-08-09 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101596, 4214, 2781, '<td valign="top">Love the old photos!</td>', 'Love the old photos!', '2002-08-11 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101597, 4214, 1031, '<td valign="top">When are you publishing the family biography? Looks as interesting as anything on TV these days...and you''ve already got a cover photo...</td>', 'When are you publishing the family biography? Looks as interesting as anything on TV these days...and you''ve already got a cover photo...', '2002-08-12 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101598, 4214, 2798, '<td valign="top">Oops - guess I was wrong :)</td>', 'Oops - guess I was wrong :)', '2002-08-12 08:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(101599, 4215, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice family album photo but it doesn''t show me anything ''old'' for the challenge... - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a nice family album photo but it doesn''t show me anything ''old'' for the challenge... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101600, 4215, 2780, '<td valign="top">20 if I counted correctly :)</td>', '20 if I counted correctly :)', '2002-08-05 04:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101601, 4215, 2200, '<td valign="top">age is relative. He looks young to me</td>', 'age is relative. He looks young to me', '2002-08-05 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101602, 4215, 2586, '<td valign="top">This picture has a snapshot quality to it and it only meets the challenge because you say so with the title. I like the expression on the guy''s face and  better composition and better cropping would have lifted this out of the snapshot realm.</td>', 'This picture has a snapshot quality to it and it only meets the challenge because you say so with the title. I like the expression on the guy''s face and  better composition and better cropping would have lifted this out of the snapshot realm.', '2002-08-05 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101603, 4215, 2123, '<td valign="top">This is a nice snapshot. :-)  The guy on the left''s lower face in the photo doesn''t add anything, in my opinion.</td>', 'This is a nice snapshot. :-)  The guy on the left''s lower face in the photo doesn''t add anything, in my opinion.', '2002-08-05 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101604, 4215, 2172, '<td valign="top">I''m being very frank in my comments - not to offend.  This photo is for the family photo album - not much for ''photography''.  I do like the idea and how he''s blowing out the candles, but the flash is harmful for this photo.  Although there isn''t a lot of post-processing aloud here, there is still a lot that can be done.  I think the main flaw is the flash/lighting.  Also, try different angles.  This is only my opinion - take it as you will.  Keep working though.   4<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I''m being very frank in my comments - not to offend.  This photo is for the family photo album - not much for ''photography''.  I do like the idea and how he''s blowing out the candles, but the flash is harmful for this photo.  Although there isn''t a lot of post-processing aloud here, there is still a lot that can be done.  I think the main flaw is the flash/lighting.  Also, try different angles.  This is only my opinion - take it as you will.  Keep working though.   4Ruthann', '2002-08-05 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101605, 4215, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - ok<br/>Technical Aspects - good<br/>Meets Challenge - not really<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - low<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - okTechnical Aspects - goodMeets Challenge - not reallyVisual Impact / Originality - low', '2002-08-05 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101606, 4215, 1175, '<td valign="top">Think of the nicest way to say this is crap and then repeat it to yourself a few times.  Yes the guy is older, but he''s really not that old.  I counted about 21 candles on that cake.  This would probably be better in "Something New" than something old. -Chariot</td>', 'Think of the nicest way to say this is crap and then repeat it to yourself a few times.  Yes the guy is older, but he''s really not that old.  I counted about 21 candles on that cake.  This would probably be better in "Something New" than something old. -Chariot', '2002-08-05 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101607, 4215, 2912, '<td valign="top">:)</td>', ':)', '2002-08-06 04:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101608, 4215, 2535, '<td valign="top">crap</td>', 'crap', '2002-08-06 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(101609, 4215, 2553, '<td valign="top">This photo does not say "Something Old" to me.  "Age", yes, but not old.  I do not find the composition of the shot to be engaging - perhaps a tight shot of him with his face very close to the cake would have given the shot a better focus on the subject. lhall</td>', 'This photo does not say "Something Old" to me.  "Age", yes, but not old.  I do not find the composition of the shot to be engaging - perhaps a tight shot of him with his face very close to the cake would have given the shot a better focus on the subject. lhall', '2002-08-07 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101610, 4215, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very loose challenge connection, I see it, but I don''t believe it.  Nice photo of the YOUNG man''s birthday blow (I''m not THAT old, but he''s a KID)!  Nice color/focus!  6 Swash</td>', 'Very loose challenge connection, I see it, but I don''t believe it.  Nice photo of the YOUNG man''s birthday blow (I''m not THAT old, but he''s a KID)!  Nice color/focus!  6 Swash', '2002-08-07 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101611, 4215, 2857, '<td valign="top">funny, but there''s nothing remarkable about this shot. it''s very plain.</td>', 'funny, but there''s nothing remarkable about this shot. it''s very plain.', '2002-08-08 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101612, 4215, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject - I was expecting more of these but I think yours is the only one.</td>', 'Good choice of subject - I was expecting more of these but I think yours is the only one.', '2002-08-08 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101613, 4215, 811, '<td valign="top">A couple of suggestions that I think would help this picture (though its focus and lighting are right on, I believe):  Focus only on the cake or only on the one guy (maybe by moving to the left a little).  I think the major distraction is the guy on the far left,  though I do think his facial expression is humorous. karmat</td>', 'A couple of suggestions that I think would help this picture (though its focus and lighting are right on, I believe):  Focus only on the cake or only on the one guy (maybe by moving to the left a little).  I think the major distraction is the guy on the far left,  though I do think his facial expression is humorous. karmat', '2002-08-09 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101614, 4215, 3087, '<td valign="top">Background distracting, half a person at the left, head of main person missing, and distracting background (wallpaper, doorframes etc). Sorry.</td>', 'Background distracting, half a person at the left, head of main person missing, and distracting background (wallpaper, doorframes etc). Sorry.', '2002-08-10 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101615, 4215, 671, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the framing in this one:  person on left is chopped in half, background too busy.  It is a nice idea for this challenge, though.</td>', 'I don''t care for the framing in this one:  person on left is chopped in half, background too busy.  It is a nice idea for this challenge, though.', '2002-08-11 04:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101616, 4217, 2011, '<td valign="top">I dont know what to look at here.  The weed or the buildiing.  ThinkI would have picked one or the other.</td>', 'I dont know what to look at here.  The weed or the buildiing.  ThinkI would have picked one or the other.', '2002-08-05 03:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101617, 4217, 2780, '<td valign="top">yes, the building in the back is old, but the main focus on this is the plant, which cant be that old.</td>', 'yes, the building in the back is old, but the main focus on this is the plant, which cant be that old.', '2002-08-05 04:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101618, 4217, 2466, '<td valign="top">It seems more a photo of a weed than of an abandoned building.  Perhaps that''s what you were looking for...but not what appeals to me today.</td>', 'It seems more a photo of a weed than of an abandoned building.  Perhaps that''s what you were looking for...but not what appeals to me today.', '2002-08-05 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101619, 4217, 1856, '<td valign="top">Love this...can''t put the message into words myself...but I get it anyway.  Great work...unique &amp; refreshing!  9 Lisa<br/></td>', 'Love this...can''t put the message into words myself...but I get it anyway.  Great work...unique & refreshing!  9 Lisa', '2002-08-05 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101620, 4217, 2170, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Perfect for this challenge.</td>', 'Great shot!  Perfect for this challenge.', '2002-08-05 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101621, 4217, 3077, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve gone for a different viewpoint here. The slight flare is such a shame.</td>', 'I like that you''ve gone for a different viewpoint here. The slight flare is such a shame.', '2002-08-06 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101622, 4217, 2798, '<td valign="top">This plant doesnt look abandoned. Oh - you mean the building? This is a good case of the title being detrimental to the shot. So I''m choosing to ignore the title. It''s a great shot - I like the subject being out of focus back ground. The plant/weed gives a good overgrown feeling to the place. Focus, colour and contrast are all great. Well done - great shot. 8 from me.</td>', 'This plant doesnt look abandoned. Oh - you mean the building? This is a good case of the title being detrimental to the shot. So I''m choosing to ignore the title. It''s a great shot - I like the subject being out of focus back ground. The plant/weed gives a good overgrown feeling to the place. Focus, colour and contrast are all great. Well done - great shot. 8 from me.', '2002-08-06 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101623, 4217, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Very cleverly composed to bring the eye up to the windows in the background. The subject of the photo is the age of the building, even if the weeds have the focus. 10 for subtelty :) - lisae</td>', 'Beautiful! Very cleverly composed to bring the eye up to the windows in the background. The subject of the photo is the age of the building, even if the weeds have the focus. 10 for subtelty :) - lisae', '2002-08-06 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101624, 4217, 2983, '<td valign="top">Great photo, though I have one siggestion for composition:  move the main bud into the lower half of the frame, and allow the upper buds to fill the top half.</td>', 'Great photo, though I have one siggestion for composition:  move the main bud into the lower half of the frame, and allow the upper buds to fill the top half.', '2002-08-06 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101625, 4217, 2535, '<td valign="top">what''s abandoned?  if it''s the building, shouldn''t it be more of a focal point in the photo?<br/></td>', 'what''s abandoned?  if it''s the building, shouldn''t it be more of a focal point in the photo?', '2002-08-06 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101626, 4217, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good framing to provide an interesting view of the subject. Color, focus, and DOF work very well here.</td>', 'Good framing to provide an interesting view of the subject. Color, focus, and DOF work very well here.', '2002-08-06 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101627, 4217, 1005, '<td valign="top">I am very conflicted over this shot.  It is WONDERFUL!  The title seems to be referring to the building (background, not subject), but the thislte by itself is a wonderful shot.  If you had titled this old flower/thistle/gone with the wind, whatever referring to the plant, this would be a 10, period.  9 Swash</td>', 'I am very conflicted over this shot.  It is WONDERFUL!  The title seems to be referring to the building (background, not subject), but the thislte by itself is a wonderful shot.  If you had titled this old flower/thistle/gone with the wind, whatever referring to the plant, this would be a 10, period.  9 Swash', '2002-08-06 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101628, 4217, 1891, '<td valign="top">The focus is wonderful and the lighting is brilliant.  The subject is maybe a bit too centered.  The flower actually looks kind of healthy to me but I''m not a botanist.</td>', 'The focus is wonderful and the lighting is brilliant.  The subject is maybe a bit too centered.  The flower actually looks kind of healthy to me but I''m not a botanist.', '2002-08-06 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101629, 4217, 1644, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know which was the subject, the dandelion or the building. Either is good, but together it''s a little distracting.</td>', 'I didn''t know which was the subject, the dandelion or the building. Either is good, but together it''s a little distracting.', '2002-08-06 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101630, 4217, 2352, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how this show the age of something to fit the challenge.  Are you talking about the abandoned building, the flower, or both?</td>', 'I am not sure how this show the age of something to fit the challenge.  Are you talking about the abandoned building, the flower, or both?', '2002-08-06 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101631, 4217, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat.  I do wish I''d have been able to see a little bit more of the factory in the background...it seems sort of overpowered by the dead flowers and especially the green grass at the bottom.</td>', 'Neat.  I do wish I''d have been able to see a little bit more of the factory in the background...it seems sort of overpowered by the dead flowers and especially the green grass at the bottom.', '2002-08-07 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101632, 4217, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxtaposition of elements.  I like the focus here. karmat</td>', 'Interesting juxtaposition of elements.  I like the focus here. karmat', '2002-08-07 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101633, 4217, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like this though that bluey-white bit at top left is distracting. Still getting v. high marks. Really lovely.</td>', 'I really like this though that bluey-white bit at top left is distracting. Still getting v. high marks. Really lovely.', '2002-08-07 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101634, 4217, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot of plant life... since the plant is the subject of the photo, I''m not sure of your intentions for showing ''something old'' in this photo.  I can see that the building in the background is old, but it is secondary to everything else in this image... - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an interesting shot of plant life... since the plant is the subject of the photo, I''m not sure of your intentions for showing ''something old'' in this photo.  I can see that the building in the background is old, but it is secondary to everything else in this image... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101635, 4217, 1454, '<td valign="top">I liked it, but to me it''d look better with the building focused insted of the flower.  (6)</td>', 'I liked it, but to me it''d look better with the building focused insted of the flower.  (6)', '2002-08-08 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101636, 4217, 806, '<td valign="top">Nice idea to use the weeds to frame the broken-down building. I would, however, like to see the DOF switched; i.e. the window in focus, and the flower framing it, but out of focus.</td>', 'Nice idea to use the weeds to frame the broken-down building. I would, however, like to see the DOF switched; i.e. the window in focus, and the flower framing it, but out of focus.', '2002-08-08 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101637, 4217, 2123, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I like it.  You have an "old" thistle AND an old building.  Beautiful, crisp shot.  Bumping you up to an 8  :-)</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I like it.  You have an "old" thistle AND an old building.  Beautiful, crisp shot.  Bumping you up to an 8  :-)', '2002-08-09 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101638, 4217, 3002, '<td valign="top">I love the colors of this shot, and I think the photographer had great forethought of subject matter, capturing the old building with broken windows with the spent and fluffy dandelion (or is it thistle?)  The colors are fabulous, the DOF and focus are great.</td>', 'I love the colors of this shot, and I think the photographer had great forethought of subject matter, capturing the old building with broken windows with the spent and fluffy dandelion (or is it thistle?)  The colors are fabulous, the DOF and focus are great.', '2002-08-10 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101639, 4217, 1944, '<td valign="top">I can see what you''re trying to say, but your method of focusing on the thisle and letting the apandoned building stay behind your depth of field weakens your statement.</td>', 'I can see what you''re trying to say, but your method of focusing on the thisle and letting the apandoned building stay behind your depth of field weakens your statement.', '2002-08-11 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101640, 4217, 3198, '<td valign="top">nice nature shot, but the ''old'' is not in the story. (broken windows? is that old?)</td>', 'nice nature shot, but the ''old'' is not in the story. (broken windows? is that old?)', '2002-08-11 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101641, 4217, 637, '<td valign="top">Interesting collage 5 sjgleah</td>', 'Interesting collage 5 sjgleah', '2002-08-11 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101642, 4217, 2247, '<td valign="top">Nice background!  It really complements the foreground dandelion.  Keep it up!</td>', 'Nice background!  It really complements the foreground dandelion.  Keep it up!', '2002-08-11 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101643, 4217, 2123, '<td valign="top">My GOODNESS these people are literal!!  I absolutely love this shot and can''t believe it didn''t fare better.  If it wasn''t Monday morning I might be able to put some coherent thoughts together and explain just why it''s so great...lol.</td>', 'My GOODNESS these people are literal!!  I absolutely love this shot and can''t believe it didn''t fare better.  If it wasn''t Monday morning I might be able to put some coherent thoughts together and explain just why it''s so great...lol.', '2002-08-12 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(101644, 4217, 1066, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and the comments.<br/><br/>The word Abandonded was teh subject of my photo.  The warehouse was used as an atmosphere background and the "OLD" weed ...in weed years :-)... was the entry to the photo.<br/><br/>Photography for me is as much about emotion transformed to shapes as it is about absolute literal images of objects we can easily classify, stereotype and file away.<br/><br/>The emotion of Abandonded is the desolation, the left behind and forgotten idea but the beauty of a nice summer day should still be evident in a very quite part of an old warehouse facility. Not just a photo of an old building with broken windows. :-)</td>', 'Thanks for the votes and the comments.The word Abandonded was teh subject of my photo.  The warehouse was used as an atmosphere background and the "OLD" weed ...in weed years :-)... was the entry to the photo.Photography for me is as much about emotion transformed to shapes as it is about absolute literal images of objects we can easily classify, stereotype and file away.The emotion of Abandonded is the desolation, the left behind and forgotten idea but the beauty of a nice summer day should still be evident in a very quite part of an old warehouse facility. Not just a photo of an old building with broken windows. :-)', '2002-08-13 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(101645, 4218, 1143, '<td valign="top">love the title</td>', 'love the title', '2002-08-05 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101646, 4218, 2111, '<td valign="top">excellent! A perfect title 7</td>', 'excellent! A perfect title 7', '2002-08-06 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101647, 4218, 3105, '<td valign="top">The structure looks good centered between the light rocks and the dark trees and water.  It looks like it is supposed to be there.  Nice pic.</td>', 'The structure looks good centered between the light rocks and the dark trees and water.  It looks like it is supposed to be there.  Nice pic.', '2002-08-06 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101648, 4218, 3035, '<td valign="top">This is very nice</td>', 'This is very nice', '2002-08-06 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101649, 4218, 2815, '<td valign="top">All say it needs work.  Let me guess,  I''ll bet the last tenants complained of a draft.</td>', 'All say it needs work.  Let me guess,  I''ll bet the last tenants complained of a draft.', '2002-08-06 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101650, 4218, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  Beautiful color, composition, subject, and it fits the challenge well. lhall</td>', 'Love this shot.  Beautiful color, composition, subject, and it fits the challenge well. lhall', '2002-08-06 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101651, 4218, 2983, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I could see a shot like this in a newspaper in the real estate section. Good photo.</td>', 'Yeah, I could see a shot like this in a newspaper in the real estate section. Good photo.', '2002-08-06 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101652, 4218, 1644, '<td valign="top">What an interesting place you found. I like the green of the trees in contrast to the stark colors of the stone. Everything is very sharp and focused, it gives a good view of the whole property, not just the building. It really makes the building look out of place.</td>', 'What an interesting place you found. I like the green of the trees in contrast to the stark colors of the stone. Everything is very sharp and focused, it gives a good view of the whole property, not just the building. It really makes the building look out of place.', '2002-08-06 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101653, 4218, 2798, '<td valign="top">Suitable subject. Nice focus, colour and contrast. Nice to see it set against such a natural surrounding.</td>', 'Suitable subject. Nice focus, colour and contrast. Nice to see it set against such a natural surrounding.', '2002-08-07 05:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101654, 4218, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great shot; it''s a really interesting picture.  I like everything about, and I really like the dramatic view looking down.  The challenge is very well met (10)</td>', 'Great shot; it''s a really interesting picture.  I like everything about, and I really like the dramatic view looking down.  The challenge is very well met (10)', '2002-08-07 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101655, 4218, 3147, '<td valign="top">and the bidding wars begin.... hahaha   Great photo</td>', 'and the bidding wars begin.... hahaha   Great photo', '2002-08-07 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101656, 4218, 772, '<td valign="top">nice view :)  I like the overhead perspectiveo n this shot... This looks like a place I would have played as a child... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice view :)  I like the overhead perspectiveo n this shot... This looks like a place I would have played as a child... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101657, 4218, 3112, '<td valign="top">Something makes me want to see more of the surrounding landscape, OR a more close up shot of the building.  Otherwise excellent, thematically.</td>', 'Something makes me want to see more of the surrounding landscape, OR a more close up shot of the building.  Otherwise excellent, thematically.', '2002-08-09 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101658, 4218, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice pic of a what looks like a pump house or other commercial building, I just can''t see this as a residence.  Excellent focus and composition.  The title was a joke right?  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice pic of a what looks like a pump house or other commercial building, I just can''t see this as a residence.  Excellent focus and composition.  The title was a joke right?  8 Swash', '2002-08-09 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101659, 4218, 3198, '<td valign="top">huhu</td>', 'huhu', '2002-08-10 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101660, 4218, 1054, '<td valign="top">Clever title, good shot too.</td>', 'Clever title, good shot too.', '2002-08-10 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101661, 4218, 2618, '<td valign="top">I''ll take it. When can I move in?</td>', 'I''ll take it. When can I move in?', '2002-08-10 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101662, 4218, 1280, '<td valign="top">Geee I feel like I''ve been there...is it in upstate New York? Adirondacks? Anyway I like it.  The rocks and the abandonment, and even the creek speak "old" to me. Nice</td>', 'Geee I feel like I''ve been there...is it in upstate New York? Adirondacks? Anyway I like it.  The rocks and the abandonment, and even the creek speak "old" to me. Nice', '2002-08-11 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101663, 4218, 637, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, composition, colors  7 sjgleah</td>', 'Nice concept, composition, colors  7 sjgleah', '2002-08-11 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101664, 4218, 554, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I would love  to live here, with a little work of course. Nice presentation.</td>', 'I really like this. I would love  to live here, with a little work of course. Nice presentation.', '2002-08-11 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101665, 4223, 2700, '<td valign="top">unlike the other "old vehicals" that have been rusted out (Im sure you know what I mean) THIS Is a great example of how framing and perspective (not to mention weather) can have a huge impact on the photo... great job 9</td>', 'unlike the other "old vehicals" that have been rusted out (Im sure you know what I mean) THIS Is a great example of how framing and perspective (not to mention weather) can have a huge impact on the photo... great job 9', '2002-08-05 02:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101666, 4223, 1330, '<td valign="top">good shot</td>', 'good shot', '2002-08-05 06:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101667, 4223, 2997, '<td valign="top">I think this one desearves "best color" picture.</td>', 'I think this one desearves "best color" picture.', '2002-08-05 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101668, 4223, 1569, '<td valign="top">This is great--it belongs on a wall in a nice frame!</td>', 'This is great--it belongs on a wall in a nice frame!', '2002-08-05 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101669, 4223, 117, '<td valign="top">one word "Excellent"</td>', 'one word "Excellent"', '2002-08-05 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101670, 4223, 2452, '<td valign="top">Stunning colour!</td>', 'Stunning colour!', '2002-08-05 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101671, 4223, 1519, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, I love all the colors.  Could you try a different position without the driveway and car? that can be seen through the wheel? It would seem more abandoned then..  7 lecalan</td>', 'This is a great photo, I love all the colors.  Could you try a different position without the driveway and car? that can be seen through the wheel? It would seem more abandoned then..  7 lecalan', '2002-08-05 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101672, 4223, 2223, '<td valign="top">very nice! looks like a storm is coming....good shot 8</td>', 'very nice! looks like a storm is coming....good shot 8', '2002-08-05 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
