(101675, 4223, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice timing, the overcast sky really adds to this, great job!</td>', 'Nice timing, the overcast sky really adds to this, great job!', '2002-08-05 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101676, 4223, 2172, '<td valign="top">I gave 4 10s this week, this is one of them.  Despite that the parking lot on the right is visible, I love this.  I like how the sky is dark on one side.  The angle is great as well as the clarity.  Great Job.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I gave 4 10s this week, this is one of them.  Despite that the parking lot on the right is visible, I love this.  I like how the sky is dark on one side.  The angle is great as well as the clarity.  Great Job.Ruthann', '2002-08-05 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101677, 4223, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great picture - only quibble is the slightly over exposed sky - (8)</td>', 'Great picture - only quibble is the slightly over exposed sky - (8)', '2002-08-05 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101678, 4223, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - very good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - quite good. Perhaps its the yellow flowers and dark clouds that offset and make this jump out.<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - very goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - quite good. Perhaps its the yellow flowers and dark clouds that offset and make this jump out.', '2002-08-05 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101679, 4223, 1143, '<td valign="top">i really like this. the angle and the sky are great. nice work</td>', 'i really like this. the angle and the sky are great. nice work', '2002-08-05 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101680, 4223, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I love the colours (it''s nice because so many photos are black and white or sepia in this challenge). The framing/composition is very striking. I just hope apostrophe man doesn''t get you for your typo in the title :P</td>', 'Beautiful. I love the colours (it''s nice because so many photos are black and white or sepia in this challenge). The framing/composition is very striking. I just hope apostrophe man doesn''t get you for your typo in the title :P', '2002-08-06 03:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101681, 4223, 2148, '<td valign="top">I love this picture, can''t be specific as to why, just do. Only negative (and it''s really being picky) - I feel there''s too much difference in the sky between the left and right sides. Are those storm clouds? maybe having waited a few minutes until the whole sky was a unifrom shade - all clouds would have added even more impact to the shot. - lamedos</td>', 'I love this picture, can''t be specific as to why, just do. Only negative (and it''s really being picky) - I feel there''s too much difference in the sky between the left and right sides. Are those storm clouds? maybe having waited a few minutes until the whole sky was a unifrom shade - all clouds would have added even more impact to the shot. - lamedos', '2002-08-06 07:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101682, 4223, 2551, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours and composition.</td>', 'Wonderful colours and composition.', '2002-08-06 08:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101683, 4223, 3105, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  It has a nice nature v. technology thing going on with the tall, green grasses and dandelions along with the sky which forecasts an impending storm approaching from the left of the frame all situated around the rusted old tractor filling most of the frame.  There''s tension and  an anticipation of the coming weather which, in the past, has helped give the tractor it''s old look so it''s more than just a "product shot" of an old tractor.  Great timing and great eye.  The only thing I would note is the pavement, fence and car on the far right which serves as the only point of distraction.</td>', 'I really like this photo.  It has a nice nature v. technology thing going on with the tall, green grasses and dandelions along with the sky which forecasts an impending storm approaching from the left of the frame all situated around the rusted old tractor filling most of the frame.  There''s tension and  an anticipation of the coming weather which, in the past, has helped give the tractor it''s old look so it''s more than just a "product shot" of an old tractor.  Great timing and great eye.  The only thing I would note is the pavement, fence and car on the far right which serves as the only point of distraction.', '2002-08-06 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101684, 4223, 2815, '<td valign="top">Wow I love this one it looks really great.  I wish I would have done mine in color too.</td>', 'Wow I love this one it looks really great.  I wish I would have done mine in color too.', '2002-08-06 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101685, 4223, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like the full range of colors in this shot (what no reds?)  I especially like the dark cloud looming, nice touch!  The angle of the shot is very interesting and almost perfectly framed (cut off part of the front tire and the top of the exhaust).  Plus I wish I could see the tool attached to the back of the tractor, but I am thinking that might have introduced other issues/problems.  9 Swash</td>', 'Very nice!  I like the full range of colors in this shot (what no reds?)  I especially like the dark cloud looming, nice touch!  The angle of the shot is very interesting and almost perfectly framed (cut off part of the front tire and the top of the exhaust).  Plus I wish I could see the tool attached to the back of the tractor, but I am thinking that might have introduced other issues/problems.  9 Swash', '2002-08-06 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101686, 4223, 3102, '<td valign="top">Cool sky!</td>', 'Cool sky!', '2002-08-06 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101687, 4223, 3035, '<td valign="top">the split in the atmosphere and what''s above the bottom of the radiator makes this a fine photo!</td>', 'the split in the atmosphere and what''s above the bottom of the radiator makes this a fine photo!', '2002-08-06 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101688, 4223, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.</td>', 'Very nice picture.', '2002-08-07 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101689, 4223, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite photo for this challenge. I love the color. My only comment would be that the sky on the right side is just a little too light. But I think its because of the white background. With a matting &amp; frame, Perfect. - 10</td>', 'This is my favorite photo for this challenge. I love the color. My only comment would be that the sky on the right side is just a little too light. But I think its because of the white background. With a matting & frame, Perfect. - 10', '2002-08-07 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101690, 4223, 2752, '<td valign="top">good angle shot..the sky is great and the grass makes a good balance</td>', 'good angle shot..the sky is great and the grass makes a good balance', '2002-08-07 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101691, 4223, 2667, '<td valign="top">this is a great photo. the only things i would change would be to try and eliminate the fence in the background (looks like a white wooden and also a chain link, and is that an auto?) and to include the whole exhaust pipe. the darkening sky adds lots of mood to this shot.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...7<br/>Meets Challenge...7<br/>Overall...7</td>', 'this is a great photo. the only things i would change would be to try and eliminate the fence in the background (looks like a white wooden and also a chain link, and is that an auto?) and to include the whole exhaust pipe. the darkening sky adds lots of mood to this shot.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...7Meets Challenge...7Overall...7', '2002-08-07 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101692, 4223, 2716, '<td valign="top">Love this picture.  Nice angle and colors. (9)</td>', 'Love this picture.  Nice angle and colors. (9)', '2002-08-07 06:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101693, 4223, 2502, '<td valign="top">Great Photo ! The dark sky on the left side seems to add to the drama of this picture.</td>', 'Great Photo ! The dark sky on the left side seems to add to the drama of this picture.', '2002-08-07 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101694, 4223, 3112, '<td valign="top">Personally, exactly what I was looking for.  Only improvement might have been in being able to see the top of the stack on the tractor.  Excellent</td>', 'Personally, exactly what I was looking for.  Only improvement might have been in being able to see the top of the stack on the tractor.  Excellent', '2002-08-07 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101695, 4223, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent photo... question... is there a wooded area on the left side of this tractor?  If so, it may have been better to photograph it from the other side to provide a better background... This photo works really well as is though.. i love the dandilions in front of the tractor :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'excellent photo... question... is there a wooded area on the left side of this tractor?  If so, it may have been better to photograph it from the other side to provide a better background... This photo works really well as is though.. i love the dandilions in front of the tractor :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101696, 4223, 2482, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love the contrast in colors.</td>', 'Great shot. I love the contrast in colors.', '2002-08-07 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101697, 4223, 1041, '<td valign="top">lol ... it''s amazing how much influence your managers have on you.  i had one that was always harping on about the difference between its and it''s ... you used the wrong one.  anyway.  i like your picture.  the angle and composition is great, even though i don''t like the cut off pipe at the top, but i think this is probably still the best angle.  the sky is nice and the dandylions add a nice touch. -- gr8photos (7)</td>', 'lol ... it''s amazing how much influence your managers have on you.  i had one that was always harping on about the difference between its and it''s ... you used the wrong one.  anyway.  i like your picture.  the angle and composition is great, even though i don''t like the cut off pipe at the top, but i think this is probably still the best angle.  the sky is nice and the dandylions add a nice touch. -- gr8photos (7)', '2002-08-07 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101698, 4223, 3162, '<td valign="top">Good angle. might want to not cut off stack.</td>', 'Good angle. might want to not cut off stack.', '2002-08-08 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
