(101701, 4223, 917, '<td valign="top">Zoomed in a bit too far, cropping the front wheel and the exhaust pipe. Nice low angle to remove background clutter, Maybe the nearest wheel could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Zoomed in a bit too far, cropping the front wheel and the exhaust pipe. Nice low angle to remove background clutter, Maybe the nearest wheel could be a bit sharper.', '2002-08-09 08:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
