(101711, 4223, 2661, '<td valign="top">this is a really pretty shot. the colors are really great. the best part, I think, is the sky, so it would be nice if you backed up and shot the picture in vertical format, placing the tractor at the bottom of the frame so you could see more sky. I really like the shot as it is, though.</td>', 'this is a really pretty shot. the colors are really great. the best part, I think, is the sky, so it would be nice if you backed up and shot the picture in vertical format, placing the tractor at the bottom of the frame so you could see more sky. I really like the shot as it is, though.', '2002-08-11 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101712, 4223, 2, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors and a wonderful subject for your shot.  I can''t decide if the changing sky adds or detracts from the composition, so I''ll give it the benefit of the doubt!  Do you have any outtakes from this shoot?  8.</td>', 'Brilliant colors and a wonderful subject for your shot.  I can''t decide if the changing sky adds or detracts from the composition, so I''ll give it the benefit of the doubt!  Do you have any outtakes from this shoot?  8.', '2002-08-12 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
