(101724, 4224, 2928, '<td valign="top">I know that without retouching you can''t remove the wire - but it kills the effect.  The dark image and subtle lighting are really atmospheric, the picture works in every other respect...(7)</td>', 'I know that without retouching you can''t remove the wire - but it kills the effect.  The dark image and subtle lighting are really atmospheric, the picture works in every other respect...(7)', '2002-08-05 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
