(101734, 4224, 811, '<td valign="top">It is definitely old, and I like how you have filled up the frame.    It is just a touch too dark though, for me, and I think some of the more interesting details may be lost. karmat</td>', 'It is definitely old, and I like how you have filled up the frame.    It is just a touch too dark though, for me, and I think some of the more interesting details may be lost. karmat', '2002-08-09 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
