(101736, 4224, 2172, '<td valign="top">I like this!  I like the lighting and its direction.  At first I scored this a 7, but I have taken a 2nd and 3rd look - each time liking it more.  There is great photo quality here.  I''m taking it to a 9.  Great work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I like this!  I like the lighting and its direction.  At first I scored this a 7, but I have taken a 2nd and 3rd look - each time liking it more.  There is great photo quality here.  I''m taking it to a 9.  Great work.Ruthann', '2002-08-10 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101737, 4224, 1031, '<td valign="top">I thought about shooting one of these, but never got over to it...nice close-up angle</td>', 'I thought about shooting one of these, but never got over to it...nice close-up angle', '2002-08-11 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101738, 4225, 2928, '<td valign="top">Technically great, fits the challange...</td>', 'Technically great, fits the challange...', '2002-08-05 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101739, 4225, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice choice of subjects for this challenge... I believe this image needs a little more sharpness overall... Possibly a lower camera angle as well... :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a nice choice of subjects for this challenge... I believe this image needs a little more sharpness overall... Possibly a lower camera angle as well... :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101740, 4225, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-05 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101741, 4225, 3112, '<td valign="top">Could be a better photo without the open books. Still the subject is well executed.</td>', 'Could be a better photo without the open books. Still the subject is well executed.', '2002-08-09 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101742, 4225, 1880, '<td valign="top">I like old books ...  RLS</td>', 'I like old books ...  RLS', '2002-08-10 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101743, 4225, 3198, '<td valign="top">yes, the books are old. british orations, russian english dictionary, what''s the story?</td>', 'yes, the books are old. british orations, russian english dictionary, what''s the story?', '2002-08-11 07:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101744, 4226, 2467, '<td valign="top">The photo is not as sharp as it could be.</td>', 'The photo is not as sharp as it could be.', '2002-08-05 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101745, 4226, 2997, '<td valign="top">There are people on this website that do not have cameras, but just like looking at pictures.  You and I as photography enthusiasts readily know the camera on the left is "old."  But would those without a background know this?  Really, the Canon doesn''t show any aging.  It "looks" new.<br/></td>', 'There are people on this website that do not have cameras, but just like looking at pictures.  You and I as photography enthusiasts readily know the camera on the left is "old."  But would those without a background know this?  Really, the Canon doesn''t show any aging.  It "looks" new.', '2002-08-05 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101746, 4226, 1792, '<td valign="top">Composition seems awkward.  A more irregular arrangement might have been effective--also a lighter background would have provided more contrast.</td>', 'Composition seems awkward.  A more irregular arrangement might have been effective--also a lighter background would have provided more contrast.', '2002-08-05 03:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101747, 4226, 2780, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but I think you could have experimented more with different angles and lighting conditions to make this more interesting. It is also a very pixelated image.</td>', 'nice idea, but I think you could have experimented more with different angles and lighting conditions to make this more interesting. It is also a very pixelated image.', '2002-08-05 04:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101748, 4226, 1993, '<td valign="top">Nice idead...but you lost me with the dark background.</td>', 'Nice idead...but you lost me with the dark background.', '2002-08-05 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101749, 4226, 2172, '<td valign="top">Idea is good.  I''m going to be frank:  Not sharp enough/or too pixelated; I don''t like seeing the black cloth and the wrinkles; the setup does not do anything - What I see:  a black cloth with 2 cameras placed side by side, taken with a camera with the flash on.  I think the idea is there, but the lighting and exposure needs improvement - when using a backdrop - especially black, you need to have the exposure just right as to not see it in the photo.  I think the arrangement of the cameras needs to be changed - perhaps at angles.<br/>Overall, I''m sorry to say, but this photo is poor - but I think that with some more practice and continued participation here at dpc, skills will improve.<br/>Ruthann - 2</td>', 'Idea is good.  I''m going to be frank:  Not sharp enough/or too pixelated; I don''t like seeing the black cloth and the wrinkles; the setup does not do anything - What I see:  a black cloth with 2 cameras placed side by side, taken with a camera with the flash on.  I think the idea is there, but the lighting and exposure needs improvement - when using a backdrop - especially black, you need to have the exposure just right as to not see it in the photo.  I think the arrangement of the cameras needs to be changed - perhaps at angles.Overall, I''m sorry to say, but this photo is poor - but I think that with some more practice and continued participation here at dpc, skills will improve.Ruthann - 2', '2002-08-05 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101750, 4226, 2123, '<td valign="top">Oh no, wrinkles! ;-)  Not enough to hold my interest, perhaps a different composition would help.</td>', 'Oh no, wrinkles! ;-)  Not enough to hold my interest, perhaps a different composition would help.', '2002-08-05 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101751, 4226, 1141, '<td valign="top">To much contrast in light</td>', 'To much contrast in light', '2002-08-05 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101752, 4226, 2535, '<td valign="top">would have been a better example of juxtaposition if it were taken from a different angle and if the background weren''t wrinkled</td>', 'would have been a better example of juxtaposition if it were taken from a different angle and if the background weren''t wrinkled', '2002-08-06 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101753, 4226, 772, '<td valign="top">I think your cnoice of subject is good for this challenge... I think you possibly could have uncovered a different perspective on this photo to give it some more punch.  The lighting isn''t quite even across the frame from left to right.. it gets darker as we move from one side to the other... - jmsetzler</td>', 'I think your cnoice of subject is good for this challenge... I think you possibly could have uncovered a different perspective on this photo to give it some more punch.  The lighting isn''t quite even across the frame from left to right.. it gets darker as we move from one side to the other... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-06 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101754, 4226, 2079, '<td valign="top">There is quite a bit of pixelation going on in this, I''m not certain if it''s due to re-sizing or resolution or what. also if you boost the cameras up above the background cloth it might help a great deal to hide it in the photo. (a lint brush is a must) - good luck</td>', 'There is quite a bit of pixelation going on in this, I''m not certain if it''s due to re-sizing or resolution or what. also if you boost the cameras up above the background cloth it might help a great deal to hide it in the photo. (a lint brush is a must) - good luck', '2002-08-07 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101755, 4226, 2553, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen this shot with a more interesting setup.  Perhaps have the cameras leaning on one another an take a very tight shot of them.  The shot lacks real visual interest. lhall</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen this shot with a more interesting setup.  Perhaps have the cameras leaning on one another an take a very tight shot of them.  The shot lacks real visual interest. lhall', '2002-08-07 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101756, 4226, 917, '<td valign="top">Stretch those wrinkes out, or drape the cloth in folds. Far too many compression artifacts, and the angle the picture was shot from is a bit naff.</td>', 'Stretch those wrinkes out, or drape the cloth in folds. Far too many compression artifacts, and the angle the picture was shot from is a bit naff.', '2002-08-08 07:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101757, 4226, 2798, '<td valign="top">Ok you really have yourself a challenge here - trying to photograph a mainly black camera on a black background. It mostly works but I think you needed more light on these subjects. Perhaps a little off to either side or even from above might have been interesting. There''s also very little resolution in your picture. There''s blockiness around the highlight in the bottom left of the blue camera. Good choice of subject, though.</td>', 'Ok you really have yourself a challenge here - trying to photograph a mainly black camera on a black background. It mostly works but I think you needed more light on these subjects. Perhaps a little off to either side or even from above might have been interesting. There''s also very little resolution in your picture. There''s blockiness around the highlight in the bottom left of the blue camera. Good choice of subject, though.', '2002-08-08 07:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101758, 4226, 2857, '<td valign="top">doesn''t make me feel anyhting.</td>', 'doesn''t make me feel anyhting.', '2002-08-08 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101759, 4226, 3112, '<td valign="top">I lost an AE-1Program just like that, back in 1985.  Sad.  Fair choice of subject.</td>', 'I lost an AE-1Program just like that, back in 1985.  Sad.  Fair choice of subject.', '2002-08-09 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101760, 4226, 811, '<td valign="top">Instead of having them side by side, did you try different arrangements?  The way you have it makes the picture static, it doesn''t draw attention or hold it.  Maybe if they were in opposing corners, it would work better. karmat</td>', 'Instead of having them side by side, did you try different arrangements?  The way you have it makes the picture static, it doesn''t draw attention or hold it.  Maybe if they were in opposing corners, it would work better. karmat', '2002-08-09 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101761, 4226, 3198, '<td valign="top">ugly flash. wrinkles in the background.</td>', 'ugly flash. wrinkles in the background.', '2002-08-11 08:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101762, 4226, 2, '<td valign="top">The shot is very dark and very grainy looking.  Add alternate sources of lighting to brighten it up, then adjust the levels in an image editing program to remove the wrinkles.</td>', 'The shot is very dark and very grainy looking.  Add alternate sources of lighting to brighten it up, then adjust the levels in an image editing program to remove the wrinkles.', '2002-08-11 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101763, 4226, 2661, '<td valign="top">funny, I have the exact same old canon. I wouldn''t be surprised if a lot of other people tell you the same thing too. anyways, things to fix... well, I think the blue camera kind of detracts from the picture. so first of all, focus exclusively on the slr. secondly, if you light it with a flash like that, the background becomes really ugly and you get glare off the subject. light it from the side to make nice shadows and give the image more depth. use different angles and compositions to focus in on certain design aspects of the canon rather than the whole thing at once.</td>', 'funny, I have the exact same old canon. I wouldn''t be surprised if a lot of other people tell you the same thing too. anyways, things to fix... well, I think the blue camera kind of detracts from the picture. so first of all, focus exclusively on the slr. secondly, if you light it with a flash like that, the background becomes really ugly and you get glare off the subject. light it from the side to make nice shadows and give the image more depth. use different angles and compositions to focus in on certain design aspects of the canon rather than the whole thing at once.', '2002-08-11 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101764, 4226, 1280, '<td valign="top">I''d like to have seen the cameras composed differently to break up the straight horizontal line straight in the middle.  That would make it more appealing to the eye. I like your idea...just needs a little adjustment.</td>', 'I''d like to have seen the cameras composed differently to break up the straight horizontal line straight in the middle.  That would make it more appealing to the eye. I like your idea...just needs a little adjustment.', '2002-08-11 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101765, 4227, 1792, '<td valign="top">NIce composition and contrasts.  The simplicity is nice, the different lines are nice.</td>', 'NIce composition and contrasts.  The simplicity is nice, the different lines are nice.', '2002-08-05 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101766, 4227, 1569, '<td valign="top">Nice,I like interesting signs.</td>', 'Nice,I like interesting signs.', '2002-08-05 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101767, 4227, 2907, '<td valign="top">Better consideration of framing and composition could help... <br/>Also there is no real focal point for the viewer.</td>', 'Better consideration of framing and composition could help... Also there is no real focal point for the viewer.', '2002-08-05 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101768, 4227, 1202, '<td valign="top">Your picture suggesst something old but it misses the mark for me.   The hanger for the sign might be old, and if it is I feel you should have worked your way in closer to make it your main focal point.   In my opinion any way.   Autool</td>', 'Your picture suggesst something old but it misses the mark for me.   The hanger for the sign might be old, and if it is I feel you should have worked your way in closer to make it your main focal point.   In my opinion any way.   Autool', '2002-08-05 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101769, 4227, 2983, '<td valign="top">The simplicity is striking.  I like this more and more each time I view it.</td>', 'The simplicity is striking.  I like this more and more each time I view it.', '2002-08-06 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101770, 4227, 2752, '<td valign="top">nice composition..good angles</td>', 'nice composition..good angles', '2002-08-06 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
