 I think it works really well, technically superb  I don''t think even the purist''s will find too much wrong  my opinion, but the DPCer''s are a diverse set of people.  Composition, again, up there with the top pictures in the set</td>', 'This  for me  is an easy 10 I think it works really well, technically superb  I don''t think even the purist''s will find too much wrong  my opinion, but the DPCer''s are a diverse set of people.  Composition, again, up there with the top pictures in the set', '2002-08-07 05:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97894, 3948, 2323, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo-- artistically it is just great.  I know the record is old, but the photo doesn''t really emphasize that aspect of it. --7-- sohr</td>', 'I really like this photo-- artistically it is just great.  I know the record is old, but the photo doesn''t really emphasize that aspect of it. --7-- sohr', '2002-08-07 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97895, 3948, 573, '<td valign="top">Does this bring back memories if my childhood.  Sit''n round the phonograph player listnen to records.  Excllent composition and lighting angle to highlight the groves in the vinyl.  My ten pick this week.</td>', 'Does this bring back memories if my childhood.  Sit''n round the phonograph player listnen to records.  Excllent composition and lighting angle to highlight the groves in the vinyl.  My ten pick this week.', '2002-08-07 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
