(97897, 3948, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent image... very nice work... I can''t really offer a suggestion for improvement :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'excellent image... very nice work... I can''t really offer a suggestion for improvement :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97898, 3948, 3090, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image!</td>', 'Beautiful image!', '2002-08-07 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97899, 3948, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - almost abstract and yet so recognisable. I was talking to a teenager recently about playing songs at the wrong speed... she didn''t know what I was talking about. CDs only play at one speed, she said scornfully.</td>', 'Nice composition - almost abstract and yet so recognisable. I was talking to a teenager recently about playing songs at the wrong speed... she didn''t know what I was talking about. CDs only play at one speed, she said scornfully.', '2002-08-07 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97900, 3948, 3147, '<td valign="top">stunning</td>', 'stunning', '2002-08-07 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97901, 3948, 3161, '<td valign="top">great image and memories!</td>', 'great image and memories!', '2002-08-08 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97902, 3948, 436, '<td valign="top">I like that you snipped off the bottom of the label, showed the ridges with soft lighting and make me feel as if I''m removing it from the jacket with the angle.  Beautiful and peaceful...as befits the lullaby.</td>', 'I like that you snipped off the bottom of the label, showed the ridges with soft lighting and make me feel as if I''m removing it from the jacket with the angle.  Beautiful and peaceful...as befits the lullaby.', '2002-08-08 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97903, 3948, 2857, '<td valign="top">the way you shot it makes it look new. if it wasn''t for the label, i''d think it was a cd.</td>', 'the way you shot it makes it look new. if it wasn''t for the label, i''d think it was a cd.', '2002-08-08 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97904, 3948, 2235, '<td valign="top">This is hard one.  I gave it a 9 only because I viewed the rest. This is still excellent with highlights and depth of field. Really awesome shot.</td>', 'This is hard one.  I gave it a 9 only because I viewed the rest. This is still excellent with highlights and depth of field. Really awesome shot.', '2002-08-09 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97905, 3948, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent technically, and in composition.  The only reason that I have not rated the picture higher is that the title "forces" the viewer''s mind to think old.  I much prefer to have my mind arrive at the notion of oldness in its own time.</td>', 'Excellent technically, and in composition.  The only reason that I have not rated the picture higher is that the title "forces" the viewer''s mind to think old.  I much prefer to have my mind arrive at the notion of oldness in its own time.', '2002-08-09 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97906, 3948, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, very nice focal range!  The glare is perfect, no matter what anybody else says.  I try to not compare other shots, but here''s an exception.  The other record shot is on the turntable, much better "interest" to me.  On the other hand, this shot is SOOO much clearer....(I ended up giving you both the same score).  I don''t know which is better, maybe on the turntable, but not turning?  8 Swash</td>', 'Cool shot, very nice focal range!  The glare is perfect, no matter what anybody else says.  I try to not compare other shots, but here''s an exception.  The other record shot is on the turntable, much better "interest" to me.  On the other hand, this shot is SOOO much clearer....(I ended up giving you both the same score).  I don''t know which is better, maybe on the turntable, but not turning?  8 Swash', '2002-08-09 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97907, 3948, 2480, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections on the disc</td>', 'I like the reflections on the disc', '2002-08-09 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97908, 3948, 2700, '<td valign="top">of course your going to get comments about the "shine" in the upper porton of the photo. DISREGARD THOSE, for those people don''t know what art is... if you would have taken a pic of a record, no shine, big deal... boring... what you have done is above average. 8</td>', 'of course your going to get comments about the "shine" in the upper porton of the photo. DISREGARD THOSE, for those people don''t know what art is... if you would have taken a pic of a record, no shine, big deal... boring... what you have done is above average. 8', '2002-08-10 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97909, 3948, 3188, '<td valign="top">like the angle of the pic and the contrast..  nice!</td>', 'like the angle of the pic and the contrast..  nice!', '2002-08-10 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97910, 3948, 2661, '<td valign="top">great composition and I like the lightness gradient. good contrast between detailed and plain.</td>', 'great composition and I like the lightness gradient. good contrast between detailed and plain.', '2002-08-11 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97911, 3948, 656, '<td valign="top">would look good on the wall of a record store or in a bar.  Nicely done.  Could perhaps do with the contrast being stretched a bit further to accent the grooves ?</td>', 'would look good on the wall of a record store or in a bar.  Nicely done.  Could perhaps do with the contrast being stretched a bit further to accent the grooves ?', '2002-08-11 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
