(97914, 3948, 2752, '<td valign="top">I''m happy you did so well on your first entry.  Brunswick is certainly an old label.  I had a few..some rubber(pre vinyl). Don''t know if son used them for skeet practice or not&amp;gt; Betty</td>', 'I''m happy you did so well on your first entry.  Brunswick is certainly an old label.  I had a few..some rubber(pre vinyl). Don''t know if son used them for skeet practice or not&gt; Betty', '2002-08-12 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(97915, 3950, 2997, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The pictures are obviously old.  I see some tell-tail signs of it.  You could have hit a home run with this shot it you had maybe emphasized the flaws in the pictures more.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The pictures are obviously old.  I see some tell-tail signs of it.  You could have hit a home run with this shot it you had maybe emphasized the flaws in the pictures more.', '2002-08-05 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
