(97917, 3950, 1569, '<td valign="top">Really nice setup,great picture.</td>', 'Really nice setup,great picture.', '2002-08-05 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97918, 3950, 2170, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The lace background is also effective.</td>', 'Very nice.  The lace background is also effective.', '2002-08-05 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97919, 3950, 3103, '<td valign="top">I like the layout</td>', 'I like the layout', '2002-08-05 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97920, 3950, 2928, '<td valign="top">I like the picture. It''s very well done technically, but I feel it''s a little to busy and this takes away the central theme.  I like the look of the cloth under the pictures - perhaps using it to border fewer items would have worked better.  Still, it''s just one opinion... Good luck.</td>', 'I like the picture. It''s very well done technically, but I feel it''s a little to busy and this takes away the central theme.  I like the look of the cloth under the pictures - perhaps using it to border fewer items would have worked better.  Still, it''s just one opinion... Good luck.', '2002-08-05 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97921, 3950, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like it.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like it.', '2002-08-05 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97922, 3950, 2172, '<td valign="top">This is a decent photo.  I''m being very frank in my comments - not to offend.  This isn''t doing much for me.  It seems too constructed.  There isn''t one thing that really stands out, or focuses in on.  I think that maybe a different DOF with a slightly different arrangement may be more effective.  Although, I do like the golden touch of the yellow key and tassle - but I almost missed the fact that it is golden.  All in all nice photo - 7<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'This is a decent photo.  I''m being very frank in my comments - not to offend.  This isn''t doing much for me.  It seems too constructed.  There isn''t one thing that really stands out, or focuses in on.  I think that maybe a different DOF with a slightly different arrangement may be more effective.  Although, I do like the golden touch of the yellow key and tassle - but I almost missed the fact that it is golden.  All in all nice photo - 7Ruthann', '2002-08-06 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97923, 3950, 811, '<td valign="top">Very well lit.  I like the addition of the other objects (coin, key) as well. karmat</td>', 'Very well lit.  I like the addition of the other objects (coin, key) as well. karmat', '2002-08-06 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97924, 3950, 2752, '<td valign="top">great collage and sharp composition.</td>', 'great collage and sharp composition.', '2002-08-07 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97925, 3950, 917, '<td valign="top">There is no real reason for the coin and key in this collection, other than they are a bit old.</td>', 'There is no real reason for the coin and key in this collection, other than they are a bit old.', '2002-08-08 07:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97926, 3950, 772, '<td valign="top">nice collection :) the silver dollar and the key add a nice touch :) good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice collection :) the silver dollar and the key add a nice touch :) good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97927, 3950, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice collection.  Is there a message or hidden meaning for the key and silver dollar?  Extremely nitty:  two different colored doilies?  The photo of the four children is dark;  the two in white, the white is blown out; The lady is nice, but the background too closely matches her dress and the little boy seems out of place (date) with the others (I''m just being silly, reviewing the old shots, habit I guess!)  8 Swash  (didn''t think I would ever get around to scoring the shot, did you?)</td>', 'Nice collection.  Is there a message or hidden meaning for the key and silver dollar?  Extremely nitty:  two different colored doilies?  The photo of the four children is dark;  the two in white, the white is blown out; The lady is nice, but the background too closely matches her dress and the little boy seems out of place (date) with the others (I''m just being silly, reviewing the old shots, habit I guess!)  8 Swash  (didn''t think I would ever get around to scoring the shot, did you?)', '2002-08-09 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97928, 3950, 3198, '<td valign="top">taken old very literally</td>', 'taken old very literally', '2002-08-10 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97929, 3952, 2586, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the post processing. Gives the image a flat greyish look and the shadows are muddy and unreal. Composition is too static as well. Sorry.</td>', 'Don''t care for the post processing. Gives the image a flat greyish look and the shadows are muddy and unreal. Composition is too static as well. Sorry.', '2002-08-05 04:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97930, 3952, 1569, '<td valign="top">Just a little underexposed.</td>', 'Just a little underexposed.', '2002-08-05 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97931, 3952, 2120, '<td valign="top">This is definately a well executed shot, technichally perfect as my untrained eye can see however it lacks much interest for me. Comes off as an advertisement rather than artistic for me. "Things of Grandma Brown, 1876 - 1966" while not as technical holds more interest and might be worth looking at. --8 Agamemnon</td>', 'This is definately a well executed shot, technichally perfect as my untrained eye can see however it lacks much interest for me. Comes off as an advertisement rather than artistic for me. "Things of Grandma Brown, 1876 - 1966" while not as technical holds more interest and might be worth looking at. --8 Agamemnon', '2002-08-05 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97932, 3952, 1856, '<td valign="top">this seems somehow muted to me.  maybe too bright?</td>', 'this seems somehow muted to me.  maybe too bright?', '2002-08-05 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97933, 3952, 1175, '<td valign="top">looks a bit washed out.</td>', 'looks a bit washed out.', '2002-08-05 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97934, 3952, 2928, '<td valign="top">Old - that''s how it feels and looks...</td>', 'Old - that''s how it feels and looks...', '2002-08-05 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97935, 3952, 1944, '<td valign="top">A nicely done photo. Good lighting and exposure/DOF. I like the sepia quality of it, especially as you used it sparengly (so many overdo it).</td>', 'A nicely done photo. Good lighting and exposure/DOF. I like the sepia quality of it, especially as you used it sparengly (so many overdo it).', '2002-08-06 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97936, 3952, 2587, '<td valign="top">Well fit subject matter... but I would''ve preferred to see only one camera. Both fit the criteria and both are visually interesting but my eyes keep jumping from one to the other. To improve this shot I would''ve eliminated one object and moved in a bit closer on the chosen one to give it a tighter composition and an interesting depth of field. ... but that''s just my 2 cents ... :-)</td>', 'Well fit subject matter... but I would''ve preferred to see only one camera. Both fit the criteria and both are visually interesting but my eyes keep jumping from one to the other. To improve this shot I would''ve eliminated one object and moved in a bit closer on the chosen one to give it a tighter composition and an interesting depth of field. ... but that''s just my 2 cents ... :-)', '2002-08-06 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97937, 3952, 2798, '<td valign="top">Wow - someone''s very lucky to have these knocking about! Superb subject. Well lit and focussed. Sepia tone doesnt detract from the image but it doesnt add much either. I think I''d have stayed with colour. Either way it''s a lovely shot.</td>', 'Wow - someone''s very lucky to have these knocking about! Superb subject. Well lit and focussed. Sepia tone doesnt detract from the image but it doesnt add much either. I think I''d have stayed with colour. Either way it''s a lovely shot.', '2002-08-06 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97938, 3952, 255, '<td valign="top">ok, i''m having a tough time with this one. first--i love the picture--very nicely set up and also nice subject/composition. I''m just trying to figure out if it has the soft overexposed look on purpose? I can only assume so, to make it look older? it looks like you jacked the output levels way up to give it that oldtimey portrait look?I took the liberty of putting this in photoshop and messing with the levels--darkening the cameras and taking that whitish contrast off really makes the camera and shadows stand out really nicely. but like i said, that is just me--i still like what you have here! BTW, i''ve never left such a long comment so i''ll stop! email me if i''m way off base because now i''m curious and would like to know your intent here! :-) <br/>8--amitchell</td>', 'ok, i''m having a tough time with this one. first--i love the picture--very nicely set up and also nice subject/composition. I''m just trying to figure out if it has the soft overexposed look on purpose? I can only assume so, to make it look older? it looks like you jacked the output levels way up to give it that oldtimey portrait look?I took the liberty of putting this in photoshop and messing with the levels--darkening the cameras and taking that whitish contrast off really makes the camera and shadows stand out really nicely. but like i said, that is just me--i still like what you have here! BTW, i''ve never left such a long comment so i''ll stop! email me if i''m way off base because now i''m curious and would like to know your intent here! :-) 8--amitchell', '2002-08-06 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97939, 3952, 92, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done and great subject:) =8 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'Very nicely done and great subject:) =8 Shiiizzzam', '2002-08-06 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97940, 3952, 2079, '<td valign="top">So many old time photos looked just like this, so you did use your technique to show the age. But I would like this better Much richer in saturation.</td>', 'So many old time photos looked just like this, so you did use your technique to show the age. But I would like this better Much richer in saturation.', '2002-08-07 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97941, 3952, 772, '<td valign="top">I wanna give this photo a good score for effort :)  I think the composition here is exellent but it looks over exposed to me.  Subjectively, this is an excellent photo... on the technical side, it needs some minor improvements.  This image could possibly be adjusted with levels or contrast controls to make it have more punch :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I wanna give this photo a good score for effort :)  I think the composition here is exellent but it looks over exposed to me.  Subjectively, this is an excellent photo... on the technical side, it needs some minor improvements.  This image could possibly be adjusted with levels or contrast controls to make it have more punch :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97942, 3952, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good technical photo.</td>', 'Good technical photo.', '2002-08-07 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97943, 3952, 1041, '<td valign="top">i love the idea for this challenge.  you photo is nice, but lacks ''umph'' in my opinion.  i just tried to do some postprocessing (all i did was autolevels).  that increased the contrast, and made your photo much more interesting to me.  it also highlighted those shadows which are nice on the white background.  let me know if you''d like me to send you a copy of what i did. -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'i love the idea for this challenge.  you photo is nice, but lacks ''umph'' in my opinion.  i just tried to do some postprocessing (all i did was autolevels).  that increased the contrast, and made your photo much more interesting to me.  it also highlighted those shadows which are nice on the white background.  let me know if you''d like me to send you a copy of what i did. -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-08-08 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97944, 3952, 2023, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. A little bit to bright, maybe darken it a little next time.</td>', 'Nice subject. A little bit to bright, maybe darken it a little next time.', '2002-08-08 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97945, 3952, 2661, '<td valign="top">A good idea, and a nice shot of the cameras. my only suggestion would be to darken the image. it looks a tad overexposed right now, so you could fix that in post-processing or just redo the shot.</td>', 'A good idea, and a nice shot of the cameras. my only suggestion would be to darken the image. it looks a tad overexposed right now, so you could fix that in post-processing or just redo the shot.', '2002-08-11 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
