(97979, 3957, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-05 19:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97980, 3957, 1330, '<td valign="top">who was grandma brown??</td>', 'who was grandma brown??', '2002-08-05 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97981, 3957, 2172, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and idea.  I''m being very frank in my comments - not to offend.  I think there are several things that would make this more effective.  A different angle and more importantly, a tighter crop.  If it''s going to be right in the middle, then crop it to take out the space.  If you leave the space, then use the rule of 3rds.  I think that the white balance is off - the white is very grey.  This is my opinion - not to offend   5<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Nice photo and idea.  I''m being very frank in my comments - not to offend.  I think there are several things that would make this more effective.  A different angle and more importantly, a tighter crop.  If it''s going to be right in the middle, then crop it to take out the space.  If you leave the space, then use the rule of 3rds.  I think that the white balance is off - the white is very grey.  This is my opinion - not to offend   5Ruthann', '2002-08-05 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97982, 3957, 3044, '<td valign="top">like the subject matter. technically it is a good shot. i think it might be more interesting if you could have shot the items with something other than the white background. maybe an old quilt or papers or maybe on an old nicely textured wood table.</td>', 'like the subject matter. technically it is a good shot. i think it might be more interesting if you could have shot the items with something other than the white background. maybe an old quilt or papers or maybe on an old nicely textured wood table.', '2002-08-06 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97983, 3957, 2752, '<td valign="top">simple and addresses the theme very well.  I like the lighting.</td>', 'simple and addresses the theme very well.  I like the lighting.', '2002-08-06 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97984, 3957, 2535, '<td valign="top">way too contrived, not unlike the majority of shots in this week''s challenge</td>', 'way too contrived, not unlike the majority of shots in this week''s challenge', '2002-08-06 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
