(97986, 3957, 1759, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a very good exposure and you have some good subjects to shoot. I love the camera. Good job at keeping reflections off the photo and camera lens.</td>', 'I think that this is a very good exposure and you have some good subjects to shoot. I love the camera. Good job at keeping reflections off the photo and camera lens.', '2002-08-06 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
