(98072, 3962, 772, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful work... the lighting is SUPERB.  In my local camera club, this photo would get pounded because of the fence.  These people in my club feel that a landscape photo needs a path or entrance for the viewer to walk into the scene.  They feel that objects blocking that ''entrance'' path are not a good thing... anyway.. that''s them.. i don'' t feel that way :)  The mood of this photo makes me very comfortable... I can just imagine myself standing here on a cool mountain morning... about 65 degrees outside... I love this photo... it gets a 10 this week... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is beautiful work... the lighting is SUPERB.  In my local camera club, this photo would get pounded because of the fence.  These people in my club feel that a landscape photo needs a path or entrance for the viewer to walk into the scene.  They feel that objects blocking that ''entrance'' path are not a good thing... anyway.. that''s them.. i don'' t feel that way :)  The mood of this photo makes me very comfortable... I can just imagine myself standing here on a cool mountain morning... about 65 degrees outside... I love this photo... it gets a 10 this week... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98073, 3962, 573, '<td valign="top">I realy like the greens and browns of this picture.  I am not all that comfortable with the composition, in my opinion the main porch should be facing onto the picture and that would place the striking wood siding on the right third for a more pleasing composition.</td>', 'I realy like the greens and browns of this picture.  I am not all that comfortable with the composition, in my opinion the main porch should be facing onto the picture and that would place the striking wood siding on the right third for a more pleasing composition.', '2002-08-07 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
