(98185, 3969, 2172, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very nice photo.  I love the fact that you can see the texture/grain of the wood.  Very nice composition and angle.  Perhaps just a touch too much contrast/sharpening (could very well be me, though).    Great work!!! 9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I think this is a very nice photo.  I love the fact that you can see the texture/grain of the wood.  Very nice composition and angle.  Perhaps just a touch too much contrast/sharpening (could very well be me, though).    Great work!!! 9Ruthann', '2002-08-06 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98186, 3969, 616, '<td valign="top">Nice. The worn area give you a great feeling of old.</td>', 'Nice. The worn area give you a great feeling of old.', '2002-08-06 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98187, 3969, 811, '<td valign="top">nice use of diagonal lines and I like the coloring on this.  karmat</td>', 'nice use of diagonal lines and I like the coloring on this.  karmat', '2002-08-06 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98188, 3969, 715, '<td valign="top">Very good composed photo and I like the yellow glow.</td>', 'Very good composed photo and I like the yellow glow.', '2002-08-06 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98189, 3969, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot!  It seems to me to be a bit overly red, but I like it that way.  The framing is just right.  The flare on the fret board is a bit distracting, but not enough to score you down for.  I keep seeing little things about this that don''t look good.  The lower hole (don''t know the tech name for it) in the violin, the upper section of the hole blends in with the shadow.  Sorry, but too many tiny issues to leave this as a 10 (but I want to anyway), I am going to place you at a 9 with lots of plus signs (nearly a 10).  Swash</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot!  It seems to me to be a bit overly red, but I like it that way.  The framing is just right.  The flare on the fret board is a bit distracting, but not enough to score you down for.  I keep seeing little things about this that don''t look good.  The lower hole (don''t know the tech name for it) in the violin, the upper section of the hole blends in with the shadow.  Sorry, but too many tiny issues to leave this as a 10 (but I want to anyway), I am going to place you at a 9 with lots of plus signs (nearly a 10).  Swash', '2002-08-06 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98190, 3969, 3035, '<td valign="top">great color and background - much like the saw</td>', 'great color and background - much like the saw', '2002-08-06 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98191, 3969, 2011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The violin and the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful. The violin and the photo.', '2002-08-07 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
