(98195, 3969, 772, '<td valign="top">wow... this is a BEAUTIFUL instrument... you have done an excellent job on this photo... This makes me want to listen to the Paganini Caprici for voilin :) - great shot... - jmsetzler</td>', 'wow... this is a BEAUTIFUL instrument... you have done an excellent job on this photo... This makes me want to listen to the Paganini Caprici for voilin :) - great shot... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
