(98209, 3969, 2667, '<td valign="top">great photo, i only wish the strings weren''t so bright...they''re blinding! the composition, though,  is fabulous.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...8<br/>Meets Challenge...8<br/>Overall...8</td>', 'great photo, i only wish the strings weren''t so bright...they''re blinding! the composition, though,  is fabulous.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...8Meets Challenge...8Overall...8', '2002-08-11 05:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98210, 3969, 2661, '<td valign="top">great composition. I like the curves in the image contrasted with the straight lines of the strings. it looksl ike you may have cranked up the saturation in the shot. if you did, then perhaps you should reconsider. I think the natural colors in the violin could carry the image, and the muted colors might perhaps enhance the feeling of age.</td>', 'great composition. I like the curves in the image contrasted with the straight lines of the strings. it looksl ike you may have cranked up the saturation in the shot. if you did, then perhaps you should reconsider. I think the natural colors in the violin could carry the image, and the muted colors might perhaps enhance the feeling of age.', '2002-08-11 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98211, 3969, 1280, '<td valign="top">This image has several elements that I find appealing. First and foremost is wood....I love earthy elements like wood and pottery.  The wood here is nicely grained and has nice warm tones.  Curves are another element I savor and curves are abundant here. The third aspect I like  is the diagonal angle.  Add all that to my love of music, which this represents so well, and the cropping is good. I like the dark/black background.  Lovely picture, uncluttered...wonderful job!</td>', 'This image has several elements that I find appealing. First and foremost is wood....I love earthy elements like wood and pottery.  The wood here is nicely grained and has nice warm tones.  Curves are another element I savor and curves are abundant here. The third aspect I like  is the diagonal angle.  Add all that to my love of music, which this represents so well, and the cropping is good. I like the dark/black background.  Lovely picture, uncluttered...wonderful job!', '2002-08-11 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98212, 3969, 318, '<td valign="top">Red violin? Beautyful! (Great movie too!)</td>', 'Red violin? Beautyful! (Great movie too!)', '2002-08-11 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98213, 3969, 2700, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the fine comments... I guess #7 out of 181 for the 2nd submission isn''t too bad :)</td>', 'Thank you all for the fine comments... I guess #7 out of 181 for the 2nd submission isn''t too bad :)', '2002-08-12 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(98214, 3972, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very neat ''old'' doll :)  I believe that this photo could have had a LOT more impact if it was shot on a background that offered some more contrast... a darker background... maybe a composition that didn''t bullseye center the subject would have worked better too :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a very neat ''old'' doll :)  I believe that this photo could have had a LOT more impact if it was shot on a background that offered some more contrast... a darker background... maybe a composition that didn''t bullseye center the subject would have worked better too :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98215, 3972, 157, '<td valign="top">I love this shot...the whiteness of the sheets show just hoe old the toy is...great lighting too...</td>', 'I love this shot...the whiteness of the sheets show just hoe old the toy is...great lighting too...', '2002-08-05 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98216, 3972, 2170, '<td valign="top">Brightened up and shot to see more of the bed would have helped this a lot!</td>', 'Brightened up and shot to see more of the bed would have helped this a lot!', '2002-08-05 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98217, 3972, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I think my daughter wants one...  Lighting is good, focus is good, subject is good.  7</td>', 'Very nice.  I think my daughter wants one...  Lighting is good, focus is good, subject is good.  7', '2002-08-05 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98218, 3972, 1202, '<td valign="top">I think this little feller would have still looked old if it had been given a little more light.   This would have given you better exposure and added snap to the picture.   In my opinion any way.   Autool</td>', 'I think this little feller would have still looked old if it had been given a little more light.   This would have given you better exposure and added snap to the picture.   In my opinion any way.   Autool', '2002-08-05 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
