(98267, 3977, 772, '<td valign="top">Great shot of an old house :)  I like the corner view... it gives depth to the subject... Lots of photos like this are done straight on and the image looks flat... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'Great shot of an old house :)  I like the corner view... it gives depth to the subject... Lots of photos like this are done straight on and the image looks flat... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
