(98272, 3977, 2170, '<td valign="top">The utility pole and electricity meter are both kind of distracting.  Otherwise, very nice.</td>', 'The utility pole and electricity meter are both kind of distracting.  Otherwise, very nice.', '2002-08-05 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98273, 3977, 2928, '<td valign="top">My only beef for what is a really good picture is the pole - I''d like to have seen that as the central theme rather than off to the left... Can''t knock it technically and it''s only one persons beef.  (8)</td>', 'My only beef for what is a really good picture is the pole - I''d like to have seen that as the central theme rather than off to the left... Can''t knock it technically and it''s only one persons beef.  (8)', '2002-08-05 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98274, 3977, 2716, '<td valign="top">Love the colour!  The power line is a bit distracting, however there isn''t much you could do about that.  Nice.  (6)</td>', 'Love the colour!  The power line is a bit distracting, however there isn''t much you could do about that.  Nice.  (6)', '2002-08-05 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98275, 3977, 2058, '<td valign="top">Hey Matt, very nice pic... I think it''s tilted though ;)  I put a couple of my outtakes up at pbase.com</td>', 'Hey Matt, very nice pic... I think it''s tilted though ;)  I put a couple of my outtakes up at pbase.com', '2002-08-06 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98276, 3977, 2912, '<td valign="top">Sepia is a nice choice for this view.</td>', 'Sepia is a nice choice for this view.', '2002-08-06 04:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98277, 3977, 1759, '<td valign="top">Cool subject. I like the totem on the left. I think this is a good shot, but the one thing that bothers me is the power lines. A tight crop showing only part of the house might be an effective way of cutting out the lines and emphasizing the subject. Composing these can be a tough call, as one might want to include the entire building, but can''t without including unwanted distractions. My usual preference is to compose so as to show the most important aspects of the building while eliminating the distracting elements.</td>', 'Cool subject. I like the totem on the left. I think this is a good shot, but the one thing that bothers me is the power lines. A tight crop showing only part of the house might be an effective way of cutting out the lines and emphasizing the subject. Composing these can be a tough call, as one might want to include the entire building, but can''t without including unwanted distractions. My usual preference is to compose so as to show the most important aspects of the building while eliminating the distracting elements.', '2002-08-06 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98278, 3977, 811, '<td valign="top">The totem pole looks out of place to me, but at the same time, it gives the house a little more character.  I like the coloring of this.  karmat</td>', 'The totem pole looks out of place to me, but at the same time, it gives the house a little more character.  I like the coloring of this.  karmat', '2002-08-07 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98279, 3977, 1686, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia tone. I would have liked to see more of the totem pole.</td>', 'I like the sepia tone. I would have liked to see more of the totem pole.', '2002-08-07 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98280, 3977, 2667, '<td valign="top">this is kinda cool. looks like its about to fall off the edge of the world. the sepia works great.  ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...7<br/>Meets Challenge...7<br/>Overall...7</td>', 'this is kinda cool. looks like its about to fall off the edge of the world. the sepia works great.  ~mcmurmaAesthetics...7Meets Challenge...7Overall...7', '2002-08-07 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98281, 3977, 2437, '<td valign="top">Oldest House in Camiguin?</td>', 'Oldest House in Camiguin?', '2002-08-07 03:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98282, 3977, 885, '<td valign="top">Oh, are you sure you didn''t mean to take a close up of that totem pole instead? :-)  Neat how the house is tilted like that, but I''m sure others have told you how the power lines are distracting and kind of take away from the oldness of it.  Could have been an interesting juxtaposition, but I think they would have had to have been more of a frame.</td>', 'Oh, are you sure you didn''t mean to take a close up of that totem pole instead? :-)  Neat how the house is tilted like that, but I''m sure others have told you how the power lines are distracting and kind of take away from the oldness of it.  Could have been an interesting juxtaposition, but I think they would have had to have been more of a frame.', '2002-08-07 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98283, 3977, 3099, '<td valign="top">I like the house with the old totem pole.</td>', 'I like the house with the old totem pole.', '2002-08-08 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98284, 3977, 1454, '<td valign="top">I liked it... but to me b/w would look better...</td>', 'I liked it... but to me b/w would look better...', '2002-08-08 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98285, 3977, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  Totem is too close to the edge of the house, and is hard to mentally distinguish from it.</td>', 'Good subject.  Totem is too close to the edge of the house, and is hard to mentally distinguish from it.', '2002-08-09 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98286, 3977, 2473, '<td valign="top">very cool. the tinting is very effective here</td>', 'very cool. the tinting is very effective here', '2002-08-09 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1);
  Only gripe, I think it should have been more central; you''ve cut a tiny bit off the bumper.  Hope that doesn''t sound too picky</td>', 'It looks like it''s still in use  Only gripe, I think it should have been more central; you''ve cut a tiny bit off the bumper.  Hope that doesn''t sound too picky', '2002-08-06 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
