(98315, 3981, 2111, '<td valign="top">black &amp; white ruins this picture</td>', 'black & white ruins this picture', '2002-08-06 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98316, 3981, 811, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the paper boxes, it would look like it was getting ready to roll out onto the road, which would be a touch of irony.  Nice shot. karmat</td>', 'If it weren''t for the paper boxes, it would look like it was getting ready to roll out onto the road, which would be a touch of irony.  Nice shot. karmat', '2002-08-06 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98317, 3981, 2079, '<td valign="top">Wow, this looks right out of Route 66. Great capture. I''m not sure I would have centered the truck in the picture or not. 8</td>', 'Wow, this looks right out of Route 66. Great capture. I''m not sure I would have centered the truck in the picture or not. 8', '2002-08-07 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98318, 3981, 917, '<td valign="top">I suspect there are better angles to take this, perhaps a couple of meters to the left, to get the telegraph poles dissappearing into the picture, and to bring the sign/mailbox thing into the picture.</td>', 'I suspect there are better angles to take this, perhaps a couple of meters to the left, to get the telegraph poles dissappearing into the picture, and to bring the sign/mailbox thing into the picture.', '2002-08-07 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98319, 3981, 772, '<td valign="top">This old girl isn''t dead yet :)  I could be mistaken here, but it looks like this old truck has one of those chain link steering wheels :)))  I like the black and white here but I think you may have over sharpened a little maybe... if you look at some of the diagonal lines in the photo, you can see some jagged edges... this is sometimes caused by sharpening... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This old girl isn''t dead yet :)  I could be mistaken here, but it looks like this old truck has one of those chain link steering wheels :)))  I like the black and white here but I think you may have over sharpened a little maybe... if you look at some of the diagonal lines in the photo, you can see some jagged edges... this is sometimes caused by sharpening... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98320, 3981, 1041, '<td valign="top">hm.  yours is one of those long descriptive titles.  not sure i''m a big fan of those.  anyway.  the truck is quite a find for this challenge, good catch.  i''m wondering whther you could''ve made it a little more interesting by zooming in on part of the truck, like just the cabin.  this way, with the road and the poles and that, it has that ''snapshot'' kind of look, sorry.  b&amp;w works well here. -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'hm.  yours is one of those long descriptive titles.  not sure i''m a big fan of those.  anyway.  the truck is quite a find for this challenge, good catch.  i''m wondering whther you could''ve made it a little more interesting by zooming in on part of the truck, like just the cabin.  this way, with the road and the poles and that, it has that ''snapshot'' kind of look, sorry.  b&w works well here. -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-08-07 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98321, 3981, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  Good exposure.  Unfortunate paper box placement.</td>', 'Good subject.  Good exposure.  Unfortunate paper box placement.', '2002-08-09 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98322, 3981, 2353, '<td valign="top">Good pic could have been centered a little more but bonus for the Creed reference!</td>', 'Good pic could have been centered a little more but bonus for the Creed reference!', '2002-08-10 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98323, 3981, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - good. Did you try any tighter crops?<br/>Technical Aspects - good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - good. Did you try any tighter crops?Technical Aspects - goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-10 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98324, 3989, 1569, '<td valign="top">Needs a slight bit more contrast,otherwise very nice picture.</td>', 'Needs a slight bit more contrast,otherwise very nice picture.', '2002-08-05 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98325, 3989, 1024, '<td valign="top">This does meet the challenge,  Unfortunately, the photo itself lacks any emotion.  It just does not "speak" to me.</td>', 'This does meet the challenge,  Unfortunately, the photo itself lacks any emotion.  It just does not "speak" to me.', '2002-08-05 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98326, 3989, 2170, '<td valign="top">Should adjust the balance to darken out the background and bring the lamp''s colors more contrast.</td>', 'Should adjust the balance to darken out the background and bring the lamp''s colors more contrast.', '2002-08-05 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98327, 3989, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat photo of an old lamp... you did an excellent job of removing a possibly distracting background with the black backdrop.  In this particular image, i believe that teh lamp shade could use a little extra ''breathing room'' at the top and on the sides... this lamp feels ''cramped'' in this space :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a neat photo of an old lamp... you did an excellent job of removing a possibly distracting background with the black backdrop.  In this particular image, i believe that teh lamp shade could use a little extra ''breathing room'' at the top and on the sides... this lamp feels ''cramped'' in this space :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98328, 3989, 2172, '<td valign="top">This is not working.  I''m going to be frank and to the point.  It''s pretty dull - the lighting definately needs work.  The straight-on shot needs to be changed - try a different angle.  Personally, I would take one aspect of the lamp - say the woman or the handles, and try to emphasize it.  I''m not sure that a black background is ideal for this.  I am in no way trying to offend - the best thing is to keep working at it - and take comments with a grain of salt - face value.  3<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'This is not working.  I''m going to be frank and to the point.  It''s pretty dull - the lighting definately needs work.  The straight-on shot needs to be changed - try a different angle.  Personally, I would take one aspect of the lamp - say the woman or the handles, and try to emphasize it.  I''m not sure that a black background is ideal for this.  I am in no way trying to offend - the best thing is to keep working at it - and take comments with a grain of salt - face value.  3Ruthann', '2002-08-05 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98329, 3989, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice old lamp but the picture does not excite me.   I think the subject should have been in stronger lighting, with the dark background.   This would have given the two the opportunity to work together.    In my opinion, Autool</td>', 'Nice old lamp but the picture does not excite me.   I think the subject should have been in stronger lighting, with the dark background.   This would have given the two the opportunity to work together.    In my opinion, Autool', '2002-08-06 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98330, 3989, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and nice detail with excellent contrast from the low key background. I do have some thoughts that I''ll share FWIW. I think the cropping is just a tad tight and that the shade dominates the frame too much. To lessen this I would shoot from furthar back with more zoom so as to compress the elements and lessen the size difference between the base and the shade. This would also bring out more detail in the base, which is lovely and deserving of as much attention as possible. I might also shoot from a slightly lower angle so as to bring the base more into figure (foreground) and the shade more into baackground.</td>', 'Good exposure and nice detail with excellent contrast from the low key background. I do have some thoughts that I''ll share FWIW. I think the cropping is just a tad tight and that the shade dominates the frame too much. To lessen this I would shoot from furthar back with more zoom so as to compress the elements and lessen the size difference between the base and the shade. This would also bring out more detail in the base, which is lovely and deserving of as much attention as possible. I might also shoot from a slightly lower angle so as to bring the base more into figure (foreground) and the shade more into baackground.', '2002-08-06 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98331, 3989, 2798, '<td valign="top">Very conventional placement and lighting. Good clear shot and very solid bkac background. Could have been made more interesting by placing a light off to one side and choosing a closer angle. Better to capture the detail on the lamp base than to get everything in. The shade isnt all that interesting so  perhaps frame things so we can see it''s there but dont show us much of it - focus more on the base detail.</td>', 'Very conventional placement and lighting. Good clear shot and very solid bkac background. Could have been made more interesting by placing a light off to one side and choosing a closer angle. Better to capture the detail on the lamp base than to get everything in. The shade isnt all that interesting so  perhaps frame things so we can see it''s there but dont show us much of it - focus more on the base detail.', '2002-08-07 06:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98332, 3989, 917, '<td valign="top">Drop a little lower to get the top of the vase into the picture.</td>', 'Drop a little lower to get the top of the vase into the picture.', '2002-08-07 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98333, 3989, 3198, '<td valign="top">taken old very literally</td>', 'taken old very literally', '2002-08-10 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98334, 3991, 2700, '<td valign="top">mines older :) just kidding, I was going to submit a shot like this... the B&amp;W works very well, as I couldnt get mine to...8</td>', 'mines older :) just kidding, I was going to submit a shot like this... the B&W works very well, as I couldnt get mine to...8', '2002-08-05 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98335, 3991, 1792, '<td valign="top">Really shows the wood detail well and is well composed, but I would have liked to have seen a little more of the instrument.</td>', 'Really shows the wood detail well and is well composed, but I would have liked to have seen a little more of the instrument.', '2002-08-05 03:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98336, 3991, 1037, '<td valign="top">Lovely... very dramatic composition and I love the high contrast black and white. 10 - lisae</td>', 'Lovely... very dramatic composition and I love the high contrast black and white. 10 - lisae', '2002-08-05 06:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98337, 3991, 1569, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too dark for my taste---otherwise really nice picture.</td>', 'Just a bit too dark for my taste---otherwise really nice picture.', '2002-08-05 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98338, 3991, 2170, '<td valign="top">Nice detail.  This might have been even better in color?</td>', 'Nice detail.  This might have been even better in color?', '2002-08-05 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98339, 3991, 255, '<td valign="top">wow, as an ex-violin player, i love this--i would have given a copy to my grandfather (he used to play in a symphony.) the lighting and contrast is just perfect. the only thing i might have done differently is pull out just a bit to get a hint more of the strings on the right. anyway, my favorite shot so far! 9--amitchell</td>', 'wow, as an ex-violin player, i love this--i would have given a copy to my grandfather (he used to play in a symphony.) the lighting and contrast is just perfect. the only thing i might have done differently is pull out just a bit to get a hint more of the strings on the right. anyway, my favorite shot so far! 9--amitchell', '2002-08-05 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98340, 3991, 1686, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white. I would have liked to see a little more of the instrument so that you could have told that it was a violin or that it was a string instrument at least from the picture and not needing the title.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white. I would have liked to see a little more of the instrument so that you could have told that it was a violin or that it was a string instrument at least from the picture and not needing the title.', '2002-08-05 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98341, 3991, 2798, '<td valign="top">Wooo - this is lovely. Lovely texture and lighting. I like the close crop. I think the only thing I''d change is that I would have tilted the violin slightly more to the right so that the strings were vertical. Right now it''s neither angled nor straight. Even so - that''s a nit pick. Lovely photo. Very well done.</td>', 'Wooo - this is lovely. Lovely texture and lighting. I like the close crop. I think the only thing I''d change is that I would have tilted the violin slightly more to the right so that the strings were vertical. Right now it''s neither angled nor straight. Even so - that''s a nit pick. Lovely photo. Very well done.', '2002-08-05 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98342, 3991, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - quite good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - quite good', '2002-08-05 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98343, 3991, 2752, '<td valign="top">great shot...especially the clef as focal point</td>', 'great shot...especially the clef as focal point', '2002-08-06 01:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98344, 3991, 92, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I love how you framed this and the b/w choice = 8 shiiizzzam</td>', 'Very nice. I love how you framed this and the b/w choice = 8 shiiizzzam', '2002-08-06 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98345, 3991, 3060, '<td valign="top">nice. the grain of the violin really emphasizes the age of the subject! and thats the aim of the competition, so im givin it a 10 :)</td>', 'nice. the grain of the violin really emphasizes the age of the subject! and thats the aim of the competition, so im givin it a 10 :)', '2002-08-06 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
