(98347, 3991, 3105, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Simple yet bold elements.  Subject fills the whole frame with nothing extraneous to distract your attention.  Seems to lose focus farther down the photo though as if focused on the light source at the top.</td>', 'Nice.  Simple yet bold elements.  Subject fills the whole frame with nothing extraneous to distract your attention.  Seems to lose focus farther down the photo though as if focused on the light source at the top.', '2002-08-06 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98348, 3991, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the bw on this, and how you have captured the wood grain.  maybe shift the frame a bit to the left so that the partial string is eliminated. karmat</td>', 'I like the bw on this, and how you have captured the wood grain.  maybe shift the frame a bit to the left so that the partial string is eliminated. karmat', '2002-08-06 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98349, 3991, 1644, '<td valign="top">I would have personally liked this in color better, I think. But the grain of the wood looks really good. It''s kind of blurry though, sharper would have also been my preference. I like it overall, though.</td>', 'I would have personally liked this in color better, I think. But the grain of the wood looks really good. It''s kind of blurry though, sharper would have also been my preference. I like it overall, though.', '2002-08-06 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98350, 3991, 885, '<td valign="top">Quite a lovely composition.  Love how you can see the grain of the wood so well.  Nice use of black and white, and great contrast.</td>', 'Quite a lovely composition.  Love how you can see the grain of the wood so well.  Nice use of black and white, and great contrast.', '2002-08-07 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98351, 3991, 772, '<td valign="top">nice work!  The only suggestions i have for this one is to either include the entire string or remove it completely... I also would like a diagonal orientation, but that is just my personal preference... great shot :) = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice work!  The only suggestions i have for this one is to either include the entire string or remove it completely... I also would like a diagonal orientation, but that is just my personal preference... great shot :) = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98352, 3991, 573, '<td valign="top">Ooh! I realy like the tezture of the wood grain and the monotone makes it look old.  the contrast is a little strong for my tasts but that in no way detracts from the picture.  What I am having trouble with is the composition, the curved symbol or cutout, whatever it is, as the center of focus needs to be at a prominate point of the picture, ie. center or at a third, In my opinion.  Even so this is one of my top ten.</td>', 'Ooh! I realy like the tezture of the wood grain and the monotone makes it look old.  the contrast is a little strong for my tasts but that in no way detracts from the picture.  What I am having trouble with is the composition, the curved symbol or cutout, whatever it is, as the center of focus needs to be at a prominate point of the picture, ie. center or at a third, In my opinion.  Even so this is one of my top ten.', '2002-08-07 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98353, 3991, 3112, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  Good contrast.  Maybe expose a tad longer.</td>', 'Great subject.  Good contrast.  Maybe expose a tad longer.', '2002-08-07 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98354, 3991, 2932, '<td valign="top">excellent composition.  How would a new violin look any different, though (I''m no expert)</td>', 'excellent composition.  How would a new violin look any different, though (I''m no expert)', '2002-08-08 04:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98355, 3991, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I like the texture in the wood</td>', 'Great photo.  I like the texture in the wood', '2002-08-08 07:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98356, 3991, 1005, '<td valign="top">Dark, with harsh glare on the upper part of the shot.  In the lower part of the shot, the darkness overwhelms the shot.  (personal nit:  did it look bad in color?)  <br/>6 Swash</td>', 'Dark, with harsh glare on the upper part of the shot.  In the lower part of the shot, the darkness overwhelms the shot.  (personal nit:  did it look bad in color?)  6 Swash', '2002-08-08 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98357, 3991, 2023, '<td valign="top">Great detail, but cant   really tell how old it is.</td>', 'Great detail, but cant   really tell how old it is.', '2002-08-09 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98358, 3991, 3087, '<td valign="top">I sort of like this but... Though I think the angle of this photo is centred around the f shaped hole (I have no idea what those are called) I find the slight angle of the wood grain distracting. If it was at a steeper angle it would work but this is too close to the vertical and throws me when I look at it.</td>', 'I sort of like this but... Though I think the angle of this photo is centred around the f shaped hole (I have no idea what those are called) I find the slight angle of the wood grain distracting. If it was at a steeper angle it would work but this is too close to the vertical and throws me when I look at it.', '2002-08-10 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98359, 3991, 2353, '<td valign="top">This is cool...great job!</td>', 'This is cool...great job!', '2002-08-11 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98360, 3991, 2661, '<td valign="top">nice curves in the picture. two gripes. 1: too much contrast. Methinks you cranked it way up, and that''s really not necessary. 2: nasty glare. try different lighting to get rid of that. I like the composition, though.</td>', 'nice curves in the picture. two gripes. 1: too much contrast. Methinks you cranked it way up, and that''s really not necessary. 2: nasty glare. try different lighting to get rid of that. I like the composition, though.', '2002-08-11 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98361, 3991, 656, '<td valign="top">wonderful grain</td>', 'wonderful grain', '2002-08-11 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98362, 3991, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting, close crop.  Very abstract.  I long to see the wood tones in this though.</td>', 'Interesting, close crop.  Very abstract.  I long to see the wood tones in this though.', '2002-08-11 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98363, 3991, 2422, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I love the way you captured the texture of the wood. 10</td>', 'Nice composition, I love the way you captured the texture of the wood. 10', '2002-08-11 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98364, 3991, 1255, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is beautiful!!!  I gave it a high score and was expecting it would have done better in the overall voting.</td>', 'I think this photo is beautiful!!!  I gave it a high score and was expecting it would have done better in the overall voting.', '2002-08-12 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(98365, 3991, 2923, '<td valign="top">Thank you guys for your comments :)<br/><br/>This violin is actually NOT old...  well, it was made in 1980''s by a violin maker in NYC and have owned it since late 80''s.  I do have/had violins that were made in the 1800''s but they are not with me (my cousins have them now).   If I had to do it again, i''d probably do it at a slightly different perspective -- i was trying to show what a violinist sees when he plays, looking mostly at the left side of the instrument.<br/><br/></td>', 'Thank you guys for your comments :)This violin is actually NOT old...  well, it was made in 1980''s by a violin maker in NYC and have owned it since late 80''s.  I do have/had violins that were made in the 1800''s but they are not with me (my cousins have them now).   If I had to do it again, i''d probably do it at a slightly different perspective -- i was trying to show what a violinist sees when he plays, looking mostly at the left side of the instrument.', '2002-08-13 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(98366, 3994, 2997, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a building that must be old .. but....<br/>This building and its artifacts have been maintained so wonderfully that they don''t readily show "age."</td>', 'Nice shot of a building that must be old .. but....This building and its artifacts have been maintained so wonderfully that they don''t readily show "age."', '2002-08-05 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98367, 3994, 2586, '<td valign="top">Het begeinenhuis! (or is begijnenhuis?). Oddly enough, this building looks so new on this picture!!! :) I know these places and I know the date is genuine and know also that they are really old and wonderful. So, it struck me as very funny. The only thing that really bothers me are the bits of the two windows on the right; would have cropped them out as it mars the composition. Ditto for the whie shape in the black overture of the gate. Daaaaag! :)</td>', 'Het begeinenhuis! (or is begijnenhuis?). Oddly enough, this building looks so new on this picture!!! :) I know these places and I know the date is genuine and know also that they are really old and wonderful. So, it struck me as very funny. The only thing that really bothers me are the bits of the two windows on the right; would have cropped them out as it mars the composition. Ditto for the whie shape in the black overture of the gate. Daaaaag! :)', '2002-08-05 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98368, 3994, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo shows something old... My mind wants to see the entire doorway, however.  The small bit of railing on the bottom of the frame is a moinor distraction... the fact that the photo is not ''level'' is not a problem... :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This photo shows something old... My mind wants to see the entire doorway, however.  The small bit of railing on the bottom of the frame is a moinor distraction... the fact that the photo is not ''level'' is not a problem... :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98369, 3994, 1143, '<td valign="top">this is cool. i would have tried either cropping more and just showing the top of the door (without that white - railing?) or cropping less and showing the whole door</td>', 'this is cool. i would have tried either cropping more and just showing the top of the door (without that white - railing?) or cropping less and showing the whole door', '2002-08-05 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98370, 3994, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subjects but I think we needed to see either more or less of the building they''re on. As it is we can see this is a doorway but we know nothing about what the building is. A closer zoom could have showed us more detail on the ladies themselves.</td>', 'Good choice of subjects but I think we needed to see either more or less of the building they''re on. As it is we can see this is a doorway but we know nothing about what the building is. A closer zoom could have showed us more detail on the ladies themselves.', '2002-08-06 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98371, 3994, 2928, '<td valign="top">Technically good, but lacking in punch:  I would have liked to see more (or less) of the building itself.  I think closer in or all the way out to show the whole building would have improved the overall composition  just one opinion(5)</td>', 'Technically good, but lacking in punch:  I would have liked to see more (or less) of the building itself.  I think closer in or all the way out to show the whole building would have improved the overall composition  just one opinion(5)', '2002-08-07 05:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98372, 3994, 917, '<td valign="top">Get square on, or take a more extreme angle. There are two windows intruding on the right side.</td>', 'Get square on, or take a more extreme angle. There are two windows intruding on the right side.', '2002-08-07 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98373, 3994, 1019, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful architrave--good detail.</td>', 'What a wonderful architrave--good detail.', '2002-08-08 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98374, 3994, 3112, '<td valign="top">The theme is forced with the use of the 1610 date.</td>', 'The theme is forced with the use of the 1610 date.', '2002-08-09 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98375, 3994, 3149, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo.  Very sharp.</td>', 'This is a good photo.  Very sharp.', '2002-08-09 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98376, 3994, 1880, '<td valign="top">Nice photo..  Different subject ... White whatever in right foreground is distracting though ...</td>', 'Nice photo..  Different subject ... White whatever in right foreground is distracting though ...', '2002-08-10 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98377, 3994, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped more off the top and have as little of the windows as possible -- maybe cut that tiny bit of railing off the bottom too</td>', 'I think I would have cropped more off the top and have as little of the windows as possible -- maybe cut that tiny bit of railing off the bottom too', '2002-08-12 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98378, 3994, 3032, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments. I have not cropped it, for various reasons. One of them is that I had not much time and found it hard to get a decent 640x480 crop out of it. The picture was not made specifically for this challenge, I made it to think about future possibilities with this subject.<br/>It was a bit hard to get a decent framing, I had no tripod (to allow more zoom and thus a longer shutter time in these light conditions). In front were parked cars, the little white rail is a sign for the library (very unfortunate to have it on the pic) and the surrounding buildings are not interesting. So I really should have taken the time to crop it. :-)<br/><br/>The 1610 date was not taken in account, and not meant to push the theme. Dates are on all the old structures in Hoorn / Holland, so I cannot help that.<br/><br/>Unfortunate that I met the oldest lady of Hoorn in front of the oldest home in Hoorn after the submission date. :-)<br/><br/>The reason why it looks so new, is because it was restored a couple of years ago, like many other likewise structures. I think they keep them in better shape nowadays. If you like these kind of structures, there are a lot more in Hoorn. And indeed, it is a kind of Begijnenhuis. Doei :-)</td>', 'Thanks for your comments. I have not cropped it, for various reasons. One of them is that I had not much time and found it hard to get a decent 640x480 crop out of it. The picture was not made specifically for this challenge, I made it to think about future possibilities with this subject.It was a bit hard to get a decent framing, I had no tripod (to allow more zoom and thus a longer shutter time in these light conditions). In front were parked cars, the little white rail is a sign for the library (very unfortunate to have it on the pic) and the surrounding buildings are not interesting. So I really should have taken the time to crop it. :-)The 1610 date was not taken in account, and not meant to push the theme. Dates are on all the old structures in Hoorn / Holland, so I cannot help that.Unfortunate that I met the oldest lady of Hoorn in front of the oldest home in Hoorn after the submission date. :-)The reason why it looks so new, is because it was restored a couple of years ago, like many other likewise structures. I think they keep them in better shape nowadays. If you like these kind of structures, there are a lot more in Hoorn. And indeed, it is a kind of Begijnenhuis. Doei :-)', '2002-08-12 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(98379, 3995, 2997, '<td valign="top">Your item definitely shows its age, but the framing makes it difficult to tell what it is.  Also, a little sharpening of the picture would have brought out all the aging indicators (cracks, bubbling paint, etc.)  Controlled lighting would also have helped this picture.</td>', 'Your item definitely shows its age, but the framing makes it difficult to tell what it is.  Also, a little sharpening of the picture would have brought out all the aging indicators (cracks, bubbling paint, etc.)  Controlled lighting would also have helped this picture.', '2002-08-05 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98380, 3995, 2798, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was slightly out of focus - it''s something about the lettering - but then I realised that the crack is in perfect focus. This contradiction somehow attracts me. That and the colours - the teracotta and the green are very attractive together and perhaps could have been brought out a touch more with your graphics package. Otherwise it''s a lovely photo - the light is a little ove strong on the right and a little over dark on the left but that''s just nit picking. Lovely atmosphere. Well done.</td>', 'At first I thought this was slightly out of focus - it''s something about the lettering - but then I realised that the crack is in perfect focus. This contradiction somehow attracts me. That and the colours - the teracotta and the green are very attractive together and perhaps could have been brought out a touch more with your graphics package. Otherwise it''s a lovely photo - the light is a little ove strong on the right and a little over dark on the left but that''s just nit picking. Lovely atmosphere. Well done.', '2002-08-05 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98381, 3995, 1569, '<td valign="top">The right side is a little washed out,and needs a little more contrast--otherwise nice pix.</td>', 'The right side is a little washed out,and needs a little more contrast--otherwise nice pix.', '2002-08-05 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98382, 3995, 2667, '<td valign="top">it certainly looks old, but then i get no clear idea of what "it" is. showing more of the object, perhaps in relation to its usage, would have made it easier for thick-skulled reviewers like myself to figure it out. the lighting is dramatic and i like that, but you have lost some detail to highlights on the right, and shadows on the left. the green triangle upper right is a puzzle as well.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...4<br/>Meets Challenge...4<br/>Overall...4</td>', 'it certainly looks old, but then i get no clear idea of what "it" is. showing more of the object, perhaps in relation to its usage, would have made it easier for thick-skulled reviewers like myself to figure it out. the lighting is dramatic and i like that, but you have lost some detail to highlights on the right, and shadows on the left. the green triangle upper right is a puzzle as well.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...4Meets Challenge...4Overall...4', '2002-08-05 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98383, 3995, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - good. perhaps a little more even lighting<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - good. perhaps a little more even lightingMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-05 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98384, 3995, 2912, '<td valign="top">I can not ecactly understand what this is. The text is blurred too much. I''d focus on the text more and prefer to look obliquer. The top is wonderful, the low is terrible. Good work, anyway.</td>', 'I can not ecactly understand what this is. The text is blurred too much. I''d focus on the text more and prefer to look obliquer. The top is wonderful, the low is terrible. Good work, anyway.', '2002-08-06 04:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98385, 3995, 1891, '<td valign="top">Intertesting lighting effect but maybe too dark on an unknown subject.</td>', 'Intertesting lighting effect but maybe too dark on an unknown subject.', '2002-08-06 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98386, 3995, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a good subject for this challenge... the lighting seems a little strange... going from extreme dark to extreme light may not be the best choice... I wonder how this image would look with the light a little more even on the subject? - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is a good subject for this challenge... the lighting seems a little strange... going from extreme dark to extreme light may not be the best choice... I wonder how this image would look with the light a little more even on the subject? - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 07:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98387, 3995, 3112, '<td valign="top">The subject is very well selected.  DOF may be a little shallow for it, however, as the soft edge on the pottery to the right makes the photo look washed out to a higher degree than it really is.</td>', 'The subject is very well selected.  DOF may be a little shallow for it, however, as the soft edge on the pottery to the right makes the photo look washed out to a higher degree than it really is.', '2002-08-07 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98388, 3995, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat patterns and shadows.</td>', 'Neat patterns and shadows.', '2002-08-07 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98389, 3995, 3087, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I get this. What is it? Also way too dark at left.</td>', 'I don''t think I get this. What is it? Also way too dark at left.', '2002-08-09 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98390, 3995, 2172, '<td valign="top">very interesting.  I first rated this a 6 in my first run through.  Now, as I take a closer look - there is much more technique here.  I like the lighting/direction.  I like the exposure - different, but good.  This is a well executed photo - with thought and effort put into it.  Great work  8<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'very interesting.  I first rated this a 6 in my first run through.  Now, as I take a closer look - there is much more technique here.  I like the lighting/direction.  I like the exposure - different, but good.  This is a well executed photo - with thought and effort put into it.  Great work  8Ruthann', '2002-08-10 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98391, 3995, 3198, '<td valign="top">yes. it''s from 1924... it looks like a nice picture but is kind of boring too.</td>', 'yes. it''s from 1924... it looks like a nice picture but is kind of boring too.', '2002-08-11 08:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98392, 3995, 2661, '<td valign="top">this shot has me confused. is the crack in the container itself? it almost looks like you shot the bubbels in a mirror which had a big scratch on it or something. well anyways, I like the lighting gradient.</td>', 'this shot has me confused. is the crack in the container itself? it almost looks like you shot the bubbels in a mirror which had a big scratch on it or something. well anyways, I like the lighting gradient.', '2002-08-11 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98393, 3995, 3002, '<td valign="top">Well, in response to ''nightfall''s'' comment, I''m sorry my photo confused you.  No, it was not shot through a mirror.  The crack is in the back of the doll.  For those who were not sure, I am fairly confident that this photo is in perfect focus.  What you are looking at is the back of an old composition material constructed  doll.  The doll''s name ("Bubbles") is obvious as is the date, etc.  I thought this was explained in my description, but anyway, thanks for looking and commenting!   I got a lot of comments about the "too dark on the left" and "too light on the right" thing, and now that it has been kindly pointed out to me, I am still not sure I agree with it, because I was attempting to use the light to emphasize the age of the subject and also to make the letters stand out.  Apparently I screwed up on the light, but I did my best.  It was fun to get both good and bad comments.</td>', 'Well, in response to ''nightfall''s'' comment, I''m sorry my photo confused you.  No, it was not shot through a mirror.  The crack is in the back of the doll.  For those who were not sure, I am fairly confident that this photo is in perfect focus.  What you are looking at is the back of an old composition material constructed  doll.  The doll''s name ("Bubbles") is obvious as is the date, etc.  I thought this was explained in my description, but anyway, thanks for looking and commenting!   I got a lot of comments about the "too dark on the left" and "too light on the right" thing, and now that it has been kindly pointed out to me, I am still not sure I agree with it, because I was attempting to use the light to emphasize the age of the subject and also to make the letters stand out.  Apparently I screwed up on the light, but I did my best.  It was fun to get both good and bad comments.', '2002-08-12 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(98394, 3996, 789, '<td valign="top">I like the exposure.</td>', 'I like the exposure.', '2002-08-05 05:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98395, 3996, 2997, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting on this picture.</td>', 'I really like the lighting on this picture.', '2002-08-05 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98396, 3996, 1856, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this is awesome!  I wish it were a bit brighter all the same (talk about oxymorons).  Great job! 8 LIsa</td>', 'The lighting in this is awesome!  I wish it were a bit brighter all the same (talk about oxymorons).  Great job! 8 LIsa', '2002-08-05 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98397, 3996, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and a good setting but that blown-out light through the cracks is too much. Perhaps a low intensity fill-in flash inside this building would have brought out more interior detail as well as dropping the exposure reading on the camera - removing the over exposed lights.</td>', 'Nice idea and a good setting but that blown-out light through the cracks is too much. Perhaps a low intensity fill-in flash inside this building would have brought out more interior detail as well as dropping the exposure reading on the camera - removing the over exposed lights.', '2002-08-05 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98398, 3996, 2223, '<td valign="top">thats intersting..i like how the light looks like its bleeding thru.</td>', 'thats intersting..i like how the light looks like its bleeding thru.', '2002-08-05 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98399, 3996, 2553, '<td valign="top">At first, I felt that this photo was too dark, but after studying it more, I kind of like the effect - it gives the light and cast shadow more prominence.  I think that I would have like to have seen it cropped  right at the top of the crossbeam just above the large upside down "L" shaped  light on the right hand upper side to give it a little more balance. lhall</td>', 'At first, I felt that this photo was too dark, but after studying it more, I kind of like the effect - it gives the light and cast shadow more prominence.  I think that I would have like to have seen it cropped  right at the top of the crossbeam just above the large upside down "L" shaped  light on the right hand upper side to give it a little more balance. lhall', '2002-08-05 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98400, 3996, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good, like the lighting<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - quite good / good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite good, like the lightingMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - quite good / good', '2002-08-05 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98401, 3996, 2261, '<td valign="top">I really liked this. The light seeping through is nice and the reds and browns work well.</td>', 'I really liked this. The light seeping through is nice and the reds and browns work well.', '2002-08-06 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98402, 3996, 1644, '<td valign="top">Seems a little dark, but maybe that''s just my monitor. I like the strong vertical lines.</td>', 'Seems a little dark, but maybe that''s just my monitor. I like the strong vertical lines.', '2002-08-06 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98403, 3996, 1793, '<td valign="top">superb. the lighting and the composition... i love how the light is seeping through the cracks. 10!</td>', 'superb. the lighting and the composition... i love how the light is seeping through the cracks. 10!', '2002-08-06 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98404, 3996, 1944, '<td valign="top">When I saw your ''title'', I thought well, let''s see if it can hold it''s own. Congradulations! Your photo speaks!</td>', 'When I saw your ''title'', I thought well, let''s see if it can hold it''s own. Congradulations! Your photo speaks!', '2002-08-07 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98405, 3996, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I love the contrast of bright light and shadows, which really emphasises the structure of the building and it''s warped planks of wood.</td>', 'Beautiful! I love the contrast of bright light and shadows, which really emphasises the structure of the building and it''s warped planks of wood.', '2002-08-07 04:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98406, 3996, 2323, '<td valign="top">wow... this looks really old.  Could just be me, but a lot of the image looks out of focus and a bit too dark.  It appears as though the sun is behind that wall, which would cause the bad backlighting-- it obscures an otherwise great photo!  --7-- sohr</td>', 'wow... this looks really old.  Could just be me, but a lot of the image looks out of focus and a bit too dark.  It appears as though the sun is behind that wall, which would cause the bad backlighting-- it obscures an otherwise great photo!  --7-- sohr', '2002-08-07 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98407, 3996, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sure reminds me of some of the old barns.  I think this would be a very difficult subject to capture, and you did about as well as I could hope for, but.....the back wall is too dark, the glare in places is painful and the whole thing seems just a little off focus.  6 Swash</td>', 'Sure reminds me of some of the old barns.  I think this would be a very difficult subject to capture, and you did about as well as I could hope for, but.....the back wall is too dark, the glare in places is painful and the whole thing seems just a little off focus.  6 Swash', '2002-08-07 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98408, 3996, 3112, '<td valign="top">I can almost smell the hay and old boards. Was this photo better focused before reduction?<br/></td>', 'I can almost smell the hay and old boards. Was this photo better focused before reduction?', '2002-08-07 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98409, 3996, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the light and wood of this shot, even though the light may be a bit bright on the right.  nice shot. karmat</td>', 'I like the contrast between the light and wood of this shot, even though the light may be a bit bright on the right.  nice shot. karmat', '2002-08-08 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98410, 3996, 1019, '<td valign="top">Good contrast and strong design--an interesting composition---andrewm</td>', 'Good contrast and strong design--an interesting composition---andrewm', '2002-08-08 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98411, 3996, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting play with light here... the blown out glow through the back of this barn looks pretty interesting :) good work - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting play with light here... the blown out glow through the back of this barn looks pretty interesting :) good work - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98412, 3996, 2221, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo! I like this a lot. Only thing I could nit-pick about is that the bright light in the upper right corner does not fit to the rest of the photo. It''s a touch too bright and also has a blue tint. If it would be the same like the bright light in the lower right corner (on the right wall of the barn) then it would be perfect. Unfortunately I don''t have a suggestion how this could be achived.<br/>-Stephan</td>', 'Beautiful photo! I like this a lot. Only thing I could nit-pick about is that the bright light in the upper right corner does not fit to the rest of the photo. It''s a touch too bright and also has a blue tint. If it would be the same like the bright light in the lower right corner (on the right wall of the barn) then it would be perfect. Unfortunately I don''t have a suggestion how this could be achived.-Stephan', '2002-08-08 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98413, 3996, 637, '<td valign="top">Probably old, but what is it?  What makes it interesting? 4 sjgleah</td>', 'Probably old, but what is it?  What makes it interesting? 4 sjgleah', '2002-08-09 03:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98414, 3996, 2172, '<td valign="top">I''m being frank - not to offend.  The cropping, composition and distance is good.  The light is harsh with too much fringing.  I like the idea very much, but it seems that the process was executed poorly.  This is just my opinion.   5<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I''m being frank - not to offend.  The cropping, composition and distance is good.  The light is harsh with too much fringing.  I like the idea very much, but it seems that the process was executed poorly.  This is just my opinion.   5Ruthann', '2002-08-09 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
