(98419, 3996, 2997, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe some losers (3 to be exact) gave you a "1" on this picture; and 13 gave you a "2"!  I personally gave an "8."  People that graded this so poorly either need to get their monitors fixed or have the eyes examined.  I really have to wonder about the motive of those that graded this picture so poorly.</td>', 'I can''t believe some losers (3 to be exact) gave you a "1" on this picture; and 13 gave you a "2"!  I personally gave an "8."  People that graded this so poorly either need to get their monitors fixed or have the eyes examined.  I really have to wonder about the motive of those that graded this picture so poorly.', '2002-08-25 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
