(98440, 3997, 2204, '<td valign="top">I like the set-up of this shot.  The reflective quality is good however, I find the non-reflective portion to not be quite as clear as I''d like (personal opinion).  Ddon''t you find it difficult to keep your reflective surface clear of debris?  I sure do.  I think I have everything clean, take my photo, and then find spots I didn''t realize were there......Good work! :&amp;gt;)  =8   Syamjonimi</td>', 'I like the set-up of this shot.  The reflective quality is good however, I find the non-reflective portion to not be quite as clear as I''d like (personal opinion).  Ddon''t you find it difficult to keep your reflective surface clear of debris?  I sure do.  I think I have everything clean, take my photo, and then find spots I didn''t realize were there......Good work! :&gt;)  =8   Syamjonimi', '2002-08-10 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
