(98480, 4004, 2079, '<td valign="top">I think you need to have children to understand this one. When I glance at my kids, now almost 20 years old, I can think..... wow, he''s getting old in a hurry. but I have had to spend a little more time trying to figure this one out. I''m afraid its going to cost you some votes and a few rough comments. -Me, I love it, but it''s not  something old, it''s something getting old too fast.   - I''m booting you up to a 7 because it is such a good shot.   - good luck   - Mike....(Gotcha)</td>', 'I think you need to have children to understand this one. When I glance at my kids, now almost 20 years old, I can think..... wow, he''s getting old in a hurry. but I have had to spend a little more time trying to figure this one out. I''m afraid its going to cost you some votes and a few rough comments. -Me, I love it, but it''s not  something old, it''s something getting old too fast.   - I''m booting you up to a 7 because it is such a good shot.   - good luck   - Mike....(Gotcha)', '2002-08-07 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
