(98485, 4004, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a cute twist title to attempt to meet the challenge.  The photo is a very good black and white shot.  It evokes emotion, is well focused and composed, but without the title, I have a hard time connecting to the challenge.  5 Swash</td>', 'This is a cute twist title to attempt to meet the challenge.  The photo is a very good black and white shot.  It evokes emotion, is well focused and composed, but without the title, I have a hard time connecting to the challenge.  5 Swash', '2002-08-07 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
