 That may sound a bit harsh  sorry Good luck</td>', 'The photography is not an issue  can''t find fault there (6).  But  for me  the content is a bit moribund and lacks punch That may sound a bit harsh  sorry Good luck', '2002-08-07 05:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
