(98512, 4005, 2172, '<td valign="top">Good Image.  (I''m being frank - NOT to offend).  At first run through I scored this a 6, but now at a 2nd and 3rd look, it''s 8.  I like the focus and cropping/composition.  The angle is great too.  I think that the reason I scored it a 6 at first - was that at a quick glance -it didn''t really hold a lot of interest for me. But as I look at it more, I see more of the quality of the photo and the effort.  Great work   8<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Good Image.  (I''m being frank - NOT to offend).  At first run through I scored this a 6, but now at a 2nd and 3rd look, it''s 8.  I like the focus and cropping/composition.  The angle is great too.  I think that the reason I scored it a 6 at first - was that at a quick glance -it didn''t really hold a lot of interest for me. But as I look at it more, I see more of the quality of the photo and the effort.  Great work   8Ruthann', '2002-08-10 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
