(98520, 4006, 2833, '<td valign="top">great Concept! I really appreiciate a solid concept of communication. The contrast of what the old banana with the new banana really strengthens the objective. Simplicity ussually speaks the clearest.</td>', 'great Concept! I really appreiciate a solid concept of communication. The contrast of what the old banana with the new banana really strengthens the objective. Simplicity ussually speaks the clearest.', '2002-08-05 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
