(98523, 4006, 734, '<td valign="top">I like this allot, although I find the focus a bit soft... great concept. Ronin -7</td>', 'I like this allot, although I find the focus a bit soft... great concept. Ronin -7', '2002-08-06 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98524, 4006, 2798, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach to the challenge - I like your idea. Your framing seems off to me, though. There is a lot of empty space at the bottom and in the top right but the bananas on the left are partially cropped. The focus of this picture is the old banana but that doesnt sit at a natural position to within the frame. I think you should have had the bunch of bananas fill the frame with the old one at the 1/3, 1/3 point. Your arrangement of the bananas is good but you''ve pushed the colour up too far for my taste. On my screen they look un-naturally yellow.</td>', 'Interesting approach to the challenge - I like your idea. Your framing seems off to me, though. There is a lot of empty space at the bottom and in the top right but the bananas on the left are partially cropped. The focus of this picture is the old banana but that doesnt sit at a natural position to within the frame. I think you should have had the bunch of bananas fill the frame with the old one at the 1/3, 1/3 point. Your arrangement of the bananas is good but you''ve pushed the colour up too far for my taste. On my screen they look un-naturally yellow.', '2002-08-06 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98525, 4006, 835, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand your title.  I used a translator on the internet and it tells me it means "the plátano in the pocket of the devil."  Is that the correct translation?  Either way I really like your idea of using food(I used the same concept)!  :)</td>', 'I don''t understand your title.  I used a translator on the internet and it tells me it means "the plátano in the pocket of the devil."  Is that the correct translation?  Either way I really like your idea of using food(I used the same concept)!  :)', '2002-08-06 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98526, 4006, 2983, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea.</td>', 'Very creative idea.', '2002-08-06 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98527, 4006, 616, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Very crisp and has a great composition.</td>', 'Great idea! Very crisp and has a great composition.', '2002-08-06 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98528, 4006, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice bright yellows, and I like the way you have it framed.  I think a sharper focus all the way across (the ones on the left look softer) would be effective.  Also, it is a bit close, in my opinion, at the top. karmat</td>', 'Nice bright yellows, and I like the way you have it framed.  I think a sharper focus all the way across (the ones on the left look softer) would be effective.  Also, it is a bit close, in my opinion, at the top. karmat', '2002-08-06 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98529, 4006, 133, '<td valign="top">A great take on old.</td>', 'A great take on old.', '2002-08-07 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98530, 4006, 2120, '<td valign="top">I was just thinking about doing a shot in all B&amp;W with the exception on one item and was annoyed I could not do it for the contest. You see to have pulled off that effect quite well all in color. It does look a little ''soft'' at points and might be served by a larger DOF. The concept which is outstanding IMO deserves another attempt at a slightly more clear shot. --9 Agamemnon</td>', 'I was just thinking about doing a shot in all B&W with the exception on one item and was annoyed I could not do it for the contest. You see to have pulled off that effect quite well all in color. It does look a little ''soft'' at points and might be served by a larger DOF. The concept which is outstanding IMO deserves another attempt at a slightly more clear shot. --9 Agamemnon', '2002-08-07 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
