(98534, 4006, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent composition.... good work with the white background... that''s not easy to do :)  the old banana stands out very well here... I would also like to see this view from the other side where the bananas come together :)  I think this image would also have some more punch with the baseline of these bananas forming a diagonal in the image... maybe about a 30 degree tilt to the left with the camera?  good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'excellent composition.... good work with the white background... that''s not easy to do :)  the old banana stands out very well here... I would also like to see this view from the other side where the bananas come together :)  I think this image would also have some more punch with the baseline of these bananas forming a diagonal in the image... maybe about a 30 degree tilt to the left with the camera?  good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
