(98538, 4006, 1005, '<td valign="top">Can''t read spanish, but I think I get the idea!  Very nice shot!  I do have to question the cropping of the last two bananas, but the contast between almost ripe and way overly ripe is very strong.  (poor guy had a tougher life than it''s neighbors, just kidding, I know it''s from a different bunch)  Would you please offer the fully translated title after the challenge for those of us, ignorant non-spanish types?  Very strong entry!  8 Swash</td>', 'Can''t read spanish, but I think I get the idea!  Very nice shot!  I do have to question the cropping of the last two bananas, but the contast between almost ripe and way overly ripe is very strong.  (poor guy had a tougher life than it''s neighbors, just kidding, I know it''s from a different bunch)  Would you please offer the fully translated title after the challenge for those of us, ignorant non-spanish types?  Very strong entry!  8 Swash', '2002-08-08 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
