(98544, 4006, 2221, '<td valign="top">Nice idea! Unfortunately I don''t understand spanish but I think I get the photo without the title, too :-) I like the lighting and the colors. Only thing I would like better is if I could see the bananas fully and not cut at the left side. Zoom a little out.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Nice idea! Unfortunately I don''t understand spanish but I think I get the photo without the title, too :-) I like the lighting and the colors. Only thing I would like better is if I could see the bananas fully and not cut at the left side. Zoom a little out.-stephan', '2002-08-10 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
