(98571, 4011, 1005, '<td valign="top">It seems old alright, but I have no idea where/what this is or even if I am looking up or across or down.  The outside world is overly bright, but I am certain that couldn''t be avoided, considering how cave like the "beast" is.   6 Swash</td>', 'It seems old alright, but I have no idea where/what this is or even if I am looking up or across or down.  The outside world is overly bright, but I am certain that couldn''t be avoided, considering how cave like the "beast" is.   6 Swash', '2002-08-09 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
