(98576, 4012, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat artifact... I don''t like the straight-down angle of this shot and the shadow on the right offers a little too much contrast in this image... this particular artifact is definitely worthy of a photo experiment with some lighting... - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a neat artifact... I don''t like the straight-down angle of this shot and the shadow on the right offers a little too much contrast in this image... this particular artifact is definitely worthy of a photo experiment with some lighting... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
