(98579, 4012, 1005, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet effective.  I think this could have been a 10, with more of a story behind this shot.  Some grain in the bottom, maybe some ground up would have told this story more completely.  The background could be more effective for showing off the subject if it contrasted more.  9 Swash</td>', 'Simple, yet effective.  I think this could have been a 10, with more of a story behind this shot.  Some grain in the bottom, maybe some ground up would have told this story more completely.  The background could be more effective for showing off the subject if it contrasted more.  9 Swash', '2002-08-06 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98580, 4012, 2983, '<td valign="top">I originally scored this low, but it''s simplicity is really growing on me.  It is not a bad photo at all, so I''m bumping it up.</td>', 'I originally scored this low, but it''s simplicity is really growing on me.  It is not a bad photo at all, so I''m bumping it up.', '2002-08-06 19:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98581, 4012, 3035, '<td valign="top">nice placement with shadow</td>', 'nice placement with shadow', '2002-08-06 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
