(98591, 4013, 2815, '<td valign="top">sorry to say this, but I get a little tired of staged photos like this.  I know they have there place though</td>', 'sorry to say this, but I get a little tired of staged photos like this.  I know they have there place though', '2002-08-05 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98592, 4013, 2891, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I don''t think it get''s any better than this.  I have had many relatives who fought in WW2, and I have studied it in detail myself.  This is as good as any published work of the same style.</td>', 'Excellent.  I don''t think it get''s any better than this.  I have had many relatives who fought in WW2, and I have studied it in detail myself.  This is as good as any published work of the same style.', '2002-08-05 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98593, 4013, 2170, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea, but the modern pen really throws it off.  The letter hasn''t been folded, it seems, and I don''t think three-hole punch paper was very prevalent.  Cleaning up some of these out of place elements would make this work much better, I think.</td>', 'Very nice idea, but the modern pen really throws it off.  The letter hasn''t been folded, it seems, and I don''t think three-hole punch paper was very prevalent.  Cleaning up some of these out of place elements would make this work much better, I think.', '2002-08-05 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98594, 4013, 2907, '<td valign="top">Nice Ball point pen..... :-)</td>', 'Nice Ball point pen..... :-)', '2002-08-05 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98595, 4013, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - very good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - high<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - very goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - high', '2002-08-05 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98596, 4013, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Nice focus and clarity.  I like the arrangement of the items, but maybe more effective in a different way.  I''m not sure I like the papermate pen.  Problem is the table and the white boards or walls - they don''t go.  Also, I think the white balance is off and the lighting is a bit too much.  Perhaps changing the DOF would make this more effective - or a different angle.  This is my opinion - not to offend.    5<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great idea. Nice focus and clarity.  I like the arrangement of the items, but maybe more effective in a different way.  I''m not sure I like the papermate pen.  Problem is the table and the white boards or walls - they don''t go.  Also, I think the white balance is off and the lighting is a bit too much.  Perhaps changing the DOF would make this more effective - or a different angle.  This is my opinion - not to offend.    5Ruthann', '2002-08-05 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98597, 4013, 2716, '<td valign="top">Real nice.  Maybe it would have been better to use an unlined  piece of paper and an older model pen.  Technically great.  I''ll give it an 8.</td>', 'Real nice.  Maybe it would have been better to use an unlined  piece of paper and an older model pen.  Technically great.  I''ll give it an 8.', '2002-08-05 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98598, 4013, 2754, '<td valign="top">I find the corner of the wall and the space to the bottom right of the picture distracting.  I also think a color other than white for the background would have been an improvement.  The pen is also out of place, it looks too modern.  Wonderful idea though, I like the way you laid everything out.</td>', 'I find the corner of the wall and the space to the bottom right of the picture distracting.  I also think a color other than white for the background would have been an improvement.  The pen is also out of place, it looks too modern.  Wonderful idea though, I like the way you laid everything out.', '2002-08-06 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98599, 4013, 2261, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo, detail is sharp, the composition is spot on and most importantly it has a real feeling about it.</td>', 'Excellent photo, detail is sharp, the composition is spot on and most importantly it has a real feeling about it.', '2002-08-06 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98600, 4013, 2928, '<td valign="top">Technically great, but for me it looks too staged... The picture does carry a great story and you can''t miss the challenge... (6)</td>', 'Technically great, but for me it looks too staged... The picture does carry a great story and you can''t miss the challenge... (6)', '2002-08-07 05:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
