(98610, 4014, 2466, '<td valign="top">love that green!  How weird that a hotel would give you books but no towel!  I assume the teddy belongs to the traveler?  That seemed a bit odd.  And I might have experimented with a smooth bedspred, although the wrinke does nice things with the light.</td>', 'love that green!  How weird that a hotel would give you books but no towel!  I assume the teddy belongs to the traveler?  That seemed a bit odd.  And I might have experimented with a smooth bedspred, although the wrinke does nice things with the light.', '2002-08-05 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
