(98613, 4014, 1944, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but it would have been even better if you had flagged off that spot of distractin light on the wall.</td>', 'Nice picture, but it would have been even better if you had flagged off that spot of distractin light on the wall.', '2002-08-06 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98614, 4014, 3105, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  I could see it in Better Homes &amp; Gardens or something similar.  Good use of natural light to illuminate and convey mood when a flash isn''t necessary.  Nice symmetry and balance too with the large areas of flat color (green ceiling and grey/blue sheet) at the top and bottom surrounding the more colorful, busy area in the center.  Just a small note: You may have wanted to have the entire bear on top of the sheet instead of leaving just its head showing if you set this shot up.  Might be a nitpicky thing but I think it would have made the photo feel more inviting or ''home-y''.</td>', 'This is nice.  I could see it in Better Homes & Gardens or something similar.  Good use of natural light to illuminate and convey mood when a flash isn''t necessary.  Nice symmetry and balance too with the large areas of flat color (green ceiling and grey/blue sheet) at the top and bottom surrounding the more colorful, busy area in the center.  Just a small note: You may have wanted to have the entire bear on top of the sheet instead of leaving just its head showing if you set this shot up.  Might be a nitpicky thing but I think it would have made the photo feel more inviting or ''home-y''.', '2002-08-06 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98615, 4014, 811, '<td valign="top">The bear adds such a quaint touch.  Good lighting and the focus is great.  Nice set up. karmat</td>', 'The bear adds such a quaint touch.  Good lighting and the focus is great.  Nice set up. karmat', '2002-08-06 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98616, 4014, 885, '<td valign="top">Of course, the green color makes this photo.  I don''t think they''d really put teddy bears in a hotel room, but he''s cute.  If I had a nitpick, I''d have removed that basket next to the sink on the left, and the light above the bed, as they seem to draw my eye away out of the frame.  But nice job.</td>', 'Of course, the green color makes this photo.  I don''t think they''d really put teddy bears in a hotel room, but he''s cute.  If I had a nitpick, I''d have removed that basket next to the sink on the left, and the light above the bed, as they seem to draw my eye away out of the frame.  But nice job.', '2002-08-07 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98617, 4014, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  Wish the bear were not under the covers, though.</td>', 'Excellent photo.  Wish the bear were not under the covers, though.', '2002-08-07 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98618, 4014, 734, '<td valign="top">Outstanding lighting, i can feel the warmth from the picture - Ronin 7</td>', 'Outstanding lighting, i can feel the warmth from the picture - Ronin 7', '2002-08-07 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98619, 4014, 92, '<td valign="top">I love EVERYTHING about this photo. It''s wonderful. This looks like a magazine add in Martha Stewert and we all know her photographer is amazing with lighting and color. This is truly superb ! =10 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'I love EVERYTHING about this photo. It''s wonderful. This looks like a magazine add in Martha Stewert and we all know her photographer is amazing with lighting and color. This is truly superb ! =10 Shiiizzzam', '2002-08-07 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
