(98622, 4014, 1041, '<td valign="top">with the teddy and the books, this looks more like an old bedroom than hotel room to me.  i would''ve liked to have the bedspread straightened and the bright lightspot from the window draws my attention (maybe take photo at different time of day if poss?), but the overall composition is good. -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'with the teddy and the books, this looks more like an old bedroom than hotel room to me.  i would''ve liked to have the bedspread straightened and the bright lightspot from the window draws my attention (maybe take photo at different time of day if poss?), but the overall composition is good. -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-08-08 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
