(98627, 4014, 2661, '<td valign="top">this shot has great colors. also nice lighting and nice composition. I''m not sure why, but I think I would like the picture better without the stuffed animal. it kind of takes the focus off the room itself. great photo, though.</td>', 'this shot has great colors. also nice lighting and nice composition. I''m not sure why, but I think I would like the picture better without the stuffed animal. it kind of takes the focus off the room itself. great photo, though.', '2002-08-11 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
