(98637, 4015, 3105, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Good composition leaving some of the green foliage to contrast against the weathered building.  Plus, I like the speck of purple in the lower right corner for a touch of additional color.  If equipment would have allowed, it would have been interesting to see if some of the reflections off the windows could have been eliminated through filters.</td>', 'Nice photo. Good composition leaving some of the green foliage to contrast against the weathered building.  Plus, I like the speck of purple in the lower right corner for a touch of additional color.  If equipment would have allowed, it would have been interesting to see if some of the reflections off the windows could have been eliminated through filters.', '2002-08-06 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98638, 4015, 2983, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrast with the reflections in the window.  It looks like construction of a new building next to this old one.</td>', 'Wonderful contrast with the reflections in the window.  It looks like construction of a new building next to this old one.', '2002-08-06 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98639, 4015, 1141, '<td valign="top">I like this picture!!! Great idea!!! #1... yay, yay, yay!!!</td>', 'I like this picture!!! Great idea!!! #1... yay, yay, yay!!!', '2002-08-06 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98640, 4015, 885, '<td valign="top">Great reflections.  Really poignant.  But I think they are a little lost.  Maybe I''d have somehow cropped out the green at the bottom, or concentrated on one window in a vertical orientation.</td>', 'Great reflections.  Really poignant.  But I think they are a little lost.  Maybe I''d have somehow cropped out the green at the bottom, or concentrated on one window in a vertical orientation.', '2002-08-07 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98641, 4015, 3090, '<td valign="top">Clever juxtaposition.</td>', 'Clever juxtaposition.', '2002-08-07 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98642, 4015, 3147, '<td valign="top">love the reflections</td>', 'love the reflections', '2002-08-07 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98643, 4015, 2798, '<td valign="top">This was a surprisingly difficult one to shoot I bet. Getting those reflections in the windows without catching yourself in there too has meant you had to stand slightly off to one side - and that means the tops of the window frames are quite square with the top of the picture frame. There''s no real solution to this I dont think except perhaps getting down on the ground and shooting up at the windows. I doubt that would have made such a nice picture, though. I love the colours and the concept of the reflections. Very good work.</td>', 'This was a surprisingly difficult one to shoot I bet. Getting those reflections in the windows without catching yourself in there too has meant you had to stand slightly off to one side - and that means the tops of the window frames are quite square with the top of the picture frame. There''s no real solution to this I dont think except perhaps getting down on the ground and shooting up at the windows. I doubt that would have made such a nice picture, though. I love the colours and the concept of the reflections. Very good work.', '2002-08-08 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98644, 4015, 2370, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much! The contrast is very clearly depicted.</td>', 'I like this shot very much! The contrast is very clearly depicted.', '2002-08-08 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98645, 4015, 2123, '<td valign="top">I love the juxtaposition of old and new here!  Great photo 8</td>', 'I love the juxtaposition of old and new here!  Great photo 8', '2002-08-09 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98646, 4015, 1880, '<td valign="top">Looked at this a seconfd time and appreciate it more ...  RLS</td>', 'Looked at this a seconfd time and appreciate it more ...  RLS', '2002-08-10 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98647, 4015, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this very much though the way the verticals of the wood aren''t vertical in the frame jars a little, I appreciate you couldn''t have taken it face on without being in it though so I don''t know a solution. I think it''s a GREAT idea for a shot.</td>', 'I like this very much though the way the verticals of the wood aren''t vertical in the frame jars a little, I appreciate you couldn''t have taken it face on without being in it though so I don''t know a solution. I think it''s a GREAT idea for a shot.', '2002-08-10 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98648, 4015, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good. Did you try this in B&amp;W?<br/>Meets Challenge - probably<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good. Needs some studing<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite good. Did you try this in B&W?Meets Challenge - probablyVisual Impact / Originality - good. Needs some studing', '2002-08-10 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98649, 4015, 2353, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to see the reflecton in the windows...after seeing that, I think that this is not only a great picture but a great statement...good job! - 9</td>', 'It took me a minute to see the reflecton in the windows...after seeing that, I think that this is not only a great picture but a great statement...good job! - 9', '2002-08-10 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98650, 4015, 3212, '<td valign="top">Very well done, excellent job</td>', 'Very well done, excellent job', '2002-08-11 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98651, 4015, 2661, '<td valign="top">this is a great idea. the colors are very nice, and I like the image within the image thing going on. two suggestions. if you back up and zoom in, you can get rid of the distortion that comes from shooting with a wide angle lens. also, if you stand in the middle of the two windows, you could get them nice and flat and hopefully still not catch your own reflection.</td>', 'this is a great idea. the colors are very nice, and I like the image within the image thing going on. two suggestions. if you back up and zoom in, you can get rid of the distortion that comes from shooting with a wide angle lens. also, if you stand in the middle of the two windows, you could get them nice and flat and hopefully still not catch your own reflection.', '2002-08-11 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98652, 4015, 656, '<td valign="top">the reflections of the cranes work well</td>', 'the reflections of the cranes work well', '2002-08-11 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98653, 4016, 2997, '<td valign="top">Boy, I''m almost embarrassed to say that I used one.</td>', 'Boy, I''m almost embarrassed to say that I used one.', '2002-08-05 02:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98654, 4016, 2467, '<td valign="top">Oooo...ghost hand.<br/><br/>Nice effect...extra point</td>', 'Oooo...ghost hand.Nice effect...extra point', '2002-08-05 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98655, 4016, 2586, '<td valign="top">Like the hand. Definitely something old here. Don''t particularly care for the darks at the top and at the right.</td>', 'Like the hand. Definitely something old here. Don''t particularly care for the darks at the top and at the right.', '2002-08-05 04:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98656, 4016, 2780, '<td valign="top">this is great! i really like the ghost hand there turning the dial. awesome photograph. My only 10 this challenge!</td>', 'this is great! i really like the ghost hand there turning the dial. awesome photograph. My only 10 this challenge!', '2002-08-05 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98657, 4016, 2891, '<td valign="top">Love the "ghosting" technique on the hand</td>', 'Love the "ghosting" technique on the hand', '2002-08-05 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98658, 4016, 2120, '<td valign="top">Along with ''Old Time Spying'' this shot expressed time/age through technique (rather than only subject) best in my eyes. It seems you were going for an aged look with the shot however I think this hurts the smooth edges (The AM FM for instance) making it look oversharpened some. You may want to look at that again with the full size image... I leave it to you --10   Agamemnon</td>', 'Along with ''Old Time Spying'' this shot expressed time/age through technique (rather than only subject) best in my eyes. It seems you were going for an aged look with the shot however I think this hurts the smooth edges (The AM FM for instance) making it look oversharpened some. You may want to look at that again with the full size image... I leave it to you --10   Agamemnon', '2002-08-05 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98659, 4016, 2798, '<td valign="top">Woooo - spooky, sneaky and scarily good. The perfect subject and an almost off-hand use of a clever effect. Im wondering if this might even be one of the rare photographs that would have benefited from sepia tone. Regardless - excellent concept, execution and technicals. No faults at all. Well done!</td>', 'Woooo - spooky, sneaky and scarily good. The perfect subject and an almost off-hand use of a clever effect. Im wondering if this might even be one of the rare photographs that would have benefited from sepia tone. Regardless - excellent concept, execution and technicals. No faults at all. Well done!', '2002-08-05 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98660, 4016, 2466, '<td valign="top">the ghost hand is a perfect effect for this very well done photo.</td>', 'the ghost hand is a perfect effect for this very well done photo.', '2002-08-05 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
