(98683, 4016, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m very new to wanting to take pictures, I actually haven''t submitted a pic on here yet and only have a regular digital camera with no attachments or anything.  Forgive me if I sound photo illiterate, but how did you accomplish the whole see through hand affect?  I like it a lot.  Thanks for the oppertunity to view your pic.<br/>~Heather~</td>', 'I''m very new to wanting to take pictures, I actually haven''t submitted a pic on here yet and only have a regular digital camera with no attachments or anything.  Forgive me if I sound photo illiterate, but how did you accomplish the whole see through hand affect?  I like it a lot.  Thanks for the oppertunity to view your pic.~Heather~', '2002-08-07 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(98684, 4016, 772, '<td valign="top">very interesting subject... the old radio is quite nice :)  I also like the hand in the image as well... it brings life to the otherwise inanimate subject :)  The ghosting effect is neat, but I would love to know why you chose to do that... It *is* an interesting effect but i find that it attracts my attention moreso than the actual radio maybe... good shot... = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'very interesting subject... the old radio is quite nice :)  I also like the hand in the image as well... it brings life to the otherwise inanimate subject :)  The ghosting effect is neat, but I would love to know why you chose to do that... It *is* an interesting effect but i find that it attracts my attention moreso than the actual radio maybe... good shot... = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
