(99192, 4055, 2110, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your coments! I understand that none could get what I was trying to comunicate here. So I explain....<br/>The image is of a Kerosene stove, and the tank of the old kerosine stove is shown in the image with the lid that is used to open and add kerosene. Since this is the most characteristic part of a stove, I took a close up and assumed that all those who have seen a kerosene stove would be able to relate to it.<br/>This image is shot on a street-vendor''s cart in Bangalore (India) who sells roasted peanuts on the roadside.He uses old magazine paper/newspaper  to make paper cones for packing the peanuts. So behind what you see as black is the image is the stack of magazines that he is going to use over the day. <br/>The black paper is interesting and I delibrately included it in frame because of what is written on it in the red. It says " Live with it". Hence the title bare necessities.<br/>The reason I entered this image in this challenge is that this is a product which is really old, but is still being used in its original form for earning a living. My interpretation of the challenge was that to shoot something that is really old, looks old but has some significance in the present context.</td>', 'Thanks for your coments! I understand that none could get what I was trying to comunicate here. So I explain....The image is of a Kerosene stove, and the tank of the old kerosine stove is shown in the image with the lid that is used to open and add kerosene. Since this is the most characteristic part of a stove, I took a close up and assumed that all those who have seen a kerosene stove would be able to relate to it.This image is shot on a street-vendor''s cart in Bangalore (India) who sells roasted peanuts on the roadside.He uses old magazine paper/newspaper  to make paper cones for packing the peanuts. So behind what you see as black is the image is the stack of magazines that he is going to use over the day. The black paper is interesting and I delibrately included it in frame because of what is written on it in the red. It says " Live with it". Hence the title bare necessities.The reason I entered this image in this challenge is that this is a product which is really old, but is still being used in its original form for earning a living. My interpretation of the challenge was that to shoot something that is really old, looks old but has some significance in the present context.', '2002-08-15 00:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(99193, 4055, 2798, '<td valign="top">Very clever shot. Too clever, in fact. I admire the thought that went into this shot and I offer the following observations. 1) many people won''t recognise this as a kerosene stove. 2) there''s no way the viewer could know that this kerosene stove was being used to roast peanuts. 3) You can''t quite make out the word "Live" in "Live with it". I still love the texture of the shot - I just wish I''d been able to get the rest of your idea out of it too.</td>', 'Very clever shot. Too clever, in fact. I admire the thought that went into this shot and I offer the following observations. 1) many people won''t recognise this as a kerosene stove. 2) there''s no way the viewer could know that this kerosene stove was being used to roast peanuts. 3) You can''t quite make out the word "Live" in "Live with it". I still love the texture of the shot - I just wish I''d been able to get the rest of your idea out of it too.', '2002-08-15 07:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(99194, 4056, 2780, '<td valign="top">i love how the sun it causht just through that window.</td>', 'i love how the sun it causht just through that window.', '2002-08-05 04:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
