(99197, 4056, 1856, '<td valign="top">This is a beautful shot...have to dock a little because ''I'' don''t see old.  I''d also like a tad more of the ground in view...the balance seems a little off to me. 7 Lisa</td>', 'This is a beautful shot...have to dock a little because ''I'' don''t see old.  I''d also like a tad more of the ground in view...the balance seems a little off to me. 7 Lisa', '2002-08-05 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99198, 4056, 1569, '<td valign="top">I know the title is 1896 but where is the something old part?I see back lit buildings with the sun comming through a window--which is really neat to look at.A great looking sky,but where is the something old?</td>', 'I know the title is 1896 but where is the something old part?I see back lit buildings with the sun comming through a window--which is really neat to look at.A great looking sky,but where is the something old?', '2002-08-05 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
