(99201, 4056, 2716, '<td valign="top">What are the odds of coming across this set up?  I like it.</td>', 'What are the odds of coming across this set up?  I like it.', '2002-08-05 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99202, 4056, 1944, '<td valign="top">I like your photo of the sky, and the sun shining through the attic window adds interest, but the title, which for me is the year of this building, is not evident enough in it''s silhouette to carry the theme of the photo.</td>', 'I like your photo of the sky, and the sun shining through the attic window adds interest, but the title, which for me is the year of this building, is not evident enough in it''s silhouette to carry the theme of the photo.', '2002-08-05 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99203, 4056, 3105, '<td valign="top">I can imagine this took some patience on your part to make sure everything was aligned and the timing was right.  It does seem somewhat dark though but that may have been your desired effect.  The tree being not fully in or out of frame is a little distracting considering everything else is centered.</td>', 'I can imagine this took some patience on your part to make sure everything was aligned and the timing was right.  It does seem somewhat dark though but that may have been your desired effect.  The tree being not fully in or out of frame is a little distracting considering everything else is centered.', '2002-08-06 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99204, 4056, 1644, '<td valign="top">This is really neat, you must have waited all day to get the sun in just that spot! I wish I could tell what it is you photographed and how it related to the challenge, but it''s a great stand alone picture.</td>', 'This is really neat, you must have waited all day to get the sun in just that spot! I wish I could tell what it is you photographed and how it related to the challenge, but it''s a great stand alone picture.', '2002-08-06 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99205, 4056, 133, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what this is supposed to be of.</td>', 'I can''t tell what this is supposed to be of.', '2002-08-07 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99206, 4056, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent capture... I love how the sun is placed in the window of the house... The silhouette effect here is quite nice...  My only issue with this photo is that i can''t really see ''old''.  I believe that the buildings are probably old, but that aspect is not strong in the photo.  I love the shot though :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an excellent capture... I love how the sun is placed in the window of the house... The silhouette effect here is quite nice...  My only issue with this photo is that i can''t really see ''old''.  I believe that the buildings are probably old, but that aspect is not strong in the photo.  I love the shot though :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99207, 4056, 885, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love the sky and how the sun shines right through that window.  Certainly isn''t anything that looks like this where I live.  The centering works.  I like how it''s almost silhouette, but I think I''d have liked to see a tiny bit more detail in the house front.  Not completely, but just a bit.  My monitor could be dark though.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love the sky and how the sun shines right through that window.  Certainly isn''t anything that looks like this where I live.  The centering works.  I like how it''s almost silhouette, but I think I''d have liked to see a tiny bit more detail in the house front.  Not completely, but just a bit.  My monitor could be dark though.', '2002-08-07 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99208, 4056, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good artistic photo.Unfortunately, the title is necessary to convey the theme of age in the challenge.  Would like to see this one again for a challenge that better fits it.</td>', 'Good artistic photo.Unfortunately, the title is necessary to convey the theme of age in the challenge.  Would like to see this one again for a challenge that better fits it.', '2002-08-07 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99209, 4056, 811, '<td valign="top">Wow, I like the capture of the sun in the window.  Beautiful picture.  karmat</td>', 'Wow, I like the capture of the sun in the window.  Beautiful picture.  karmat', '2002-08-08 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99210, 4056, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot  the use of light and dark really works giving an impression of pyramids in Egypt.  I think that the challenge link is weak, but the photo deserves a good score. (8)</td>', 'This is a great shot  the use of light and dark really works giving an impression of pyramids in Egypt.  I think that the challenge link is weak, but the photo deserves a good score. (8)', '2002-08-08 07:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99211, 4056, 2857, '<td valign="top">cool shot but doesn''t say something old at all.</td>', 'cool shot but doesn''t say something old at all.', '2002-08-08 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99212, 4056, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely timing and framing. Great sky and an effective silhouette. Great shot.</td>', 'Lovely timing and framing. Great sky and an effective silhouette. Great shot.', '2002-08-08 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99213, 4056, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!  On beauty alone, this is a keeper!  The sky is great, the tree silhouette is fantastic, the light shining through the window is inspiring and without the title, I would never have any idea of this structure''s age (the stated point of the challenge).   I am going to raise your score from 6 to 8, but only because this is a truly fantastic photograph.  Swash</td>', 'Wonderful shot!  On beauty alone, this is a keeper!  The sky is great, the tree silhouette is fantastic, the light shining through the window is inspiring and without the title, I would never have any idea of this structure''s age (the stated point of the challenge).   I am going to raise your score from 6 to 8, but only because this is a truly fantastic photograph.  Swash', '2002-08-08 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99214, 4056, 1454, '<td valign="top">It might be old... but it doesn''t look that old to me...</td>', 'It might be old... but it doesn''t look that old to me...', '2002-08-08 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
