(99216, 4056, 2373, '<td valign="top">i must know how you had your camera setup for this shot. Ive been trying to get something like this for a while but it never turns out great like this one.</td>', 'i must know how you had your camera setup for this shot. Ive been trying to get something like this for a while but it never turns out great like this one.', '2002-08-10 09:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99217, 4056, 917, '<td valign="top">I like the sun through the building, I feel it could use a bit less sky, and the tree on the left is unfortunate. Is this the same building as the other 1896 photo? I guessed that was in Iceland, but maybe I was wrong.</td>', 'I like the sun through the building, I feel it could use a bit less sky, and the tree on the left is unfortunate. Is this the same building as the other 1896 photo? I guessed that was in Iceland, but maybe I was wrong.', '2002-08-10 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99218, 4056, 2618, '<td valign="top">I would have said, forget about ''Something Old'' (I presume 1896 is the building''s date) and just go for a stunningly good sunrise/sunset shot. Dropping the exposure to make the buildings completely black silhouettes would have made for an astounding picture IMHO. It might not have been applicable to the competition, but hey. who cares if its a 10+ picture anyway!</td>', 'I would have said, forget about ''Something Old'' (I presume 1896 is the building''s date) and just go for a stunningly good sunrise/sunset shot. Dropping the exposure to make the buildings completely black silhouettes would have made for an astounding picture IMHO. It might not have been applicable to the competition, but hey. who cares if its a 10+ picture anyway!', '2002-08-10 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99219, 4056, 2661, '<td valign="top">this is an awesome picture. I love how the sun is coming through the window of the house. that really makes the picture stand out from all the other silhouetted shots out there. great job with the lighting.</td>', 'this is an awesome picture. I love how the sun is coming through the window of the house. that really makes the picture stand out from all the other silhouetted shots out there. great job with the lighting.', '2002-08-11 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99220, 4056, 1280, '<td valign="top">This has a certain appeal...blue, cloudy sky, pointy silhouette.  I love the light shining through the facade.  But for the title  there is nothing that says "Old" to me though.</td>', 'This has a certain appeal...blue, cloudy sky, pointy silhouette.  I love the light shining through the facade.  But for the title  there is nothing that says "Old" to me though.', '2002-08-11 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
