(99222, 4056, 885, '<td valign="top">I take back my dark comment.  Looking at it on this monitor I can see the amount of detail I want to see.  The other monitor is just dark.</td>', 'I take back my dark comment.  Looking at it on this monitor I can see the amount of detail I want to see.  The other monitor is just dark.', '2002-08-12 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(99223, 4059, 2780, '<td valign="top">that keep out sign looks like it says "POO" between the leaves. Heheh it made me laugh.<br/>Anyway, its a good photo, I like the contrast between the old red/brown, and the lush green leaves.</td>', 'that keep out sign looks like it says "POO" between the leaves. Heheh it made me laugh.Anyway, its a good photo, I like the contrast between the old red/brown, and the lush green leaves.', '2002-08-05 04:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99224, 4059, 1141, '<td valign="top">Bad shadows</td>', 'Bad shadows', '2002-08-05 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99225, 4059, 3077, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked equally as well without the sign - the contrast between the plant and the tattered siding would have been enough to signify age to me. That said, I guess you couldn''t get close enough to remove it for the photo.</td>', 'I think this would have worked equally as well without the sign - the contrast between the plant and the tattered siding would have been enough to signify age to me. That said, I guess you couldn''t get close enough to remove it for the photo.', '2002-08-06 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99226, 4059, 2199, '<td valign="top">I love the texture of the building. I might like the composition a bit more if the sign were closer, and maybe not so near the center of the photo (move to the lower right?). The photo could also be improved with a small amount of sharpening in Photoshop. Overall, nice work!</td>', 'I love the texture of the building. I might like the composition a bit more if the sign were closer, and maybe not so near the center of the photo (move to the lower right?). The photo could also be improved with a small amount of sharpening in Photoshop. Overall, nice work!', '2002-08-06 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99227, 4059, 811, '<td valign="top">Very  nice use of contrasting colors, and I like how the tree gives it some balanced.  It just seems a little soft on the focus, and I think a sharper focus would have really made the sign jump out.  Good job, though. karmat</td>', 'Very  nice use of contrasting colors, and I like how the tree gives it some balanced.  It just seems a little soft on the focus, and I think a sharper focus would have really made the sign jump out.  Good job, though. karmat', '2002-08-06 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99228, 4059, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting concept... I would like to see less of the greenery and more of the wall in this composition... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting concept... I would like to see less of the greenery and more of the wall in this composition... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-06 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99229, 4059, 2928, '<td valign="top">Sorry to score so low, but I am really not sure of the picture overall.  It seems to me to be lacking in content.  But, I''m just one voter and I hope others have better eyes than I</td>', 'Sorry to score so low, but I am really not sure of the picture overall.  It seems to me to be lacking in content.  But, I''m just one voter and I hope others have better eyes than I', '2002-08-08 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99230, 4059, 917, '<td valign="top">The peeling paint needs to be alot sharper. Its probably been blurred by your picture editor, rather than by the camera.</td>', 'The peeling paint needs to be alot sharper. Its probably been blurred by your picture editor, rather than by the camera.', '2002-08-09 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99231, 4059, 2172, '<td valign="top">Good use of lines...the diagonal shadow, the lines of the siding, the tree also gives a diagonal line.  (I''m being frank - not to offend)  As I look at this, the brightness of the sign is distracting.  I feel as if there should be something else - as if part of a story has been left out.  The image is not ''speaking to me''.<br/>7<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Good use of lines...the diagonal shadow, the lines of the siding, the tree also gives a diagonal line.  (I''m being frank - not to offend)  As I look at this, the brightness of the sign is distracting.  I feel as if there should be something else - as if part of a story has been left out.  The image is not ''speaking to me''.7Ruthann', '2002-08-09 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99232, 4059, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - good<br/>Meets Challenge - maybe. Don''t confuse old with unkept<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - goodMeets Challenge - maybe. Don''t confuse old with unkeptVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-10 20:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99233, 4060, 2223, '<td valign="top">are those fossils?</td>', 'are those fossils?', '2002-08-05 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99234, 4060, 1202, '<td valign="top">I can''t determine exactly what your picture is of.   You have good focus but it looks a little overworked in post processing.   I like to have the subject jump out an say "I am a .....".    Autool</td>', 'I can''t determine exactly what your picture is of.   You have good focus but it looks a little overworked in post processing.   I like to have the subject jump out an say "I am a .....".    Autool', '2002-08-05 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99235, 4060, 2928, '<td valign="top">Somethings wrong, but I''m really not sure what it is... Perhaps it''s too close.  Sorry, that''s not a good comment, but I''m really not sure...</td>', 'Somethings wrong, but I''m really not sure what it is... Perhaps it''s too close.  Sorry, that''s not a good comment, but I''m really not sure...', '2002-08-05 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
