(99242, 4060, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice :)  the depth of field got a little weak in the top of the frame, but other than that, this is an excellent photo :) good work... - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice :)  the depth of field got a little weak in the top of the frame, but other than that, this is an excellent photo :) good work... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
