(99244, 4060, 3112, '<td valign="top">Great technical photo, good subject choice. Superhigh contrast. Excellent effort.</td>', 'Great technical photo, good subject choice. Superhigh contrast. Excellent effort.', '2002-08-09 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99245, 4060, 2353, '<td valign="top">I love this picture but I think that I''m missing something on it meeting the challenge...great shot, though! - 8</td>', 'I love this picture but I think that I''m missing something on it meeting the challenge...great shot, though! - 8', '2002-08-10 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99246, 4060, 2661, '<td valign="top">as the title implies, the shot really does have great shadows. the composition is good, but I would like it even better if you tilted the camera to place the upper spiral in the upper right corner. also, a greater dof would be nice to get everything in focus. and one more thing... it looks like you boosted the contrast a little too much. but it really is a nice shot.</td>', 'as the title implies, the shot really does have great shadows. the composition is good, but I would like it even better if you tilted the camera to place the upper spiral in the upper right corner. also, a greater dof would be nice to get everything in focus. and one more thing... it looks like you boosted the contrast a little too much. but it really is a nice shot.', '2002-08-11 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99247, 4060, 656, '<td valign="top">Funky.  a bit blurred though, perhaps needs more sharpening ?</td>', 'Funky.  a bit blurred though, perhaps needs more sharpening ?', '2002-08-11 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99248, 4060, 205, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, great composition. A ten.</td>', 'Nice lighting, great composition. A ten.', '2002-08-11 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99249, 4060, 2148, '<td valign="top">Thanks again for everyone who took the time to comment.<br/><br/>Yes those are fossils - very small (about 1cm Pyratised Ammonites).<br/><br/>lolly_gagger - When I read your comment I was thinking of replying about living in the UK and how am I supposed to have heard of some obscure US band - then I figured out they are actually a UK band - DOH! Having looked them up on the Internet, I have to agree that the images are very similar. You''ll just have to take my word for it that I have never heard of the Sundays or seen the Album before.</td>', 'Thanks again for everyone who took the time to comment.Yes those are fossils - very small (about 1cm Pyratised Ammonites).lolly_gagger - When I read your comment I was thinking of replying about living in the UK and how am I supposed to have heard of some obscure US band - then I figured out they are actually a UK band - DOH! Having looked them up on the Internet, I have to agree that the images are very similar. You''ll just have to take my word for it that I have never heard of the Sundays or seen the Album before.', '2002-08-12 05:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(99250, 4060, 472, '<td valign="top">hey lamedos.  ammonites are cool, aren''t they? :)</td>', 'hey lamedos.  ammonites are cool, aren''t they? :)', '2002-08-15 09:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(99251, 4060, 3080, '<td valign="top">LOL!!  I just looked up the band the Sundays and wow...Their photo and this one are very similar.  Just goes to show you that this must be a really great photo, if one like it has been on an album cover.  Sorry I missed this challenge, but I really like this shot. <br/>~Heather~</td>', 'LOL!!  I just looked up the band the Sundays and wow...Their photo and this one are very similar.  Just goes to show you that this must be a really great photo, if one like it has been on an album cover.  Sorry I missed this challenge, but I really like this shot. ~Heather~', '2002-10-09 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
