(99273, 4065, 715, '<td valign="top">Well composed shot with great detail and DOF. I find the small angle of the certificate a little disturbing though. I''d prefer a much stronger angle, either parallel to the shoe or -probably even better- square to the angle of the shoe. That''s just my personal taste though :)</td>', 'Well composed shot with great detail and DOF. I find the small angle of the certificate a little disturbing though. I''d prefer a much stronger angle, either parallel to the shoe or -probably even better- square to the angle of the shoe. That''s just my personal taste though :)', '2002-08-05 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
