(99281, 4065, 2983, '<td valign="top">Good color, I''d like to see this with a more "daring" compositional approach.</td>', 'Good color, I''d like to see this with a more "daring" compositional approach.', '2002-08-06 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99282, 4065, 1759, '<td valign="top">Excellent storytelling. Technically a very good exposure with good use of DOF. My only nitpick would be to have a softer lighting to reduce the shadows along the bottom of the booty. Nonetheless, very good!</td>', 'Excellent storytelling. Technically a very good exposure with good use of DOF. My only nitpick would be to have a softer lighting to reduce the shadows along the bottom of the booty. Nonetheless, very good!', '2002-08-06 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99283, 4065, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great close up shot  a bit dark</td>', 'Great close up shot  a bit dark', '2002-08-07 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99284, 4065, 917, '<td valign="top">The birth certificate seems to distract from the image. I think this is because text automatically demands to be read first. Its like those TVs in bars, you dont want to view the Oklahoma all-state cherry spitting semi-final, but your eyes get dragged away from the pretty girl you are trying to date to watch some bearded bloke honking across a field.</td>', 'The birth certificate seems to distract from the image. I think this is because text automatically demands to be read first. Its like those TVs in bars, you dont want to view the Oklahoma all-state cherry spitting semi-final, but your eyes get dragged away from the pretty girl you are trying to date to watch some bearded bloke honking across a field.', '2002-08-07 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99285, 4065, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  For some reason, my first thought was of the holocaust.  Having the show sit on the birth certificate is an awesome idea! karmat</td>', 'I really like this.  For some reason, my first thought was of the holocaust.  Having the show sit on the birth certificate is an awesome idea! karmat', '2002-08-07 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99286, 4065, 2798, '<td valign="top">Excellent DoF. Overall the picture seems a tiny bit dark. Not clear to me how the shoe relates to the document. This is perhaps something a brit like me wouldn''t recognise.</td>', 'Excellent DoF. Overall the picture seems a tiny bit dark. Not clear to me how the shoe relates to the document. This is perhaps something a brit like me wouldn''t recognise.', '2002-08-08 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99287, 4065, 2932, '<td valign="top">thank you for filling the frame with oldness, not just the object.  The birth certificate looks to be 75 years old, so probably not yours?  The framing really begs for the other bootie to be in the picture next to it, but overall a great picture</td>', 'thank you for filling the frame with oldness, not just the object.  The birth certificate looks to be 75 years old, so probably not yours?  The framing really begs for the other bootie to be in the picture next to it, but overall a great picture', '2002-08-08 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99288, 4065, 2857, '<td valign="top">very cool shot.</td>', 'very cool shot.', '2002-08-08 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99289, 4065, 772, '<td valign="top">this is an excellent idea and great composition... good work :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is an excellent idea and great composition... good work :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99290, 4065, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Depth is just a little too shallow.</td>', 'Good subject. Depth is just a little too shallow.', '2002-08-09 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99291, 4065, 616, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great subjects, the bootie was a nice touch. Good detail, but I think the DOF should have been set to grab the whole certificate.  The unfocused area is a little distracting. Just a personal opinion.</td>', 'Very nice. Great subjects, the bootie was a nice touch. Good detail, but I think the DOF should have been set to grab the whole certificate.  The unfocused area is a little distracting. Just a personal opinion.', '2002-08-09 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99292, 4065, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture.  I am assuming you wanted the shoe and foreground as the only focal points, but I want more.  The shoe seems on the dark side.  I wish I could read the document title.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very cool picture.  I am assuming you wanted the shoe and foreground as the only focal points, but I want more.  The shoe seems on the dark side.  I wish I could read the document title.  8 Swash', '2002-08-09 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
