(99299, 4065, 2172, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  The composition is great.  I like your use of DOF here - I don''t think there is a need to see everything focused.  One small thing, I wish there was just a tad more light on the shoe.  A job well done!!  8<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Nicely done!  The composition is great.  I like your use of DOF here - I don''t think there is a need to see everything focused.  One small thing, I wish there was just a tad more light on the shoe.  A job well done!!  8Ruthann', '2002-08-11 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99300, 4065, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo.  I rated it very high.  The only thing that keeps drawing my attention is that the date on the certificate and the date on the shoe don''t match.  Then I just tell myself.  Of course, they bought the shoe before the baby was born.  You could almost enter the same photo in the "something new" contest, only switching, of course, the style of shoe to modern and with a new birth certificate.  Just a funny observation.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo.  I rated it very high.  The only thing that keeps drawing my attention is that the date on the certificate and the date on the shoe don''t match.  Then I just tell myself.  Of course, they bought the shoe before the baby was born.  You could almost enter the same photo in the "something new" contest, only switching, of course, the style of shoe to modern and with a new birth certificate.  Just a funny observation.  Good luck.', '2002-08-11 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99301, 4066, 1792, '<td valign="top">I like the subject.  The composition seems a little weak.</td>', 'I like the subject.  The composition seems a little weak.', '2002-08-05 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99302, 4066, 210, '<td valign="top">Leveling to focus more on the coloring of the train would have been nicer.</td>', 'Leveling to focus more on the coloring of the train would have been nicer.', '2002-08-05 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99303, 4066, 3103, '<td valign="top">This is awesome, would have been neat with an old man in overalls</td>', 'This is awesome, would have been neat with an old man in overalls', '2002-08-05 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1);
 Perhaps all of the subject visible would have been better</td>', 'Nice idea.  The composition makes it look a little cramped Perhaps all of the subject visible would have been better', '2002-08-07 05:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99347, 4068, 2798, '<td valign="top">I can see what you were trying to do with the framing here but I dont think you went far enough with the idea. Perhaps if you''d stood furher back fromj the subject and introduced more negative space it would have helped. Besides I kinda like the idea that not even the photographer wanted to get too close to these shoes!</td>', 'I can see what you were trying to do with the framing here but I dont think you went far enough with the idea. Perhaps if you''d stood furher back fromj the subject and introduced more negative space it would have helped. Besides I kinda like the idea that not even the photographer wanted to get too close to these shoes!', '2002-08-07 06:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99348, 4068, 772, '<td valign="top">I think you chose an excellent subject for this challenge... The composition of this photo is nice, but I think the lighting is just a little too harsh.  I like the shadows, but a darker backround may have removed some of the impression of the lighting... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I think you chose an excellent subject for this challenge... The composition of this photo is nice, but I think the lighting is just a little too harsh.  I like the shadows, but a darker backround may have removed some of the impression of the lighting... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99349, 4068, 917, '<td valign="top">Cropped way too closely.</td>', 'Cropped way too closely.', '2002-08-07 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99350, 4068, 2932, '<td valign="top">fascinating crop and use of shadow as subject</td>', 'fascinating crop and use of shadow as subject', '2002-08-08 04:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99351, 4068, 1005, '<td valign="top">Challenge well met.  (claimed milage questionable)  Background, not crazy about.  Focus is good.  Framing: well, you cut of a toe and a third of a shoe.  These two issues could have been on purpose, but it makes me want to ask why?  My guess on the background is, you were attempting to "blank" it; as for the cropping of the shoes, I have no idea.  I started you as a 6, the shoes still seem whole (my oldest tennis shoes have sole talk and holes all over), but the shot is really very good.  How about bumping up one to a 7, O.K?  Swash</td>', 'Challenge well met.  (claimed milage questionable)  Background, not crazy about.  Focus is good.  Framing: well, you cut of a toe and a third of a shoe.  These two issues could have been on purpose, but it makes me want to ask why?  My guess on the background is, you were attempting to "blank" it; as for the cropping of the shoes, I have no idea.  I started you as a 6, the shoes still seem whole (my oldest tennis shoes have sole talk and holes all over), but the shot is really very good.  How about bumping up one to a 7, O.K?  Swash', '2002-08-08 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99352, 4068, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject choice. better-than average, technically.</td>', 'Good subject choice. better-than average, technically.', '2002-08-09 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99353, 4068, 2618, '<td valign="top">Oddly cropped. Doesn''t quite do it for me like that, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Oddly cropped. Doesn''t quite do it for me like that, I''m afraid.', '2002-08-10 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99354, 4068, 554, '<td valign="top">I would have perfered all of both shoes in the view.</td>', 'I would have perfered all of both shoes in the view.', '2002-08-10 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99355, 4068, 2, '<td valign="top">Great subject, great title.  The lights in the photo seem a little too bright to me -- I almost feel like I have to squint to see everything.  Still, one of my favorites for the week.</td>', 'Great subject, great title.  The lights in the photo seem a little too bright to me -- I almost feel like I have to squint to see everything.  Still, one of my favorites for the week.', '2002-08-11 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99356, 4068, 2661, '<td valign="top">the high key lighting works very well with the shot to emphasize the memories associated with the shoes. nice muted colors and great lighting.</td>', 'the high key lighting works very well with the shot to emphasize the memories associated with the shoes. nice muted colors and great lighting.', '2002-08-11 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99357, 4068, 715, '<td valign="top">Good one. I like both the idea and the colors, but I think the empty space at the bottom is kinda disturbing the balance of the photo.</td>', 'Good one. I like both the idea and the colors, but I think the empty space at the bottom is kinda disturbing the balance of the photo.', '2002-08-11 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99358, 4068, 656, '<td valign="top">time for new tyres I think</td>', 'time for new tyres I think', '2002-08-11 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99359, 4071, 2798, '<td valign="top">Is that really wattle and daub? Regardless - it''s a lovely old building and the strong contrast B&amp;W makes it look like an old photo. Good effort at meeting the challenge. My only criticism is that it''s not an especially interesting picture. Perhaps it''s the angle that''s very conventional. But that, again, adds to the old picture feel.</td>', 'Is that really wattle and daub? Regardless - it''s a lovely old building and the strong contrast B&W makes it look like an old photo. Good effort at meeting the challenge. My only criticism is that it''s not an especially interesting picture. Perhaps it''s the angle that''s very conventional. But that, again, adds to the old picture feel.', '2002-08-05 07:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
