(99438, 4074, 2618, '<td valign="top">Very well done. The figures don''t quite fit if you stop to think and look closely, but it''s close. I thought they were real people when I looked at the thumbnail!</td>', 'Very well done. The figures don''t quite fit if you stop to think and look closely, but it''s close. I thought they were real people when I looked at the thumbnail!', '2002-08-10 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99439, 4075, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this image would have been much better if you had rotated it up to a vertical orientation.  I don''t understand your intention of having it horizontal like this.... I like the sepia toning, but the exposure seems a little hot.  The high exposure in the background is washing out the details in the front end of this classic car... - jmsetzler</td>', 'I think this image would have been much better if you had rotated it up to a vertical orientation.  I don''t understand your intention of having it horizontal like this.... I like the sepia toning, but the exposure seems a little hot.  The high exposure in the background is washing out the details in the front end of this classic car... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99440, 4075, 835, '<td valign="top">rotate please.  too much light on top of the car<br/></td>', 'rotate please.  too much light on top of the car', '2002-08-05 01:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
