(99471, 4075, 806, '<td valign="top">did you place this horizontally on purpose? I don''t think it adds anything. Vertical would be better. If I tilt my head I can see good composition, but there is also pixelation/dithering/compression artifacts.</td>', 'did you place this horizontally on purpose? I don''t think it adds anything. Vertical would be better. If I tilt my head I can see good composition, but there is also pixelation/dithering/compression artifacts.', '2002-08-09 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
