(99484, 4075, 2829, '<td valign="top">Ok, I sat here for a few minutes looking at this picture...Could not figure out what to give it....Most of the cars have gotten a 5 from me...Wanted to give a low score since the car seems to be parked on the wall...but you know what...it''s different...so I''m giving you an 8 :)</td>', 'Ok, I sat here for a few minutes looking at this picture...Could not figure out what to give it....Most of the cars have gotten a 5 from me...Wanted to give a low score since the car seems to be parked on the wall...but you know what...it''s different...so I''m giving you an 8 :)', '2002-08-11 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
