(99486, 4075, 2, '<td valign="top">I can''t for the life of me figure out why you wouldn''t rotate this picture.   The top (er left) of the image, though, is very washed out compared to the bottom (right).</td>', 'I can''t for the life of me figure out why you wouldn''t rotate this picture.   The top (er left) of the image, though, is very washed out compared to the bottom (right).', '2002-08-12 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
