(99488, 4077, 1569, '<td valign="top">The auto focus seems to have locked on the fence. The pumpitself is fuzzy---and I don''t mean the handle. I can see that the handle was moving when the pix was snapped thats not a problem.</td>', 'The auto focus seems to have locked on the fence. The pumpitself is fuzzy---and I don''t mean the handle. I can see that the handle was moving when the pix was snapped thats not a problem.', '2002-08-05 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
