(99491, 4077, 2928, '<td valign="top">I love the reddish tint in the shot  it gives a rust effect and creates atmosphere.  Overall, it looks old  you may find people comment on sharpness, but I for one think it would lose personality it were sharp.  It looks like it''s a deliberate attempt to look older, so, I''m going to mark as such (9) Great shot</td>', 'I love the reddish tint in the shot  it gives a rust effect and creates atmosphere.  Overall, it looks old  you may find people comment on sharpness, but I for one think it would lose personality it were sharp.  It looks like it''s a deliberate attempt to look older, so, I''m going to mark as such (9) Great shot', '2002-08-05 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
