(99494, 4077, 2110, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors. it looks like you have been one of the few users in some time..or else we would have sen something gren around!!<br/>Great sot.7</td>', 'Very nice colors. it looks like you have been one of the few users in some time..or else we would have sen something gren around!!Great sot.7', '2002-08-06 00:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99495, 4077, 811, '<td valign="top">Is that desaturated colors?  I like the effect.  I think the picture could be improved overall by using a different angle that showed more water and less chain-link fence.  Otherwise, a great shot!</td>', 'Is that desaturated colors?  I like the effect.  I think the picture could be improved overall by using a different angle that showed more water and less chain-link fence.  Otherwise, a great shot!', '2002-08-06 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
