(99551, 4083, 885, '<td valign="top">Though I think the navy blue background (carpet?) works well, I think that something with less texture might force my eye to look at the texture of the pitted marbles more.  I think I would have cropped it a little less closely, and gotten in the small parts of the leather bag that seems artificially chopped.  Otherwise, neat subject, composition, and lighting.</td>', 'Though I think the navy blue background (carpet?) works well, I think that something with less texture might force my eye to look at the texture of the pitted marbles more.  I think I would have cropped it a little less closely, and gotten in the small parts of the leather bag that seems artificially chopped.  Otherwise, neat subject, composition, and lighting.', '2002-08-07 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
