(99560, 4083, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic - I adore the colours and the way you''ve got low down to take the shot. The only regret is the way the pouch is just clipped at the top and the leather tie at the right. The carpet works well as a background too. It leaves me wishing that I still had my marbles (!) and could play for penny chews!<br/><br/>Having now looked regularly at all 7 of my score 9 choices, I have decided that this one is definitely my absolute favourite and am upping my score to a ten. I know it''s not perfect, technically, because of the slight clipping at two edges, but I do love it.</td>', 'This is fantastic - I adore the colours and the way you''ve got low down to take the shot. The only regret is the way the pouch is just clipped at the top and the leather tie at the right. The carpet works well as a background too. It leaves me wishing that I still had my marbles (!) and could play for penny chews!Having now looked regularly at all 7 of my score 9 choices, I have decided that this one is definitely my absolute favourite and am upping my score to a ten. I know it''s not perfect, technically, because of the slight clipping at two edges, but I do love it.', '2002-08-08 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
