(99568, 4083, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like it!  Nice colors but beat up enough to show use.  If I''d change anything it would be the carpet.  I''d like to see this on wood or tile, or pottery or iron...etc.  Still very nice though.</td>', 'I like it!  Nice colors but beat up enough to show use.  If I''d change anything it would be the carpet.  I''d like to see this on wood or tile, or pottery or iron...etc.  Still very nice though.', '2002-08-11 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99569, 4083, 2247, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  Good choice of background.  The dark blue brings out the colors of the balls-which are your subjects. I give you a 10.</td>', 'Not bad.  Good choice of background.  The dark blue brings out the colors of the balls-which are your subjects. I give you a 10.', '2002-08-12 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
