(99571, 4084, 1175, '<td valign="top">I like how you used the trees to frame this house.  The effect of the sun shining through the leaves at the top is interesting, but a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like how you used the trees to frame this house.  The effect of the sun shining through the leaves at the top is interesting, but a bit distracting.', '2002-08-05 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99572, 4084, 2323, '<td valign="top">This is one old house!<br/><br/>The black and white make this photo look a little flat.  The upper portion is a bit overexposed, and the trees framing the house don''t seem to help here.<br/><br/>--4-- sohr</td>', 'This is one old house!The black and white make this photo look a little flat.  The upper portion is a bit overexposed, and the trees framing the house don''t seem to help here.--4-- sohr', '2002-08-07 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99573, 4084, 2764, '<td valign="top">Compostion is a little off, makes it look unbalanced.  I like the way the trees fuse together, could havve uses that better, and what is supposed to be the eyecatcher here?  I would have used to half open door becasue the white makes such a nice contrast but it is too far off to the right.</td>', 'Compostion is a little off, makes it look unbalanced.  I like the way the trees fuse together, could havve uses that better, and what is supposed to be the eyecatcher here?  I would have used to half open door becasue the white makes such a nice contrast but it is too far off to the right.', '2002-08-07 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99574, 4084, 3147, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2002-08-07 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99575, 4084, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting old house... the blow out along the top of the image is a little harsh though... :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an interesting old house... the blow out along the top of the image is a little harsh though... :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99576, 4084, 2798, '<td valign="top">It''s an excellent subject for the photo and I like how you attempt to frame it within the trees. Just a couple of nit picks - there''s a little glare at the very top edge of the picture and there''s a black ''well'' in the middle of the picture where there''s no detail. Definitely captures the feeling of oldness though. Well done.</td>', 'It''s an excellent subject for the photo and I like how you attempt to frame it within the trees. Just a couple of nit picks - there''s a little glare at the very top edge of the picture and there''s a black ''well'' in the middle of the picture where there''s no detail. Definitely captures the feeling of oldness though. Well done.', '2002-08-08 07:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99577, 4084, 2587, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure, great touch of color &amp; very nice composition. You should end up in the top 10! I''m gonna add this one to my favorites. :-) sylk</td>', 'Excellent exposure, great touch of color & very nice composition. You should end up in the top 10! I''m gonna add this one to my favorites. :-) sylk', '2002-08-08 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99578, 4084, 1005, '<td valign="top">Was the glare across the top on purpose?  I don''t get any extra meaning from it.  I kinda like the glare through the tree leaves.  6 Swash</td>', 'Was the glare across the top on purpose?  I don''t get any extra meaning from it.  I kinda like the glare through the tree leaves.  6 Swash', '2002-08-08 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
