(99596, 4085, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. The shapes, textures, lighting, colours, composition... everything here is not only very pleasing but definitely emphasises the age of the subject.</td>', 'This is beautiful. The shapes, textures, lighting, colours, composition... everything here is not only very pleasing but definitely emphasises the age of the subject.', '2002-08-07 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99597, 4085, 1519, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. It''s wonderful.  Great choice! Great composition.  Beautiful color and detail. Nicely done! 10 lecalan</td>', 'I love this picture. It''s wonderful.  Great choice! Great composition.  Beautiful color and detail. Nicely done! 10 lecalan', '2002-08-07 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99598, 4085, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice work!  I love the curves on this old saw... great job on the dark background as well... i can''t really say that there is anything I would have done differently on this image... good work :) = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice work!  I love the curves on this old saw... great job on the dark background as well... i can''t really say that there is anything I would have done differently on this image... good work :) = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99599, 4085, 2798, '<td valign="top">Great framing, contrast and colour.</td>', 'Great framing, contrast and colour.', '2002-08-08 08:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99600, 4085, 1041, '<td valign="top">very nice.  nice that you picked just the handle and part of the blade.  the black background is fantastic, and the sharpness of the shot really good, too.  i would love to see the teeth of the saw at the bottom, even though that would mean more of the blade and (in proportion) less of the handle. -- gr8photos (8)</td>', 'very nice.  nice that you picked just the handle and part of the blade.  the black background is fantastic, and the sharpness of the shot really good, too.  i would love to see the teeth of the saw at the bottom, even though that would mean more of the blade and (in proportion) less of the handle. -- gr8photos (8)', '2002-08-08 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99601, 4085, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the focus on the handle of the tool and the visibility of the wear and tear, and I also love that it only has three main colours, rich bronze, silver and black. I would like a tiny bit more black space at the top of the image.</td>', 'I like the focus on the handle of the tool and the visibility of the wear and tear, and I also love that it only has three main colours, rich bronze, silver and black. I would like a tiny bit more black space at the top of the image.', '2002-08-08 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99602, 4085, 2235, '<td valign="top">Excellent image quality. Nice framing of shot. Handle is well outlined by black background. Detail is very good. Like worn look of handle.</td>', 'Excellent image quality. Nice framing of shot. Handle is well outlined by black background. Detail is very good. Like worn look of handle.', '2002-08-09 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99603, 4085, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Focus is a little soft, but not so as to upset the composition. Very good, overall.</td>', 'Good subject. Focus is a little soft, but not so as to upset the composition. Very good, overall.', '2002-08-09 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99604, 4085, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great quality photo.  The image is very clear.  Black background came out great - good lighting skills.  I like the different textures.  Seems that it has been around for some time.  Good cropping and composition.    9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great quality photo.  The image is very clear.  Black background came out great - good lighting skills.  I like the different textures.  Seems that it has been around for some time.  Good cropping and composition.    9Ruthann', '2002-08-09 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99605, 4085, 671, '<td valign="top">really nice framing on this.  The background and lighting bring out the lustre in the wood very nicely.  9</td>', 'really nice framing on this.  The background and lighting bring out the lustre in the wood very nicely.  9', '2002-08-10 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99606, 4085, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very nice. This saw certainly looks old and used. Good composition, interesting textures and curves.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Very nice. This saw certainly looks old and used. Good composition, interesting textures and curves.-stephan', '2002-08-10 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99607, 4085, 3198, '<td valign="top">looks like a face/monster! nice composition but not challenging</td>', 'looks like a face/monster! nice composition but not challenging', '2002-08-11 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99608, 4085, 2661, '<td valign="top">great subject and great shot. lighting and colors are great. I love being able to see the tarnish on the blade and the grime on the handle. the only thing I would change is the amount of negative space. I would like to see a little more room around the handle, especially at the top. good job, though.</td>', 'great subject and great shot. lighting and colors are great. I love being able to see the tarnish on the blade and the grime on the handle. the only thing I would change is the amount of negative space. I would like to see a little more room around the handle, especially at the top. good job, though.', '2002-08-11 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99609, 4085, 1280, '<td valign="top">I can see the age in the patina of the wood.  My submission is somewhat similar and many people just don''t see the age in it, because it has been well preserved for many, many years.  I thought they''d see that but didn''t.  I hope your''s is scoring better than mine....:-)  I like yours.</td>', 'I can see the age in the patina of the wood.  My submission is somewhat similar and many people just don''t see the age in it, because it has been well preserved for many, many years.  I thought they''d see that but didn''t.  I hope your''s is scoring better than mine....:-)  I like yours.', '2002-08-11 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99610, 4085, 3215, '<td valign="top">I''m partial to tools but the lighting is perfect and the color excelent. Worthy of a screen saver too.</td>', 'I''m partial to tools but the lighting is perfect and the color excelent. Worthy of a screen saver too.', '2002-08-11 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99611, 4086, 2997, '<td valign="top">A wilted or dried flower was one of my choices (on a checklist of 5 possble items.  I didn''t think I could do the shot justice.  You did it and then some!  Congrats.</td>', 'A wilted or dried flower was one of my choices (on a checklist of 5 possble items.  I didn''t think I could do the shot justice.  You did it and then some!  Congrats.', '2002-08-05 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
