(99617, 4086, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and the overall "feel" of this shot, but the close up is almost too overwhelming for me - it just gives me an odd feeling.  Love the color. lhall</td>', 'I like the composition, and the overall "feel" of this shot, but the close up is almost too overwhelming for me - it just gives me an odd feeling.  Love the color. lhall', '2002-08-05 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
