(99645, 4087, 1202, '<td valign="top">There are so many different lines going every which way it becomes confusing.   You found an interesting subject and if you had worked with it to straighten up the distracting bars etc, it would have been nice.   Is it raining?   If so maybe you could have worked that to your advantage.   Autool</td>', 'There are so many different lines going every which way it becomes confusing.   You found an interesting subject and if you had worked with it to straighten up the distracting bars etc, it would have been nice.   Is it raining?   If so maybe you could have worked that to your advantage.   Autool', '2002-08-06 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
