(99647, 4087, 2937, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. I really can feel the rain. How nice to see the rain drops and the reflections on the metal. Well done!</td>', 'Very nice picture. I really can feel the rain. How nice to see the rain drops and the reflections on the metal. Well done!', '2002-08-07 04:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99648, 4087, 3112, '<td valign="top">Picture is slightly overexposed, enhancing video-like artifacts. Good idea, though. Shallower DOF would take the house in the background out of focus, enhancing attention on the broken toy.</td>', 'Picture is slightly overexposed, enhancing video-like artifacts. Good idea, though. Shallower DOF would take the house in the background out of focus, enhancing attention on the broken toy.', '2002-08-07 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99649, 4087, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the idea - composition within the frame could be improved - wonder if you could move your position to get rid of the blue house in the background? And to show all of the top of the frame?</td>', 'Love the idea - composition within the frame could be improved - wonder if you could move your position to get rid of the blue house in the background? And to show all of the top of the frame?', '2002-08-07 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
