(99651, 4087, 917, '<td valign="top">I want to like this, but I think the background comes to the fore a bit too much. The focus seems to be the shiny ring, right at the bottom of the picture, rather than the broken support as you intended.</td>', 'I want to like this, but I think the background comes to the fore a bit too much. The focus seems to be the shiny ring, right at the bottom of the picture, rather than the broken support as you intended.', '2002-08-08 06:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
