(99661, 4091, 1944, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject, but the key lighting is too dim. Unfortunatly, if you brightened it you would blow out the highlights. Next time, a lighter color backdrop would soak up less light, and for a subject like this, you might put a gauze curtain in front of the light source to soften the light and hold down hot spots some.</td>', 'An interesting subject, but the key lighting is too dim. Unfortunatly, if you brightened it you would blow out the highlights. Next time, a lighter color backdrop would soak up less light, and for a subject like this, you might put a gauze curtain in front of the light source to soften the light and hold down hot spots some.', '2002-08-05 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99662, 4091, 3099, '<td valign="top">boring.</td>', 'boring.', '2002-08-06 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
