(99669, 4091, 3149, '<td valign="top">I have always liked old firehouse equipment.  I can''t tell if the darkness was on purpose or not.  Nice subject choice.</td>', 'I have always liked old firehouse equipment.  I can''t tell if the darkness was on purpose or not.  Nice subject choice.', '2002-08-09 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99670, 4091, 811, '<td valign="top">I think a different perspective, like maybe closer and from the bottom, would really make this item stand out more.  It''s really cool looking, though, and you have lit it well to keep dominant shadows away and still show some details.  Reflective surfaces are a bear.  If you figure out how to do it with out glare, please, let me know. karmat</td>', 'I think a different perspective, like maybe closer and from the bottom, would really make this item stand out more.  It''s really cool looking, though, and you have lit it well to keep dominant shadows away and still show some details.  Reflective surfaces are a bear.  If you figure out how to do it with out glare, please, let me know. karmat', '2002-08-09 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99671, 4091, 656, '<td valign="top">Lighting could be improved, overall seems quite dark and flat.  Probably needs more diffuse light to minimise reflections</td>', 'Lighting could be improved, overall seems quite dark and flat.  Probably needs more diffuse light to minimise reflections', '2002-08-11 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
