(99681, 4092, 2667, '<td valign="top">i see two major problems with this photo. the first is the lighting, it is just a bit too dark to get any detail in the walls. the second is the composition.  the straight-on... "here''s a picture of an old house" look just doesn''t interest me visually. the subject matter meets the challenge, it just wasnt presented in a very engaging manner.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...3<br/>Meets Challenge...5<br/>Overall...4</td>', 'i see two major problems with this photo. the first is the lighting, it is just a bit too dark to get any detail in the walls. the second is the composition.  the straight-on... "here''s a picture of an old house" look just doesn''t interest me visually. the subject matter meets the challenge, it just wasnt presented in a very engaging manner.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...3Meets Challenge...5Overall...4', '2002-08-05 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
