(99688, 4092, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the softer focus, generally, but I think a little sharper focus might have shown the details better.  Also, I think you need to be a little closer, so that it fills up the frame more. karmat</td>', 'I like the softer focus, generally, but I think a little sharper focus might have shown the details better.  Also, I think you need to be a little closer, so that it fills up the frame more. karmat', '2002-08-06 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99689, 4092, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but I would like to see your composition follow the thirds rule here as well as more exposure.   If the building were offset to one side and the bricks exposed more to bring them out in your picture it would be sooo much nicer.   Autool</td>', 'Nice subject, but I would like to see your composition follow the thirds rule here as well as more exposure.   If the building were offset to one side and the bricks exposed more to bring them out in your picture it would be sooo much nicer.   Autool', '2002-08-06 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
