  awards (10) Can''t find fault...<br/></td>', 'Great picture.  Always, the piano associates itself with the great masters of the past, Rachmaninoff, Shostakovich, Elton John :)This picture works for me, it SCORES (On No  really bad pun alert) well.  It''s well lit, it''s a really well COMPOSED (forget it, I didn''t mean it like that) and overall, it''s one of my Best in Show shots  awards (10) Can''t find fault...', '2002-08-06 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
