(99834, 4102, 772, '<td valign="top">these old toy cars like this one fascinate me... I had some as a child but didn''t manage to save any of them.  This one is in remarkably good shape... i guess this is about 50 or 60 years old maybe?  i like your composition as well... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'these old toy cars like this one fascinate me... I had some as a child but didn''t manage to save any of them.  This one is in remarkably good shape... i guess this is about 50 or 60 years old maybe?  i like your composition as well... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99835, 4102, 3183, '<td valign="top">I love your work. Thank you so much for my photograph. I had a frame that is perfect for it. And thanks for referring me to this website. I am now eyeing my dad''s digital with a renewed interest, haha! Love you.<br/>Bridget</td>', 'I love your work. Thank you so much for my photograph. I had a frame that is perfect for it. And thanks for referring me to this website. I am now eyeing my dad''s digital with a renewed interest, haha! Love you.Bridget', '2002-08-09 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
