(99845, 4104, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting perspective of an old watch... I think the off centering of the subject works very well here... I believe that the only improvement that I could suggest for this subject would be a smooth textured background.  The background that you have is not bad, but a smooth background would possibly enhance the overall impact of the image by removing the ''texture'' constrasts from the non-subject area of the photo... - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an interesting perspective of an old watch... I think the off centering of the subject works very well here... I believe that the only improvement that I could suggest for this subject would be a smooth textured background.  The background that you have is not bad, but a smooth background would possibly enhance the overall impact of the image by removing the ''texture'' constrasts from the non-subject area of the photo... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99846, 4104, 2472, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the cropping of this picture. I am grateful that you didn''t fall for the B&amp;W cliché for this challenge. I belive the ticker is at 12:12...</td>', 'I like the subject and the cropping of this picture. I am grateful that you didn''t fall for the B&W cliché for this challenge. I belive the ticker is at 12:12...', '2002-08-05 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
