(99874, 4105, 2148, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, unfortunately I don''t go a whole lot on photo''s that rely on the title to get the idea across (personal thing). Would it have stood without the title? Hmmm, don''t know. Anyhow, the fact that the legs go right off the edge of the frame ruin the composition. Not sure how to have done it but, tighter lighting on the feet and getting rid of the twigs etc would have made a better shot for me - lamedos</td>', 'Very good idea, unfortunately I don''t go a whole lot on photo''s that rely on the title to get the idea across (personal thing). Would it have stood without the title? Hmmm, don''t know. Anyhow, the fact that the legs go right off the edge of the frame ruin the composition. Not sure how to have done it but, tighter lighting on the feet and getting rid of the twigs etc would have made a better shot for me - lamedos', '2002-08-06 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99875, 4105, 1202, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but there is quite a difference between those wrinkles and the old ones.   The bits of grass etc. is very distracting.   In my opinion, Autool</td>', 'Sorry, but there is quite a difference between those wrinkles and the old ones.   The bits of grass etc. is very distracting.   In my opinion, Autool', '2002-08-06 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
