(99880, 4105, 2928, '<td valign="top">A great idea, well taken  put me right off my burger  B&amp;W would make this I think; in colour it''s too graphic and makes it look like the feet have just been in water for a few hours.  (5) Sorry about the low mark, it''s technically a really top shot, but because the flaw (in my opinion) makes it look like the effects of water rather than age I don''t think the challenge has been met effectively</td>', 'A great idea, well taken  put me right off my burger  B&W would make this I think; in colour it''s too graphic and makes it look like the feet have just been in water for a few hours.  (5) Sorry about the low mark, it''s technically a really top shot, but because the flaw (in my opinion) makes it look like the effects of water rather than age I don''t think the challenge has been met effectively', '2002-08-07 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99881, 4105, 1005, '<td valign="top">Yet another cute title twist attempting to slide into the challenge.  Without the title, I KNOW the wrinkles are from water soaking, with the title, I offer you a twisted little smile.  It''s a fine shot, well focused, nice lighting, but the best I can offer you is a 5.  Swash</td>', 'Yet another cute title twist attempting to slide into the challenge.  Without the title, I KNOW the wrinkles are from water soaking, with the title, I offer you a twisted little smile.  It''s a fine shot, well focused, nice lighting, but the best I can offer you is a 5.  Swash', '2002-08-07 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
