(99892, 4105, 1042, '<td valign="top">I think it was a good idea Tom...I don''t get all the "disgusting" and "nasty" comments. His feet are wrinkled..."before his time" means old before his time...it''s just a play on words/subject matter. I don''t get folks...lol. I think it a different view of the challenge and you did a fine job. I can''t believe that people actually leave comments like this....is this helpful? constructive? oh well...to each his own, huh?  good luck in the future.<br/><br/>:O)</td>', 'I think it was a good idea Tom...I don''t get all the "disgusting" and "nasty" comments. His feet are wrinkled..."before his time" means old before his time...it''s just a play on words/subject matter. I don''t get folks...lol. I think it a different view of the challenge and you did a fine job. I can''t believe that people actually leave comments like this....is this helpful? constructive? oh well...to each his own, huh?  good luck in the future.:O)', '2002-08-21 05:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
