 The glare on the engraved plate detracts for the quality, perhaps a change of lighting would have made this a winner (8)</td>', 'This is a really good picture, liked it overall The glare on the engraved plate detracts for the quality, perhaps a change of lighting would have made this a winner (8)', '2002-08-07 05:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
