(99931, 4108, 2649, '<td valign="top">I like you photo.  I thought about doing something like this.  Now, I''m glad I did not.  Your''s is much better, and the gun is older :-)</td>', 'I like you photo.  I thought about doing something like this.  Now, I''m glad I did not.  Your''s is much better, and the gun is older :-)', '2002-08-08 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
