(99939, 4108, 2172, '<td valign="top">Good Photo.  Good composition and execution of the black background.  Focus is good.  I like the subject.  Good display of the rust and teh other textures.  8<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Good Photo.  Good composition and execution of the black background.  Focus is good.  I like the subject.  Good display of the rust and teh other textures.  8Ruthann', '2002-08-10 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99940, 4108, 2661, '<td valign="top">this I like. terriffic lighting, great colors, great composition. the only thing I would try to fix is the glare off the stock. other than that, excellent photo!</td>', 'this I like. terriffic lighting, great colors, great composition. the only thing I would try to fix is the glare off the stock. other than that, excellent photo!', '2002-08-11 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99941, 4108, 2829, '<td valign="top">A high quality shot. Great focus - you can even see the texture of the trigger. Great lighting too.</td>', 'A high quality shot. Great focus - you can even see the texture of the trigger. Great lighting too.', '2002-08-11 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99942, 4108, 2003, '<td valign="top">My dad''s shotgun - his dad''s before that - couldn''t say when the last time it was fired (not in my lifetime of 48 years) - now I have no idea where the firing pins are</td>', 'My dad''s shotgun - his dad''s before that - couldn''t say when the last time it was fired (not in my lifetime of 48 years) - now I have no idea where the firing pins are', '2002-08-25 05:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(99943, 4109, 2170, '<td valign="top">Cher has a glare.  Nice idea.</td>', 'Cher has a glare.  Nice idea.', '2002-08-05 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99944, 4109, 2172, '<td valign="top">I''m being blunt - it''s flat.  I''m sure this has meaning to you, but it doesn''t do much for me.  I see: a ''snapshot'' of album covers, ever so slightly arranged.  I understand the idea.  The photo needs a little more depth.  What I like about photos is the 2 dimension.  I would suggest adding something else that is not flat.  The focus is pretty good - but did you try different DOFs?  There isn''t something particular to see, that really draws the eye to.  Don''t be offended - just keep going.  4<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I''m being blunt - it''s flat.  I''m sure this has meaning to you, but it doesn''t do much for me.  I see: a ''snapshot'' of album covers, ever so slightly arranged.  I understand the idea.  The photo needs a little more depth.  What I like about photos is the 2 dimension.  I would suggest adding something else that is not flat.  The focus is pretty good - but did you try different DOFs?  There isn''t something particular to see, that really draws the eye to.  Don''t be offended - just keep going.  4Ruthann', '2002-08-05 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99945, 4109, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - ok. Needs light?<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - ok. Needs light?', '2002-08-05 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99946, 4109, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting collection :)  the image looks slightly grainy... the lighting may need a minor improvement to make the image punch harder... - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting collection :)  the image looks slightly grainy... the lighting may need a minor improvement to make the image punch harder... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99947, 4109, 2752, '<td valign="top">nice collage and your dullness adds to the age</td>', 'nice collage and your dullness adds to the age', '2002-08-07 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99948, 4109, 2204, '<td valign="top">This collage sure brings back some memories.....the technical quality could be better....less fuzzy and less lens flare.</td>', 'This collage sure brings back some memories.....the technical quality could be better....less fuzzy and less lens flare.', '2002-08-07 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99949, 4109, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is an OLD collection!  This is an interesting concept.  The CHER album is still too glossy and reflects light back (sad).  Frank''s album seems grainy and dark.  You also got some glare on the EArly Hits Of 1964.  The Best of Bread seems like it came through the best, but is mostly obsured.  Think you used about the right number of LP covers, but need to work on the lighting/exposure issues.<br/>6 Swash</td>', 'Wow, this is an OLD collection!  This is an interesting concept.  The CHER album is still too glossy and reflects light back (sad).  Frank''s album seems grainy and dark.  You also got some glare on the EArly Hits Of 1964.  The Best of Bread seems like it came through the best, but is mostly obsured.  Think you used about the right number of LP covers, but need to work on the lighting/exposure issues.6 Swash', '2002-08-07 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99950, 4109, 3112, '<td valign="top">Theme is a little forced with the obvious centered date.  reflection on the Cher cover is unfortunate.</td>', 'Theme is a little forced with the obvious centered date.  reflection on the Cher cover is unfortunate.', '2002-08-09 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99951, 4109, 2, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great subject for the challenge, but the lighting is very weak.</td>', 'I think this is a great subject for the challenge, but the lighting is very weak.', '2002-08-12 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99952, 4110, 3020, '<td valign="top">Nice, looking at this makes me think of time come and gone. I can also almost see the workers coming and going, and then slowly fading away. It is a little dark, and hard to make out on the bottom, but still overall quite nice.<br/></td>', 'Nice, looking at this makes me think of time come and gone. I can also almost see the workers coming and going, and then slowly fading away. It is a little dark, and hard to make out on the bottom, but still overall quite nice.', '2002-08-05 03:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99953, 4110, 1362, '<td valign="top">Wow! It''s so deep, like the darkness represents the twilight of the coal age!</td>', 'Wow! It''s so deep, like the darkness represents the twilight of the coal age!', '2002-08-05 03:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99954, 4110, 2780, '<td valign="top">its nice, but i find it a little bit too dark.</td>', 'its nice, but i find it a little bit too dark.', '2002-08-05 04:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99955, 4110, 1485, '<td valign="top">would have been much better had this not been so dark.  its between silhouette and detail.</td>', 'would have been much better had this not been so dark.  its between silhouette and detail.', '2002-08-05 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99956, 4110, 2011, '<td valign="top">A little dark at the bottom</td>', 'A little dark at the bottom', '2002-08-05 09:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99957, 4110, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Focus is good.  Looks a bit dark.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Focus is good.  Looks a bit dark.', '2002-08-05 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99958, 4110, 2170, '<td valign="top">I love the sky in this.  I bet the uncompressed version has great detail on the building.</td>', 'I love the sky in this.  I bet the uncompressed version has great detail on the building.', '2002-08-05 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99959, 4110, 1019, '<td valign="top">I like this composition--very strong--good contrasts--nice flash of blue above</td>', 'I like this composition--very strong--good contrasts--nice flash of blue above', '2002-08-05 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99960, 4110, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice subject idea.  I would have liked it more if the large building wasn''t almost dead center, and it is also a little dark for my taste. lhall</td>', 'Nice subject idea.  I would have liked it more if the large building wasn''t almost dead center, and it is also a little dark for my taste. lhall', '2002-08-05 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99961, 4110, 1143, '<td valign="top">love the dark, overcast sky and mood. nice angle. almost like a painting</td>', 'love the dark, overcast sky and mood. nice angle. almost like a painting', '2002-08-05 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99962, 4110, 2352, '<td valign="top">The subject matter is good, but a better time of day for better lighting is a must...</td>', 'The subject matter is good, but a better time of day for better lighting is a must...', '2002-08-05 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99963, 4110, 3077, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes here, but I wish the foreground had been a bit lighter.</td>', 'I like the shapes here, but I wish the foreground had been a bit lighter.', '2002-08-06 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99964, 4110, 1041, '<td valign="top">this image looks very dark on my computer, i can barely make out the detail on the right side of the building and the bottom is pretty much black for me.  the building was a good subject to pick, but i''m not to thrilled with its placement right in the middle of the shot.  maybe more too one side ... -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'this image looks very dark on my computer, i can barely make out the detail on the right side of the building and the bottom is pretty much black for me.  the building was a good subject to pick, but i''m not to thrilled with its placement right in the middle of the shot.  maybe more too one side ... -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-08-06 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99965, 4110, 2983, '<td valign="top">The building seems under exposed, and my attention drifts to the sky.  This is probably because you shot the shady side, and the camera''s auto exposure metered to the sky.  You can bump it up a stop or two or use post-processing to correct it.</td>', 'The building seems under exposed, and my attention drifts to the sky.  This is probably because you shot the shady side, and the camera''s auto exposure metered to the sky.  You can bump it up a stop or two or use post-processing to correct it.', '2002-08-06 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99966, 4110, 2217, '<td valign="top">Pity about the darkness at the bottom, perhaps it could have been cropped more.  Otherwise I like it very much.</td>', 'Pity about the darkness at the bottom, perhaps it could have been cropped more.  Otherwise I like it very much.', '2002-08-06 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99967, 4110, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the way the angles lead my eyes from left ot right, and the colors in the sky are really nice.  It is a little dark for me in the foreground, though.  I feel like I am missing some nice details.  karmat</td>', 'I like the way the angles lead my eyes from left ot right, and the colors in the sky are really nice.  It is a little dark for me in the foreground, though.  I feel like I am missing some nice details.  karmat', '2002-08-06 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99968, 4110, 3099, '<td valign="top">a little too dark, unfortunately.</td>', 'a little too dark, unfortunately.', '2002-08-06 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99969, 4110, 3105, '<td valign="top">Very strong foreground.  I think the photo really benefits from the building and related structures being thrown into shadow against the bright cloudy sky.  The strong lines of the middle building and the diagonals of the ramp really hold my attention.  Great job.</td>', 'Very strong foreground.  I think the photo really benefits from the building and related structures being thrown into shadow against the bright cloudy sky.  The strong lines of the middle building and the diagonals of the ramp really hold my attention.  Great job.', '2002-08-06 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99970, 4110, 3035, '<td valign="top">subject is excellent - exposure detracts from this fine selection</td>', 'subject is excellent - exposure detracts from this fine selection', '2002-08-06 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99971, 4110, 2752, '<td valign="top">composition is good as is the subject..I think a duller sky would work</td>', 'composition is good as is the subject..I think a duller sky would work', '2002-08-06 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99972, 4110, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice pseudo-silhouette. Great sky. Looks like you had to do a little processing to get the detail visible enough. Works for me.</td>', 'Nice pseudo-silhouette. Great sky. Looks like you had to do a little processing to get the detail visible enough. Works for me.', '2002-08-07 06:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99973, 4110, 3147, '<td valign="top">beautiful contrast between the building and the sky</td>', 'beautiful contrast between the building and the sky', '2002-08-07 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99974, 4110, 3016, '<td valign="top">a little more light in the foreground</td>', 'a little more light in the foreground', '2002-08-07 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99975, 4110, 772, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting scene, but I think that some more light in the foreground would possibly make it stand out more :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is an interesting scene, but I think that some more light in the foreground would possibly make it stand out more :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99976, 4110, 1005, '<td valign="top">Seems so very dark, were you going for a gloomy effect?  I think I should be glad this is an old power station, it looks like a coal burner.  Foreground almost completely gone.  On the other hand, I like the sky part.  6 Swash</td>', 'Seems so very dark, were you going for a gloomy effect?  I think I should be glad this is an old power station, it looks like a coal burner.  Foreground almost completely gone.  On the other hand, I like the sky part.  6 Swash', '2002-08-08 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99977, 4110, 2279, '<td valign="top">just a little too dark for my taste</td>', 'just a little too dark for my taste', '2002-08-09 03:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99978, 4110, 806, '<td valign="top">If you angle the camera and posiiton the bulk of the building further right, I think the ramp-like structure would lead the eye into the photo, and create a neat diagonal line. I do like, however, how the wirey structure on the right forms a silouette, and I''m not trying to be a "rule of thirds" stickler, just wondering if the right part of the photo is needed as it really is made up of a lot of non-descript boxy structures. Love the sky.</td>', 'If you angle the camera and posiiton the bulk of the building further right, I think the ramp-like structure would lead the eye into the photo, and create a neat diagonal line. I do like, however, how the wirey structure on the right forms a silouette, and I''m not trying to be a "rule of thirds" stickler, just wondering if the right part of the photo is needed as it really is made up of a lot of non-descript boxy structures. Love the sky.', '2002-08-09 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99979, 4110, 3112, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  Underexposed for the subject.</td>', 'Great subject.  Underexposed for the subject.', '2002-08-09 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99980, 4110, 2618, '<td valign="top">What little sky is visible is an impressive colour, but the foreground is just too dark.</td>', 'What little sky is visible is an impressive colour, but the foreground is just too dark.', '2002-08-10 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99981, 4110, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - good. I''d also like to see a version in B&amp;W with sun in front.<br/>Meets Challenge - probably. Don''t confuse old with unused.<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - good. I''d also like to see a version in B&W with sun in front.Meets Challenge - probably. Don''t confuse old with unused.Visual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-10 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99982, 4110, 2221, '<td valign="top">Nice photo! I like the lighting. With the bright background the building is almost only a silhouette. It has enough light to show the rusty surface but not too much so that too much unimportant details in the bottom area are revealed.<br/>Maybe off-centering the subject and moving the camera to the left would have made it even more effective.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Nice photo! I like the lighting. With the bright background the building is almost only a silhouette. It has enough light to show the rusty surface but not too much so that too much unimportant details in the bottom area are revealed.Maybe off-centering the subject and moving the camera to the left would have made it even more effective.-stephan', '2002-08-10 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99983, 4110, 2661, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot! the sky is very dramatic, and I love the colors and composition. are you sure it''s a power station? looks like a grain elevator or something.</td>', 'beautiful shot! the sky is very dramatic, and I love the colors and composition. are you sure it''s a power station? looks like a grain elevator or something.', '2002-08-11 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99984, 4110, 637, '<td valign="top">Great colors, lighting, subject.  I like this one alot.  7 sjgleah</td>', 'Great colors, lighting, subject.  I like this one alot.  7 sjgleah', '2002-08-11 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99985, 4111, 3094, '<td valign="top">Great subject.</td>', 'Great subject.', '2002-08-05 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99986, 4111, 2798, '<td valign="top">I realise there''s little you can do about it but the framing of this picture is spoiled a little by the excessive foliage in the bottom right of the shot. The overhanging branches at the top are good. Perhaps if you''d crouched down you could have minimised the foliage at the bottom and had the rampart more central in the frame. Otherwise it''s a suitably old looking subject. The light is a little lacking though.</td>', 'I realise there''s little you can do about it but the framing of this picture is spoiled a little by the excessive foliage in the bottom right of the shot. The overhanging branches at the top are good. Perhaps if you''d crouched down you could have minimised the foliage at the bottom and had the rampart more central in the frame. Otherwise it''s a suitably old looking subject. The light is a little lacking though.', '2002-08-05 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99987, 4111, 2928, '<td valign="top">Spooky - meets the challenge... Nice shot. It makes me curious - and I like that - about what it''s like to go inside the building itself... (7) My only fault - but I do know how hard it is with the limited image size - is shapness...</td>', 'Spooky - meets the challenge... Nice shot. It makes me curious - and I like that - about what it''s like to go inside the building itself... (7) My only fault - but I do know how hard it is with the limited image size - is shapness...', '2002-08-05 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99988, 4111, 2170, '<td valign="top">nice!</td>', 'nice!', '2002-08-05 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99989, 4111, 2752, '<td valign="top">good composition and play of textures...could be a little lighter.</td>', 'good composition and play of textures...could be a little lighter.', '2002-08-06 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99990, 4111, 2983, '<td valign="top">I love the color and overall feeling expressed here.</td>', 'I love the color and overall feeling expressed here.', '2002-08-06 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99991, 4111, 2172, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very very much.  I feel as if I''ve been walking through the woods and just came across this very old building - it looks like entry gates to something or other.  The angle and composition is very effective.  The focus and lighting are also great.  This is a Framer!   Great work.  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I like this photo very very much.  I feel as if I''ve been walking through the woods and just came across this very old building - it looks like entry gates to something or other.  The angle and composition is very effective.  The focus and lighting are also great.  This is a Framer!   Great work.  9Ruthann', '2002-08-06 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99992, 4111, 3105, '<td valign="top">This has a nice tranquil mood to it with the saturated greens and diffused lighting.  My eyes follow the subject throughout the entire frame letting me take in everything.  Excellent.</td>', 'This has a nice tranquil mood to it with the saturated greens and diffused lighting.  My eyes follow the subject throughout the entire frame letting me take in everything.  Excellent.', '2002-08-06 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99993, 4111, 1041, '<td valign="top">this is a pretty cool old building, i like the angle you chose and how the plants frame your photo.  -- gr8photos (6)</td>', 'this is a pretty cool old building, i like the angle you chose and how the plants frame your photo.  -- gr8photos (6)', '2002-08-06 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99994, 4111, 811, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a great job of moving the eyes from the left to the right.  good focus and detail.  my only tiny suggetion would be to try and get closer so you could see more of the "decay" details. karmat</td>', 'You''ve done a great job of moving the eyes from the left to the right.  good focus and detail.  my only tiny suggetion would be to try and get closer so you could see more of the "decay" details. karmat', '2002-08-07 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99995, 4111, 3147, '<td valign="top">the foliage really adds to this photo</td>', 'the foliage really adds to this photo', '2002-08-07 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99996, 4111, 3112, '<td valign="top">Very cool subject.  I''d love to know where this was shot.</td>', 'Very cool subject.  I''d love to know where this was shot.', '2002-08-07 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99997, 4111, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting view :)  this looks like some piece of history that has been lost in time and forgotten... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting view :)  this looks like some piece of history that has been lost in time and forgotten... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99998, 4111, 509, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  I like the subject too.  The focus seems a little soft.</td>', 'Great colors!  I like the subject too.  The focus seems a little soft.', '2002-08-10 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(99999, 4111, 656, '<td valign="top">nicely framed</td>', 'nicely framed', '2002-08-11 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100000, 4111, 2661, '<td valign="top">nicely done shot. I like the converging lines of the wall and the placement of the highlighted leaves. very cool.</td>', 'nicely done shot. I like the converging lines of the wall and the placement of the highlighted leaves. very cool.', '2002-08-11 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100001, 4112, 2011, '<td valign="top">Kinda blurry on the top</td>', 'Kinda blurry on the top', '2002-08-05 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100002, 4112, 157, '<td valign="top">this would have been an wesome shot had it not been for the pixelation</td>', 'this would have been an wesome shot had it not been for the pixelation', '2002-08-05 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100003, 4112, 2458, '<td valign="top">Very nice but I would prefer a different angle.  mjl 5</td>', 'Very nice but I would prefer a different angle.  mjl 5', '2002-08-05 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100004, 4112, 2123, '<td valign="top">Great old truck!  This seems a bit light to me, though</td>', 'Great old truck!  This seems a bit light to me, though', '2002-08-05 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100005, 4112, 1856, '<td valign="top">A little too blurry and overexposed to me.  Was that intentional? Lisa</td>', 'A little too blurry and overexposed to me.  Was that intentional? Lisa', '2002-08-05 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100006, 4112, 2200, '<td valign="top">that''s not retired. It''s dead.</td>', 'that''s not retired. It''s dead.', '2002-08-05 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100007, 4112, 2466, '<td valign="top">whites are too bright, s ee pixels showing, compostion lacks a strong focus</td>', 'whites are too bright, s ee pixels showing, compostion lacks a strong focus', '2002-08-05 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100008, 4112, 1041, '<td valign="top">the idea is good, the composition, too, but the picture quality could be better IMO.  the photo seems a little pixelated (even though your file size is fine, so i don''t know whether it''s the camera or any of the post processing you did).  overall, the photo is too bright, there are some large blown out areas (posts in the foreground, sky, bits on the truck) and a little more contrast would be better IMO, too. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'the idea is good, the composition, too, but the picture quality could be better IMO.  the photo seems a little pixelated (even though your file size is fine, so i don''t know whether it''s the camera or any of the post processing you did).  overall, the photo is too bright, there are some large blown out areas (posts in the foreground, sky, bits on the truck) and a little more contrast would be better IMO, too. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-08-05 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100009, 4112, 2907, '<td valign="top">Either you have over sharpened or over compressed this image... or maybe you have a Fijifilm Super CCD?</td>', 'Either you have over sharpened or over compressed this image... or maybe you have a Fijifilm Super CCD?', '2002-08-05 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100010, 4112, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great picture, but the over white area on the right takes away from the overall feel of age. (6)</td>', 'Great picture, but the over white area on the right takes away from the overall feel of age. (6)', '2002-08-05 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100011, 4112, 1143, '<td valign="top">might work better as a vertical crop</td>', 'might work better as a vertical crop', '2002-08-05 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100012, 4112, 1189, '<td valign="top">good, the picture even looks old :-) a little out of focus isn''t it?</td>', 'good, the picture even looks old :-) a little out of focus isn''t it?', '2002-08-06 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100013, 4112, 2798, '<td valign="top">Woo - great subject! Your picture is a little over exposed in places and I think perhaps you could have moved a little to minimise the impact of the vertical beams towards the right. But this is one of the few photos where I think sepia tone has helped it. Well done.</td>', 'Woo - great subject! Your picture is a little over exposed in places and I think perhaps you could have moved a little to minimise the impact of the vertical beams towards the right. But this is one of the few photos where I think sepia tone has helped it. Well done.', '2002-08-06 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100014, 4112, 3044, '<td valign="top">cool subject matter. nice composition. too soft and the whites are too blown out. maybe that was intended.</td>', 'cool subject matter. nice composition. too soft and the whites are too blown out. maybe that was intended.', '2002-08-06 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100015, 4112, 2752, '<td valign="top">composition good..color good..could be sharper.</td>', 'composition good..color good..could be sharper.', '2002-08-06 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100016, 4112, 2261, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but over exposed!</td>', 'Nice shot but over exposed!', '2002-08-06 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100017, 4112, 2932, '<td valign="top">seems to lack sharpness and suffer from over-exposure.  right 1/3 of picture is wasted -- perhaps a vertical crop would have been more to your advantage</td>', 'seems to lack sharpness and suffer from over-exposure.  right 1/3 of picture is wasted -- perhaps a vertical crop would have been more to your advantage', '2002-08-08 04:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100018, 4112, 772, '<td valign="top">this is an excellent comcept, but the photo is very pixellated... soft focus is ok on ''old'' shots but the jagged edges here are quite distracting.. - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is an excellent comcept, but the photo is very pixellated... soft focus is ok on ''old'' shots but the jagged edges here are quite distracting.. - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100019, 4112, 917, '<td valign="top">Far too many compression effects, this looks like its been transmitted by fax.</td>', 'Far too many compression effects, this looks like its been transmitted by fax.', '2002-08-09 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100020, 4112, 806, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, good composition, but the artifacts in this shot take away from it... i.e. the compression or over enhanced? Dunno, but it''s not sharp or clear. The brights are too bright, and the shadows look muddy. Maybe alot of this happened with the compression?</td>', 'Nice subject, good composition, but the artifacts in this shot take away from it... i.e. the compression or over enhanced? Dunno, but it''s not sharp or clear. The brights are too bright, and the shadows look muddy. Maybe alot of this happened with the compression?', '2002-08-09 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100021, 4112, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  Unfortunate JPEG problem in resizing.  Sepiatone makes for "forced" notion of oldness, when the suject produces this feeling itself.  Good effort.</td>', 'Good subject.  Unfortunate JPEG problem in resizing.  Sepiatone makes for "forced" notion of oldness, when the suject produces this feeling itself.  Good effort.', '2002-08-09 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100022, 4112, 2618, '<td valign="top">This looks like the original was only 320x200. It''s all blocky and pixellated :-(.</td>', 'This looks like the original was only 320x200. It''s all blocky and pixellated :-(.', '2002-08-10 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100023, 4112, 656, '<td valign="top">looks it its suffered from compression a bit.  The support in the middle right is in the way</td>', 'looks it its suffered from compression a bit.  The support in the middle right is in the way', '2002-08-11 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100024, 4113, 2815, '<td valign="top">If she were real she could be in Playboy</td>', 'If she were real she could be in Playboy', '2002-08-05 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100025, 4113, 2466, '<td valign="top">If you increased the saturation on the foliage, it might make the statue stand out in contrast even more.</td>', 'If you increased the saturation on the foliage, it might make the statue stand out in contrast even more.', '2002-08-05 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100026, 4113, 2752, '<td valign="top">very nice..good composition and the framing of the folliage is great.</td>', 'very nice..good composition and the framing of the folliage is great.', '2002-08-06 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100027, 4113, 2148, '<td valign="top">Like this. Purely personal, but maybe slightly tighter cropped and slightly less central? - lamedos</td>', 'Like this. Purely personal, but maybe slightly tighter cropped and slightly less central? - lamedos', '2002-08-06 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100028, 4113, 811, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a representation of Eve in the Garden of Eden.  Well taken. karmat</td>', 'Reminds me of a representation of Eve in the Garden of Eden.  Well taken. karmat', '2002-08-06 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100029, 4113, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful setting, nicely captured.  Good focus/framing/composition.  (Tasteful leaf coverage!)  9 Swash</td>', 'This is a beautiful setting, nicely captured.  Good focus/framing/composition.  (Tasteful leaf coverage!)  9 Swash', '2002-08-06 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100030, 4113, 2798, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of subject. Nicely framed by the bushes. Looks like it was taken with all natural light. Im wondering if a light fill-in flash might have focussed the eye more firmly on the statue.</td>', 'Excellent choice of subject. Nicely framed by the bushes. Looks like it was taken with all natural light. Im wondering if a light fill-in flash might have focussed the eye more firmly on the statue.', '2002-08-07 05:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100031, 4113, 2928, '<td valign="top">I really like this one; lighting gives it a summery look.  It also has a mellow, angelic relaxing feel to it Age didn''t come across that well, but I think the picture still deserves a good mark. Nice job (8)</td>', 'I really like this one; lighting gives it a summery look.  It also has a mellow, angelic relaxing feel to it Age didn''t come across that well, but I think the picture still deserves a good mark. Nice job (8)', '2002-08-07 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100032, 4113, 917, '<td valign="top">Its good, but the foliage needs to be greener. Try stopping down a bit.</td>', 'Its good, but the foliage needs to be greener. Try stopping down a bit.', '2002-08-07 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100033, 4113, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice capture of old.  i like how the statue is framed by the leaves, but not much obscured.  -- gr8photos (8)</td>', 'nice capture of old.  i like how the statue is framed by the leaves, but not much obscured.  -- gr8photos (8)', '2002-08-07 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100034, 4113, 2933, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!  Shows style.</td>', 'This is beautiful!  Shows style.', '2002-08-07 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
