(100036, 4113, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice... i think I would have zoomed in a little closer or possibly moved the statue to the right in the frame just a little... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice... i think I would have zoomed in a little closer or possibly moved the statue to the right in the frame just a little... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100037, 4113, 2389, '<td valign="top">perfect placement of the leaves :)</td>', 'perfect placement of the leaves :)', '2002-08-09 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100038, 4113, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good technical photo.  Good execution of theme.</td>', 'Good technical photo.  Good execution of theme.', '2002-08-09 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100039, 4113, 2618, '<td valign="top">She could do with a bath though!</td>', 'She could do with a bath though!', '2002-08-10 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100040, 4113, 2221, '<td valign="top">I like how the statue is hidden in the bushes. Maybe an inteded underexposure would have created more contrast between the statue and the surrounding. Different light (sunset!) also can make a photo much more interesting and dramatic.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'I like how the statue is hidden in the bushes. Maybe an inteded underexposure would have created more contrast between the statue and the surrounding. Different light (sunset!) also can make a photo much more interesting and dramatic.-stephan', '2002-08-11 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100041, 4113, 2456, '<td valign="top">Hey, I really like this picture, contrast between the gray of the statue and the green around her. Nice capture of the subject...!</td>', 'Hey, I really like this picture, contrast between the gray of the statue and the green around her. Nice capture of the subject...!', '2002-08-11 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100042, 4114, 1569, '<td valign="top">The exposure needs a little help here,the lemon is really washed out.</td>', 'The exposure needs a little help here,the lemon is really washed out.', '2002-08-05 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100043, 4114, 2221, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but when you want to show the bowl why did you add the lemon, the knife and the salad on top of it? It''s a bit too much for my taste. Especially the bright yellow lemon.<br/>Also this photo if very blurred and looks like it has a bad jpeg compression.<br/>Colors and lighting are nice and it could have been a good photo.<br/></td>', 'Nice idea, but when you want to show the bowl why did you add the lemon, the knife and the salad on top of it? It''s a bit too much for my taste. Especially the bright yellow lemon.Also this photo if very blurred and looks like it has a bad jpeg compression.Colors and lighting are nice and it could have been a good photo.', '2002-08-05 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100044, 4114, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition... the lemon is a ilbble over exposed though... I love wooden bowls and I have a few old ones myself... they just don''t ''look'' old :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a nice composition... the lemon is a ilbble over exposed though... I love wooden bowls and I have a few old ones myself... they just don''t ''look'' old :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-05 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100045, 4114, 2717, '<td valign="top">Is the bowl old?</td>', 'Is the bowl old?', '2002-08-05 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100046, 4114, 1175, '<td valign="top">that lemon appears to be overexposed. I don''t like the knife handle cut off where its cut off.  Otherwise I like the composition.</td>', 'that lemon appears to be overexposed. I don''t like the knife handle cut off where its cut off.  Otherwise I like the composition.', '2002-08-05 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100047, 4114, 2912, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. Shading is great. But it does not fit the challenge, actually.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. Shading is great. But it does not fit the challenge, actually.', '2002-08-06 05:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100048, 4114, 2261, '<td valign="top">Lost some detail on your lemon but otherwise very nice.</td>', 'Lost some detail on your lemon but otherwise very nice.', '2002-08-06 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100049, 4114, 1944, '<td valign="top">Pretty composition:)</td>', 'Pretty composition:)', '2002-08-07 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100050, 4114, 2798, '<td valign="top">Very well titled and lovely lighting. Just a tinge of blurryness about the lemon.</td>', 'Very well titled and lovely lighting. Just a tinge of blurryness about the lemon.', '2002-08-08 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100051, 4114, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good colors.  Other than the title, the photo does not directly keep with the "old" theme.</td>', 'Good colors.  Other than the title, the photo does not directly keep with the "old" theme.', '2002-08-09 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100052, 4114, 811, '<td valign="top">I think looking straight down into this image makes it appear kinda flat.  Also, the light works wonderfully for the leaves/green, but it is a little too much on the lemon, I think. karmat</td>', 'I think looking straight down into this image makes it appear kinda flat.  Also, the light works wonderfully for the leaves/green, but it is a little too much on the lemon, I think. karmat', '2002-08-10 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100053, 4114, 3087, '<td valign="top">I looked at this and asked myself what it represented to me. Mediterranean. Fresh. Salad. Picnic. Lots of things came to mind, but not Something Old. Sorry.</td>', 'I looked at this and asked myself what it represented to me. Mediterranean. Fresh. Salad. Picnic. Lots of things came to mind, but not Something Old. Sorry.', '2002-08-10 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100054, 4114, 2618, '<td valign="top">Odd angle. It gives the impression of having just tripped up and falling head first over the bowl (which makes it a little uncomfortable to look at). Or maybe that''s just me.</td>', 'Odd angle. It gives the impression of having just tripped up and falling head first over the bowl (which makes it a little uncomfortable to look at). Or maybe that''s just me.', '2002-08-10 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100055, 4114, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - not convinced. hard to tell the bowl is old<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - pretty good<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - not convinced. hard to tell the bowl is oldVisual Impact / Originality - pretty good', '2002-08-10 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100056, 4114, 2661, '<td valign="top">great composition, lighting, and colors. the one thing that throws me off is the placement of the knife. it''s nice to have a straight line to interrupt the curves of the photo, but you might experiment with other placements.</td>', 'great composition, lighting, and colors. the one thing that throws me off is the placement of the knife. it''s nice to have a straight line to interrupt the curves of the photo, but you might experiment with other placements.', '2002-08-11 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100057, 4114, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice knife too</td>', 'Nice knife too', '2002-08-12 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100058, 4116, 2466, '<td valign="top">I find the wood too similiar in color and texture to provide a good background.  I''d like a higher contrast.</td>', 'I find the wood too similiar in color and texture to provide a good background.  I''d like a higher contrast.', '2002-08-05 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100059, 4116, 1856, '<td valign="top">I think this may have worked better with some different lighting and maybe less of a vertical position for the key to add interest.  Maybe try hanging the key from a nail to put some space between it and the wood?  Lisa</td>', 'I think this may have worked better with some different lighting and maybe less of a vertical position for the key to add interest.  Maybe try hanging the key from a nail to put some space between it and the wood?  Lisa', '2002-08-05 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100060, 4116, 2170, '<td valign="top">More color contrast would have helped the key stand out.</td>', 'More color contrast would have helped the key stand out.', '2002-08-05 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100061, 4116, 2123, '<td valign="top">My kind of picture. :-) 8</td>', 'My kind of picture. :-) 8', '2002-08-05 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100062, 4116, 2928, '<td valign="top">I love macro - I love the way this looks like a giant key leaning on a door... An unusual method of locking a door.  I have to score it 10 on the grounds that it meets the challenge and not because I''m a macro fan, it''s also a blooming good shot - so I have... It deserves to do well...</td>', 'I love macro - I love the way this looks like a giant key leaning on a door... An unusual method of locking a door.  I have to score it 10 on the grounds that it meets the challenge and not because I''m a macro fan, it''s also a blooming good shot - so I have... It deserves to do well...', '2002-08-05 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
