(100069, 4116, 811, '<td valign="top">i like the way you have captured the detail of the wood and key.  Maybe cropped/framed a little too tightly on the top and bottom.  karmat</td>', 'i like the way you have captured the detail of the wood and key.  Maybe cropped/framed a little too tightly on the top and bottom.  karmat', '2002-08-06 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100070, 4116, 3035, '<td valign="top">nice!</td>', 'nice!', '2002-08-06 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100071, 4116, 2667, '<td valign="top">nice key, i wish the background had provided more of a contrast for it, however.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...6<br/>Meets Challenge...6<br/>overall...6</td>', 'nice key, i wish the background had provided more of a contrast for it, however.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...6Meets Challenge...6overall...6', '2002-08-06 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100072, 4116, 772, '<td valign="top">These old keys like this are really neat :)  This photo does a good job of showing the age of this key and the background works well too.  My only suggestion for possible improvement would be to back up just a tad to allow some breathing room for the key along the edges of the frame... - jmsetzler</td>', 'These old keys like this are really neat :)  This photo does a good job of showing the age of this key and the background works well too.  My only suggestion for possible improvement would be to back up just a tad to allow some breathing room for the key along the edges of the frame... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100073, 4116, 133, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2002-08-07 08:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100074, 4116, 2798, '<td valign="top">Wow - look at the texture on that key. I like the framing too. Light is perhaps a little harsh.</td>', 'Wow - look at the texture on that key. I like the framing too. Light is perhaps a little harsh.', '2002-08-08 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100075, 4116, 2235, '<td valign="top">I like the photo but its a bit static. Need more in the picture to make it interesting</td>', 'I like the photo but its a bit static. Need more in the picture to make it interesting', '2002-08-09 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100076, 4116, 2473, '<td valign="top">nice detail...but the key is a bit too far to left in my eyes.</td>', 'nice detail...but the key is a bit too far to left in my eyes.', '2002-08-09 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100077, 4117, 2575, '<td valign="top">Nice framing !</td>', 'Nice framing !', '2002-08-05 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100078, 4117, 1569, '<td valign="top">The washed out sky is really distracting here.</td>', 'The washed out sky is really distracting here.', '2002-08-05 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100079, 4117, 2466, '<td valign="top">I find the pixelization distracting on an otherwise well composed photo.  Did yu shoot it at a high resolution and resize it for submission or are you shooting this low-res?</td>', 'I find the pixelization distracting on an otherwise well composed photo.  Did yu shoot it at a high resolution and resize it for submission or are you shooting this low-res?', '2002-08-05 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100080, 4117, 1944, '<td valign="top">A very interesting photo. I like your subject a lot. The exposure and sharpness  are right on:) One thing i might add though is it''s nicer to not have your subject looking out of the picture. If you had moved the statue somewhat to the left, there would have been more room for the subject to ''breathe'' and the photo would have been more restfull to look at.</td>', 'A very interesting photo. I like your subject a lot. The exposure and sharpness  are right on:) One thing i might add though is it''s nicer to not have your subject looking out of the picture. If you had moved the statue somewhat to the left, there would have been more room for the subject to ''breathe'' and the photo would have been more restfull to look at.', '2002-08-06 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100081, 4117, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. The framing, the camera angle, and the colouring all work very well for me.</td>', 'Very beautiful. The framing, the camera angle, and the colouring all work very well for me.', '2002-08-06 03:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100082, 4117, 616, '<td valign="top">Nice. The angle you used was perfect, I don''t think an angle from any other position would have looked as good.</td>', 'Nice. The angle you used was perfect, I don''t think an angle from any other position would have looked as good.', '2002-08-06 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100083, 4117, 772, '<td valign="top">I wish I had access to this type of ''culture'' where I live... The US is not a rich source of photographic cultural artifacts such as this one... you have done an excellent job of capturing the feeling of ''old'' in this photograph... good work :) = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I wish I had access to this type of ''culture'' where I live... The US is not a rich source of photographic cultural artifacts such as this one... you have done an excellent job of capturing the feeling of ''old'' in this photograph... good work :) = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100084, 4117, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice choice.  Focus looks good, lighting looks good.  7</td>', 'Nice choice.  Focus looks good, lighting looks good.  7', '2002-08-07 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100085, 4117, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good perspective.</td>', 'Good perspective.', '2002-08-07 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100086, 4117, 2798, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject, angle and framing. Some jaggies under this chap''s chin. Interesting colour choice - almost but not quite sepia. I''m glad it wasnt sepia though. I dont think it would have worked on this shot. Overall I really like it.</td>', 'Excellent subject, angle and framing. Some jaggies under this chap''s chin. Interesting colour choice - almost but not quite sepia. I''m glad it wasnt sepia though. I dont think it would have worked on this shot. Overall I really like it.', '2002-08-08 08:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100087, 4117, 3198, '<td valign="top">yes, religion is old</td>', 'yes, religion is old', '2002-08-10 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100088, 4117, 3087, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the angle of this shot - makes for a fabulous composition.</td>', 'I LOVE the angle of this shot - makes for a fabulous composition.', '2002-08-10 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100089, 4119, 2997, '<td valign="top">The shot was very nicely framed, and the pink building against that bluish shy is a wonderful balance.  I don''t live wherever this shot was taken and I have no knowledge of the bldg.  So from my viewpiont, how would I know the age of a building?  I would know it by evidence of specific aging details (cracks, window sheen, etc.)  Even though the building may actually be old, it does not look it.  In my opinion, "appearance of age" was a major part of this project.<br/>Still, it is a very good picture.</td>', 'The shot was very nicely framed, and the pink building against that bluish shy is a wonderful balance.  I don''t live wherever this shot was taken and I have no knowledge of the bldg.  So from my viewpiont, how would I know the age of a building?  I would know it by evidence of specific aging details (cracks, window sheen, etc.)  Even though the building may actually be old, it does not look it.  In my opinion, "appearance of age" was a major part of this project.Still, it is a very good picture.', '2002-08-05 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100090, 4119, 2798, '<td valign="top">This is a tricky one - I live in England and over here this building would not qualify as ''something old''. However, I must see past my own little world and recognise that this *is* something old. It''s beautiful building which, I think, could have been taken from a more interesting angle. The weather definitely gave you problems with light and there''s no flash big enough to compendate for that. The car in centre shot s a little distracting too. Perhaps you should have panned up and made a feature of the heavy cloud.</td>', 'This is a tricky one - I live in England and over here this building would not qualify as ''something old''. However, I must see past my own little world and recognise that this *is* something old. It''s beautiful building which, I think, could have been taken from a more interesting angle. The weather definitely gave you problems with light and there''s no flash big enough to compendate for that. The car in centre shot s a little distracting too. Perhaps you should have panned up and made a feature of the heavy cloud.', '2002-08-05 07:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100091, 4119, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  Looks like it could use just a bit of sharpening.</td>', 'Nice subject.  Looks like it could use just a bit of sharpening.', '2002-08-05 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100092, 4119, 1569, '<td valign="top">The pix is tipped to the left and the colors are really dull.</td>', 'The pix is tipped to the left and the colors are really dull.', '2002-08-05 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100093, 4119, 1519, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely building.  Wonder if you could get a little more color to come out in the building and trees in your photo processing program?  Also, I think I would like to see the lines of the roof look straight instead of the driveway... Maybe?</td>', 'This is a lovely building.  Wonder if you could get a little more color to come out in the building and trees in your photo processing program?  Also, I think I would like to see the lines of the roof look straight instead of the driveway... Maybe?', '2002-08-05 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100094, 4119, 1993, '<td valign="top">Oh...I want to go inside and sip tea near the window....lots of ambiance here!</td>', 'Oh...I want to go inside and sip tea near the window....lots of ambiance here!', '2002-08-05 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100095, 4119, 1019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2002-08-05 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100096, 4119, 2643, '<td valign="top">Dosen''t look all that old.</td>', 'Dosen''t look all that old.', '2002-08-05 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100097, 4119, 1143, '<td valign="top">i like the overcast feel but it''s a bit too dark as a result. nice angle</td>', 'i like the overcast feel but it''s a bit too dark as a result. nice angle', '2002-08-05 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100098, 4119, 205, '<td valign="top">A centered composition may have been more succesful</td>', 'A centered composition may have been more succesful', '2002-08-06 04:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100099, 4119, 3147, '<td valign="top">the weather in the background gives the feeling of a haunted mansion....  i spent my honeymoon at the don cesar and it did indeed feel very haunted.  this photo captures both the elegance and the mystery of this well known Florida spot.</td>', 'the weather in the background gives the feeling of a haunted mansion....  i spent my honeymoon at the don cesar and it did indeed feel very haunted.  this photo captures both the elegance and the mystery of this well known Florida spot.', '2002-08-07 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100100, 4119, 917, '<td valign="top">Rather artless. If you couldnt get square on for a formal shot, you could have gone for a detail shot, contrasting the palm trees against the detail of the towers.</td>', 'Rather artless. If you couldnt get square on for a formal shot, you could have gone for a detail shot, contrasting the palm trees against the detail of the towers.', '2002-08-08 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100101, 4119, 772, '<td valign="top">This place may *be* old for sure... it just doesn''t look old in this photograph.  As a viewer, I would have to know the history of this place to understand the age behind it.  - jmsetzler</td>', 'This place may *be* old for sure... it just doesn''t look old in this photograph.  As a viewer, I would have to know the history of this place to understand the age behind it.  - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100102, 4119, 3112, '<td valign="top">It''s unfortunate that a 1978 Caprice wagon is in the drive.  (Though it''s getting to the point that that could be considered old.) Many angles on this subject could be used to illustrate age without interference.  Good subject choice.</td>', 'It''s unfortunate that a 1978 Caprice wagon is in the drive.  (Though it''s getting to the point that that could be considered old.) Many angles on this subject could be used to illustrate age without interference.  Good subject choice.', '2002-08-09 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100103, 4119, 2437, '<td valign="top">do some tweaking on this picture in photoshop(or any editing software) to enhance light levels.</td>', 'do some tweaking on this picture in photoshop(or any editing software) to enhance light levels.', '2002-08-10 03:01:00.000000', NULL, 1);
 This could easily be a contender</td>', 'This is superbly lit; I love the effects you have created without going over the top.  It gives sense of power emanating from the object rather than just plain light.  The bubbled background just adds to the effect  but does it look old, yes, 10  definitely This could easily be a contender', '2002-08-07 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100532, 4142, 3090, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual subject, but I wonder about the effectiveness of the shiny dots in conveying "old".</td>', 'I like the unusual subject, but I wonder about the effectiveness of the shiny dots in conveying "old".', '2002-08-07 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100533, 4142, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the effect of this.  The little "starbursts" of light are also a neat effect.  I think if the biggest one on the left was at a corner somewhere, that would be too cool (kinda a minor thing to mention, though, huh?)  I really like this. karmat</td>', 'I love the effect of this.  The little "starbursts" of light are also a neat effect.  I think if the biggest one on the left was at a corner somewhere, that would be too cool (kinda a minor thing to mention, though, huh?)  I really like this. karmat', '2002-08-08 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100534, 4142, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a nice concept for a photo... in this particular case, the ''effect'' of the lighting and the background may be distracting from the purpose of your photo, which is to show something old and create a ''sense'' of old with your photographic technique :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is a nice concept for a photo... in this particular case, the ''effect'' of the lighting and the background may be distracting from the purpose of your photo, which is to show something old and create a ''sense'' of old with your photographic technique :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100535, 4142, 1454, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t look old to me..</td>', 'It doesn''t look old to me..', '2002-08-08 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100536, 4142, 3112, '<td valign="top">Interesting photograph.  Does not imply a sense of age.</td>', 'Interesting photograph.  Does not imply a sense of age.', '2002-08-09 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100537, 4142, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this but have NO idea what the bubble effect is - it''s like bubble wrap and strangely, it makes the whole thing look more new. Weird paradox. Is that old/new thing intentional? Or is it just something that I only I am seeing?</td>', 'I like this but have NO idea what the bubble effect is - it''s like bubble wrap and strangely, it makes the whole thing look more new. Weird paradox. Is that old/new thing intentional? Or is it just something that I only I am seeing?', '2002-08-09 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100538, 4142, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool bottle, very interesting backdrop, major flare is a nice touch, but you probably got flamed for it, minor flares on the right were probably more in line as acceptable. I like all of them!  The bottom of the container seems too bright.  Maybe a little cheese cloth to lessen the glare would have been helpful.  Please excuse my ignorance, but what is milenary?   8 Swash</td>', 'Cool bottle, very interesting backdrop, major flare is a nice touch, but you probably got flamed for it, minor flares on the right were probably more in line as acceptable. I like all of them!  The bottom of the container seems too bright.  Maybe a little cheese cloth to lessen the glare would have been helpful.  Please excuse my ignorance, but what is milenary?   8 Swash', '2002-08-09 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100539, 4142, 2473, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting...great idea</td>', 'very nice lighting...great idea', '2002-08-09 20:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100540, 4142, 509, '<td valign="top">I like this, but the overexposure distracts from the overall photo.</td>', 'I like this, but the overexposure distracts from the overall photo.', '2002-08-10 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100541, 4142, 671, '<td valign="top">Your choice of background and lighting to display this piece was excellent.  The lighting is exquisite.</td>', 'Your choice of background and lighting to display this piece was excellent.  The lighting is exquisite.', '2002-08-10 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100542, 4142, 2661, '<td valign="top">for the life of me, I can''t seem to find "milenary" in any dictionary. but anyways... it''s a great shot. nice contrast between modern background and ancient art form.</td>', 'for the life of me, I can''t seem to find "milenary" in any dictionary. but anyways... it''s a great shot. nice contrast between modern background and ancient art form.', '2002-08-11 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100543, 4142, 3215, '<td valign="top">The original art is beautiful and the photo is excellent.</td>', 'The original art is beautiful and the photo is excellent.', '2002-08-11 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100544, 4142, 3080, '<td valign="top">I really really like this photo.  I like how it''s lit, and I like the way it was shot.  However, in the challenge, it said to use photographing tecnique to make the object look old.  When I think of old, bright and shiny doesn''t come to mind orriginally.  The object may BE old, but here it doesn''t LOOK old.  I don''t know if that makes much sense.  I met you a bit better than half on the score cause this is such a great photo.  Hey. Maybe you could try something like this again in the something new challenge.  It has GREAT affect.</td>', 'I really really like this photo.  I like how it''s lit, and I like the way it was shot.  However, in the challenge, it said to use photographing tecnique to make the object look old.  When I think of old, bright and shiny doesn''t come to mind orriginally.  The object may BE old, but here it doesn''t LOOK old.  I don''t know if that makes much sense.  I met you a bit better than half on the score cause this is such a great photo.  Hey. Maybe you could try something like this again in the something new challenge.  It has GREAT affect.', '2002-08-11 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100545, 4143, 2586, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love this picture. It is very interesting and enjoyable to look at. Love the subdued colors yet is lively. Only nitpick: the two small shapes at top right corner.</td>', 'Oh, I love this picture. It is very interesting and enjoyable to look at. Love the subdued colors yet is lively. Only nitpick: the two small shapes at top right corner.', '2002-08-05 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100546, 4143, 1792, '<td valign="top">Composition, color, theme--it''s all there.</td>', 'Composition, color, theme--it''s all there.', '2002-08-05 04:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100547, 4143, 674, '<td valign="top">I would of cropped the foreground weeds out, but that is just my opinion!  7</td>', 'I would of cropped the foreground weeds out, but that is just my opinion!  7', '2002-08-05 06:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100548, 4143, 1856, '<td valign="top">interesting vantage point...i like it. 7 Lisa</td>', 'interesting vantage point...i like it. 7 Lisa', '2002-08-05 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100549, 4143, 1569, '<td valign="top">Great exposure of a very hard to expose shot!!!Nothing blown out or underexposed.The colors are slightly muted though.</td>', 'Great exposure of a very hard to expose shot!!!Nothing blown out or underexposed.The colors are slightly muted though.', '2002-08-05 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100550, 4143, 2466, '<td valign="top">clever title and interesting perspective.  I wish it were cleaner on the other side of the window so I saw only the barn and not the distracting junk from the past.</td>', 'clever title and interesting perspective.  I wish it were cleaner on the other side of the window so I saw only the barn and not the distracting junk from the past.', '2002-08-05 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100551, 4143, 3103, '<td valign="top">this is my personal favorite</td>', 'this is my personal favorite', '2002-08-05 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100552, 4143, 2643, '<td valign="top">B &amp; W would have made it get another point.</td>', 'B & W would have made it get another point.', '2002-08-05 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100553, 4143, 3105, '<td valign="top">The window and barn do a good job of pulling me into the photo but the supporting wall in the foregound is somewhat distracting and pulls my attention off to the borders of the frame.  The muted colors help emphasize the age of the wooden objects.  Might be interesting to see what it would look like with more of the ''through the window'' area filling the frame and less of the supporting wall.</td>', 'The window and barn do a good job of pulling me into the photo but the supporting wall in the foregound is somewhat distracting and pulls my attention off to the borders of the frame.  The muted colors help emphasize the age of the wooden objects.  Might be interesting to see what it would look like with more of the ''through the window'' area filling the frame and less of the supporting wall.', '2002-08-06 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100554, 4143, 2172, '<td valign="top">I very much like this photo.  The angle and composition/cropping really make this very effective.  The colors and lighting also work very well.  Really nice work!  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I very much like this photo.  The angle and composition/cropping really make this very effective.  The colors and lighting also work very well.  Really nice work!  9Ruthann', '2002-08-06 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100555, 4143, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting composition :)  I can''t really come up with a good critique on this one.  :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting composition :)  I can''t really come up with a good critique on this one.  :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-06 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100556, 4143, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great shot..well alanced and good depth.</td>', 'Great shot..well alanced and good depth.', '2002-08-07 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100557, 4143, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how you have used the lighting and focus here.  Good job, and neat idea. karmat</td>', 'I like how you have used the lighting and focus here.  Good job, and neat idea. karmat', '2002-08-07 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100558, 4143, 2815, '<td valign="top">I really like this one allot it feels kind of complicated but you can tell that everything was just kind of thrown around and has sat there for years.</td>', 'I really like this one allot it feels kind of complicated but you can tell that everything was just kind of thrown around and has sat there for years.', '2002-08-07 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100559, 4143, 917, '<td valign="top">The picture looks unbalanced because you have cropped more off the bottom of the frame than the top. You should also bash the weeds back so they dont intrude into the picture.</td>', 'The picture looks unbalanced because you have cropped more off the bottom of the frame than the top. You should also bash the weeds back so they dont intrude into the picture.', '2002-08-08 06:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
