(100561, 4143, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject choice.  VERY difficult to get a DOF large enough to encompass the window and the things through.  Good effort.</td>', 'Good subject choice.  VERY difficult to get a DOF large enough to encompass the window and the things through.  Good effort.', '2002-08-09 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
