(100564, 4144, 2170, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but a plain background would have been nicer.  Also too much lighting from the left.</td>', 'Nice photo, but a plain background would have been nicer.  Also too much lighting from the left.', '2002-08-05 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
