(100568, 4144, 811, '<td valign="top">A little too bright in the lower left, and on top of the hat box lid, but you ahve shown the details nicely, and i like the  colors. karmat</td>', 'A little too bright in the lower left, and on top of the hat box lid, but you ahve shown the details nicely, and i like the  colors. karmat', '2002-08-06 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100569, 4144, 2752, '<td valign="top">lovely assortment..good composition..good colord and texture</td>', 'lovely assortment..good composition..good colord and texture', '2002-08-06 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100570, 4144, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject and lighting. Framing was pretty good but I think I''d like to have seen just a bit more of the hats.</td>', 'Good choice of subject and lighting. Framing was pretty good but I think I''d like to have seen just a bit more of the hats.', '2002-08-08 08:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100571, 4144, 772, '<td valign="top">nice colors... excellent composition :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice colors... excellent composition :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-08 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100572, 4144, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Need to lose the skirting board at the top right and the tissue paper at top left is reflecting too much white light.</td>', 'Nice idea. Need to lose the skirting board at the top right and the tissue paper at top left is reflecting too much white light.', '2002-08-10 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100573, 4144, 1280, '<td valign="top">This appeals to me.  I used to collect vintage hats...and gloves, and dresses, and purses...lol  You name it I collected it.  Now I have limited it to purses and sold the rest on ebay.  I like the composition and the lighting.  If I had to pick something I didn''t like, I''d ditch the white tissue paper in the upper left corner that sort of draws my eye to it.  I like the curves of the box, lid, and hats.  The window sill detracts a bit, and the clutter between the box and lid on the bottom, near the center also is a distraction.  Those few complaints keep it from being perfect.  All in all I like it.</td>', 'This appeals to me.  I used to collect vintage hats...and gloves, and dresses, and purses...lol  You name it I collected it.  Now I have limited it to purses and sold the rest on ebay.  I like the composition and the lighting.  If I had to pick something I didn''t like, I''d ditch the white tissue paper in the upper left corner that sort of draws my eye to it.  I like the curves of the box, lid, and hats.  The window sill detracts a bit, and the clutter between the box and lid on the bottom, near the center also is a distraction.  Those few complaints keep it from being perfect.  All in all I like it.', '2002-08-11 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100574, 4144, 637, '<td valign="top">Nice idea... don''t really like the composition... can''t really see enough of the hats  4 sjgleah</td>', 'Nice idea... don''t really like the composition... can''t really see enough of the hats  4 sjgleah', '2002-08-11 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100575, 4145, 2815, '<td valign="top">I like this one with color<br/></td>', 'I like this one with color', '2002-08-05 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100576, 4145, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great picture...</td>', 'Great picture...', '2002-08-05 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100577, 4145, 2170, '<td valign="top">Tighter cropping would have helped this a lot.  The foreground is too prominent.  Great shot, though.</td>', 'Tighter cropping would have helped this a lot.  The foreground is too prominent.  Great shot, though.', '2002-08-05 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100578, 4145, 1143, '<td valign="top">all that extra ground on the bottom right seems a little odd and the lighting was a bit too harsh</td>', 'all that extra ground on the bottom right seems a little odd and the lighting was a bit too harsh', '2002-08-05 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100579, 4145, 2148, '<td valign="top">Great subject, angle, shadows, etc. Only thing - the subject is a bit to ''loose'' (is that a real term?) in the shot for me - maybe just getting in a touch closer or cropping a touch tighter and filling the frame with the subject would have really done it for me - very subjective though. - lamedos</td>', 'Great subject, angle, shadows, etc. Only thing - the subject is a bit to ''loose'' (is that a real term?) in the shot for me - maybe just getting in a touch closer or cropping a touch tighter and filling the frame with the subject would have really done it for me - very subjective though. - lamedos', '2002-08-06 07:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100580, 4145, 2983, '<td valign="top">I really heel your subject should dominate the scene more, with a tighter cropping or a more interesting angle.  This subject has potential, you should take as many pictures from as many perspectives as possible.</td>', 'I really heel your subject should dominate the scene more, with a tighter cropping or a more interesting angle.  This subject has potential, you should take as many pictures from as many perspectives as possible.', '2002-08-06 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100581, 4145, 2261, '<td valign="top">A little bit dark at the front of the vehicle but a nicely composed shot.</td>', 'A little bit dark at the front of the vehicle but a nicely composed shot.', '2002-08-06 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100582, 4145, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is a neat photo... the lighting is a little harsh... this would have been tough to do, but overcast skies would have balanced the lighting in this image.. i bet it would have made a great black and white also :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I think this is a neat photo... the lighting is a little harsh... this would have been tough to do, but overcast skies would have balanced the lighting in this image.. i bet it would have made a great black and white also :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100583, 4145, 2079, '<td valign="top">I love this. It is just a little over exposed for my taste but still in my top 10</td>', 'I love this. It is just a little over exposed for my taste but still in my top 10', '2002-08-07 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100584, 4145, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good perspective.  Leaves the subject a tad too bright.</td>', 'Good perspective.  Leaves the subject a tad too bright.', '2002-08-07 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100585, 4145, 1759, '<td valign="top">Cool subject! I get a good feeling from the photo, but I also see some problems. My personal preference is to be a little closer to the subject to get some more detail. I also note that the lighting is so directional that we get a good view of the side, but the front sort of fades away. An off camera flash (if available) could be used to light up the front. This would be even more effective if fitted to an umbrella. Another way improve lighting would be to take the shot more from the front and use the on camera flash for fill. Fill flash can go a long way to improve daylight photos. The fill flash doesn''t have to be at the same lighting level as the natural light, it only needs to fill in the shadow area so that the shadows are not so pronounced.</td>', 'Cool subject! I get a good feeling from the photo, but I also see some problems. My personal preference is to be a little closer to the subject to get some more detail. I also note that the lighting is so directional that we get a good view of the side, but the front sort of fades away. An off camera flash (if available) could be used to light up the front. This would be even more effective if fitted to an umbrella. Another way improve lighting would be to take the shot more from the front and use the on camera flash for fill. Fill flash can go a long way to improve daylight photos. The fill flash doesn''t have to be at the same lighting level as the natural light, it only needs to fill in the shadow area so that the shadows are not so pronounced.', '2002-08-07 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100586, 4145, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the vehicle needed to be further to the right.  It has nowhere to "go" as it is framed right now. (Like it is going anywhere).  Also, if you ever get a chance to reshoot, those front lights look really interesting.  Like little eyes, or something. karmat</td>', 'I think the vehicle needed to be further to the right.  It has nowhere to "go" as it is framed right now. (Like it is going anywhere).  Also, if you ever get a chance to reshoot, those front lights look really interesting.  Like little eyes, or something. karmat', '2002-08-08 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100587, 4145, 3002, '<td valign="top">I think this shot is quite good, but a bit too dark on the left side, which I myself am often guilty of doing.  Love the colors and lighting.  Nice job.</td>', 'I think this shot is quite good, but a bit too dark on the left side, which I myself am often guilty of doing.  Love the colors and lighting.  Nice job.', '2002-08-10 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100588, 4145, 2609, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been much better had you done it in black and white. however, it''s still a decent photo.</td>', 'I think it would have been much better had you done it in black and white. however, it''s still a decent photo.', '2002-08-11 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1);
</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen the entire barrow.  Apart from that  good shooting', '2002-08-06 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100625, 4147, 3105, '<td valign="top">Good idea filling the frame with the main subject since its color is so simillar to its surroundings and would get lost if it were any less.</td>', 'Good idea filling the frame with the main subject since its color is so simillar to its surroundings and would get lost if it were any less.', '2002-08-06 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100626, 4147, 1644, '<td valign="top">I like the monochrome colors in this photo. Very cool feeling and rustic. This must be a great garden.</td>', 'I like the monochrome colors in this photo. Very cool feeling and rustic. This must be a great garden.', '2002-08-06 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100627, 4147, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the different greens in this picture, though I also think it would be awesome if there were another contrasting color somewhere. Great angle/perspective and framing. karmat</td>', 'I like the different greens in this picture, though I also think it would be awesome if there were another contrasting color somewhere. Great angle/perspective and framing. karmat', '2002-08-07 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100628, 4147, 1658, '<td valign="top">Your composition of this shot is what makes this an interesting picture.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Your composition of this shot is what makes this an interesting picture.  Nicely done.', '2002-08-07 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100629, 4147, 3090, '<td valign="top">Love the monochromatic texture.</td>', 'Love the monochromatic texture.', '2002-08-07 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100630, 4147, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful old garden wheel barrow.   You have done a nice job with near perfect lighting.   The only problem I see is that portions of the subject on the very top are blown out with a little too much light.   Otherwide great.   Autool</td>', 'This is a wonderful old garden wheel barrow.   You have done a nice job with near perfect lighting.   The only problem I see is that portions of the subject on the very top are blown out with a little too much light.   Otherwide great.   Autool', '2002-08-07 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100631, 4147, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely angle and framing. Slightly over light I think.</td>', 'Lovely angle and framing. Slightly over light I think.', '2002-08-08 08:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100632, 4147, 436, '<td valign="top">for me, the plant in the foreground is distracting me from relishing the amazing patina of the cart.  The...tomato?...bothers me more than the ...cabbage? I know the argument could be made that they frame it, but they seem discordant to me. What a beautiful cart.  I hope you keep shooting it when the flora have gone.</td>', 'for me, the plant in the foreground is distracting me from relishing the amazing patina of the cart.  The...tomato?...bothers me more than the ...cabbage? I know the argument could be made that they frame it, but they seem discordant to me. What a beautiful cart.  I hope you keep shooting it when the flora have gone.', '2002-08-08 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100633, 4147, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  Now that looks old!  Except for the plant in the foreground blending in with the wheel, this is very good.  This shot grows on me, started out as a 7, but with more reflection and viewing, I think it''s closer to a 9.  Swash</td>', 'Very nice shot!  Now that looks old!  Except for the plant in the foreground blending in with the wheel, this is very good.  This shot grows on me, started out as a 7, but with more reflection and viewing, I think it''s closer to a 9.  Swash', '2002-08-08 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100634, 4147, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject.  Would definitely make this a couple of stops darker.</td>', 'Excellent subject.  Would definitely make this a couple of stops darker.', '2002-08-09 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100635, 4147, 2437, '<td valign="top">contrast can be increased</td>', 'contrast can be increased', '2002-08-10 04:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
