(100641, 4148, 2172, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Very interesting.  I like the lighting - very effective.  The focus and dof is also effective.  Excellent work   9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I really like this.  Very interesting.  I like the lighting - very effective.  The focus and dof is also effective.  Excellent work   9Ruthann', '2002-08-05 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
