(100643, 4148, 2553, '<td valign="top">"Old" is not the first thing that comes to mind when seeing this shot.  However, I really like the light/shadow thing that is going on, and especially like that there are areas of nice detail, as well as lots of "lost edges".  The overall effect is very nice. lhall</td>', '"Old" is not the first thing that comes to mind when seeing this shot.  However, I really like the light/shadow thing that is going on, and especially like that there are areas of nice detail, as well as lots of "lost edges".  The overall effect is very nice. lhall', '2002-08-06 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100644, 4148, 133, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2002-08-07 08:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100645, 4148, 3077, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful. It has a lovely mood to it, and the lighting is just perfect.</td>', 'This is just beautiful. It has a lovely mood to it, and the lighting is just perfect.', '2002-08-07 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
