(100652, 4148, 3087, '<td valign="top">This does need the shadows but I find some of them a little OTT. I love the detail of the withered daisy. I know one isn''t supposed to centre things, but on this one I think I''d like both the round thing (vase?) and the flower to be further right in the frame.</td>', 'This does need the shadows but I find some of them a little OTT. I love the detail of the withered daisy. I know one isn''t supposed to centre things, but on this one I think I''d like both the round thing (vase?) and the flower to be further right in the frame.', '2002-08-10 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
