(100660, 4149, 2200, '<td valign="top">If you''re Ellen Larsen, you should be proud. However, photographic image is only of the paper. If your picture was on a wall, of in a case or something to show texture or wear it would be more interesting</td>', 'If you''re Ellen Larsen, you should be proud. However, photographic image is only of the paper. If your picture was on a wall, of in a case or something to show texture or wear it would be more interesting', '2002-08-05 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
