(100721, 4153, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent photo :)  The old 8mm projectors are practically a thing of the past... my parents have an old super 8 video camera and a projector, but it is not nearly as ''aged'' as this one... excellent lighting and composition... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'excellent photo :)  The old 8mm projectors are practically a thing of the past... my parents have an old super 8 video camera and a projector, but it is not nearly as ''aged'' as this one... excellent lighting and composition... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100722, 4153, 573, '<td valign="top">A classic projector shot, are you sure you took this picture just last week.  Is that a little dust I see around the top of the light housing?  :-P  I like the way the lighting was done and the coloring, gives it that preserved look.  The only nit pic I have is that I would have liked to have the knurling on the projection lens in sharp focus.  Still, one of my top ten picks.</td>', 'A classic projector shot, are you sure you took this picture just last week.  Is that a little dust I see around the top of the light housing?  :-P  I like the way the lighting was done and the coloring, gives it that preserved look.  The only nit pic I have is that I would have liked to have the knurling on the projection lens in sharp focus.  Still, one of my top ten picks.', '2002-08-07 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100723, 4153, 2370, '<td valign="top">excellent photo! the gold colour really adds to the oldish feel to it.</td>', 'excellent photo! the gold colour really adds to the oldish feel to it.', '2002-08-08 01:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100724, 4153, 2932, '<td valign="top">nice close framing and shiny color</td>', 'nice close framing and shiny color', '2002-08-08 04:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100725, 4153, 2798, '<td valign="top">As an old 35mm projectionist this really appeals to me. Lovely subject, angle and lighting - superb.</td>', 'As an old 35mm projectionist this really appeals to me. Lovely subject, angle and lighting - superb.', '2002-08-08 08:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100726, 4153, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Very good depth of field.  Is this the "real" color or is this sepia?  (no matter, just curious)  Nice angle of attack, but did you try between the reels? (it might have been a cool view, also)  Score change  -  was 8, now 9!  Swash</td>', 'Great shot!  Very good depth of field.  Is this the "real" color or is this sepia?  (no matter, just curious)  Nice angle of attack, but did you try between the reels? (it might have been a cool view, also)  Score change  -  was 8, now 9!  Swash', '2002-08-08 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100727, 4153, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Sepia unnecessary.</td>', 'Good composition.  Sepia unnecessary.', '2002-08-09 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100728, 4153, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice. But the close crop means it''s like an abstract and the balance of shapes and layout doesn''t quite work for me.</td>', 'Nice. But the close crop means it''s like an abstract and the balance of shapes and layout doesn''t quite work for me.', '2002-08-10 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
