(100731, 4153, 2353, '<td valign="top">I love the angle, the lighting, and the subject matter!  I like how you left the dust on it also! Great job - 9</td>', 'I love the angle, the lighting, and the subject matter!  I like how you left the dust on it also! Great job - 9', '2002-08-10 20:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100732, 4153, 2261, '<td valign="top">The colours work really well with the subject matter here, it really gives off the feeling of old, well done.</td>', 'The colours work really well with the subject matter here, it really gives off the feeling of old, well done.', '2002-08-11 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100733, 4153, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice use of curves.  I especially like the way you included both reels in the composition.  They complement each other through repitition of the curves. I love the way the boxy part up front contrasts with the reels and in between are some details of the "other parts."  The contrast of textures is good and the coloring works well here.  The dark background is good too. I''m looking for something to NOT like here....um......I can''t!  Oh wait!  A tiny dof issue in the center of the upper reel...hmmmmmm.   Oh so what!  Still a great photo.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Nice use of curves.  I especially like the way you included both reels in the composition.  They complement each other through repitition of the curves. I love the way the boxy part up front contrasts with the reels and in between are some details of the "other parts."  The contrast of textures is good and the coloring works well here.  The dark background is good too. I''m looking for something to NOT like here....um......I can''t!  Oh wait!  A tiny dof issue in the center of the upper reel...hmmmmmm.   Oh so what!  Still a great photo.  Congratulations!', '2002-08-11 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100734, 4153, 472, '<td valign="top">good job!<br/></td>', 'good job!', '2002-08-14 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(100735, 4154, 1569, '<td valign="top">The hard part about using a white background is getting rid of the shadows.You have to put in a lot of time going back and forth between light/dark and contrast to eliminate them.</td>', 'The hard part about using a white background is getting rid of the shadows.You have to put in a lot of time going back and forth between light/dark and contrast to eliminate them.', '2002-08-05 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100736, 4154, 2170, '<td valign="top">I had a picture of a fan almost exactly like this that I was going to submit.  I guess I''m glad I didn''t.  Nice shot.  Maybe I''ll get some outtakes put together...</td>', 'I had a picture of a fan almost exactly like this that I was going to submit.  I guess I''m glad I didn''t.  Nice shot.  Maybe I''ll get some outtakes put together...', '2002-08-05 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
