(100739, 4154, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great - except the cable... Sorry, that just sounds picky, but I think it spoils it quite a bit.</td>', 'Great - except the cable... Sorry, that just sounds picky, but I think it spoils it quite a bit.', '2002-08-05 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
