(100744, 4154, 2079, '<td valign="top">You know, I love this shot, its perfect in every way. But the white background against the white background of the browser window makes this look too bland. (It''s not your photo). this has bothered me on several photos in this challenge. Not much we can fix about that, until we get it to the frame store. -  9</td>', 'You know, I love this shot, its perfect in every way. But the white background against the white background of the browser window makes this look too bland. (It''s not your photo). this has bothered me on several photos in this challenge. Not much we can fix about that, until we get it to the frame store. -  9', '2002-08-07 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100745, 4154, 133, '<td valign="top">Very cool fan.  My grandmother used to have one, and I think my mother has it now.  I like the use of black &amp; white.  This is one of the few "setup" shots of an object that I actually liike.</td>', 'Very cool fan.  My grandmother used to have one, and I think my mother has it now.  I like the use of black & white.  This is one of the few "setup" shots of an object that I actually liike.', '2002-08-07 08:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100746, 4154, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice shot!  I love this one... the only minor distraction is the cord.. i''m not sure if that could have been rolled up and hidden behind the fan or not... it''s not a problem, but the photo would be cleaner without it... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice shot!  I love this one... the only minor distraction is the cord.. i''m not sure if that could have been rolled up and hidden behind the fan or not... it''s not a problem, but the photo would be cleaner without it... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-07 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100747, 4154, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely B&amp;W and great subject. But taken very front-on. Would have been more interesting at a 45 degree angle.</td>', 'Lovely B&W and great subject. But taken very front-on. Would have been more interesting at a 45 degree angle.', '2002-08-08 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
