(100759, 4156, 2172, '<td valign="top">Tells a story.  I like this very much.  I gave 4 10s and this is one of them.  The composition and cropping is great as well at the focus and lighting.  You have brought the bear to life.  It makes feel sad - which is great, I love photos that portray emotion.  Excellent work - give yourself a pat on the back!!!<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Tells a story.  I like this very much.  I gave 4 10s and this is one of them.  The composition and cropping is great as well at the focus and lighting.  You have brought the bear to life.  It makes feel sad - which is great, I love photos that portray emotion.  Excellent work - give yourself a pat on the back!!!Ruthann', '2002-08-05 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100760, 4156, 737, '<td valign="top">Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.<br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good. I really like the lighting<br/>Meets Challenge - yes +<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - high/ high<br/></td>', 'Something old. Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject.Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite good. I really like the lightingMeets Challenge - yes +Visual Impact / Originality - high/ high', '2002-08-05 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100761, 4156, 2764, '<td valign="top">Oooh, nice.  Have you noticed that people always feel compelled to critisize rather than compliment?  Like I haven''t looked critically if I can''t find something wrong.  I like the subject, the arrangement, the shadows on the clock.  The only things I don''t like are the brightest part of the bear doesn''t make it look "old", maybe could have been softer, Abd the way his foot is cropped out of the photo makes that foot look mis shapen.</td>', 'Oooh, nice.  Have you noticed that people always feel compelled to critisize rather than compliment?  Like I haven''t looked critically if I can''t find something wrong.  I like the subject, the arrangement, the shadows on the clock.  The only things I don''t like are the brightest part of the bear doesn''t make it look "old", maybe could have been softer, Abd the way his foot is cropped out of the photo makes that foot look mis shapen.', '2002-08-06 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
