(100788, 4160, 2798, '<td valign="top">What a lovely tonal quality this has. Great subject and lovely low late afternoon lighting. Good subject and good technicals. It would have been possible to push the colour and contrast up a little further on this but Im glad you didn''t.</td>', 'What a lovely tonal quality this has. Great subject and lovely low late afternoon lighting. Good subject and good technicals. It would have been possible to push the colour and contrast up a little further on this but Im glad you didn''t.', '2002-08-05 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1);
 Sorry to be so negative</td>', 'The focus seems out, giving the whole picture a washed out feel.  I think it would have worked better in crisp focus.  I also think the theme doesn''t meet the challenge Sorry to be so negative', '2002-08-07 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(100972, 4172, 3147, '<td valign="top">great idea but the eye looks young / youthful, which I don''t think of as "wise" -- a wrinkly eye would have portrayed the idea more drastically.</td>', 'great idea but the eye looks young / youthful, which I don''t think of as "wise" -- a wrinkly eye would have portrayed the idea more drastically.', '2002-08-07 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
