(100975, 4172, 1042, '<td valign="top">This may be a case of shooting the photo and then cropping one part out and blowing it up. Or maybe you were just too close for your camera to focus well. I''m not sure what type of camera you''re using so I''m not sure what to say.</td>', 'This may be a case of shooting the photo and then cropping one part out and blowing it up. Or maybe you were just too close for your camera to focus well. I''m not sure what type of camera you''re using so I''m not sure what to say.', '2002-08-07 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
