(100979, 4172, 3112, '<td valign="top">Turns out eyes are very hard to photograph up close with an AF camera.  Good idea, but the lack of focus is too distracting.  Try using the manual focus features of your camera, and make sure the camera''s macro capability is up to the task.</td>', 'Turns out eyes are very hard to photograph up close with an AF camera.  Good idea, but the lack of focus is too distracting.  Try using the manual focus features of your camera, and make sure the camera''s macro capability is up to the task.', '2002-08-09 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
