</td>', 'This picture really creates a great feeling of age, witty title too', '2002-08-07 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101151, 4183, 3026, '<td valign="top">I like this picture. The graininess adds to the "old" effect.<br/><br/>The only two things I see which could have improved it (i.e., made it look older) would have been to use a 78 as the record being played and a less "hi-tech" cartridge on the tonearm. But those are niggly little things.<br/><br/>Good work!</td>', 'I like this picture. The graininess adds to the "old" effect.The only two things I see which could have improved it (i.e., made it look older) would have been to use a 78 as the record being played and a less "hi-tech" cartridge on the tonearm. But those are niggly little things.Good work!', '2002-08-09 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
