(101154, 4183, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very good photo! Nice subject, I don''t even own a player for these "big black compact disks" ;-) Excellent DOF. The grain is ok, it makes the photo look even older. Also very nice how the lighting reflects in the furrows. One of my favourite photos this week.<br/>-stephan<br/></td>', 'Very good photo! Nice subject, I don''t even own a player for these "big black compact disks" ;-) Excellent DOF. The grain is ok, it makes the photo look even older. Also very nice how the lighting reflects in the furrows. One of my favourite photos this week.-stephan', '2002-08-11 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
